from (values
  ('category_page', 'diving', '{"cover":"cover-diving","intro":{"de":[{"text":"Kaş bietet über 30 Tauchplätze für alle Erfahrungsstufen: moderne Wracks, antike Amphoren und Anker, felsige Riffe, Canyons, große Höhlen und Seegraswiesen. Das Unterwasserleben des Meeresschutzgebiets Kaş-Kekova wird durch lessepsische Arten aus dem Roten Meer zusätzlich bereichert.","type":"p"},{"text":"Dank ausgezeichneter Sicht und Wassertemperaturen zwischen 19 °C (Januar) und 29 °C (August) kann hier das ganze Jahr über getaucht werden.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Kaş offers over 30 dive spots that suit all levels, with modern wrecks, amphorae and anchors from ancient civilizations, rocky reefs, canyons, large caves and sea-grass meadows. The Mediterranean life of the Kaş-Kekova Marine Protected Area is further enriched by lessepsian species migrating from the Red Sea.","type":"p"},{"text":"Excellent underwater visibility and water temperatures between 19 °C (January) and 29 °C (August) make diving possible all year round.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Kaş compte plus de 30 sites de plongée convenant à tous les niveaux : épaves anciennes et modernes, amphores, ancres, secs rocheux, canyons, grandes grottes et herbiers. La faune et la flore de l''Aire Marine Protégée de Kaş-Kekova s''enrichissent d''espèces lessepsiennes venues de la mer Rouge.","type":"p"},{"text":"Une excellente visibilité et une eau entre 19 °C (janvier) et 29 °C (août) permettent de plonger toute l''année.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Kaş''ta her seviyeye uygun 30''un üzerinde dalış noktası; modern batıklar, antik amforalar ve çapalar, geniş sualtı mağaraları, kayalık bankolar, duvarlar ve deniz çayırları sunuyor. Kaş-Kekova Özel Deniz Koruma Alanı''nın zengin sualtı yaşamı, Kızıldeniz''den gelen lesepsiyen türlerle daha da zenginleşiyor.","type":"p"},{"text":"Mükemmel görüş mesafesi ve 19 °C (Ocak) ile 29 °C (Ağustos) arasındaki su sıcaklıklarıyla burada 12 ay dalış yapılabiliyor.","type":"p"}]},"key":"diving","origin":"cloner","seo":{"description":{"de":"Über 30 Tauchplätze für alle Stufen in Kaş: Wracks, Amphoren, Höhlen und Seegraswiesen. Bei 19 bis 29 °C ganzjährig tauchen, mit Kursen und Bootstouren.","en":"Over 30 dive sites for all levels in Kaş: wrecks, amphorae, caves and seagrass. Water at 19–29 °C means diving all year, with courses and boat dives.","fr":"Plus de 30 sites de plongée pour tous niveaux à Kaş : épaves, amphores, grottes et herbiers. Eau de 19 à 29 °C toute l''année, cours et sorties en bateau.","tr":"Kaş''ta her seviyeye uygun 30''u aşkın dalış noktası: batıklar, amforalar, mağaralar ve deniz çayırları. 19–29 °C suda 12 ay dalış, kurslar ve tekne dalışları."},"title":{"de":"Tauchen in Kaş: über 30 Tauchplätze und Kurse","en":"Diving in Kaş: 30+ Dive Sites, Courses and Trips","fr":"Plongée à Kaş : 30+ sites, cours et sorties","tr":"Kaş''ta Dalış: 30''u Aşkın Nokta, Kurs ve Turlar"}},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/plongee/"],"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}}'::jsonb, '{"/intro":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0850fcca71e94b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0850fcca71e94b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0850fcca71e94b","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16c80d6c927b5b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16c80d6c927b5b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16c80d6c927b5b","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1f111186d24879","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1f111186d24879","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1f111186d24879","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('category_page', 'outdoor', '{"cover":"cover-outdoor","intro":{"de":[{"text":"Vom Wandern bis zum Coasteering, vom Radfahren bis zu Bootsausflügen: Alle unsere Outdoor-Aktivitäten bringen Sie den Geheimnissen Lykiens, des Landes des Lichts, ein Stück näher. Das Türkis des Meeres, die Zedernwälder der Berge oder vergessene lykische Siedlungen an der Küste: Für alle von 7 bis 70 gibt es etwas zu entdecken.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"From hiking to coasteering, from cycling to boat trips, all of our outdoor activities bring you one step closer to the secrets of Lycia, the land of light. The turquoise sea, the cedar forests of the mountains or forgotten Lycian settlements on the coast: there is something to discover for everyone from 7 to 70.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"De la randonnée au coasteering, du vélo aux sorties en bateau, toutes nos activités de plein air vous rapprochent des secrets de la Lycie, la terre de lumière. Le turquoise de la mer, les forêts de cèdres des montagnes ou les cités lyciennes oubliées sur la côte : il y a de quoi découvrir pour tous, de 7 à 70 ans.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Yürüyüşten kıyı traversine, bisikletten tekne turlarına tüm doğa etkinliklerimiz sizi ışık ülkesi Likya''nın sırlarını keşfetmeye bir adım yaklaştırıyor. Denizin turkuazı, dağların sedir ormanları ya da kıyıda unutulmuş kadim Likya yerleşimleri; 7''den 70''e herkes için keşfedecek bir şey var.","type":"p"}]},"key":"outdoor","origin":"cloner","seo":{"description":{"de":"Vom Wandern bis zum Coasteering, vom Radfahren bis zur Bootstour: Outdoor-Aktivitäten, die Sie Lykiens Geheimnissen näherbringen. Für alle von 7 bis 70 Jahren.","en":"From hiking to coasteering, from cycling to boat trips: outdoor activities that bring you closer to the secrets of Lycia. Something for everyone from 7 to 70.","fr":"De la randonnée au coasteering, du vélo aux sorties en bateau : des activités de plein air pour percer les secrets de la Lycie. Pour tous, de 7 à 70 ans.","tr":"Yürüyüşten kıyı tırmanışına, bisikletten tekne turlarına: Likya''nın sırlarına bir adım daha yaklaştıran doğa aktiviteleri. 7''den 70''e herkes için bir rota var."},"title":{"de":"Outdoor in Kaş: Wandern, Radfahren, Bootstouren","en":"Outdoor Activities in Kaş: Hiking, Biking, Boats","fr":"Plein air à Kaş : randonnée, vélo et bateau","tr":"Kaş''ta Doğa Aktiviteleri: Yürüyüş ve Bisiklet"}},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/doga-etkinlikleri/"],"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/intro":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1237d36e4205ff","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1237d36e4205ff","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1237d36e4205ff","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"151918243c709d","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"151918243c709d","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"151918243c709d","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"160e820af1ff8a","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"160e820af1ff8a","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"160e820af1ff8a","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('category_page', 'seaKayak', '{"cover":"cover-sea-kayak","intro":{"de":[{"text":"Paddeln Sie über die versunkene Stadt, schwimmen Sie in versteckten Buchten und entdecken Sie die lykische Küste im Seekajak. Von ruhigen Buchten bis zu Routen auf offenem Wasser gibt es Angebote für jedes Niveau.","type":"p"},{"text":"Unsere Touren werden von Guides mit Lizenz des Türkischen Kanuverbands geführt; Route, Wetter und Seegang werden vor jeder Tour geprüft.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Paddle over the sunken city, swim in hidden coves and discover the beauty of the Lycian coast by sea kayak. There are options for every level, from calm bays to open-water routes.","type":"p"},{"text":"Our tours are led by guides licensed by the Turkish Canoe Federation; the route, weather and sea conditions are assessed before every tour.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Pagayez au-dessus de la cité engloutie, baignez-vous dans des criques cachées et découvrez la côte lycienne en kayak de mer. Des baies calmes aux itinéraires en pleine mer, il y a une option pour chaque niveau.","type":"p"},{"text":"Nos sorties sont encadrées par des guides diplômés de la Fédération turque de canoë-kayak ; l''itinéraire, la météo et l''état de la mer sont évalués avant chaque sortie.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Batık şehir üzerinde kürek çekin, saklı koylarda yüzün, Likya kıyısının güzelliğini deniz kayağıyla keşfedin. Sakin koylardan açık deniz rotalarına kadar her seviyeye uygun seçenekler var.","type":"p"},{"text":"Turlarımızı Türkiye Kano Federasyonu lisanslı rehberler yönetir; rota, hava ve deniz koşulları her tur öncesinde değerlendirilir.","type":"p"}]},"key":"seaKayak","origin":"kayak-site","seo":{"description":{"de":"Über die versunkene Stadt paddeln, in versteckten Buchten baden: Touren für jedes Niveau an der lykischen Küste, mit vom Kanuverband lizenzierten Guides.","en":"Paddle over the sunken city and swim in hidden coves: sea kayak tours for all levels on the Lycian coast, with guides licensed by the Turkish Canoe Federation.","fr":"Pagayez sur la cité engloutie, baignez-vous dans des criques cachées : kayak de mer pour tous niveaux sur la côte lycienne, avec des guides agréés.","tr":"Batık şehrin üzerinde kürek çekin, saklı koylarda yüzün: Likya kıyısında her seviyeye uygun deniz kanosu turları, Türkiye Kano Federasyonu lisanslı rehberlerle."},"title":{"de":"Seekajak bei Kekova: Tages- und Mehrtagestouren","en":"Sea Kayaking in Kekova: Day and Multi-Day Tours","fr":"Kayak de mer à Kekova : journées et circuits","tr":"Kekova''da Deniz Kanosu: Günübirlik ve Uzun Turlar"}},"sourceRefs":["https://dragomanseakayak.com/tr/"],"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/intro":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1dd1ca47282554","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1dd1ca47282554","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1dd1ca47282554","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1c2c38fed49366","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1c2c38fed49366","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1c2c38fed49366","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0c0b3fe48e1158","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0c0b3fe48e1158","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0c0b3fe48e1158","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('category_page', 'shop', '{"cover":"book-tropical-spread-1","intro":{"de":[{"text":"Unsere Bücher über die Unterwasserwelt von Kaş: The Diving Guide – Kaş mit Karten der Tauchplätze und Tropical Mediterranean über die Arten, die aus dem Roten Meer einwandern.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Our books documenting the underwater world of Kaş: The Diving Guide – Kaş with maps of the local dive sites, and Tropical Mediterranean on the species arriving from the Red Sea.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Nos livres consacrés au monde sous-marin de Kaş : The Diving Guide – Kaş, avec les cartes des sites de plongée, et Méditerranée tropicale, sur les espèces venues de la mer Rouge.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Kaş sualtını belgeleyen kitaplarımız: Kaş dalış noktalarının haritalarıyla Dalış Rehberi – Kaş ve Kızıldeniz''den gelen türleri anlatan Tropikal Akdeniz.","type":"p"}]},"key":"shop","origin":"mockup","seo":{"description":{"de":"Bücher über die Unterwasserwelt von Kaş: der Tauchführer mit Karten und Tropical Mediterranean über Arten aus dem Roten Meer. Bestellung per WhatsApp.","en":"Our books on the underwater world of Kaş: The Diving Guide – Kaş with dive site maps, and Tropical Mediterranean on Red Sea species. Order by WhatsApp or email.","fr":"Livres sur le monde sous-marin de Kaş : le guide de plongée et ses cartes, et Méditerranée tropicale sur les espèces de la mer Rouge. Commande par WhatsApp.","tr":"Kaş''ın sualtı dünyasını belgeleyen kitaplarımız: haritalı Dalış Rehberi – Kaş ve Kızıldeniz türleri üzerine Tropikal Akdeniz. WhatsApp ile sipariş."},"title":{"de":"Shop: Bücher über die Unterwasserwelt von Kaş","en":"Shop: Books on the Underwater World of Kaş","fr":"Boutique : livres sur le monde sous-marin de Kaş","tr":"Mağaza: Kaş Dalış Rehberi ve Tropikal Akdeniz"}},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/dukkan/"],"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/intro":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ebe34bc0bcb2b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ebe34bc0bcb2b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ebe34bc0bcb2b","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"07be2dd548a918","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"07be2dd548a918","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"07be2dd548a918","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d50755508ec09","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d50755508ec09","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d50755508ec09","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('category_page', 'transport', '{"cover":"kas-town-view-1","intro":{"de":[{"text":"Wir organisieren Ihre Transfers nach Kaş von den Flughäfen Dalaman und Antalya und planen Ihren Aufenthalt in den Hotels und Pensionen, die wir empfehlen. Schreiben Sie uns für aktuelle Preise und Verfügbarkeit.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"We arrange your transfers to Kaş from Dalaman and Antalya airports and plan your stay at the hotels and guesthouses we recommend. Please write to us for current prices and availability.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Nous organisons vos transferts vers Kaş depuis les aéroports de Dalaman et d''Antalya, et votre séjour dans les hôtels et pensions que nous recommandons. Écrivez-nous pour les tarifs et disponibilités à jour.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Dalaman ve Antalya havalimanlarından Kaş''a transferlerinizi ayarlıyor, önerdiğimiz otel ve pansiyonlarda konaklamanızı planlıyoruz. Güncel fiyat ve müsaitlik için lütfen bize yazın.","type":"p"}]},"key":"transport","origin":"cloner","seo":{"description":{"de":"Wir organisieren Ihren Transfer nach Kaş ab den Flughäfen Dalaman und Antalya und Ihren Aufenthalt in empfohlenen Hotels und Pensionen. Preise auf Anfrage.","en":"We arrange your transfer to Kaş from Dalaman and Antalya airports and plan your stay at hotels and guesthouses we recommend. Write to us for current prices.","fr":"Nous organisons votre transfert vers Kaş depuis Dalaman et Antalya et votre séjour dans les hôtels et pensions que nous recommandons. Prix sur demande.","tr":"Dalaman ve Antalya havalimanlarından Kaş''a transferinizi ayarlıyor, önerdiğimiz otel ve pansiyonlarda konaklamanızı planlıyoruz. Güncel fiyat için bize yazın."},"title":{"de":"Transfer und Unterkunft in Kaş ab Dalaman","en":"Kaş Transfers and Stays from Dalaman and Antalya","fr":"Transferts et hébergement à Kaş depuis Dalaman","tr":"Kaş Transfer ve Konaklama: Dalaman ve Antalya"}},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/ulasim-konaklama/"],"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/intro":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"05f8418c03bfcf","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"05f8418c03bfcf","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"05f8418c03bfcf","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a0586cd9ae14e","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a0586cd9ae14e","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a0586cd9ae14e","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"18ea5f9c521978","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"18ea5f9c521978","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"18ea5f9c521978","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'beceri-tazeleme', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Die Tauch-Auffrischung richtet sich an alle, die gerade ihr erstes Brevet erhalten haben oder lange nicht getaucht sind. Vor dem Einstieg in die Tauchgruppen wiederholen Sie mit einem Tauchlehrer oder Divemaster kurz die Theorie und üben in zwei Tauchgängen (an einem Tag) wichtige Fertigkeiten.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"The scuba skills update is for those who have just got their first diver''s certificate and/or want a refresher after a long period without diving. You are given a concise theoretical review and two dives with a dive professional during which essential practical skills are practised, before you join the dive groups. It is a one-day programme.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Pour ceux qui désirent un petit rappel après une longue période sans plongée, ou qui viennent d''obtenir leur premier brevet : une courte révision théorique et 2 plongées avec un dive-master ou un moniteur, pendant lesquelles quelques exercices essentiels sont exécutés, avant de rejoindre les palanquées. Le programme se déroule sur une journée.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Beceri tazeleme dalışı, ilk dalış sertifikasını yeni almış ve/veya uzun zamandır dalmamış olanların dalış gruplarına katılmadan önce eğitmen veya dalış lideri eşliğinde özet bilgi tekrarı yaptığı ve bazı önemli becerileri uyguladığı 2 dalışlık (1 günlük) bir programdır.","type":"p"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"boat-dragoman-1","duration":{"de":"1 Tag · 2 Tauchgänge","en":"1 day · 2 dives","fr":"1 jour · 2 plongées","tr":"1 gün · 2 dalış"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":[],"healthForm":"diving","id":"beceri-tazeleme","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"iki-dalis","name":{"de":"Programm mit 2 Tauchgängen","en":"2-dive programme","fr":"Programme de 2 plongées","tr":"2 dalışlık program"},"price":120}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Nach längerer Pause oder mit frischem Brevet: kurze Theoriewiederholung und zwei Tauchgänge mit einem Tauchprofi in Kaş, bevor Sie sich den Gruppen anschließen.","en":"Back in the water after a long break, or newly certified? A concise theory review and two dives with a dive professional in Kaş before you join the dive groups.","fr":"Après une longue pause ou un tout nouveau brevet : révision théorique et deux plongées avec un professionnel à Kaş, avant de rejoindre les groupes. Une journée.","tr":"Uzun bir aradan sonra ya da yeni sertifikanızla, gruplara katılmadan önce kısa bir teori tekrarı ve bir profesyonelle iki dalış: bir günlük tazeleme."},"title":{"de":"Tauch-Auffrischung in Kaş: 1 Tag, 2 Tauchgänge","en":"Scuba Skills Update in Kaş: 1 Day, 2 Dives","fr":"Remise à niveau plongée à Kaş, 2 plongées","tr":"Kaş''ta Beceri Tazeleme Dalışı: 1 Gün, 2 Dalış"}},"slug":{"de":"tauchauffrischung","en":"scuba-skills-update","fr":"plongees-de-rappel","tr":"beceri-tazeleme-dalisi"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/plongee/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-egitim","summary":{"de":"Zwei Auffrischungstauchgänge vor dem Einstieg in die Gruppen, nach langer Pause oder mit frischem Brevet.","en":"Two refresher dives before joining the groups, after a long break or with a brand-new certificate.","fr":"Deux plongées de rappel avant de rejoindre les groupes, après une longue pause ou un tout nouveau brevet.","tr":"Uzun aradan sonra ya da yeni sertifikayla, gruplara katılmadan önce 2 dalışlık tazeleme."},"title":{"de":"Tauch-Auffrischung","en":"Scuba Skills Update","fr":"Plongées de rappel","tr":"Beceri Tazeleme Dalışı"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"092de2dd4b08e6","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"092de2dd4b08e6","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"092de2dd4b08e6","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0421d7f6371b74","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0421d7f6371b74","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0421d7f6371b74","origin":"seed"}},"/options/0/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"06b73150493835","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"06b73150493835","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"06b73150493835","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16bb44b0f1e712","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16bb44b0f1e712","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16bb44b0f1e712","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14cda0192ae71d","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14cda0192ae71d","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14cda0192ae71d","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"011d5b5c38aae7","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"011d5b5c38aae7","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"011d5b5c38aae7","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1f6020eea7b382","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1f6020eea7b382","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1f6020eea7b382","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'deneme-dalisi', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Für den allerersten Abstieg bietet Kaş ideale Bedingungen: Das Wasser ist warm und klar, die Tauchplätze sind sicher und ruhig. In einer kurzen Einweisung erklärt der Tauchlehrer die wichtigsten Sicherheits- und Anpassungstechniken unter Wasser und stellt die Tier- und Pflanzenwelt des Mittelmeers vor.","type":"p"},{"text":"Danach tauchen Sie etwa zwanzig Minuten allein mit einem Tauchlehrer oder Divemaster bis maximal 5 Meter Tiefe. Ein Schnuppertauch-Zertifikat hält Ihren ersten Tauchgang fest. Wer zwei Schnuppertauchgänge bucht, taucht an zwei verschiedenen Plätzen.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"A chance to discover the underwater world for absolute beginners: the water in Kaş is warm and clear and the dive spots are safe and calm. You first take a briefing introducing the diving techniques that help you adapt to the underwater world and to SCUBA equipment, and presenting Mediterranean fauna and flora.","type":"p"},{"text":"You are then taken on a dive of about 20 minutes, one-to-one with an instructor, to a maximum of 5 metres. A try-dive certificate from our dive centre immortalises the experience. Those who do a double try dive will dive at two different spots.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Pour le vrai débutant, une petite escapade dans les eaux turquoise qui vous fera découvrir les plaisirs du monde sous-marin : l''eau est chaude et limpide, les sites sûrs et calmes. Un briefing récapitule les techniques d''adaptation au milieu subaquatique, l''équipement de plongée et la faune et la flore méditerranéennes.","type":"p"},{"text":"Vous êtes ensuite accompagné, en tête-à-tête par un moniteur, lors d''une plongée d''une vingtaine de minutes à 5 mètres de profondeur maximum. Un certificat de baptême immortalise cette expérience. Le double baptême se fait sur deux sites différents.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Kaş''ın turkuaz derinliklerinde ilk geçiş için en elverişli şartlar bir araya gelmiştir: su sıcak ve berrak, dalış yerleri güvenli ve sakindir. Kısa bir brifingde eğitmen temel güvenlik ve sualtına uyum bilgilerini ve becerilerini özetler, Akdeniz''in fauna ve florasını tanıtır.","type":"p"},{"text":"Ardından uzman bir eğitmen veya dalış lideri eşliğinde en fazla 5 metreye birebir yaklaşık yirmi dakikalık bir dalış yaparsınız. İlk dalışınızı ölümsüzleştirecek bir deneme dalışı sertifikası da verilir. İki deneme dalışı yapanlar iki farklı noktada dalar.","type":"p"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"diving-try-dive-1","duration":{"de":"Ein Tauchgang von etwa 20 Minuten","en":"A dive of about 20 minutes","fr":"Une plongée d''environ 20 minutes","tr":"Yaklaşık 20 dakikalık dalış"},"faq":[],"featured":true,"gallery":["diving-turtle-2","cover-diving"],"healthForm":"diving","id":"deneme-dalisi","includes":{"de":["Tauchgang allein mit dem Tauchlehrer","Einweisung","Schnuppertauch-Zertifikat"],"en":["One-to-one dive with an instructor","Briefing","Try-dive certificate"],"fr":["Plongée en tête-à-tête avec un moniteur","Briefing","Certificat de baptême"],"tr":["Eğitmenle birebir dalış","Brifing","Deneme dalışı sertifikası"]},"itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"tek-deneme","name":{"de":"Schnuppertauchgang","en":"Try dive","fr":"Baptême","tr":"Deneme dalışı"},"price":50},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"iki-deneme","name":{"de":"Zwei Schnuppertauchgänge","en":"Double try dive","fr":"Double baptême","tr":"İki deneme dalışı"},"price":90}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Zum ersten Mal abtauchen: in Kaş eins zu eins mit einem Tauchlehrer, nach kurzem Briefing rund 20 Minuten bis 5 Meter Tiefe, mit Schnuppertauch-Zertifikat.","en":"Never dived before? Take your first dive in Kaş one-to-one with an instructor: a short briefing, about 20 minutes at up to 5 metres and a try-dive certificate.","fr":"Première plongée à Kaş pour les débutants, en tête-à-tête avec un moniteur : briefing, environ 20 minutes jusqu''à 5 mètres et un certificat de baptême.","tr":"Hiç dalmamış olanlar için Kaş''ta eğitmenle birebir ilk dalış: kısa bir brifing, en fazla 5 metrede yaklaşık 20 dakika ve deneme dalışı sertifikası."},"title":{"de":"Schnuppertauchen in Kaş mit eigenem Tauchlehrer","en":"Try Dive in Kaş: First Dive with an Instructor","fr":"Baptême de plongée à Kaş avec un moniteur","tr":"Kaş''ta Deneme Dalışı: Eğitmenle İlk Dalış"}},"slug":{"de":"schnuppertauchen","en":"try-dive","fr":"bapteme-de-plongee","tr":"deneme-dalisi"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/plongee/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-deneme","summary":{"de":"Ein erster Tauchgang allein mit einem Tauchlehrer im klaren Wasser von Kaş, für absolute Anfänger.","en":"A first one-to-one dive with an instructor in the clear waters of Kaş, for absolute beginners.","fr":"Une première plongée en tête-à-tête avec un moniteur dans les eaux limpides de Kaş, pour les vrais débutants.","tr":"Hiç dalmamış olanlar için Kaş''ın berrak sularında eğitmenle birebir ilk dalış."},"title":{"de":"Schnuppertauchen","en":"Try Dive","fr":"Baptême de plongée","tr":"Deneme Dalışı"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1272d26514c8b0","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1272d26514c8b0","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1272d26514c8b0","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02ff4cee8d7c1f","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02ff4cee8d7c1f","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02ff4cee8d7c1f","origin":"seed"}},"/includes":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0fe06489765fa0","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0fe06489765fa0","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0fe06489765fa0","origin":"seed"}},"/options/0/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1e7a4bec9a7671","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1e7a4bec9a7671","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1e7a4bec9a7671","origin":"seed"}},"/options/1/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ca82587c59084","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ca82587c59084","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ca82587c59084","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"155e7273304e47","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"155e7273304e47","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"155e7273304e47","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0dbda46c4b9d83","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0dbda46c4b9d83","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0dbda46c4b9d83","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0855947a45971c","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0855947a45971c","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0855947a45971c","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14a56246f6f1cf","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14a56246f6f1cf","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14a56246f6f1cf","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'dogaya-donus', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Seien Sie Ihr eigener Motor: wandernd, radelnd und paddelnd durch die eindrucksvollsten Ecken dieser schönen Mittelmeerregion. Tauchen Sie ein in die Geschichte bei unserem viertägigen Outdoor-Abenteuer, zelten Sie neben antiken lykischen Stätten und genießen Sie das klare Meer in der Hitze des Tages wie in der Ruhe der Nacht.","type":"p"},{"text":"Entdecken Sie fünf lykische Städte, zwei davon versunken: Paddeln Sie an der versunkenen Stadt Kekova entlang oder schnorcheln Sie nach einer schönen Wanderung zwischen den Ruinen von Aperlai. Abstand vom Trubel der Stadt ist garantiert.","type":"p"},{"items":["Aktivitäten: Wandern, Radfahren, Seekajak","Dauer: 3 Nächte, 4 Tage"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"Be your own engine, hiking, biking and paddling your way through the most stunning parts of this beautiful Mediterranean region. Immerse yourself in history on our 4-day multi-activity outdoor adventure, camping next to ancient Lycian sites and enjoying the crystal-clear sea in the heat of the day as well as at its calmest at night.","type":"p"},{"text":"Explore five different Lycian cities, two of which are sunken: paddle along the ancient sunken city of Kekova or treat yourself to a snorkel along the ruins of Aperlai after a beautiful hike. Seclusion from the hustle and bustle of city life is guaranteed.","type":"p"},{"items":["Activities: hiking, biking, sea kayaking","Duration: 3 nights, 4 days"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Soyez votre propre moteur en randonnée, à vélo et en kayak à travers les plus beaux endroits de cette magnifique région méditerranéenne. Plongez dans l''histoire lors de notre aventure de 4 jours, où vous camperez près des sites lyciens antiques et profiterez de la mer cristalline pendant les heures chaudes comme au calme de la nuit.","type":"p"},{"text":"Explorez cinq cités lyciennes, dont deux englouties : pagayez le long de la cité engloutie de Kekova ou offrez-vous du snorkeling parmi les ruines d''Aperlai après une belle randonnée. Isolement et refuge loin de l''agitation urbaine garantis.","type":"p"},{"items":["Activités : randonnée, VTT, kayak de mer","Durée : 3 nuits, 4 jours"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Kendi motorun ol: Akdeniz''in bu güzel bölgesinin en etkileyici yerlerinde yürüyerek, bisiklete binerek ve kürek çekerek ilerle. Antik Likya alanlarının yanında kamp kuracağın, günün sıcağında olduğu kadar gecenin en sakin anlarında da berrak denizin tadını çıkaracağın 4 günlük bir açık hava macerası.","type":"p"},{"text":"İkisi batık beş farklı Likya kentini keşfet: Kekova batık kenti boyunca kürek çek ya da güzel bir yürüyüşün ardından Aperlai harabeleri arasında şnorkelle yüz. Şehrin koşuşturmasından uzaklık ve huzur garanti.","type":"p"},{"items":["Etkinlikler: bisiklet, deniz kanosu, yürüyüş","Süre: 3 gece 4 gün"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"outdoor","conditions":{"de":["Wochentouren finden ab 2 Teilnehmenden statt; Preise pro Person."],"en":["Weekly tours run with a minimum of 2 participants; prices are per person."],"fr":["Les circuits hebdomadaires partent à partir de 2 participants ; prix par personne."],"tr":["Haftalık turlar en az 2 kişiyle yapılır; fiyatlar kişi başıdır."]},"cover":"outdoor-multi-activity-1","duration":{"de":"4 Tage / 3 Nächte","en":"4 days / 3 nights","fr":"4 jours / 3 nuits","tr":"4 gün / 3 gece"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["cover-outdoor","hero-sea-kayak"],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"dogaya-donus","itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Vier Tage Wandern, Radfahren und Seekajak: Camping neben antiken lykischen Stätten, im Kajak an der versunkenen Stadt Kekova und Schnorcheln bei Aperlai.","en":"Four days of hiking, biking and sea kayaking: camp beside ancient Lycian sites, paddle along the sunken city of Kekova and snorkel over the ruins of Aperlai.","fr":"Quatre jours de randonnée, de vélo et de kayak de mer : bivouacs près de sites lyciens antiques, la cité engloutie de Kekova en kayak et snorkeling à Aperlai.","tr":"Yürüyüş, bisiklet ve deniz kanosuyla 4 gün: antik Likya kentlerinin yanında kamp, Kekova Batık Şehri boyunca kürek ve Aperlai kalıntılarında şnorkel."},"title":{"de":"Zurück zur Natur: 4 Tage Multisport in Lykien","en":"Back to Nature: 4-Day Lycian Multi-Activity Trip","fr":"Retour à la nature : 4 jours actifs en Lycie","tr":"Doğaya Dönüş: 4 Günlük Çok Aktiviteli Likya Turu"}},"slug":{"de":"zurueck-zur-natur","en":"back-to-nature","fr":"retour-a-la-nature","tr":"dogaya-donus"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/doga-etkinlikleri/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/outdoor-activities/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/activites-pleine-nature/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-coklu-aktivite","summary":{"de":"Ein viertägiges Multiaktivitätsabenteuer in Lykien zu Fuß, mit dem Rad und im Seekajak.","en":"A 4-day multi-activity Lycian adventure on foot, by bike and by sea kayak.","fr":"Une aventure lycienne multi-activités de 4 jours à pied, à vélo et en kayak de mer.","tr":"Yürüyüş, bisiklet ve deniz kanosuyla 4 günlük çok aktiviteli Likya macerası."},"title":{"de":"Zurück zur Natur","en":"Back to Nature","fr":"Retour à la nature","tr":"Doğaya Dönüş"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a031c33ea9afc","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a031c33ea9afc","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a031c33ea9afc","origin":"seed"}},"/conditions":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"06b582609599ef","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"06b582609599ef","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"06b582609599ef","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0770d8bd028b9c","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0770d8bd028b9c","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0770d8bd028b9c","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"00ec55133d4472","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"00ec55133d4472","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"00ec55133d4472","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0566dfc6613d86","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0566dfc6613d86","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0566dfc6613d86","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19d7258671d0d5","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19d7258671d0d5","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19d7258671d0d5","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1143ca956ad8c7","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1143ca956ad8c7","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1143ca956ad8c7","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'felen-kas-yuruyusu', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Die Wanderung beginnt an einem kleinen Waldhaus, das man durch kleine Dörfer erreicht. Nach einigen hundert Metern legen wir eine kurze Pause ein, um den Blick über das bewaldete Tal zu genießen. Dann zeigt sich die antike Stadt Phellos mit ihrer eindrucksvollen Nekropole und den zwischen Bäumen und Büschen versteckten Sarkophagen.","type":"p"},{"text":"Beim Abstieg zum Dorf Çukurbağ fällt die gut erhaltene Architektur der alten Häuser auf. Im letzten Abschnitt bildet die griechische Insel Meis die Kulisse.","type":"p"},{"items":["Transferzeit: 25 Min.","Schwierigkeit: A (leicht, für alle Altersgruppen)","Höhe: 850–0 m"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"The hike starts at a small forest house reached through small village settlements. After a few hundred metres we stop to enjoy the view of the valley, covered with trees. The ancient city of Phellos then presents itself with its impressive necropolis and tombs hidden in the trees and bushes.","type":"p"},{"text":"Going down towards Çukurbağ village, the well-preserved architecture of the old houses is worth seeing. On the final part of the hike the Greek island of Meis forms the backdrop.","type":"p"},{"items":["Transfer time: 25 min","Grade: A (easy, for anyone of any age)","Altitude: 850–0 m"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"La randonnée commence près d''une petite maison forestière, accessible par de petits villages. Après quelques centaines de mètres, nous faisons une pause pour admirer le panorama de la vallée boisée. La cité antique de Phellos se révèle alors avec son impressionnante nécropole et ses tombes cachées parmi les arbres et les buissons.","type":"p"},{"text":"En descendant vers le village de Çukurbağ, l''architecture bien conservée des vieilles maisons mérite le coup d''œil. Dans la dernière partie, l''île grecque de Meis s''impose à l''horizon.","type":"p"},{"items":["Durée du transfert : 25 min","Niveau : A (facile, pour tous les âges)","Altitude : 850–0 m"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Yürüyüş, küçük köy yerleşimlerinden geçilerek ulaşılan orman evinden başlar. Birkaç yüz metre sonra, yoğun bitki örtüsüyle kaplı vadi manzarasının tadını çıkarmak için kısa bir mola verilir. Ağaçlar arasından birdenbire karşımıza çıkan, lahit mezarlarla donatılmış Phellos kentidir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Çukurbağ Köyü''ne inerken köyün iyi korunmuş ev mimarisi dikkat çeker. Yürüyüşün son etabı fon manzarası olarak Meis adasını sunar.","type":"p"},{"items":["Transfer süresi: 25 dk","Zorluk: A (kolay, her yaştan herkes için)","İrtifa: 850–0 m"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"outdoor","conditions":{"de":["Tagestouren finden ab 4 Teilnehmenden statt."],"en":["Day tours run with a minimum of 4 participants."],"fr":["Les sorties à la journée partent à partir de 4 participants."],"tr":["Günlük turlar en az 4 kişiyle yapılır."]},"cover":"outdoor-hiking-lycian-way-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["cover-outdoor"],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"felen-kas-yuruyusu","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kisi-basi","name":{"de":"Pro Person","en":"Per person","fr":"Par personne","tr":"Kişi başı"},"price":50}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Leichte Tageswanderung von der Nekropole des antiken Phellos über das Dorf Çukurbağ nach Kaş, von 850 m auf Meereshöhe, mit Blick auf Meis. Für jedes Alter.","en":"An easy day hike from the necropolis of ancient Phellos via Çukurbağ village down to Kaş, from 850 m to sea level with views of Meis. Suitable for all ages.","fr":"Randonnée facile d''une journée, de la nécropole de l''antique Phellos à Kaş par le village de Çukurbağ, de 850 m au niveau de la mer, face à Meis. Tous âges.","tr":"Antik Phellos nekropolünden Çukurbağ köyü üzerinden Kaş''a inen kolay yürüyüş: 850 metreden deniz seviyesine, Meis adası manzarasıyla. Her yaşa uygun."},"title":{"de":"Wanderung von Phellos nach Kaş mit Blick auf Meis","en":"Phellos to Kaş Hike: Easy Downhill Day Walk","fr":"Randonnée facile de Phellos à Kaş, vue sur Meis","tr":"Felen (Phellos) – Kaş Yürüyüşü: Kolay Günlük Rota"}},"slug":{"de":"wanderung-phellos-kas","en":"phellos-to-kas-hike","fr":"randonnee-phellos-kas","tr":"felen-kas-yuruyusu"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/doga-etkinlikleri/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/outdoor-activities/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/activites-pleine-nature/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-yuruyus","summary":{"de":"Eine Tageswanderung von der Nekropole von Phellos hinunter nach Kaş mit Blick auf Meis.","en":"A day hike from the Phellos necropolis down to Kaş, with views of Meis.","fr":"Une randonnée à la journée de la nécropole de Phellos jusqu''à Kaş, face à Meis.","tr":"Phellos nekropolünden Kaş''a, Meis manzarasıyla inen günlük yürüyüş."},"title":{"de":"Wanderung Felen (Phellos) – Kaş (Antiphellos)","en":"Felen (Phellos) – Kaş (Antiphellos) Hike","fr":"Randonnée Felen (Phellos) – Kaş (Antiphellos)","tr":"Felen (Phellos) – Kaş (Antiphellos) Yürüyüşü"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0b159fe2a377fa","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0b159fe2a377fa","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0b159fe2a377fa","origin":"seed"}},"/conditions":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0fe8c956d399ee","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0fe8c956d399ee","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0fe8c956d399ee","origin":"seed"}},"/options/0/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"13fb3277b5881d","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"13fb3277b5881d","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"13fb3277b5881d","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a63ebd487e782","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a63ebd487e782","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a63ebd487e782","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"03ed2120462f95","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"03ed2120462f95","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"03ed2120462f95","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0404f9b804c410","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0404f9b804c410","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0404f9b804c410","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'gece-dalisi', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Ein Nachttauchgang für brevetierte Taucher, vom Boot aus, mit Guide und in Gruppen von höchstens 6 Personen. Die Tauchlampe ist inbegriffen. Der Preis ohne Ausrüstung enthält Flasche, Blei, Boot und Guide; der Preis mit Ausrüstung enthält die komplette Ausrüstung, Boot und Guide.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"A night dive for certified divers, made from the boat with a guide and in groups of no more than 6. The dive torch is included. The price without equipment includes tank, weights, boat and guide; the price with equipment includes full equipment, boat and guide.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Une plongée de nuit pour plongeurs certifiés, depuis le bateau, avec un guide et en groupes de 6 plongeurs maximum. La torche de plongée est incluse. Le tarif sans équipement comprend bouteille, plombs, bateau et guide ; le tarif avec équipement comprend tout l''équipement, le bateau et le guide.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Sertifikalı dalıcılar için tekneden, rehber eşliğinde ve en fazla 6 kişilik gruplarla yapılan gece dalışı. Dalış feneri fiyata dahildir. Ekipmansız fiyata tüp, ağırlık, tekne ve rehber; ekipmanlı fiyata tüm ekipman, tekne ve rehber dahildir.","type":"p"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"diving-nudibranch-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["diving-cornetfish-1"],"healthForm":"diving","id":"gece-dalisi","includes":{"de":["Tauchlampe","Boot und Guide","Flasche und Blei"],"en":["Dive torch","Boat and guide","Tank and weights"],"fr":["Torche de plongée","Bateau et guide","Bouteille et plombs"],"tr":["Dalış feneri","Tekne ve rehber","Tüp ve ağırlık"]},"itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"ekipmansiz","name":{"de":"Ohne Ausrüstung","en":"Without equipment","fr":"Sans équipement","tr":"Ekipmansız"},"price":35},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"ekipmanli","name":{"de":"Mit Ausrüstung","en":"With equipment","fr":"Avec équipement","tr":"Ekipmanlı"},"price":44}],"order":2,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Geführter Nachttauchgang vom Boot in Kaş für zertifizierte Taucher, in Gruppen von höchstens 6 Personen, Tauchlampe inklusive, mit oder ohne Ausrüstung.","en":"A guided night dive from the boat in Kaş for certified divers, in groups of no more than 6, with the dive torch included. Choose with or without equipment.","fr":"Plongée de nuit guidée depuis le bateau à Kaş, réservée aux plongeurs certifiés, en groupes de 6 au plus, lampe fournie. Formule avec ou sans équipement.","tr":"Sertifikalı dalıcılar için Kaş''ta tekneden rehberli gece dalışı. Gruplar en fazla 6 kişi, dalış feneri dahil; ekipmanlı ve ekipmansız seçenekler var."},"title":{"de":"Nachttauchgang in Kaş für zertifizierte Taucher","en":"Night Diving in Kaş for Certified Divers","fr":"Plongée de nuit à Kaş pour plongeurs certifiés","tr":"Kaş''ta Gece Dalışı: Sertifikalı Dalıcılar İçin"}},"slug":{"de":"nachttauchgang","en":"night-dive","fr":"plongee-de-nuit","tr":"gece-dalisi"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/plongee/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-sertifikali","summary":{"de":"Geführter Nachttauchgang für brevetierte Taucher; Lampe inklusive.","en":"A guided night dive for certified divers; dive torch included.","fr":"Une plongée de nuit guidée pour plongeurs certifiés ; torche incluse.","tr":"Sertifikalı dalıcılar için rehberli gece dalışı; fener dahil."},"title":{"de":"Nachttauchgang","en":"Night Dive","fr":"Plongée de nuit","tr":"Gece Dalışı"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d1e8d2f6beaf1","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d1e8d2f6beaf1","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d1e8d2f6beaf1","origin":"seed"}},"/includes":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"064f0efd40d8d6","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"064f0efd40d8d6","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"064f0efd40d8d6","origin":"seed"}},"/options/0/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1cffdab18b6f8c","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1cffdab18b6f8c","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1cffdab18b6f8c","origin":"seed"}},"/options/1/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"163504923423ec","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"163504923423ec","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"163504923423ec","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"029227f1fc7543","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"029227f1fc7543","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"029227f1fc7543","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1458ee397fe02c","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1458ee397fe02c","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1458ee397fe02c","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ba2327a76796d","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ba2327a76796d","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ba2327a76796d","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"085f5c9addc0d6","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"085f5c9addc0d6","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"085f5c9addc0d6","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'isik-kiyisi', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Eine Seekajakreise entlang der lykischen Küste: von Kaş bis Andriake, dem historischen Hafen von Myra, vorbei an zwei versunkenen Städten, Mittelmeerpanoramen und versteckten Buchten. Zeltnächte in Üzümlü und Aperlai, eine Hotelnacht in Simena.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Zwei versunkene Städte: Kekova und Aperlai","Übernachtung am Strand und im Camp","Ausblicke auf den Lykischen Weg","Schnorcheln über versunkenen Häfen","Simena, das Burgdorf"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"A sea kayaking journey along the Lycian coast: paddle from Kaş to Andriake, the historic harbour of Myra, discovering two sunken cities, Mediterranean views and hidden coves. Camping nights in Üzümlü and Aperlai, a hotel night in Simena.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["Two sunken cities: Kekova and Aperlai","Beach and camp accommodation","Views of the Lycian Way","Snorkelling over sunken harbours","Simena, the castle village"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Un voyage en kayak de mer le long de la côte lycienne : de Kaş jusqu''à Andriake, le port historique de Myra, en découvrant deux cités englouties, des panoramas méditerranéens et des criques cachées. Nuits en camping à Üzümlü et Aperlai, nuit à l''hôtel à Simena.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["Deux cités englouties : Kekova et Aperlai","Nuits en bord de mer et en camping","Vues sur le chemin lycien","Snorkeling au-dessus de ports engloutis","Simena, le village du château"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Likya kıyısı boyunca bir deniz kayağı yolculuğu: Kaş''tan Myra''nın tarihi limanı Andriake''ye kürek çekerek iki batık şehri, Akdeniz manzaralarını ve saklı koyları keşfedin. Üzümlü ve Aperlai''de kamp geceleri, Simena''da otel konaklaması.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["İki batık şehir: Kekova ve Aperlai","Sahil ve kamp konaklaması","Likya Yolu manzaraları","Batık limanlar üzerinde şnorkel","Kale köyü Simena"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","cover":"kayak-light-coast-1","duration":{"de":"4 Tage / 3 Nächte","en":"4 days / 3 nights","fr":"4 jours / 3 nuits","tr":"4 gün / 3 gece"},"faq":[{"answer":{"de":"Die ersten beiden Nächte im Camp in Üzümlü und Aperlai, die dritte Nacht im Hotel im Burgdorf Simena.","en":"The first two nights are spent camping in Üzümlü and Aperlai, the third night in a hotel in Simena, the castle village.","fr":"Les deux premières nuits en camping à Üzümlü et Aperlai, la troisième à l''hôtel à Simena, le village du château.","tr":"İlk iki gece Üzümlü''de ve Aperlai''de kampta, üçüncü gece kale köyü Simena''da otelde."},"question":{"de":"Wo übernachten wir?","en":"Where do we sleep?","fr":"Où dort-on ?","tr":"Geceleri nerede kalıyoruz?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Sie beginnt in Büyükçakıl in Kaş und endet in Andriake, dem antiken Hafen von Myra.","en":"It starts from Büyükçakıl in Kaş and ends at Andriake, the ancient harbour of Myra.","fr":"Il part de Büyükçakıl à Kaş et se termine à Andriake, le port antique de Myra.","tr":"Kaş''ta Büyükçakıl''dan başlar ve Myra''nın antik limanı Andriake''de biter."},"question":{"de":"Wo beginnt und endet die Tour?","en":"Where does the tour start and end?","fr":"Où commence et se termine le circuit ?","tr":"Tur nerede başlayıp bitiyor?"}}],"featured":false,"gallery":["kayak-light-coast-2"],"healthForm":null,"id":"isik-kiyisi","itinerary":[{"description":{"de":"Treffen in Kaş, Start in Büyükçakıl und Paddeln nach Üzümlü, wo wir zelten. Mittag- und Abendessen im Camp, Frühstück am nächsten Morgen.","en":"Meet in Kaş, start the tour at Büyükçakıl and paddle to Üzümlü, where we camp. Lunch and dinner at the campsite, breakfast the next morning.","fr":"Rendez-vous à Kaş, départ de Büyükçakıl et pagayage jusqu''à Üzümlü, où l''on campe. Déjeuner et dîner au camp, petit-déjeuner le lendemain matin.","tr":"Kaş''ta buluşun ve tura Büyükçakıl''dan başlayıp Üzümlü''ye kürek çekin; kamp burada. Kamp alanında öğle ve akşam yemeği, ertesi sabah kahvaltı."},"title":{"de":"Tag 1 — Von Kaş nach Üzümlü","en":"Day 1 — Kaş to Üzümlü","fr":"Jour 1 — De Kaş à Üzümlü","tr":"Gün 1 — Kaş''tan Üzümlü''ye"}},{"description":{"de":"Paddeln von Üzümlü zur antiken Stadt Aperlai. Camp in Aperlai; Mittagessen, Abendessen und Frühstück.","en":"Paddle from Üzümlü to the ancient city of Aperlai. Camp at Aperlai; lunch, dinner and breakfast.","fr":"Pagayage d''Üzümlü jusqu''à la cité antique d''Aperlai. Camp à Aperlai ; déjeuner, dîner et petit-déjeuner.","tr":"Üzümlü''den antik Aperlai kentine kürek çekin. Aperlai''de kamp; öğle, akşam yemeği ve kahvaltı."},"title":{"de":"Tag 2 — Von Üzümlü nach Aperlai","en":"Day 2 — Üzümlü to Aperlai","fr":"Jour 2 — D''Üzümlü à Aperlai","tr":"Gün 2 — Üzümlü''den Aperlai''ye"}},{"description":{"de":"Weiter nach Simena mit Mittagspause in einem Fischerhaus unterwegs. Abendessen und Übernachtung im Burgdorf Simena.","en":"Continue to Simena with a lunch stop at a fisherman''s house on the way. Dinner and overnight in Simena, the castle village.","fr":"Poursuite vers Simena avec une pause déjeuner chez un pêcheur en chemin. Dîner et nuit à Simena, le village du château.","tr":"Yol üzerinde bir balıkçı evinde öğle yemeği molasıyla Simena''ya devam edin. Kale köyü Simena''da akşam yemeği ve konaklama."},"title":{"de":"Tag 3 — Von Aperlai nach Simena","en":"Day 3 — Aperlai to Simena","fr":"Jour 3 — D''Aperlai à Simena","tr":"Gün 3 — Aperlai''den Simena''ya"}},{"description":{"de":"Nach dem Frühstück über die versunkene Stadt paddeln, Picknick genießen und dann der Ostroute bis nach Andriake folgen.","en":"After breakfast, paddle over the Sunken City, enjoy a picnic lunch, then follow the eastern route to finish at Andriake.","fr":"Après le petit-déjeuner, pagayage au-dessus de la cité engloutie, déjeuner pique-nique, puis la route est jusqu''à l''arrivée à Andriake.","tr":"Kahvaltıdan sonra Batık Şehir üzerinde kürek çekin, piknik öğle yemeğinin tadını çıkarın, ardından doğu rotasını izleyerek Andriake''de tamamlayın."},"title":{"de":"Tag 4 — Versunkene Stadt und Ostroute nach Andriake","en":"Day 4 — The Sunken City and the eastern route to Andriake","fr":"Jour 4 — La cité engloutie et la route est jusqu''à Andriake","tr":"Gün 4 — Batık Şehir ve doğu rotasıyla Andriake"}}],"options":[],"order":2,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Vier Tage im Seekajak von Kaş nach Andriake, dem Hafen von Myra: versunkene Städte Kekova und Aperlai, Camping in Üzümlü und Aperlai, eine Hotelnacht in Simena.","en":"Four days of sea kayaking from Kaş to Andriake, Myra''s harbour: sunken cities of Kekova and Aperlai, camping at Üzümlü and Aperlai, a hotel night in Simena.","fr":"Quatre jours de kayak de mer de Kaş à Andriake, port de Myra : cités englouties de Kekova et d''Aperlai, bivouacs à Üzümlü et Aperlai, une nuit d''hôtel à Simena.","tr":"Kaş''tan Myra''nın limanı Andriake''ye 4 gün deniz kayağı: Kekova ve Aperlai batık şehirleri, Üzümlü ve Aperlai''de kamp, Simena''da otel gecesi ve bol şnorkel."},"title":{"de":"Küste des Lichts: 4 Tage Seekajak und Camping","en":"Coast of Light: 4-Day Lycian Kayak & Camping Tour","fr":"Côte de Lumière : 4 jours de kayak et camping","tr":"Işık Kıyısı: 4 Günlük Likya Kano ve Kamp Turu"}},"slug":{"de":"kueste-des-lichts","en":"coast-of-light","fr":"cote-de-lumiere","tr":"isik-kiyisi"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragomanseakayak.com/tr/turlar/coast-of-light/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/deniz-kanosu/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-cok-gunlu","summary":{"de":"Ein Kajak- und Schnorchelabenteuer entlang des antiken Lykien.","en":"A kayaking and snorkelling adventure along ancient Lycia.","fr":"Une aventure en kayak et en snorkeling le long de l''antique Lycie.","tr":"Antik Likya boyunca kayak ve şnorkel macerası."},"title":{"de":"Küste des Lichts — Kajak- und Campingtour (4 Tage)","en":"Coast of Light — Kayak & Camping Tour (4 Days)","fr":"Côte de Lumière — Kayak et camping (4 jours)","tr":"Işık Kıyısı — Kano & Kamp Turu (4 Gün)"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1edb86d73e6156","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1edb86d73e6156","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1edb86d73e6156","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0770d8bd028b9c","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0770d8bd028b9c","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0770d8bd028b9c","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/0/answer":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"17190dbc840f36","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"17190dbc840f36","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"17190dbc840f36","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/0/question":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0c40cca05a9ca8","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0c40cca05a9ca8","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0c40cca05a9ca8","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/1/answer":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0e587e2457715a","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0e587e2457715a","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0e587e2457715a","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/1/question":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11657b028a489a","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11657b028a489a","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11657b028a489a","origin":"seed"}},"/itinerary/0/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0afd5eea98c9d7","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0afd5eea98c9d7","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0afd5eea98c9d7","origin":"seed"}},"/itinerary/0/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z"