":"11446e76a5f9d3","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f33d807681aa0","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f33d807681aa0","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f33d807681aa0","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0abfb23b8e1296","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0abfb23b8e1296","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0abfb23b8e1296","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1127491e54543a","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1127491e54543a","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1127491e54543a","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'karia-kiyisi', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Eine Seekajakreise an der antiken karischen Küste, wo Geschichte, Natur und Abenteuer zusammenkommen. Entdecken Sie versteckte Buchten, Naturhäfen und historische Stätten wie die antike Stadt Knidos im unberührten Wasser von Mittelmeer und Ägäis. Übernachten Sie in den Ägäisorten Datça und Bozburun und genießen Sie die traditionelle Küche der Ägäis.","type":"p"},{"text":"Diese Route ist noch ein Entwurf; das ausführliche Tagesprogramm wird in Kürze ergänzt.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Die antike Stadt Knidos","Unberührtes Wasser von Mittelmeer und Ägäis","Versteckte Buchten und Naturhäfen","Osmanische Burgen","Übernachtungen in Datça und Bozburun","Traditionelle ägäische Küche"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"A sea kayaking journey on the ancient Carian coast, where history, nature and adventure meet. Discover hidden coves, natural harbours and historic sites such as the ancient city of Knidos in the unspoilt waters of the Mediterranean and the Aegean. Stay in the Aegean towns of Datça and Bozburun and enjoy traditional Aegean cuisine.","type":"p"},{"text":"This route is still a draft; the detailed day-by-day programme will be added soon.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["The ancient city of Knidos","Unspoilt waters of the Mediterranean and the Aegean","Hidden coves and natural harbours","Ottoman castles","Stays in Datça and Bozburun","Traditional Aegean cuisine"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Un voyage en kayak de mer sur la côte de l''antique Carie, là où se rencontrent histoire, nature et aventure. Découvrez des criques cachées, des ports naturels et des sites historiques comme la cité antique de Cnide, dans les eaux préservées de la Méditerranée et de l''Égée. Logez dans les bourgs égéens de Datça et de Bozburun et goûtez à la cuisine égéenne traditionnelle.","type":"p"},{"text":"Cet itinéraire est encore à l''état de projet ; le programme détaillé jour par jour sera ajouté prochainement.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["La cité antique de Cnide","Les eaux préservées de la Méditerranée et de l''Égée","Criques cachées et ports naturels","Châteaux ottomans","Séjours à Datça et Bozburun","Cuisine égéenne traditionnelle"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Tarih, doğa ve maceranın buluştuğu antik Karia kıyılarında bir deniz kayağı yolculuğu. Akdeniz ve Ege''nin el değmemiş sularında saklı koyları, doğal limanları ve Knidos antik kenti gibi tarihi yerleri keşfedin. Datça ve Bozburun''un Ege kasabalarında konaklayın ve geleneksel Ege mutfağının tadını çıkarın.","type":"p"},{"text":"Bu rota taslak aşamasındadır; ayrıntılı günlük program yakında eklenecektir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["Antik Knidos kenti","Akdeniz ve Ege''nin el değmemiş suları","Saklı koylar ve doğal limanlar","Osmanlı kaleleri","Datça ve Bozburun''da konaklama","Geleneksel Ege mutfağı"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","cover":"kayak-caria-coast-1","duration":{"de":"7 Tage / 6 Nächte","en":"7 days / 6 nights","fr":"7 jours / 6 nuits","tr":"7 gün / 6 gece"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":[],"healthForm":null,"id":"karia-kiyisi","itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":5,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Eine Woche Seekajak an der antiken karischen Küste: die Stadt Knidos, versteckte Buchten und Naturhäfen, Nächte in Datça und Bozburun, ägäische Küche.","en":"A week of sea kayaking on the ancient Carian coast: the city of Knidos, hidden coves and natural harbours, stays in Datça and Bozburun and Aegean cuisine.","fr":"Une semaine de kayak de mer sur l''antique côte carienne : la cité de Cnide, criques cachées et ports naturels, étapes à Datça et Bozburun, cuisine égéenne.","tr":"Antik Karia kıyısında bir hafta deniz kayağı: Knidos antik kenti, saklı koylar ve doğal limanlar, Datça ve Bozburun''da konaklama ve geleneksel Ege mutfağı."},"title":{"de":"Karische Küste: eine Woche Seekajak bis Knidos","en":"Carian Shore: A Week of Sea Kayaking to Knidos","fr":"Côte carienne : une semaine de kayak vers Cnide","tr":"Karia Kıyısı: Knidos ve Datça''da 1 Hafta Kayak"}},"slug":{"de":"karische-kueste","en":"carian-shore","fr":"cote-carienne","tr":"karia-kiyisi"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragomanseakayak.com/tr/turlar/carian-shore/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/deniz-kanosu/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-cok-gunlu","summary":{"de":"Eine Woche Kajak-Entdeckung an der eindrucksvollen Küste des antiken Karien.","en":"A week of kayak exploration along the striking coast of ancient Caria.","fr":"Une semaine de découverte en kayak sur la côte saisissante de l''antique Carie.","tr":"Antik Karia''nın etkileyici kıyılarında bir hafta süren kayak keşfi."},"title":{"de":"Karische Küste — 1 Woche","en":"Carian Shore — 1 Week","fr":"Côte carienne — 1 semaine","tr":"Karia Kıyısı — 1 Hafta"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11b5436a3fe3fa","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11b5436a3fe3fa","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11b5436a3fe3fa","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"07a75fc293207d","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"07a75fc293207d","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"07a75fc293207d","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f10f39a43115a","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f10f39a43115a","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f10f39a43115a","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"05e9c505e56cbc","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"05e9c505e56cbc","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"05e9c505e56cbc","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"162fd87c479e12","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"162fd87c479e12","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"162fd87c479e12","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16124f8e57b986","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16124f8e57b986","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16124f8e57b986","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'kas-kekova-tekne-turu', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Der Ausflug dauert insgesamt etwa 9 Stunden. Sie erkunden das Sonderschutzgebiet Kaş-Kekova und sehen die Ruinen antiker Siedlungen, die 3000 Jahre zurückreichen, von lykischer bis römischer Zeit.","type":"p"},{"text":"Im Laufe des Tages besuchen Sie den Archipel von Kaş, den Strand von Limanağzı, die Insel Kekova, die versunkene Stadt und die Burg von Simena (Kaleköy).","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"The tour takes around 9 hours in total. You explore the Specially Protected Area of Kaş-Kekova and see the ruins of ancient settlements going back 3000 years, from Lycian to Roman times.","type":"p"},{"text":"During the day you visit the Kaş archipelago, Limanağzı beach, Kekova island, the Sunken City and Simena Castle (Kaleköy).","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"La sortie dure environ 9 heures au total. Vous explorez la zone spécialement protégée de Kaş-Kekova et découvrez les ruines de cités anciennes vieilles de 3000 ans, des villes lyciennes aux villes romaines.","type":"p"},{"text":"Au cours de la journée, vous visitez l''archipel de Kaş, la plage de Limanağzı, l''île de Kekova, la cité engloutie et le château de Simena (Kaleköy).","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Tur toplamda yaklaşık 9 saat sürer. Kaş-Kekova Özel Koruma Alanı''nı keşfeder, Likya''dan Roma dönemine 3000 yıl öncesine uzanan antik yerleşimlerin güzelliklerini görürsünüz.","type":"p"},{"text":"Gün boyunca Kaş takımadalarını, Limanağzı plajını, Kekova adasını, Batık Şehir''i ve Simena Kalesi''ni (Kaleköy) ziyaret edeceksiniz.","type":"p"}]},"category":"outdoor","cover":"boat-dragoman-aerial-1","duration":{"de":"Etwa 9 Stunden","en":"About 9 hours","fr":"Environ 9 heures","tr":"Yaklaşık 9 saat"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["kayak-simena-castle-1","kas-town-view-1"],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"kas-kekova-tekne-turu","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kisi-basi","name":{"de":"Pro Person","en":"Per person","fr":"Par personne","tr":"Kişi başı"},"price":55}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Ein Bootstag von rund 9 Stunden: Archipel von Kaş, Strand Limanağzı, Insel Kekova, versunkene Stadt und Burg Simena, Ruinen aus lykischer bis römischer Zeit.","en":"A boat day of about 9 hours: the Kaş archipelago, Limanağzı beach, Kekova Island, the Sunken City and Simena Castle, with ruins from Lycian to Roman times.","fr":"Une journée d''environ 9 heures en bateau : archipel de Kaş, plage de Limanağzı, île de Kekova, cité engloutie et château de Simena, des Lyciens aux Romains.","tr":"Yaklaşık 9 saatlik tekne günü: Kaş takımadaları, Limanağzı plajı, Kekova Adası, Batık Şehir ve Simena Kalesi; Likya''dan Roma''ya 3000 yıllık kalıntılar."},"title":{"de":"Bootstour Kaş – Kekova zur versunkenen Stadt","en":"Kaş – Kekova Boat Trip: Sunken City and Simena","fr":"Bateau Kaş – Kekova : cité engloutie et Simena","tr":"Kaş – Kekova Tekne Turu: Batık Şehir ve Simena"}},"slug":{"de":"bootsausflug-kas-kekova-kas","en":"kas-kekova-kas-boat-trip","fr":"excursion-bateau-kas-kekova-kas","tr":"kas-kekova-kas-tekne-turu"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/doga-etkinlikleri/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/outdoor-activities/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/activites-pleine-nature/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-tekne","summary":{"de":"Ein etwa neunstündiger Bootstag vom Archipel von Kaş zur versunkenen Stadt und zur Burg von Simena.","en":"A boat day of about 9 hours from the Kaş archipelago to the Sunken City and Simena Castle.","fr":"Une journée en bateau d''environ 9 heures, de l''archipel de Kaş à la cité engloutie et au château de Simena.","tr":"Kaş takımadalarından Batık Şehir ve Simena Kalesi''ne yaklaşık 9 saatlik tekne günü."},"title":{"de":"Bootsausflug Kaş – Kekova – Kaş","en":"Kaş – Kekova – Kaş Boat Trip","fr":"Excursion en bateau Kaş – Kekova – Kaş","tr":"Kaş – Kekova – Kaş Tekne Turu"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"082ae4674814d9","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"082ae4674814d9","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"082ae4674814d9","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"03d6daa478cb0e","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"03d6daa478cb0e","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"03d6daa478cb0e","origin":"seed"}},"/options/0/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"146b84b99eb9f2","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"146b84b99eb9f2","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"146b84b99eb9f2","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"08d0288b1eac3c","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"08d0288b1eac3c","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"08d0288b1eac3c","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0611c1fb5bda47","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0611c1fb5bda47","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0611c1fb5bda47","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"168b10da1de234","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"168b10da1de234","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"168b10da1de234","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'kekova-bati', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Diese Route zeigt Ihnen zwei versunkene Städte an einem Tag und richtet sich an fortgeschrittene Paddler: etwa 15 km Paddeln und 1,5 km zu Fuß. Sie fahren über die versunkene Stadt Kekova, paddeln weiter zur antiken Stadt Aperlai, wandern ein kurzes Stück auf dem Lykischen Weg und schnorcheln über den versunkenen Hafenruinen.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Der Kekova-Sund und seine Inseln","Die antike Stadt Aperlai","Seekajak und kurze Wanderung","Ganztägige Route"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Route","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → Kekova-Sund und Inseln → Polemos → Sıçak → Aperlai","type":"p"},{"text":"Programm","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 Treffpunkt am Königsgrab in Kaş; Abholung auf der Halbinsel Kaş möglich, Transfer ab Kalkan +10 €.","Etwa 40 Minuten Fahrt nach Üçağız; komplette Ausrüstung und ausführliche Sicherheitseinweisung.","Paddeln Richtung Simena, vorbei am berühmten halb versunkenen lykischen Grab und über die versunkene Stadt; Badepause in der Bucht Tersane.","Mittagessen in einem Fischerhaus: gegrillter Fisch, Kartoffeln und frischer Mittelmeersalat.","Kurze Wanderung auf dem Lykischen Weg und Blick über die Küste von den Mauern Aperlais.","Schnorcheln über versunkenen Häfen und Gebäuden; die Geschichte der antiken Purpurfärberei.","Kajaksegeln mit kleinen Segeln, wenn das Wetter es erlaubt.","Freie Zeit in Üçağız und Rückfahrt nach Kaş; Ankunft 17:00–17:30."],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"This route shows you two sunken cities in one day and is designed for intermediate and advanced paddlers: about 15 km of paddling and a 1.5 km walk. You cross over the Kekova Sunken City, paddle on to the ancient city of Aperlai, take a short hike on the Lycian Way and snorkel over the sunken harbour ruins.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["Kekova Sound and its islands","The ancient city of Aperlai","Sea kayaking plus a short hike","Full-day route"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Route","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → Kekova Sound and islands → Polemos → Sıçak → Aperlai","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 meeting at the King''s Tomb in Kaş; pick-up available on the Kaş Peninsula, Kalkan transfer +€10.","About 40 minutes'' drive to Üçağız; full equipment and a detailed safety briefing.","Paddle towards Simena, past the iconic half-submerged Lycian tomb and over the Kekova Sunken City; swim break in Tersane Bay.","Lunch at a fisherman''s house: grilled fish, potatoes and fresh Mediterranean salad.","Short hike on the Lycian Way and coastal views from the walls of Aperlai.","Snorkel over sunken harbours and buildings; the story of the ancient purple-dye industry.","Kayak sailing with small sails, weather permitting.","Free time in Üçağız and return to Kaş; arrival 17:00–17:30."],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Cet itinéraire vous fait découvrir deux cités englouties en une journée et s''adresse aux pagayeurs de niveau intermédiaire à avancé : environ 15 km de pagaie et 1,5 km de marche. Vous passez au-dessus de la cité engloutie de Kekova, pagayez jusqu''à la cité antique d''Aperlai, marchez un peu sur le chemin lycien et faites du snorkeling sur les vestiges du port englouti.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["La baie de Kekova et ses îles","La cité antique d''Aperlai","Kayak de mer et courte randonnée","Itinéraire à la journée"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Itinéraire","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → baie et îles de Kekova → Polemos → Sıçak → Aperlai","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["07h30 rendez-vous au Tombeau du Roi à Kaş ; transfert possible sur la péninsule de Kaş, transfert depuis Kalkan +10 €.","Environ 40 minutes de route jusqu''à Üçağız ; équipement complet et briefing sécurité détaillé.","Pagayage vers Simena, le long de la célèbre tombe lycienne à demi immergée et au-dessus de la cité engloutie ; pause baignade dans la baie de Tersane.","Déjeuner chez un pêcheur : poisson grillé, pommes de terre et salade méditerranéenne.","Courte randonnée sur le chemin lycien et vue sur la côte depuis les remparts d''Aperlai.","Snorkeling au-dessus des ports et bâtiments engloutis ; l''histoire de l''industrie antique de la pourpre.","Voile en kayak avec de petites voiles, si la météo le permet.","Temps libre à Üçağız et retour à Kaş ; arrivée 17h00–17h30."],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"İki batık şehri tek günde gören bu rota orta ve ileri seviye kürekçiler içindir: yaklaşık 15 km kürek ve 1,5 km yürüyüş. Kekova Batık Şehri''nin üzerinden geçip antik Aperlai kentine kadar kürek çeker, Likya Yolu''nda kısa bir yürüyüş yapar ve batık liman kalıntılarında şnorkel yaparsınız.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["Kekova Boğazı ve adaları","Aperlai antik kenti","Deniz kayağı ve kısa yürüyüş","Tam gün rota"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Rota","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → Kekova Boğazı ve adaları → Polemos → Sıçak → Aperlai","type":"p"},{"text":"Tur programı","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 Kaş Kral Mezarı''nda buluşma; Kaş Yarımadası''nda transfer mevcut, Kalkan transferi +10 €.","Üçağız''a yaklaşık 40 dakikalık yolculuk; tam ekipman ve detaylı güvenlik brifingi.","Simena''ya doğru kürek, yarı batık ikonik Likya mezarı ve Kekova Batık Şehri; Tersane Koyu''nda yüzme molası.","Bir balıkçı evinde öğle yemeği: ızgara balık, patates ve taze Akdeniz salatası.","Likya Yolu''nda kısa yürüyüş ve Aperlai surlarından kıyı manzarası.","Batık limanlar ve yapılar üzerinde şnorkel; antik mor boya endüstrisinin hikâyesi.","Hava uygunsa küçük yelkenlerle kayak yelkeni.","Üçağız''da serbest zaman ve Kaş''a dönüş; varış 17:00–17:30."],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","conditions":{"de":["Transfer ab Kalkan +10 €"],"en":["Transfer from Kalkan +€10"],"fr":["Transfert depuis Kalkan +10 €"],"tr":["Transfer Kalkan''dan +10 €"]},"cover":"kayak-kekova-west-1","duration":{"de":"Tagestour · 07:30 – 16:30/17:00","en":"Day tour · 07:30 – 16:30/17:00","fr":"À la journée · 07h30 – 16h30/17h00","tr":"Günübirlik · 07:30 – 16:30/17:00"},"faq":[{"answer":{"de":"Es ist eine ganztägige Route für fortgeschrittene Paddler mit etwa 15 km Paddeln und 1,5 km Fußweg.","en":"It is a full-day route designed for intermediate and advanced paddlers, with about 15 km of paddling and a 1.5 km walk.","fr":"C''est un itinéraire à la journée conçu pour les pagayeurs intermédiaires et avancés, avec environ 15 km de pagaie et 1,5 km de marche.","tr":"Orta ve ileri seviye kürekçiler için tasarlanmış tam gün bir rotadır; yaklaşık 15 km kürek ve 1,5 km yürüyüş içerir."},"question":{"de":"Für wen ist diese Tour geeignet?","en":"Who is this tour for?","fr":"À qui s''adresse cette sortie ?","tr":"Bu tur kimler için uygun?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Ja. Ein hausgemachtes Mittagessen mit gegrilltem Fisch, Kartoffeln und Mittelmeersalat in einem Fischerhaus in Aperlai ist inbegriffen.","en":"Yes. A home-cooked lunch of grilled fish, potatoes and fresh Mediterranean salad at a fisherman''s house in Aperlai is included.","fr":"Oui. Un déjeuner fait maison chez un pêcheur à Aperlai (poisson grillé, pommes de terre et salade méditerranéenne) est inclus.","tr":"Evet. Aperlai''de bir balıkçı evinde ızgara balık, patates ve taze Akdeniz salatasından oluşan ev yemeği fiyata dahildir."},"question":{"de":"Ist das Mittagessen inbegriffen?","en":"Is lunch included?","fr":"Le déjeuner est-il inclus ?","tr":"Öğle yemeği fiyata dahil mi?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Ja, ein Transfer ab Kalkan ist gegen 10 € Aufpreis möglich. Auch auf der Halbinsel Kaş wird abgeholt.","en":"Yes, a transfer from Kalkan can be arranged for an extra €10. Pick-up is also available on the Kaş Peninsula.","fr":"Oui, un transfert depuis Kalkan peut être organisé avec un supplément de 10 €. Un transfert est aussi possible sur la péninsule de Kaş.","tr":"Evet, Kalkan transferi 10 € ek ücretle ayarlanabilir. Kaş Yarımadası''nda konaklayanlar için transfer de mevcuttur."},"question":{"de":"Kann ich von Kalkan aus teilnehmen?","en":"Can I join from Kalkan?","fr":"Puis-je partir de Kalkan ?","tr":"Kalkan''dan katılabilir miyim?"}}],"featured":false,"gallery":["kayak-kekova-west-2","kayak-aperlai-1","kayak-aperlai-2","kayak-aperlai-3","kayak-aperlai-4"],"healthForm":null,"id":"kekova-bati","includes":{"de":["Vom Kanuverband lizenzierter Guide","Kajak und komplette Ausrüstung","Maske und Schnorchel","Wasserdichter Packsack","Hin- und Rücktransfer ab Kaş","Mittagessen im Restaurant","Snacks"],"en":["Guide licensed by the canoe federation","Kayak and all equipment","Mask and snorkel","Dry bag","Return transfer from Kaş","Restaurant lunch","Snacks"],"fr":["Guide diplômé de la fédération de canoë-kayak","Kayak et tout l''équipement","Masque et tuba","Sac étanche","Transfert aller-retour depuis Kaş","Déjeuner au restaurant","Collations"],"tr":["Kayak federasyonu lisanslı rehber","Kayak ve tüm ekipman","Maske ve şnorkel","Kuru çanta (dry bag)","Kaş''tan gidiş-dönüş transfer","Restoranda öğle yemeği","Atıştırmalıklar"]},"itinerary":[],"meetingPoint":{"de":"Königsgrab, Kaş, 07:30","en":"King''s Tomb, Kaş, 07:30","fr":"Tombeau du Roi, Kaş, 07h30","tr":"Kaş Kral Mezarı, 07:30"},"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kisi-basi","name":{"de":"Pro Person","en":"Per person","fr":"Par personne","tr":"Kişi başı"},"price":80}],"order":2,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Zwei versunkene Städte an einem Tag für Fortgeschrittene: rund 15 km von Kekova nach Aperlai, 1,5 km auf dem Lykischen Weg und Schnorcheln am alten Hafen.","en":"Two sunken cities in one day for intermediate and advanced paddlers: 15 km from Kekova to Aperlai, a 1.5 km Lycian Way hike and snorkelling over the harbour.","fr":"Deux cités englouties en un jour pour pagayeurs intermédiaires et confirmés : 15 km de Kekova à Aperlai, 1,5 km sur la voie lycienne et snorkeling sur le port.","tr":"Orta ve ileri seviye için tam gün: Kekova ve Aperlai''nin iki batık şehri, yaklaşık 15 km kürek, Likya Yolu''nda 1,5 km yürüyüş ve batık liman üzerinde şnorkel."},"title":{"de":"Kekova West: Seekajak-Tagestour nach Aperlai","en":"Kekova West: Full-Day Sea Kayak to Aperlai","fr":"Kekova Ouest : kayak de mer jusqu''à Aperlai","tr":"Kekova Batı: Kekova ve Aperlai Deniz Kayağı"}},"slug":{"de":"kekova-west","en":"kekova-west","fr":"kekova-ouest","tr":"kekova-bati"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragomanseakayak.com/tr/turlar/kekova-west/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/deniz-kanosu/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-gunluk","summary":{"de":"Ein ganztägiges Seekajak-Abenteuer nach Kekova und Aperlai!","en":"A full-day sea kayaking adventure to Kekova and Aperlai!","fr":"Une journée complète en kayak de mer entre Kekova et Aperlai !","tr":"Kekova & Aperlai tam gün deniz kayağı macerası!"},"title":{"de":"Kekova West","en":"Kekova West","fr":"Kekova Ouest","tr":"Kekova Batı"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"17d8ec51640986","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"17d8ec51640986","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"17d8ec51640986","origin":"seed"}},"/conditions":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1d24256b4a36d9","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1d24256b4a36d9","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1d24256b4a36d9","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0587f9909256ff","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0587f9909256ff","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0587f9909256ff","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/0/answer":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"065b91f7e1a674","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"065b91f7e1a674","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"065b91f7e1a