026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"09a6924aae88b6","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"09a6924aae88b6","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"09a6924aae88b6","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"148360796aa28c","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"148360796aa28c","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"148360796aa28c","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"03ea70595c04fd","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"03ea70595c04fd","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"03ea70595c04fd","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1507564dec8b91","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1507564dec8b91","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1507564dec8b91","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'kekova-dogu', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Eine ganztägige Route, auf der Sie über versunkene Ruinen paddeln, in abgelegenen Buchten schwimmen, Tiere beobachten und an einer Meereshöhle vorbeifahren. Sie umfasst etwa 17 km und richtet sich an fortgeschrittene Paddler oder Teilnehmende mit guter Kondition für einen langen Paddeltag.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Theimussa und Simena","Die versunkene Stadt","Die Bucht Hamidiye","Die Piratenhöhle der Insel Aşırlı","Der Bach von Andriake","Meeresschildkröten beobachten","Ziel im Hafen von Andriake"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Route","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız → Simena → Versunkene Stadt → Bucht Hamidiye → Insel Aşırlı → Çayağzı (Andriake)","type":"p"},{"text":"Programm","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 Treffpunkt am Königsgrab in Kaş; Abholung auf der Halbinsel Kaş möglich, Transfer ab Kalkan +10 €.","Etwa 40 Minuten Fahrt nach Üçağız; Ausrüstung, Einweisung und Start mit Blick auf die Nekropole von Üçağız.","Direkt über die versunkene Stadt Kekova paddeln: Treppen, Mauern und Hafenreste unter Wasser.","Bade- und Schnorchelpausen in versteckten Buchten; Wildziegen an den Felsen.","Picknick am Strand mit Sandwiches, Obst und lokalen Snacks.","Vorbei an der Meereshöhle bei der Insel Aşırlı, einst Heimat der Mittelmeer-Mönchsrobben.","Dem Bach von Andriake folgen, einem geschützten Nistgebiet, und Meeresschildkröten beobachten.","Ziel im Hafen von Andriake bei Demre (Myra) und Rückfahrt nach Kaş; Ankunft gegen 17:00–17:30."],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"A full-day route where you paddle over sunken ruins, swim in secluded bays, watch wildlife and pass by a sea cave. It covers about 17 km and is meant for intermediate and advanced paddlers, or participants fit enough for a long day of paddling.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["Theimussa and Simena","The Sunken City","Hamidiye Bay","The pirate cave on Aşırlı Island","The Andriake stream","Sea turtle watching","Finish at Andriake harbour"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Route","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız → Simena → Sunken City → Hamidiye Bay → Aşırlı Island → Çayağzı (Andriake)","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 meeting at the King''s Tomb in Kaş; pick-up can be arranged on the Kaş Peninsula, Kalkan transfer +€10.","About 40 minutes'' drive to Üçağız; equipment, briefing and launch with a view of the Üçağız necropolis.","Paddle straight over the Kekova Sunken City: stairs, walls and harbour remains under the water.","Swimming and snorkelling breaks in hidden bays; wild goats on the cliffs.","Picnic lunch on the shore with sandwiches, fruit and local snacks.","Pass by the sea cave near Aşırlı Island, once home to Mediterranean monk seals.","Follow the Andriake stream, a protected turtle nesting area, to watch sea turtles.","Finish at Andriake harbour near Demre (Myra) and return to Kaş; arrival around 17:00–17:30."],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Une journée complète où vous pagayez au-dessus de ruines englouties, vous baignez dans des baies isolées, observez la faune et longez une grotte marine. Environ 17 km de pagaie, pour des pagayeurs intermédiaires et avancés ou des participants en bonne condition physique pour une longue journée sur l''eau.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["Theimussa et Simena","La cité engloutie","La baie d''Hamidiye","La grotte des pirates de l''île d''Aşırlı","Le ruisseau d''Andriake","Observation des tortues marines","Arrivée au port d''Andriake"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Itinéraire","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız → Simena → cité engloutie → baie d''Hamidiye → île d''Aşırlı → Çayağzı (Andriake)","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["07h30 rendez-vous au Tombeau du Roi à Kaş ; transfert possible sur la péninsule de Kaş, transfert depuis Kalkan +10 €.","Environ 40 minutes de route jusqu''à Üçağız ; équipement, briefing et mise à l''eau face à la nécropole d''Üçağız.","Pagayage directement au-dessus de la cité engloutie : escaliers, murs et vestiges du port sous l''eau.","Pauses baignade et snorkeling dans des baies cachées ; chèvres sauvages sur les falaises.","Déjeuner pique-nique sur la plage : sandwich, fruits et en-cas locaux.","Passage devant la grotte marine près de l''île d''Aşırlı, autrefois habitée par des phoques moines.","Remontée du ruisseau d''Andriake, zone protégée de ponte, pour observer les tortues marines.","Arrivée au port d''Andriake près de Demre (Myra) et retour à Kaş vers 17h00–17h30."],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Batık kalıntıların üzerinden kürek çekip tenha koylarda yüzdüğünüz, yaban hayatını gözlediğiniz ve bir deniz mağarasının yanından geçtiğiniz tam günlük bir rota. Yaklaşık 17 km kürek içerir; orta ve ileri seviye kürekçiler ya da uzun süre kürek çekebilecek kondisyondaki katılımcılar içindir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["Theimussa ve Simena","Batık Şehir","Hamidiye Koyu","Aşırlı Adası korsan mağarası","Andriake deresi","Deniz kaplumbağası gözlemi","Andriake limanında bitiş"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Rota","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız → Simena → Batık Şehir → Hamidiye Koyu → Aşırlı Adası → Çayağzı (Andriake)","type":"p"},{"text":"Tur programı","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 Kaş Kral Mezarı''nda buluşma; Kaş Yarımadası''nda transfer ayarlanabilir, Kalkan transferi +10 €.","Üçağız''a yaklaşık 40 dakikalık yolculuk; donanım, brifing ve Üçağız nekropolü manzarasıyla suya iniş.","Doğrudan Kekova Batık Şehri''nin üzerinden kürek; su altındaki merdivenler, duvarlar ve liman kalıntıları.","Saklı koylarda yüzme ve şnorkel molaları; kayalıklarda yaban keçileri.","Sahilde sandviç, meyve ve yerel atıştırmalıklarla piknik öğle yemeği.","Aşırlı Adası yakınında, bir zamanlar Akdeniz foklarının yaşadığı deniz mağarasının yanından geçiş.","Korunan bir kaplumbağa yuvalama alanı olan Andriake deresini takip ederek kaplumbağa gözlemi.","Demre (Myra) yakınındaki Andriake limanında bitiş ve Kaş''a dönüş; varış 17:00–17:30 civarı."],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","conditions":{"de":["Transfer ab Kalkan +10 €"],"en":["Transfer from Kalkan +€10"],"fr":["Transfert depuis Kalkan +10 €"],"tr":["Transfer Kalkan''dan +10 €"]},"cover":"kayak-kekova-east-1","duration":{"de":"Tagestour · 07:30 – 17:00/17:30","en":"Day tour · 07:30 – 17:00/17:30","fr":"À la journée · 07h30 – 17h00/17h30","tr":"Günübirlik · 07:30 – 17:00/17:30"},"faq":[{"answer":{"de":"Abfahrt in Kaş um 07:30, Rückkehr gegen 17:00–17:30. Im Laufe des Tages paddeln Sie etwa 17 km.","en":"We leave Kaş at 07:30 and are back around 17:00–17:30. You paddle about 17 km during the day.","fr":"Départ de Kaş à 07h30, retour vers 17h00–17h30. Vous pagayez environ 17 km dans la journée.","tr":"07:30''da Kaş''tan çıkılır, 17:00–17:30 civarında dönülür. Gün boyunca yaklaşık 17 km kürek çekilir."},"question":{"de":"Wie lange dauert die Tour und wie weit wird gepaddelt?","en":"How long is the tour and how far do we paddle?","fr":"Quelle est la durée de la sortie et la distance pagayée ?","tr":"Tur ne kadar sürüyor ve ne kadar kürek çekiliyor?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Im Hafen von Andriake bei Demre (Myra). Von dort sind es etwa 40 Minuten Fahrt zurück nach Kaş.","en":"At Andriake harbour near Demre (Myra). From there it is a drive of about 40 minutes back to Kaş.","fr":"Au port d''Andriake, près de Demre (Myra). Le retour à Kaş se fait ensuite en 40 minutes de route environ.","tr":"Demre (Myra) yakınındaki Andriake limanında. Buradan Kaş''a yaklaşık 40 dakikalık bir sürüşle dönülür."},"question":{"de":"Wo endet die Tour?","en":"Where does the tour finish?","fr":"Où se termine la sortie ?","tr":"Tur nerede bitiyor?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Mittags gibt es ein Picknick am Strand mit Sandwiches, Obst und lokalen Snacks; das Lunchpaket ist inbegriffen.","en":"Lunch is a picnic on the shore with sandwiches, fruit and local snacks; the lunch box is included.","fr":"Le déjeuner est un pique-nique sur la plage avec sandwich, fruits et en-cas locaux ; le panier-repas est inclus.","tr":"Sahilde sandviç, meyve ve yerel atıştırmalıklardan oluşan bir piknik öğle yemeği yapılır; öğle yemeği kutusu fiyata dahildir."},"question":{"de":"Wie sieht das Mittagessen aus?","en":"What about lunch?","fr":"Comment se passe le déjeuner ?","tr":"Öğle yemeği nasıl?"}}],"featured":false,"gallery":["kayak-kekova-east-2","kayak-kekova-east-3","kayak-kekova-east-4","kayak-kekova-east-5"],"healthForm":null,"id":"kekova-dogu","includes":{"de":["Vom Kanuverband lizenzierter Guide","Kajak und komplette Ausrüstung","Maske und Schnorchel","Wasserdichter Packsack","Hin- und Rücktransfer ab Kaş","Lunchpaket","Snacks"],"en":["Guide licensed by the canoe federation","Kayak and all equipment","Mask and snorkel","Dry bag","Return transfer from Kaş","Lunch box","Snacks"],"fr":["Guide diplômé de la fédération de canoë-kayak","Kayak et tout l''équipement","Masque et tuba","Sac étanche","Transfert aller-retour depuis Kaş","Panier-repas","Collations"],"tr":["Kayak federasyonu lisanslı rehber","Kayak ve tüm ekipman","Maske ve şnorkel","Kuru çanta (dry bag)","Kaş''tan gidiş-dönüş transfer","Öğle yemeği kutusu","Atıştırmalıklar"]},"itinerary":[],"meetingPoint":{"de":"Königsgrab, Kaş, 07:30","en":"King''s Tomb, Kaş, 07:30","fr":"Tombeau du Roi, Kaş, 07h30","tr":"Kaş Kral Mezarı, 07:30"},"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kisi-basi","name":{"de":"Pro Person","en":"Per person","fr":"Par personne","tr":"Kişi başı"},"price":80}],"order":3,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Ein Tag mit rund 17 km für Fortgeschrittene: Simena, die versunkene Stadt, die Bucht Hamidiye, die Piratenhöhle auf Aşırlı und Meeresschildkröten bei Andriake.","en":"A full day of 17 km for intermediate and advanced paddlers: Simena, the Sunken City, Hamidiye Bay, the pirate cave on Aşırlı Island and turtles at Andriake.","fr":"Journée de 17 km pour pagayeurs intermédiaires et confirmés : Simena, la cité engloutie, la baie d''Hamidiye, la grotte des pirates et les tortues d''Andriake.","tr":"Orta ve ileri seviye için yaklaşık 17 km''lik tam gün: Simena, Batık Şehir, Hamidiye Koyu, Aşırlı Adası''nda korsan mağarası ve Andriake''de kaplumbağalar."},"title":{"de":"Kekova Ost: Seekajak von Kekova nach Andriake","en":"Kekova East: Sea Kayak from Kekova to Andriake","fr":"Kekova Est : kayak de mer de Kekova à Andriake","tr":"Kekova Doğu: Batık Şehir''den Andriake''ye Kayak"}},"slug":{"de":"kekova-ost","en":"kekova-east","fr":"kekova-est","tr":"kekova-dogu"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragomanseakayak.com/tr/turlar/kekova-east/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/deniz-kanosu/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-gunluk","summary":{"de":"Ein ganztägiges Seekajak- und Schnorchelabenteuer zwischen Kekova, Çayağzı und Demre!","en":"A full-day sea kayaking and snorkelling adventure between Kekova, Çayağzı and Demre!","fr":"Une journée complète de kayak de mer et de snorkeling entre Kekova, Çayağzı et Demre !","tr":"Kekova, Çayağzı ve Demre arasında tam gün deniz kayağı ve şnorkel macerası!"},"title":{"de":"Kekova Ost","en":"Kekova East","fr":"Kekova Est","tr":"Kekova Doğu"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0bd65e0f4181e4","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0bd65e0f4181e4","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0bd65e0f4181e4","origin":"seed"}},"/conditions":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1d24256b4a36d9","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1d24256b4a36d9","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1d24256b4a36d9","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"001c2031fb326f","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"001c2031fb326f","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"001c2031fb326f","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/0/answer":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0e78464104b8b4","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0e78464104b8b4","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0e78464104b8b4","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/0/question":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d237dadfad601","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d237dadfad601","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d237dadfad601","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/1/answer":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0e795de7e87f2c","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0e795de7e87f2c","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0e795de7e87f2c","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/1/question":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"13d31c850c1e59","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"13d31c850c1e59","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"13d31c850c1e59","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/2/answer":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1ecf5a370a04a1","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1ecf5a370a04a1","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1ecf5a370a04a1","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/2/question":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0312205527c94f","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0312205527c94f","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0312205527c94f","origin":"seed"}},"/includes":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1f2d0aef22fa1b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1f2d0aef22fa1b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1f2d0aef22fa1b","origin":"seed"}},"/meetingPoint":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"006a8f8b9ec6c4","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"006a8f8b9ec6c4","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"006a8f8b9ec6c4","origin":"seed"}},"/options/0/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d5a45689c624e","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d5a45689c624e","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d5a45689c624e","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"198443ea377f86","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"198443ea377f86","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"198443ea377f86","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1355d85fa91cb4","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1355d85fa91cb4","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1355d85fa91cb4","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"09a7cc53f9722b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"09a7cc53f9722b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"09a7cc53f9722b","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'kekova-kayak-gulet', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Erleben Sie eine der großartigsten Küsten des Mittelmeers auf einer Reise, die das Seekajakfahren mit dem Komfort einer traditionellen türkischen Gulet verbindet. Diese mehrtägige Expedition ist für alle gedacht, die Abenteuer lieben, ohne auf Komfort verzichten zu wollen. Sie führt zu den versteckten Buchten, den antiken lykischen Städten und dem klaren Wasser von Kekova, einem der geschützten Küstengebiete der Türkei.","type":"p"},{"text":"Jeder Tag beginnt an Bord unserer handgefertigten Gulet; danach brechen Sie mit dem Seekajak auf, um einsame Strände, steile Klippen, verborgene Höhlen und die versunkene Stadt Kekova zu entdecken. Unterwegs paddeln Sie auf ruhigem, türkisfarbenem Wasser, besuchen antike Siedlungen wie Aperlai und Simena, legen Badepausen ein und erfahren viel über die reiche Geschichte und die natürliche Schönheit dieser Küste.","type":"p"},{"text":"Nach einem Tag auf dem Wasser kehren Sie auf das Boot zurück, wo frisch zubereitete, hausgemachte türkische Gerichte unserer Gulet-Crew auf Sie warten. Verbringen Sie die Abende beim Schwimmen, beim Betrachten des Sonnenuntergangs, im Gespräch mit Ihren Mitreisenden oder entspannt an Deck unter einem sternenklaren Himmel.","type":"p"},{"text":"Unsere erfahrenen Guides passen die Route jedes Tages an Wetter und Seegang an, damit die Reise sicher und zugleich angenehm bleibt. Diese Flexibilität erlaubt es uns, das Beste aus der Küste herauszuholen, und schafft ein authentisches Entdeckungserlebnis in enger Verbindung mit der Natur.","type":"p"},{"text":"Ob Sie bereits erfahren im Paddeln sind oder zu Ihrem ersten mehrtägigen Seekajak-Abenteuer aufbrechen: Diese Reise bietet ein ausgewogenes Verhältnis von Entdeckung, Komfort, Kultur und türkischer Gastfreundschaft.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Übernachtung auf einer traditionellen türkischen Gulet","Seekajakfahren an der versunkenen Stadt Kekova","Die antiken Städte Aperlai und Simena","Versteckte Buchten, Höhlen und einsame Strände","Frische hausgemachte türkische Küche an Bord","Sonnenuntergänge und Sternennächte an Deck"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Führung und Sicherheit","type":"h2"},{"items":["Ausgebildete, vom Türkischen Kanuverband lizenzierte Tourleiter erzählen Ihnen von Geschichte, Geografie und Kultur der Region.","Route, Wetter und Seegang werden vor jeder Tour geprüft; Ausrüstung und Abläufe werden nach festgelegten Standards vorbereitet.","Kleine Gruppen und bei Bedarf zusätzliche Sicherheitsmaßnahmen, damit sich die Guides um jede einzelne Person kümmern können."],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Schwierigkeitsgrad","type":"h2"},{"text":"Unsere mehrtägigen Kajaktouren entsprechen der Klasse 2: Touren in Gebieten mit wenigen Siedlungen, mit Strömungen von höchstens 2 Knoten, Überfahrten auf offenem Wasser von höchstens 5 Seemeilen, geringem Seegang, geschützten Buchten und sicheren Anlandestränden etwa jede Seemeile und einer täglichen Paddelzeit von unter 6 Stunden.","type":"p"},{"text":"Programm","type":"h2"},{"text":"Das ausführliche Tagesprogramm wird in Kürze ergänzt.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Experience one of the most magnificent coastlines of the Mediterranean on a journey that combines sea kayaking with the comfort of a traditional Turkish gulet. Designed for those who love adventure without giving up comfort, this multi-day expedition explores the hidden coves, ancient Lycian cities and clear waters of Kekova, one of Turkey''s protected coastal areas.","type":"p"},{"text":"Every day starts on our handcrafted gulet; then you set off by sea kayak to discover secluded beaches, steep cliffs, hidden caves and the Kekova Sunken City. Along the way you paddle on calm turquoise water, visit ancient settlements such as Aperlai and Simena, stop for swims and learn about the rich history and natural beauty of this coast.","type":"p"},{"text":"After a day on the water you return to the boat, where fresh home-made Turkish dishes prepared by our gulet crew are waiting. Spend your evenings swimming, watching the sunset, chatting with your travel companions or resting on deck under a starry sky.","type":"p"},{"text":"Our experienced guides adapt each day''s route to the weather and sea conditions so that the journey is both safe and enjoyable. This flexibility lets us make the most of the coast and creates an authentic exploration closely connected with nature.","type":"p"},{"text":"Whether you are an experienced paddler or setting out on your first multi-day sea kayaking adventure, this trip offers a balance of exploration, comfort, culture and Turkish hospitality.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["Accommodation on a traditional Turkish gulet","Sea kayaking at the Kekova Sunken City","The ancient cities of Aperlai and Simena","Hidden coves, caves and secluded beaches","Fresh home-made Turkish food on board","Sunsets and starry nights on deck"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Guiding and safety","type":"h2"},{"items":["Trained tour leaders licensed by the Turkish Canoe Federation share the history, geography and culture of the area.","Route, weather and sea conditions are assessed before every tour; equipment and procedures are prepared to set standards.","Small groups, with extra safety measures when needed, so that every participant gets close attention."],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Difficulty grade","type":"h2"},{"text":"Our multi-day kayak tours are Class 2: trips where settlements are sparse, currents do not exceed 2 knots, open-water crossings do not exceed 5 nautical miles, swell is low, there are sheltered coves and safe landing beaches every mile, and daily paddling time is under 6 hours.","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"text":"The detailed day-by-day programme will be added soon.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Découvrez l''un des plus beaux littoraux de la Méditerranée lors d''un voyage qui associe le kayak de mer au confort d''une goélette turque traditionnelle (gulet). Conçue pour ceux qui aiment l''aventure sans renoncer au confort, cette expédition de plusieurs jours explore les criques cachées, les cités lyciennes antiques et les eaux limpides de Kekova, l''une des zones côtières protégées de Turquie.","type":"p"},{"text":"Chaque journée commence à bord de notre goélette construite à la main ; vous partez ensuite en kayak de mer à la découverte de plages isolées, de falaises abruptes, de grottes cachées et de la cité engloutie de Kekova. En chemin, vous pagayez sur une eau turquoise et calme, visitez des sites antiques comme Aperlai et Simena, faites des pauses baignade et découvrez l''histoire et la beauté naturelle de cette côte.","type":"p"},{"text":"Après une journée sur l''eau, vous retrouvez le bateau, où vous attendent des plats turcs faits maison préparés par l''équipage. Passez vos soirées à vous baigner, à regarder le coucher du soleil, à discuter avec vos compagnons de voyage ou à vous reposer sur le pont sous un ciel étoilé.","type":"p"},{"text":"Nos guides expérimentés adaptent l''itinéraire de chaque jour à la météo et à l''état de la mer pour que le voyage soit à la fois sûr et agréable. Cette souplesse nous permet de profiter au mieux de la côte et crée une expérience de découverte authentique, en lien étroit avec la nature.","type":"p"},{"text":"Que vous soyez un pagayeur expérimenté ou que vous partiez pour votre première aventure de plusieurs jours, ce voyage offre un équilibre entre découverte, confort, culture et hospitalité turque.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["Hébergement sur une goélette turque traditionnelle","Kayak de mer à la cité engloutie de Kekova","Les cités antiques d''Aperlai et de Simena","Criques cachées, grottes et plages isolées","Cuisine turque maison à bord","Couchers de soleil et nuits étoilées sur le pont"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Encadrement et sécurité","type":"h2"},{"items":["Des chefs de groupe formés et diplômés de la Fédération turque de canoë-kayak vous racontent l''histoire, la géographie et la culture de la région.","L''itinéraire, la météo et l''état de la mer sont évalués avant chaque sortie ; équipement et pratiques respectent des standards établis.","Petits groupes, avec des mesures de sécurité supplémentaires si nécessaire, pour une attention réelle à chaque participant."],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Niveau de difficulté","type":"h2"},{"text":"Nos circuits de kayak de plusieurs jours sont de classe 2 : peu de villages, courant inférieur à 2 nœuds, traversées en pleine mer de moins de 5 milles, peu de houle, criques abritées et plages de débarquement sûres tous les milles, et moins de 6 heures de pagaie par jour.","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"text":"Le programme détaillé jour par jour sera ajouté prochainement.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Akdeniz''in en görkemli kıyı şeritlerinden birini, deniz kayağını geleneksel bir Türk guletinin konforuyla birleştiren bir yolculukta deneyimleyin. Konfordan ödün vermeden macerayı sevenler için tasarlanan bu çok günlü keşif gezisi, Türkiye''nin korunan kıyı bölgelerinden biri olan Kekova''nın saklı koylarını, antik Likya kentlerini ve berrak sularını keşfeder.","type":"p"},{"text":"Her gün el yapımı guletimizde başlar; ardından tenha plajları, sarp kayalıkları, gizli mağaraları ve Kekova Batık Şehri''ni keşfetmek için deniz kayaklarıyla yola çıkarsınız. Yol boyunca sakin turkuaz sularda kürek çeker, Aperlai ve Simena gibi antik yerleşimleri ziyaret eder, yüzme molaları verir ve bu kıyının zengin tarihi ile doğal güzelliğini öğrenirsiniz.","type":"p"},{"text":"Suda geçen bir günün ardından, gulet ekibimizin taze hazırladığı ev yapımı Türk yemeklerinin sizi beklediği tekneye dönersiniz. Akşamlarınızı yüzerek, gün batımlarını izleyerek, yol arkadaşlarınızla sohbet ederek ya da yıldızlı gökyüzünün altında güvertede dinlenerek geçirin.","type":"p"},{"text":"Deneyimli rehberlerimiz her günün rotasını hava ve deniz koşullarına göre uyarlayarak yolculuğun hem güvenli hem keyifli olmasını sağlar. Bu esneklik, kıyıdan en iyi şekilde yararlanmamızı ve doğayla bağlı, otantik bir keşif deneyimi yaratmamızı sağlar.","type":"p"},{"text":"İster deneyimli bir kürekçi olun ister ilk çok günlü deniz kayağı maceranıza çıkıyor olun, bu gezi keşif, konfor, kültür ve Türk misafirperverliği arasında bir denge sunar.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["Geleneksel Türk guletinde konaklama","Kekova Batık Şehri''nde deniz kayağı","Antik Aperlai ve Simena kentleri","Saklı koylar, mağaralar ve tenha plajlar","Teknede taze ev yapımı Türk yemekleri","Güvertede gün batımları ve yıldızlı geceler"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Rehberlik ve güvenlik","type":"h2"},{"items":["Türkiye Kano Federasyonu lisanslı, eğitimli tur liderlerinden bölgenin tarihi, coğrafyası ve kültürü üzerine bilgiler.","Rota, hava ve deniz koşulları her tur öncesinde değerlendirilir; ekipman ve uygulamalar belirlenmiş standartlara göre hazırlanır.","Her katılımcıyla yakından ilgilenebilmek için küçük gruplar ve gerektiğinde ek güvenlik önlemleri."],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Zorluk derecesi","type":"h2"},{"text":"Çok günlü kano turlarımız Sınıf 2 zorluk derecesindedir: yerleşimlerin seyrek olduğu, akıntı hızının 2 mili geçmediği, açık deniz geçişlerinin 5 mili aşmadığı, dalgalanmanın az olduğu, her 1 milde kapalı koyların ve güvenli yanaşma plajlarının bulunduğu ve günlük kürek süresinin 6 saatten az olduğu geziler.","type":"p"},{"text":"Tur programı","type":"h2"},{"text":"Ayrıntılı günlük program yakında eklenecek.","type":"p"}]},"category":"seaKayak","cover":"kayak-kekova-gulet-1","duration":{"de":"7 Tage / 6 Nächte","en":"7 days / 6 nights","fr":"7 jours / 6 nuits","tr":"7 gün / 6 gece"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["kayak-simena-castle-1","kayak-group-1"],"healthForm":null,"id":"kekova-kayak-gulet","itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":3,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Sieben Tage auf einer traditionellen Gulet, täglich im Seekajak zu versteckten Buchten, zur versunkenen Stadt und zu lykischen Stätten wie Aperlai und Simena.","en":"Seven days on a traditional Turkish gulet, setting off daily by sea kayak to hidden coves, the Sunken City and Lycian sites such as Aperlai and Simena.","fr":"Sept jours sur un gulet turc traditionnel, et chaque jour en kayak de mer vers criques cachées, cité engloutie et sites lyciens comme Aperlai et Simena.","tr":"Geleneksel bir Türk guletinin konforunda 7 gün: her gün deniz kayağıyla saklı koylara, Batık Şehir''e, Aperlai ve Simena gibi antik Likya yerleşimlerine kürek."},"title":{"de":"Kekova mit Seekajak und Gulet: 7-tägige Reise","en":"Kekova by Sea Kayak and Gulet: a 7-Day Voyage","fr":"Kekova en kayak de mer et gulet : 7 jours","tr":"Kekova Deniz Kayağı ve Gulet Turu: 7 Gün"}},"slug":{"de":"kekova-kajak-und-gulet","en":"kekova-kayak-and-gulet","fr":"kekova-kayak-et-goelette","tr":"kekova-kayak-gulet"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragomanseakayak.com/tr/turlar/kekova-gulet/","https://dragomanseakayak.com/tr/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/deniz-kanosu/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-cok-gunlu","summary":{"de":"Eine Reise, die das Abenteuer Seekajak mit dem Komfort einer traditionellen türkischen Gulet verbindet.","en":"A journey that combines the adventure of sea kayaking with the comfort of a traditional Turkish gulet.","fr":"Un voyage qui associe l''aventure du kayak de mer au confort d''une goélette turque traditionnelle.","tr":"Deniz kayağının macerasını geleneksel bir Türk guletinin konforuyla birleştiren bir yolculuk."},"title":{"de":"Kekova: Seekajak- und Gulettour","en":"Kekova Sea Kayak & Gulet Tour","fr":"Kekova, kayak de mer et goélette","tr":"Kekova Deniz Kayağı & Gulet Turu"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11dae75af3d820","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11dae75af3d820","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11dae75af3d820","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"07a75fc293207d","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"07a75fc293207d","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"07a75fc293207d","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1c2e80221d397f","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1c2e80221d397f","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1c2e80221d397f","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"08459609cd6561","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"08459609cd6561","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"08459609cd6561","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11b9c781c8638f","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11b9c781c8638f","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11b9c781c8638f","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1a22d637e33efe","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1a22d637e33efe","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1a22d637e33efe","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'kekova-klasik', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Auf dieser einsteigerfreundlichen Route entdecken Sie die Insel Kekova, die Bucht Tersane, die Ruinen der versunkenen Stadt Kekova direkt unter der Wasserlinie und Simena (Kaleköy) mit seiner Burg auf dem Hügel. Die Paddelstrecke beträgt etwa 8 km.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Das Ufer der versunkenen Stadt","Badepause in der Bucht Tersane","Das Dorf Simena und der Blick von der Burg","Einsteigerfreundliche Route"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Route","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → Insel Kekova → Bucht Tersane → Versunkene Stadt → Simena","type":"p"},{"text":"Programm","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 Treffpunkt am Königsgrab in Kaş; auf der Halbinsel Kaş kann eine Abholung organisiert werden.","Etwa 40 Minuten Fahrt nach Üçağız mit einem kurzen Halt für Wasser und letzte Besorgungen.","Kajak, Schwimmweste, wasserdichter Packsack und Paddel; ausführliche Paddel- und Sicherheitseinweisung. Schnorchelausrüstung wird gestellt.","Paddeln an Inselchen mit römischen und lykischen Ruinen vorbei zur Bucht Tersane (etwa 30 Minuten) mit kurzer Snackpause.","Im Gänsemarsch entlang der versunkenen Stadt: halb versunkene Mauern, Treppen und der antike Hafen unter klarem Wasser.","Überfahrt nach Simena, das nur per Boot oder Kajak erreichbar ist; Mittagessen am Wasser (gegrillter Fisch, Köfte, gegrilltes Hähnchen oder eine vegetarische/vegane Option).","Etwa 1 Stunde freie Zeit in Simena: Burg, Steingassen, hausgemachtes Eis oder ein Bad.","Rückpaddeln nach Üçağız an in den Felsen versteckten lykischen Gräbern vorbei, danach 40 Minuten Fahrt nach Kaş."],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"On this beginner-friendly route you discover Kekova Island, Tersane Bay, the ruins of the Kekova Sunken City that begin just below the waterline, and Simena (Kaleköy) with its hilltop castle. The paddling distance is about 8 km.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["The shore of the Sunken City","Swim break in Tersane Bay","Simena village and the castle view","Beginner-friendly route"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Route","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → Kekova Island → Tersane Bay → Sunken City → Simena","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 meeting at the King''s Tomb in Kaş; pick-up can be arranged on the Kaş Peninsula.","About 40 minutes'' drive to Üçağız, with a short stop for water and last-minute needs.","Kayak, life jacket, dry bag and paddle; a detailed paddling and safety briefing. Snorkelling gear is provided.","Paddle past islets with Roman and Lycian ruins to Tersane Bay (about 30 minutes) and a short snack break.","Paddle single file along the Sunken City: half-submerged walls, stairs and the ancient harbour under clear water.","Cross to Simena, reachable only by boat or kayak; lunch by the sea (grilled fish, köfte, grilled chicken or a vegetarian/vegan option).","About 1 hour of free time in Simena: the castle, stone lanes, homemade ice cream or a swim.","Paddle back to Üçağız past Lycian tombs hidden in the rocks, then a 40-minute drive to Kaş."],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Sur cet itinéraire accessible aux débutants, vous découvrez l''île de Kekova, la baie de Tersane, les ruines de la cité engloutie de Kekova qui commencent juste sous la surface, et Simena (Kaleköy) avec son château perché. La distance pagayée est d''environ 8 km.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["Le rivage de la cité engloutie","Pause baignade dans la baie de Tersane","Le village de Simena et la vue depuis le château","Itinéraire adapté aux débutants"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Itinéraire","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → île de Kekova → baie de Tersane → cité engloutie → Simena","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["07h30 rendez-vous au Tombeau du Roi à Kaş ; un transfert peut être organisé sur la péninsule de Kaş.","Environ 40 minutes de route jusqu''à Üçağız, avec un court arrêt pour l''eau et les derniers achats.","Kayak, gilet de sauvetage, sac étanche et pagaie ; briefing détaillé sur la pagaie et la sécurité. Le matériel de snorkeling est fourni.","Pagayage le long d''îlots aux ruines romaines et lyciennes jusqu''à la baie de Tersane (environ 30 minutes), courte pause collation.","Pagayage en file indienne le long de la cité engloutie : murs à demi immergés, escaliers et port antique sous une eau limpide.","Traversée vers Simena, accessible uniquement en bateau ou en kayak ; déjeuner au bord de l''eau (poisson grillé, köfte, poulet grillé ou option végétarienne/vegan).","Environ 1 heure de temps libre à Simena : château, ruelles en pierre, glace maison ou baignade.","Retour en kayak vers Üçağız le long de tombes lyciennes cachées dans les rochers, puis 40 minutes de route jusqu''à Kaş."],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Başlangıç dostu bu rotada Kekova Adası''nı, Tersane Koyu''nu, Kekova Batık Şehri''nin su seviyesinin hemen altında başlayan kalıntılarını ve tepesindeki kalesiyle Simena''yı (Kaleköy) keşfedersiniz. Kürek mesafesi yaklaşık 8 km''dir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["Batık Şehir kıyısı","Tersane Koyu''nda yüzme molası","Simena köyü ve kale manzarası","Başlangıç dostu rota"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Rota","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → Kekova Adası → Tersane Koyu → Batık Şehir → Simena","type":"p"},{"text":"Tur programı","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 Kaş Kral Mezarı''nda buluşma; Kaş Yarımadası''nda transfer ayarlanabilir.","Üçağız''a yaklaşık 40 dakikalık yolculuk, su ve son ihtiyaçlar için kısa bir mola.","Kayak, can yeleği, su geçirmez çanta ve kürek ile donanım; detaylı kürek ve güvenlik brifingi. Şnorkel ekipmanı sağlanır.","Roma ve Likya kalıntılı adacıkların yanından Tersane Koyu''na kürek (yaklaşık 30 dakika) ve atıştırmalıklı kısa mola.","Batık Şehir boyunca tek sıra kürek; berrak suyun altındaki yarı batık duvarlar, merdivenler ve antik liman.","Yalnızca tekne veya kayakla ulaşılan Simena''ya geçiş; deniz kenarında öğle yemeği (ızgara balık, köfte, ızgara tavuk veya vejetaryen/vegan seçenek).","Simena''da yaklaşık 1 saat serbest zaman: kale, taş sokaklar, ev yapımı dondurma ya da yüzme.","Kayalıklara gizlenmiş Likya mezarlarının yanından Üçağız''a dönüş küreği, ardından Kaş''a 40 dakikalık sürüş."],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","cover":"kayak-kekova-classic-1","duration":{"de":"Tagestour · 07:30 – 14:30/15:00","en":"Day tour · 07:30 – 14:30/15:00","fr":"À la journée · 07h30 – 14h30/15h00","tr":"Günübirlik · 07:30 – 14:30/15:00"},"faq":[{"answer":{"de":"Ja. Kekova Klassik ist eine einsteigerfreundliche Route; vor dem Start gibt es eine ausführliche Paddel- und Sicherheitseinweisung, und die Guides begleiten Sie während der gesamten Tour.","en":"Yes. Kekova Classic is a beginner-friendly route; a thorough paddling and safety briefing is given before you go on the water, and the guides are with you throughout the tour.","fr":"Oui. Kekova Classique est un itinéraire adapté aux débutants ; un briefing complet sur la pagaie et la sécurité est donné avant la mise à l''eau, et les guides vous accompagnent tout au long de la sortie.","tr":"Evet. Kekova Klasik başlangıç dostu bir rotadır; suya çıkmadan önce kapsamlı bir kürek ve güvenlik brifingi verilir ve rehberler tur boyunca yanınızdadır."},"question":{"de":"Kann ich ohne Kajakerfahrung teilnehmen?","en":"Can I join without any kayaking experience?","fr":"Puis-je participer sans expérience du kayak ?","tr":"Daha önce kano deneyimim olmadan katılabilir miyim?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Nein. Die versunkene Stadt ist geschützt, Schwimmen ist dort verboten; Sie betrachten die Ruinen vom Kajak aus. Badepausen gibt es in der Bucht Tersane und in Simena.","en":"No. The Sunken City is a protected area where swimming is not allowed; you view the ruins from your kayak. Swim breaks are taken in Tersane Bay and in Simena.","fr":"Non. La cité engloutie est une zone protégée où la baignade est interdite ; vous observez les ruines depuis votre kayak. Les pauses baignade ont lieu dans la baie de Tersane et à Simena.","tr":"Hayır. Batık Şehir koruma altındadır ve burada yüzmek yasaktır; kalıntıları kanonuzdan izlersiniz. Yüzme molaları Tersane Koyu''nda ve Simena''da verilir."},"question":{"de":"Darf man über der versunkenen Stadt schwimmen?","en":"Can we swim over the Sunken City?","fr":"Peut-on se baigner au-dessus de la cité engloutie ?","tr":"Batık Şehir''in üzerinde yüzebilir miyiz?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Treffpunkt ist um 07:30 am Königsgrab in Kaş. Wer auf der Halbinsel Kaş wohnt, kann abgeholt werden. Zurück in Kaş sind wir gegen 14:30–15:00.","en":"We meet at 07:30 at the King''s Tomb in Kaş. If you are staying on the Kaş Peninsula, a pick-up can be arranged. We are back in Kaş around 14:30–15:00.","fr":"Rendez-vous à 07h30 au Tombeau du Roi à Kaş. Si vous logez sur la péninsule de Kaş, un transfert peut être organisé. Retour à Kaş vers 14h30–15h00.","tr":"Saat 07:30''da Kaş Kral Mezarı''nda buluşuyoruz. Kaş Yarımadası''nda konaklıyorsanız transfer ayarlanabilir. Kaş''a dönüş 14:30–15:00 civarındadır."},"question":{"de":"Wo und wann ist der Treffpunkt?","en":"Where and when do we meet?","fr":"Où et à quelle heure est le rendez-vous ?","tr":"Buluşma nerede ve saat kaçta?"}}],"featured":true,"gallery":["kayak-kekova-classic-2","kayak-kekova-classic-3","kayak-simena-castle-1","kayak-group-1"],"healthForm":null,"id":"kekova-klasik","includes":{"de":["Vom Kanuverband lizenzierter Guide","Kajak und komplette Ausrüstung","Maske und Schnorchel","Wasserdichter Packsack","Hin- und Rücktransfer ab Kaş","Mittagessen im Restaurant (bei der Option mit Mittagessen)","Snacks"],"en":["Guide licensed by the canoe federation","Kayak and all equipment","Mask and snorkel","Dry bag","Return transfer from Kaş","Restaurant lunch (with the lunch option)","Snacks"],"fr":["Guide diplômé de la fédération de canoë-kayak","Kayak et tout l''équipement","Masque et tuba","Sac étanche","Transfert aller-retour depuis Kaş","Déjeuner au restaurant (avec l''option déjeuner)","Collations"],"tr":["Kayak federasyonu lisanslı rehber","Kayak ve tüm ekipman","Maske ve şnorkel","Kuru çanta (dry bag)","Kaş''tan gidiş-dönüş transfer","Restoranda öğle yemeği (yemekli seçenekte)","Atıştırmalıklar"]},"itinerary":[],"meetingPoint":{"de":"Königsgrab, Kaş, 07:30","en":"King''s Tomb, Kaş, 07:30","fr":"Tombeau du Roi, Kaş, 07h30","tr":"Kaş Kral Mezarı, 07:30"},"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"yemekli","name":{"de":"Mit Mittagessen","en":"With lunch","fr":"Déjeuner inclus","tr":"Öğle yemeği dahil"},"price":60},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"yemeksiz","name":{"de":"Ohne Mittagessen","en":"Without lunch","fr":"Sans déjeuner","tr":"Öğle yemeği hariç"},"price":45}],"order":1,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Einsteigerfreundliche Seekajak-Tagestour ab Üçağız zur Insel Kekova, Bucht Tersane, versunkenen Stadt und nach Simena: rund 8 km, Start in Kaş um 7:30 Uhr.","en":"A beginner-friendly day of sea kayaking from Üçağız to Kekova Island, Tersane Bay, the Sunken City and Simena: about 8 km of paddling, leaving Kaş at 07:30.","fr":"Journée de kayak de mer pour débutants : d''Üçağız à l''île de Kekova, la baie de Tersane, la cité engloutie et Simena, environ 8 km, départ de Kaş à 7 h 30.","tr":"Yeni başlayanlara uygun günübirlik rota: Üçağız''dan Kekova Adası, Tersane Koyu, Batık Şehir ve Simena''ya yaklaşık 8 km kürek; Kaş''tan sabah 07:30''da hareket."},"title":{"de":"Kekova Klassik: Seekajak zur versunkenen Stadt","en":"Kekova Classic: Sunken City Sea Kayak Day Trip","fr":"Kekova Classique : kayak de mer et cité engloutie","tr":"Kekova Klasik: Batık Şehir''e Deniz Kayağı Turu"}},"slug":{"de":"kekova-klassik","en":"kekova-classic","fr":"kekova-classique","tr":"kekova-klasik"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragomanseakayak.com/tr/turlar/kekova-classic/","https://dragomanseakayak.com/tr/sss/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/deniz-kanosu/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/dragoman-blog-tr/sea-kayak-kekova-classic-tour/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-gunluk","summary":{"de":"Entdecken Sie die einzigartige Schönheit von Kekova auf diesem unvergesslichen Seekajak-Abenteuer!","en":"Discover the unique beauty of Kekova on this unforgettable sea kayaking adventure!","fr":"Découvrez la beauté unique de Kekova lors de cette aventure inoubliable en kayak de mer !","tr":"Kekova''nın eşsiz güzelliğini bu unutulmaz deniz kayağı macerasında keşfedin!"},"title":{"de":"Kekova Klassik","en":"Kekova Classic","fr":"Kekova Classique","tr":"Kekova Klasik"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"077a89c50c28fb","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"077a89c50c28fb","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"077a89c50c28fb","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14725be6508648","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14725be6508648","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14725be6508648","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/0/answer":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"025e8fc99275c2","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"025e8fc99275c2","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"025e8fc99275c2","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/0/question":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14b56afc2e1723","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14b56afc2e1723","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14b56afc2e1723","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/1/answer":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0486c681c17d42","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0486c681c17d42","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0486c681c17d42","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/1/question":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.