seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1d85a6f4e6218d","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'kiyi-tirmanisi', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Beim Coasteering durchquert man die felsige Küste ganz nah am Wasser. Technische Kletterausrüstung oder fortgeschrittene Klettertechnik braucht es nicht: einfach gehen, klettern, springen, schwimmen und wieder springen!","type":"p"},{"text":"Unterwegs entdecken Sie die geologischen und ökologischen Formationen der Gegend und können Seevögel, Fische, Krabben und Meeresschildkröten beobachten. Mit viel Glück sogar eine scheue Mittelmeer-Mönchsrobbe.","type":"p"},{"items":["Strecke: 3 km","Route: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"Coasteering basically consists of traversing the rocky coastline very close to the water. No technical climbing equipment or advanced climbing techniques are needed: you just walk, climb, jump, swim and jump again!","type":"p"},{"text":"Along your path you explore the geological and ecological formations of the area, and you may observe sea birds, fish, crabs and sea turtles. If you are very lucky, perhaps even an elusive Mediterranean monk seal.","type":"p"},{"items":["Distance: 3 km","Route: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Le coasteering consiste essentiellement à parcourir la côte rocheuse tout près de l''eau. Aucun équipement technique d''escalade ni technique avancée n''est nécessaire : vous marchez, grimpez, sautez, nagez, et sautez encore !","type":"p"},{"text":"En chemin, vous découvrez les formations géologiques et écologiques de la région et pouvez observer oiseaux marins, poissons, crabes et tortues de mer. Pourquoi pas un phoque moine furtif, si vous avez beaucoup de chance ?","type":"p"},{"items":["Distance : 3 km","Itinéraire : Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Coasteering temel olarak kayalık kıyıyı suya çok yakın bir şekilde geçmeyi içerir. Hiçbir teknik tırmanış ekipmanına veya ileri tırmanış tekniğine gerek yoktur: sadece yürüyün, tırmanın, atlayın, yüzün ve tekrar atlayın!","type":"p"},{"text":"Rotanız boyunca bölgenin jeolojik ve ekolojik oluşumlarını keşfeder; deniz kuşlarını, balıkları, yengeçleri ve deniz kaplumbağalarını gözlemleyebilirsiniz. Çok şanslıysanız nadir bir Akdeniz fokunu bile görebilirsiniz.","type":"p"},{"items":["Mesafe: 3 km","Rota: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"outdoor","conditions":{"de":["Mindestens 4 Teilnehmende; Preise pro Person.","Geeignet für 16- bis 55-Jährige, gute körperliche Fitness erforderlich."],"en":["Minimum 4 participants; prices are per person.","Suitable for ages 16–55 and requires a good level of fitness."],"fr":["4 participants minimum ; prix par personne.","Adapté aux 16–55 ans et nécessite une bonne condition physique."],"tr":["En az 4 katılımcı; fiyatlar kişi başıdır.","16–55 yaş grubu için uygundur ve iyi bir fiziksel kondisyon gerektirir."]},"cover":"outdoor-coasteering-1","faq":[],"featured":true,"gallery":["outdoor-coasteering-2","hero-outdoor"],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"kiyi-tirmanisi","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kisi-basi","name":{"de":"Pro Person","en":"Per person","fr":"Par personne","tr":"Kişi başı"},"price":70}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Gehen, klettern, springen und schwimmen auf 3 km Felsküste von Büyükçakıl nach Limanağzı. Ohne Kletterausrüstung; unterwegs Seevögel, Fische und Schildkröten.","en":"Walk, climb, jump and swim along 3 km of rocky shore from Büyükçakıl to Limanağzı. No technical gear needed; look out for sea birds, fish, crabs and turtles.","fr":"Marcher, grimper, sauter et nager sur 3 km de côte rocheuse, de Büyükçakıl à Limanağzı. Sans matériel technique ; oiseaux marins, poissons et tortues en chemin.","tr":"Büyükçakıl''dan Limanağzı''na 3 km kayalık kıyıda yürü, tırman, atla ve yüz. Teknik ekipman gerekmez; deniz kuşları, balıklar ve kaplumbağalar görülebilir."},"title":{"de":"Coasteering in Kaş: von Büyükçakıl nach Limanağzı","en":"Coasteering in Kaş: Büyükçakıl to Limanağzı","fr":"Coasteering à Kaş : de Büyükçakıl à Limanağzı","tr":"Kaş''ta Coasteering: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı Kıyısı"}},"slug":{"de":"coasteering-buyukcakil-limanagzi","en":"coasteering-buyukcakil-limanagzi","fr":"coasteering-buyukcakil-limanagzi","tr":"coasteering-buyukcakil-limanagzi"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/doga-etkinlikleri/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/outdoor-activities/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/activites-pleine-nature/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-kiyi-tirmanisi","summary":{"de":"Gehen, klettern, springen und schwimmen entlang der Felsküste: eine 3 km lange Küstentraverse.","en":"Walk, climb, jump and swim along the rocky shore: a 3 km coastal traverse.","fr":"Marchez, grimpez, sautez et nagez le long de la côte rocheuse : une traversée de 3 km.","tr":"Kayalık kıyı boyunca yürü, tırman, atla ve yüz: 3 km''lik kıyı traversi."},"title":{"de":"Coasteering: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı","en":"Coasteering: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı","fr":"Coasteering : Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı","tr":"Coasteering: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1345fa3e23d0c7","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1345fa3e23d0c7","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1345fa3e23d0c7","origin":"seed"}},"/conditions":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11416137c0525b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11416137c0525b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11416137c0525b","origin":"seed"}},"/options/0/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f59431af303ee","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f59431af303ee","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f59431af303ee","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"09e58664971b86","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"09e58664971b86","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"09e58664971b86","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14cbdc5fc2f731","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14cbdc5fc2f731","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"14cbdc5fc2f731","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"000d9783330bf3","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"000d9783330bf3","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"000d9783330bf3","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'likya-kayak-konfor', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Begeben Sie sich mit unserer einwöchigen Seekajaktour entlang der Lykischen Küste auf eine Reise durch Zeit und Natur. Paddeln Sie durch klares Wasser und entdecken Sie antike Städte, versteckte Buchten und jahrtausendealte Ruinen. Für Abenteurer, Geschichtsinteressierte und alle, die ein authentisches Erlebnis suchen.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Zwei versunkene antike Städte: Kekova und Aperlai","Ein ganzer Paddeltag im Archipel von Kaş","Der Strand von Patara","Das Lykische Museum in Andriake","Optionale Ausflüge am freien Tag","All-inclusive-Unterkunft mit Komfort"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"Set out on a journey through time and nature with our week-long sea kayaking tour along the Lycian Coast. Paddle through clear water and discover ancient cities, hidden coves and ruins thousands of years old. For adventurers, history lovers and anyone looking for an authentic experience.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["Two sunken ancient cities: Kekova and Aperlai","A full day of paddling in the Kaş archipelago","Patara beach","The Lycian Museum at Andriake","Optional tours on the free day","All-inclusive comfortable accommodation"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Partez pour un voyage dans le temps et la nature avec notre semaine de kayak de mer le long de la côte lycienne. Pagayez dans une eau limpide et découvrez des cités antiques, des criques cachées et des ruines millénaires. Pour les aventuriers, les passionnés d''histoire et tous ceux qui cherchent une expérience authentique.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["Deux cités antiques englouties : Kekova et Aperlai","Une journée complète de pagaie dans l''archipel de Kaş","La plage de Patara","Le musée lycien d''Andriake","Excursions en option le jour libre","Hébergement confortable en formule tout compris"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Likya Kıyısı boyunca haftalık deniz kayağı turumuzla zaman ve doğa içinde bir yolculuğa çıkın. Berrak sularda kürek çekerken antik kentleri, saklı koyları ve binlerce yıllık kalıntıları keşfedin. Maceracılar, tarih meraklıları ve otantik bir deneyim arayanlar için.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["İki batık antik kent: Kekova ve Aperlai","Kaş takımadalarında tam gün kürek","Patara kumsalı","Andriake Likya Müzesi","Serbest gün opsiyonel turları","Her şey dahil konfor konaklama"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","conditions":{"de":["Mindestens 6, höchstens 12 Teilnehmende"],"en":["Minimum 6, maximum 12 participants"],"fr":["6 participants minimum, 12 maximum"],"tr":["En az 6, en fazla 12 kişi"]},"cover":"kayak-lycian-comfort-1","duration":{"de":"7 Tage / 6 Nächte","en":"7 days / 6 nights","fr":"7 jours / 6 nuits","tr":"7 gün / 6 gece"},"excludes":{"de":["Alle internationalen und Inlandsflüge","Persönliche Ausgaben wie Getränke oder Souvenirs","Trinkgelder für Reiseleitung, Kajakguide, Fahrer usw.","Hotelnächte vor und nach den Tourdaten","Optionale Ausflüge am freien Tag","Reiseversicherung"],"en":["All international and domestic flights","Personal expenses such as drinks or souvenirs","Tips for the tour leader, kayak guide, driver etc.","Hotel nights before and after the tour dates","Optional tours on the free day","Travel insurance"],"fr":["Tous les vols internationaux et intérieurs","Dépenses personnelles (boissons, souvenirs)","Pourboires du chef de groupe, du guide de kayak, du chauffeur, etc.","Nuits d''hôtel avant et après les dates du circuit","Excursions en option le jour libre","Assurance voyage"],"tr":["Türkiye''ye/Türkiye''den ve ülke içi tüm uçak biletleri","İçecek veya hediyelik gibi kişisel harcamalar","Tur lideri, kayak rehberi, sürücü vb. için bahşişler","Tur tarihlerinden önce ve sonra otel konaklaması","Serbest gün opsiyonel turları","Seyahat sigortası"]},"faq":[{"answer":{"de":"Die Tour findet mit mindestens 6 und höchstens 12 Teilnehmenden statt.","en":"The tour runs with a minimum of 6 and a maximum of 12 participants.","fr":"Le circuit se fait avec 6 participants minimum et 12 au maximum.","tr":"Tur en az 6, en fazla 12 kişiyle yapılır."},"question":{"de":"Wie groß ist die Gruppe?","en":"How big is the group?","fr":"Quelle est la taille du groupe ?","tr":"Grup kaç kişilik?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Sie können sich in Kaş erholen oder einen optionalen Ausflug wählen: Bootsfahrt zur griechischen Insel Meis, Besuch von Myra und der Nikolauskirche oder ein Tauchgang in Kaş. Optionale Ausflüge sind nicht im Preis enthalten.","en":"You can rest in Kaş or choose an optional tour: a boat trip to the Greek island of Meis, a visit to Myra and the Church of St Nicholas, or a dive in Kaş. Optional tours are not included in the price.","fr":"Vous pouvez vous reposer à Kaş ou choisir une excursion en option : bateau vers l''île grecque de Meis, visite de Myra et de l''église Saint-Nicolas, ou plongée à Kaş. Les excursions en option ne sont pas comprises dans le prix.","tr":"Kaş''ta dinlenebilir ya da opsiyonel bir tur seçebilirsiniz: Meis adasına tekne turu, Myra ve Aziz Nikolaos Kilisesi ziyareti veya Kaş''ta dalış. Opsiyonel turlar fiyata dahil değildir."},"question":{"de":"Was kann ich am freien Tag unternehmen?","en":"What can I do on the free day?","fr":"Que faire le jour libre ?","tr":"Serbest günde neler yapılabilir?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Ja, alle Flughafentransfers der Gruppe sind inbegriffen. Flüge sind nicht enthalten.","en":"Yes, all group airport transfers are included. Flights are not included.","fr":"Oui, tous les transferts aéroport du groupe sont inclus. Les vols ne le sont pas.","tr":"Evet, tüm grup havalimanı transferleri dahildir. Uçak biletleri dahil değildir."},"question":{"de":"Sind Flughafentransfers inbegriffen?","en":"Are airport transfers included?","fr":"Les transferts aéroport sont-ils inclus ?","tr":"Havalimanı transferi dahil mi?"}}],"featured":true,"gallery":["kayak-lycian-comfort-2","kayak-sea-turtle-1"],"healthForm":null,"id":"likya-kayak-konfor","includes":{"de":["Alle Flughafentransfers der Gruppe","Hotelunterkunft (6 Nächte)","Alle Mahlzeiten inkl. Snacks (außer Mittagessen am freien Tag)","Alle Bus-/Minibusfahrten","Zertifizierter Kajakguide und zweiter Guide","Kajak, Paddel, Schwimmweste, Packsack, Spritzdecke, Schnorchelausrüstung","Begleitboote bei Bedarf","Trinkwasser an Paddeltagen","Parkgebühren","Gebühren für externe Führer","Eintritt in Museen und Ausgrabungsstätten"],"en":["All group airport transfers","Hotel accommodation (6 nights)","All meals including snacks (except lunch on the free day)","All bus/minibus transport","Certified kayak guide and a second guide","Kayak, paddle, life jacket, dry bag, spray skirt, snorkelling gear","Support boats when needed","Drinking water on paddling days","Parking fees","External guide fees","Museum and site entrance fees"],"fr":["Tous les transferts aéroport du groupe","Hébergement à l''hôtel (6 nuits)","Tous les repas, collations comprises (sauf le déjeuner du jour libre)","Tous les transports en bus/minibus","Guide de kayak certifié et second guide","Kayak, pagaie, gilet, sac étanche, jupe, matériel de snorkeling","Bateaux d''assistance si nécessaire","Eau potable les jours de pagaie","Frais de parking","Frais de guides externes","Entrées des musées et des sites"],"tr":["Tüm grup havalimanı transferleri","Otel konaklaması (6 gece)","Atıştırmalıklar dahil tüm öğünler (serbest gün öğle yemeği hariç)","Tüm otobüs/minibüs ulaşımı","Sertifikalı kayak rehberi ve ikinci rehber","Kayak, kürek, can yeleği, su geçirmez çanta, etek, şnorkel ekipmanı","Gerektiğinde destek tekneleri","Kürek günlerinde içme suyu","Otopark ücretleri","Harici rehber ücretleri","Müze ve ören yeri giriş ücretleri"]},"itinerary":[{"description":{"de":"3 Meilen. Empfang am Flughafen und Transfer nach Üçağız mit einem ersten türkischen Mittagessen unterwegs. Nach dem Einchecken im Hotel in Üçağız/Simena Paddeln über die versunkene Stadt und Erkundung des Burgdorfs Kaleköy; traditionelles türkisches Abendessen.","en":"3 miles. Airport welcome and transfer to Üçağız with a first Turkish lunch on the way. After checking in at the hotel in Üçağız/Simena, paddle over the Kekova Sunken City and explore the castle village of Kaleköy; traditional Turkish dinner.","fr":"3 milles. Accueil à l''aéroport et transfert à Üçağız avec un premier déjeuner turc en route. Après l''installation à l''hôtel à Üçağız/Simena, pagayage au-dessus de la cité engloutie et découverte du village fortifié de Kaleköy ; dîner turc traditionnel.","tr":"3 mil. Havalimanında karşılanıp yol üzerinde ilk Türk öğle yemeğiyle Üçağız''a transfer. Üçağız/Simena''daki otele yerleştikten sonra Kekova Batık Şehri üzerinde kürek ve kale köyü Kaleköy; ardından geleneksel Türk akşam yemeği."},"title":{"de":"Tag 1 — Ankunft und erste Eindrücke von Kekova","en":"Day 1 — Arrival and introduction to Kekova","fr":"Jour 1 — Arrivée et découverte de Kekova","tr":"Gün 1 — Varış ve Kekova''ya giriş"}},{"description":{"de":"8,5 Meilen, 1,5 Meilen zu Fuß. Westroute über die Bucht Tersane zum antiken Aperlai; kurzer Fußweg zu den Ruinen und die Geschichte des Königspurpurs, danach Schnorcheln über der versunkenen Stadt. Mittagessen mit Meeresfrüchten in einem Fischerhaus, auf dem Rückweg optional Kajaksegeln.","en":"8.5 miles, 1.5-mile walk. Western route via Tersane Bay to ancient Aperlai; a short walk to the ruins and the story of royal purple dye, then snorkelling over the sunken city. Seafood lunch at a fisherman''s house, optional kayak sailing on the way back.","fr":"8,5 milles, 1,5 mille à pied. Route ouest par la baie de Tersane jusqu''à l''antique Aperlai ; courte marche jusqu''aux ruines et histoire de la pourpre royale, puis snorkeling au-dessus de la cité engloutie. Déjeuner de produits de la mer chez un pêcheur, voile en kayak en option au retour.","tr":"8,5 mil, 1,5 mil yürüyüş. Tersane Koyu üzerinden batı rotasıyla antik Aperlai''ye kürek; kalıntılara kısa yürüyüş ve kraliyet moru boyasının hikâyesi, ardından batık şehrin üzerinde şnorkel. Bir balıkçı evinde deniz ürünleri öğle yemeği, dönüşte opsiyonel kayak yelkeni."},"title":{"de":"Tag 2 — Aperlai und Schnorcheln","en":"Day 2 — Aperlai and snorkelling","fr":"Jour 2 — Aperlai et snorkeling","tr":"Gün 2 — Aperlai ve şnorkel"}},{"description":{"de":"9 Meilen. Die Ostroute mit versteckten Buchten, der geschützten Robbenhöhle und Schildkrötenbeobachtung am Bach von Andriake. Besuch des Lykischen Museums in Andriake und der antiken Zisterne, danach Transfer nach Kaş zum Abendessen.","en":"9 miles. The eastern route with hidden coves, the protected seal cave and turtle watching on the Andriake stream. Visit to the Lycian Museum at Andriake and the ancient cistern, then transfer to Kaş for dinner.","fr":"9 milles. Route est avec criques cachées, grotte protégée des phoques et observation des tortues sur le ruisseau d''Andriake. Visite du musée lycien d''Andriake et de la citerne antique, puis transfert à Kaş pour le dîner.","tr":"9 mil. Saklı koylar, korunan fok mağarası ve Andriake deresinde kaplumbağa gözlemiyle doğu rotası. Andriake Likya Müzesi ve antik sarnıç ziyareti, akşam yemeği için Kaş''a transfer."},"title":{"de":"Tag 3 — Kekova Ost und das Lykische Museum in Andriake","en":"Day 3 — Kekova East and the Lycian Museum at Andriake","fr":"Jour 3 — Kekova Est et le musée lycien d''Andriake","tr":"Gün 3 — Kekova Doğu ve Andriake Likya Müzesi"}},{"description":{"de":"Erholung in Kaş oder ein optionaler Ausflug: Bootsfahrt nach Meis, Besuch von Myra und der Nikolauskirche oder ein Tauchgang vor Kaş. Abendessen mit mediterranen Spezialitäten.","en":"Rest in Kaş or choose an optional tour: a boat trip to Meis, a visit to Myra and the Church of St Nicholas, or a dive in the waters of Kaş. Dinner with Mediterranean flavours.","fr":"Repos à Kaş ou excursion en option : bateau vers Meis, visite de Myra et de l''église Saint-Nicolas, ou plongée dans les eaux de Kaş. Dîner aux saveurs méditerranéennes.","tr":"Kaş''ta dinlenin veya opsiyonel bir tur seçin: Meis adasına tekne turu, Myra ve Aziz Nikolaos Kilisesi ziyareti ya da Kaş sularında dalış. Akdeniz lezzetleriyle akşam yemeği."},"title":{"de":"Tag 4 — Freier Tag","en":"Day 4 — Free day","fr":"Jour 4 — Journée libre","tr":"Gün 4 — Serbest gün"}},{"description":{"de":"7,5 Meilen. Ein ganzer Paddeltag rund um Kaş: versteckte Buchten, ruhiges Wasser, Blick auf Kaş und Meis und Mittagessen am Meer. Abends traditionelles türkisches Essen.","en":"7.5 miles. A full day of paddling around Kaş: hidden coves, calm water, views of Kaş and Meis and a seaside lunch. Traditional Turkish dinner in the evening.","fr":"7,5 milles. Une journée complète de pagaie autour de Kaş : criques cachées, eau calme, vues sur Kaş et Meis et déjeuner en bord de mer. Dîner turc traditionnel le soir.","tr":"7,5 mil. Kaş çevresinde tam gün kürek: saklı koylar, sakin sular, Kaş ve Meis manzaraları ve deniz kenarında öğle yemeği. Akşam geleneksel Türk yemeği."},"title":{"de":"Tag 5 — Paddeln im Archipel von Kaş","en":"Day 5 — Paddling in the Kaş archipelago","fr":"Jour 5 — Pagaie dans l''archipel de Kaş","tr":"Gün 5 — Kaş takımadalarında kürek"}},{"description":{"de":"9 Meilen. Transfer nach Kalkan und Paddeln zum Strand von Patara mit den Ruinen eines der ältesten Versammlungsgebäude der Welt. Strandpicknick und Zeit für die Ruinen, danach Abschiedsessen im Hotel in Patara.","en":"9 miles. Transfer to Kalkan and paddle to Patara Beach, home to the ruins of one of the oldest assembly buildings in the world. Beach picnic and time to explore the ruins, then a farewell dinner at the hotel in Patara.","fr":"9 milles. Transfert à Kalkan et pagayage jusqu''à la plage de Patara, où se trouvent les ruines de l''un des plus anciens bâtiments d''assemblée au monde. Pique-nique sur la plage et visite des ruines, puis dîner d''adieu à l''hôtel à Patara.","tr":"9 mil. Kalkan''a transfer ve Patara Plajı''na kürek; dünyanın en eski meclis binalarından birinin kalıntıları. Plaj pikniği ve antik kalıntıları gezme zamanı, ardından Patara''daki otelde veda yemeği."},"title":{"de":"Tag 6 — Patara","en":"Day 6 — Patara","fr":"Jour 6 — Patara","tr":"Gün 6 — Patara"}},{"description":{"de":"Frühstück vor dem Auschecken, danach Transfer zum Flughafen.","en":"Breakfast before check-out, then transfer to the airport.","fr":"Petit-déjeuner avant le départ, puis transfert à l''aéroport.","tr":"Çıkıştan önce kahvaltı, ardından havalimanına transfer."},"title":{"de":"Tag 7 — Abreise","en":"Day 7 — Departure","fr":"Jour 7 — Départ","tr":"Gün 7 — Ayrılış"}}],"options":[],"order":4,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Eine Woche Seekajak in Lykien, all inclusive: versunkene Städte Kekova und Aperlai, ein Tag im Archipel von Kaş, Strand von Patara und Lykisches Museum.","en":"A 7-day all-inclusive sea kayaking trip in Lycia: the sunken cities of Kekova and Aperlai, a day in the Kaş archipelago, Patara beach and the Lycian Museum.","fr":"Une semaine tout compris en kayak de mer en Lycie : cités englouties de Kekova et d''Aperlai, journée dans l''archipel de Kaş, plage de Patara et musée lycien.","tr":"Likya kıyısında her şey dahil 7 günlük deniz kayağı: Kekova ve Aperlai batık şehirleri, Kaş takımadalarında tam gün, Patara plajı ve Andriake''deki Likya Müzesi."},"title":{"de":"Lykien im Seekajak mit Komfort, all inclusive","en":"Lycian Kayak & Comfort Escape, All-Inclusive","fr":"Escapade lycienne en kayak, tout compris, 7 jours","tr":"Likya Kayak ve Konfor Kaçamağı: Her Şey Dahil"}},"slug":{"de":"lykien-kajak-komfort","en":"lycian-kayak-comfort-escape","fr":"kayak-lycien-evasion-confort","tr":"likya-kayak-konfor"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragomanseakayak.com/tr/turlar/lycian-comfort-escape/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/dragoman-blog-tr/lycian-kayak-comfort-escape-tour/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-cok-gunlu","summary":{"de":"Sieben Tage Paddeln all-inclusive zwischen Geschichte und Natur.","en":"An all-inclusive 7-day paddling experience between history and nature.","fr":"Sept jours de pagaie tout compris, entre histoire et nature.","tr":"Tarih ve doğa arasında her şey dahil 7 günlük kürek deneyimi."},"title":{"de":"Lykien: Kajak und Komfort","en":"Lycian Kayak & Comfort Escape","fr":"Kayak lycien et évasion confort","tr":"Likya Kayak & Konfor Kaçamağı"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19f9fa10fbfaf5","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19f9fa10fbfaf5","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19f9fa10fbfaf5","origin":"seed"}},"/conditions":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0dbbf997b1d5fb","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0dbbf997b1d5fb","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0dbbf997b1d5fb","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"07a75fc293207d","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"07a75fc293207d","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"07a75fc293207d","origin":"seed"}},"/excludes":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ec745222e2fe4","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ec745222e2fe4","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ec745222e2fe4","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/0/answer":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a2bc126f35a19","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a2bc126f35a19","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a2bc126f35a19","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/0/question":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"091920bceaeebd","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"091920bceaeebd","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"091920bceaeebd","origin":"seed"}},"/faq/1/answer":