  ('event', 'myra-demre-kultur-turu', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Ab Kyaenai, besiedelt seit dem 4. Jahrhundert v. Chr., führt unser Ausflug zur Nikolauskirche bei Myra, wo der Heilige die meiste Zeit verbrachte, zu den lykischen Felsgräbern und zum antiken Theater von Myra.","type":"p"},{"text":"Am Strand von Sülüklü legen wir eine Badepause ein und essen dort zu Mittag. Nach dem Besuch von Andriake bringt uns der Bus nach Hoyran, der Stadt der Muttergöttin aus phrygischer Zeit, wo Sie die Felsgräber erkunden.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Starting from Kyaenai, a settlement since the 4th century BC, our trip includes the Church of St Nicholas near Myra, where the saint spent most of his time, the rock tombs from Lycian times and the ancient theatre of Myra.","type":"p"},{"text":"We stop for a swim at Sülüklü beach and have lunch on the beach. After visiting Andriake, our bus takes us to Hoyran, the city of the mother goddess dating back to the Phrygians, where you can explore the rock tombs.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Au départ de Kyaenai, habitée depuis le IVe siècle av. J.-C., notre excursion comprend l''église Saint-Nicolas près de Myra, où le saint passa la majeure partie de son temps, les tombes rupestres lyciennes et le théâtre antique de Myra.","type":"p"},{"text":"Nous faisons une pause baignade à la plage de Sülüklü et déjeunons sur la plage. Après Andriake, notre bus nous conduit à Hoyran, la ville de la déesse mère datant des Phrygiens, où vous explorez les tombes rupestres.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"M.Ö. 4. yüzyıldan beri yerleşim yeri olarak kullanılan Kyaenai''den başlayan gezimiz, Aziz Nikolaos''un zamanının çoğunu geçirdiği Myra yakınlarındaki Aya Nikola kilisesini, Likya dönemine ait kaya mezarlarını ve Myra''daki antik tiyatroyu kapsar.","type":"p"},{"text":"Sülüklü Plajı''nda yüzme molası verip öğle yemeğini plajda alırız. Andriake''yi ziyaret ettikten sonra otobüsümüz bizi Frigler dönemine uzanan ana tanrıça kenti Hoyran''a götürür; burada kaya mezarlarını keşfedersiniz.","type":"p"}]},"category":"outdoor","conditions":{"de":["Mindestens 2, höchstens 22 Teilnehmende"],"en":["Minimum 2, maximum 22 participants"],"fr":["2 participants minimum, 22 maximum"],"tr":["En az 2, en fazla 22 katılımcı"]},"cover":"outdoor-culture-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["outdoor-culture-2","outdoor-beach-dunes-1"],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"myra-demre-kultur-turu","itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Ein Kulturtag von Kyaenai zu den Felsgräbern und dem Theater von Myra und zur Nikolauskirche, mit Badestopp in Sülüklü, Andriake und den Gräbern von Hoyran.","en":"A day of culture from Kyaenai to the rock tombs and theatre of Myra and the Church of St Nicholas, with a swim at Sülüklü, Andriake and the tombs of Hoyran.","fr":"Une journée culturelle de Kyaenai aux tombes rupestres et au théâtre de Myra, avec l''église Saint-Nicolas, baignade à Sülüklü, Andriake et tombes de Hoyran.","tr":"Kyaenai''den Myra''nın kaya mezarları ve tiyatrosuna, Aya Nikola Kilisesi''nden Sülüklü plajında yüzmeye, Andriake ve Hoyran''a uzanan günlük kültür turu."},"title":{"de":"Kulturtour Myra: Nikolauskirche und Andriake","en":"Myra Culture Tour: St Nicholas, Andriake, Hoyran","fr":"Circuit culturel Myra : Saint-Nicolas et Andriake","tr":"Myra (Demre) Kültür Turu: Aya Nikola ve Andriake"}},"slug":{"de":"kulturtour-myra-demre","en":"myra-demre-culture-tour","fr":"circuit-culturel-myra-demre","tr":"myra-demre-kultur-turu"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/doga-etkinlikleri/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/outdoor-activities/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/activites-pleine-nature/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-kultur","summary":{"de":"Von Kyaenai zum Theater von Myra, von der Nikolauskirche nach Andriake und Hoyran.","en":"From Kyaenai to the theatre of Myra, from the Church of St Nicholas to Andriake and Hoyran.","fr":"De Kyaenai au théâtre de Myra, de l''église Saint-Nicolas à Andriake et Hoyran.","tr":"Kyaenai''den Myra tiyatrosuna, Aya Nikola kilisesinden Andriake ve Hoyran''a."},"title":{"de":"Kulturtour Myra (Demre)","en":"Myra (Demre) Culture Tour","fr":"Circuit culturel Myra (Demre)","tr":"Myra (Demre) Kültür Turu"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f765bd8b476bc","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f765bd8b476bc","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f765bd8b476bc","origin":"seed"}},"/conditions":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"17d38dbd8d81af","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"17d38dbd8d81af","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"17d38dbd8d81af","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"10c4704996dea4","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"10c4704996dea4","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"10c4704996dea4","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1a07cadc01b955","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1a07cadc01b955","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1a07cadc01b955","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"129255c905c1cf","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"129255c905c1cf","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"129255c905c1cf","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"191ed50c429e9d","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"191ed50c429e9d","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"191ed50c429e9d","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'ozel-dalis-dragoman-junior', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Dragoman Junior ist 5,9 Meter lang, hat 80 PS und erreicht jeden Tauchplatz in kurzer Zeit. Die Kapazität ist auf 4 Taucher begrenzt. Solange Wetter und Meer es erlauben, steht das Boot unseren Tauchern unabhängig von Uhrzeit und Tauchplatz zur Verfügung. Die Preise gelten für einen Tauchgang; für diesen besonderen Service wenden Sie sich bitte an unser Büro.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Dragoman Junior is 5.9 metres long with an 80 HP engine and reaches every dive site quickly. Its capacity is limited to 4 divers. As long as the weather and sea allow, it is at our divers'' disposal whatever the time or dive site. Prices are for one dive; please contact our office for this special service.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Dragoman Junior, long de 5,9 mètres et doté d''un moteur de 80 chevaux, rejoint rapidement tous les sites de plongée. Sa capacité est limitée à 4 plongeurs. Tant que la météo et la mer le permettent, il est à la disposition de nos plongeurs quels que soient l''heure et le site. Les tarifs s''entendent pour une plongée ; contactez notre bureau pour ce service particulier.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Dragoman Junior, 5,9 metre uzunluğu ve 80 beygir motor gücüyle tüm dalış noktalarına kısa sürede ulaşım sağlar. Tekne kapasitesi 4 dalıcı ile sınırlıdır. Hava ve deniz koşulları elverdiği sürece saat ve dalış noktası gözetmeksizin dalıcılarımızın hizmetindedir. Fiyatlar 1 dalış içindir; bu özel hizmet için lütfen ofisimizle iletişime geçin.","type":"p"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"diving-wreck-boat-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":[],"healthForm":"diving","id":"ozel-dalis-dragoman-junior","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"bir-dalici","name":{"de":"1 Taucher","en":"1 diver","fr":"1 plongeur","tr":"1 dalıcı"},"price":150},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"iki-uc-dalici","name":{"de":"2–3 Taucher, pro Person","en":"2–3 divers, per diver","fr":"2–3 plongeurs, par personne","tr":"2–3 dalıcı, kişi başı"},"price":95},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"dort-bes-dalici","name":{"de":"4–5 Taucher, pro Person","en":"4–5 divers, per diver","fr":"4–5 plongeurs, par personne","tr":"4–5 dalıcı, kişi başı"},"price":85}],"order":3,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Private Tauchgänge für bis zu 4 Taucher mit dem 5,9-Meter-Schnellboot Dragoman Jr: Wenn Wetter und Meer es erlauben, jederzeit an den Tauchplatz Ihrer Wahl.","en":"Private dives for up to 4 divers on the 5.9-metre speedboat Dragoman Jr: when the weather and sea allow, we take you to the dive site of your choice, any time.","fr":"Plongées privées pour 4 plongeurs au plus sur Dragoman Jr, notre vedette de 5,9 mètres : si la météo et la mer le permettent, le site et l''heure de votre choix.","tr":"5,9 metrelik hız teknemiz Dragoman Jr ile en fazla 4 dalıcıya özel dalış: hava ve deniz uygunsa istediğiniz saatte, istediğiniz dalış noktasına gidiyoruz."},"title":{"de":"Private Tauchgänge in Kaş mit Dragoman Jr","en":"Private Dives in Kaş with Speedboat Dragoman Jr","fr":"Plongées privées à Kaş à bord de Dragoman Jr","tr":"Dragoman Jr ile Kaş''ta Özel Tekne Dalışları"}},"slug":{"de":"private-tauchgaenge-dragoman-junior","en":"private-dives-dragoman-junior","fr":"plongees-privees-dragoman-junior","tr":"dragoman-junior-ozel-dalis"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/plongee/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-sertifikali","summary":{"de":"Wohin und wann Sie wollen: ein privater Tauchgang von unserem Schnellboot aus.","en":"Anywhere, any time: a private dive from our speedboat.","fr":"Où vous voulez, quand vous voulez : une plongée privée depuis notre semi-rigide.","tr":"İstediğiniz zaman, istediğiniz yere: hız teknemizle özel dalış."},"title":{"de":"Private Tauchgänge mit Dragoman Jr","en":"Private Dives with Dragoman Jr","fr":"Plongées privées avec Dragoman Jr","tr":"Dragoman Jr ile Özel Dalışlar"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0b19bd075c645d","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0b19bd075c645d","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0b19bd075c645d","origin":"seed"}},"/options/0/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"03e4c316f614f8","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"03e4c316f614f8","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"03e4c316f614f8","origin":"seed"}},"/options/1/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19e4e0e1623f49","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19e4e0e1623f49","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19e4e0e1623f49","origin":"seed"}},"/options/2/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0cf56c090f4a15","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0cf56c090f4a15","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0cf56c090f4a15","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"146375a56dcfdc","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"146375a56dcfdc","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"146375a56dcfdc","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"013a6510fda82f","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"013a6510fda82f","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"013a6510fda82f","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"06bda597801485","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"06bda597801485","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"06bda597801485","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"13f3d8b651bc02","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"13f3d8b651bc02","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"13f3d8b651bc02","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'ozel-turlar', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Wenn Sie eine Tour nur für Ihre Gruppe wünschen oder sie mit Tauchen und anderen Outdoor-Aktivitäten verbinden möchten, schreiben Sie uns Ihre Vorstellungen; wir stellen Ihr Programm gemeinsam mit Ihnen zusammen. Route, Termine und Dauer richten sich nach Ihren Wünschen.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"If you would like a tour just for your group, or one combined with diving or other outdoor activities, write to us with what you have in mind and we will put your programme together with you. Route, dates and duration are planned around your needs.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Si vous souhaitez une sortie réservée à votre groupe, ou combinée avec de la plongée ou d''autres activités de plein air, écrivez-nous vos attentes et nous préparerons votre programme ensemble. Itinéraire, dates et durée sont adaptés à vos besoins.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Turunuzu grubunuza özel hâle getirmek, dalış veya farklı doğa etkinlikleriyle zenginleştirmek isterseniz beklentilerinizi bize yazın; size özel programınızı birlikte hazırlayalım. Rota, tarih ve süre sizin ihtiyaçlarınıza göre planlanır.","type":"p"}]},"category":"outdoor","cover":"kas-town-view-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["outdoor-beach-dunes-1"],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"ozel-turlar","itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":1,"origin":"mockup","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Eine Tour nur für Ihre Gruppe oder kombiniert mit Tauchen und anderen Outdoor-Aktivitäten? Schreiben Sie Ihre Wünsche, wir planen Route und Termine gemeinsam.","en":"Want a tour just for your group, or combined with diving or other outdoor activities? Tell us what you have in mind and we plan the route and dates with you.","fr":"Un circuit pour votre groupe, ou combiné avec la plongée et d''autres activités de plein air ? Dites-nous vos envies, nous préparons l''itinéraire avec vous.","tr":"Yalnızca grubunuz için ya da dalış ve doğa etkinlikleriyle birleşik bir tur mu istiyorsunuz? Beklentinizi yazın, rotayı ve tarihleri birlikte planlayalım."},"title":{"de":"Private Touren in Kaş, geplant für Ihre Gruppe","en":"Private Tours in Kaş, Planned for Your Group","fr":"Circuits privés à Kaş, conçus pour votre groupe","tr":"Size Özel Turlar: Kaş''ta Grubunuza Özel Program"}},"slug":{"de":"private-touren","en":"private-tours","fr":"circuits-prives","tr":"size-ozel-turlar"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragomanseakayak.com/tr/","https://dragomanseakayak.com/tr/ozel-turlar/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-ozel-turlar","summary":{"de":"Ein Programm nur für Ihre Gruppe: Sagen Sie uns, was Sie sich wünschen, wir planen es gemeinsam.","en":"A programme just for your group: tell us what you have in mind and we plan it together.","fr":"Un programme rien que pour votre groupe : dites-nous ce que vous souhaitez, nous le préparons ensemble.","tr":"Grubunuza özel program: beklentilerinizi yazın, birlikte hazırlayalım."},"title":{"de":"Private Touren","en":"Private Tours","fr":"Circuits privés","tr":"Size Özel Turlar"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"092de28c6eaa6f","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"092de28c6eaa6f","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"092de28c6eaa6f","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19c6bf5c7582ce","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19c6bf5c7582ce","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19c6bf5c7582ce","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1eb6bb02dc6120","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1eb6bb02dc6120","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1eb6bb02dc6120","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"15a9e17f7f3dca","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T