  ('event', 'sarilar-belenli-bisiklet', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Eichen, alte Dorfhäuser und die Ruinen der antiken Stadt Korba begleiten Sie an diesem Radtag. Wir starten auf etwa 450 Metern Höhe; die durchschnittliche Höhe liegt bei rund 355 Metern, und die Strecke ist überwiegend flach. Je nach Jahreszeit essen Sie im Schatten einer Eiche oder im Hof einer alten Schule zu Mittag.","type":"p"},{"text":"Gesamtstrecke: 22 km + 12 km (optional).","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"A view of oak trees, old village houses and the ruins of the ancient city of Korba welcomes you on this cycling day. We start pedalling at around 450 metres; the average altitude during the tour is about 355 metres and the route is mostly flat. Depending on the season, you can have lunch in the shade of an oak tree or in an old school yard.","type":"p"},{"text":"Total distance: 22 km + 12 km (optional).","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Une vue sur de nombreux chênes, de vieilles maisons de village et les ruines de l''ancienne cité de Korba vous accueille pour cette journée de vélo. Nous commençons à pédaler vers 450 mètres d''altitude ; l''altitude moyenne du parcours est d''environ 355 mètres, sur un itinéraire principalement plat. Selon la saison, vous déjeunerez à l''ombre d''un chêne ou dans la cour d''une ancienne école.","type":"p"},{"text":"Distance totale : 22 km + 12 km (en option).","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Meşe ağaçları, eski köy evleri ve antik Korba kentinin kalıntılarından oluşan bir manzara bu bisiklet gününde sizi karşılıyor. Pedallamaya yaklaşık 450 metre rakımda başlıyoruz; tur boyunca ortalama rakım yaklaşık 355 metre, rota ise çoğunlukla düz. Mevsime bağlı olarak öğle yemeğinizi bir meşe ağacının gölgesinde ya da eski bir okul bahçesinde yiyebilirsiniz.","type":"p"},{"text":"Toplam mesafe: 22 km + isteğe bağlı 12 km.","type":"p"}]},"category":"outdoor","cover":"outdoor-cycling-placeholder","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":[],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"sarilar-belenli-bisiklet","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kisi-basi","name":{"de":"Pro Person","en":"Per person","fr":"Par personne","tr":"Kişi başı"},"price":50}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Ein überwiegend flacher Radtag zwischen Eichen, alten Dorfhäusern und den Ruinen des antiken Korba: 22 km plus optional 12 km, im Schnitt auf etwa 355 m Höhe.","en":"A mostly flat day of cycling among oak trees, old village houses and the ruins of ancient Korba: 22 km plus an optional 12 km, at about 355 m on average.","fr":"Une journée de vélo presque plate entre chênes, vieilles maisons de village et ruines de l''antique Korba : 22 km et 12 km en option, vers 355 m d''altitude.","tr":"Meşe ağaçları, eski köy evleri ve antik Korba kalıntıları arasında çoğunlukla düz bir bisiklet günü: 22 km ve isteğe bağlı 12 km daha, ortalama rakım 355 metre."},"title":{"de":"Radtour Sarılar – Belenli zur antiken Stadt Korba","en":"Sarılar – Belenli Bike Tour past Ancient Korba","fr":"Vélo Sarılar – Belenli : chênes et antique Korba","tr":"Sarılar – Belenli Bisiklet Turu ve Antik Korba"}},"slug":{"de":"radtour-sarilar-belenli","en":"sarilar-belenli-bike-tour","fr":"velo-sarilar-belenli","tr":"sarilar-belenli-bisiklet-turu"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/doga-etkinlikleri/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/outdoor-activities/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/activites-pleine-nature/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-bisiklet","summary":{"de":"Ein überwiegend flacher Radtag zwischen Eichen, Dorfhäusern und dem antiken Korba.","en":"A mostly flat cycling day among oak trees, village houses and ancient Korba.","fr":"Une journée de vélo, surtout à plat, entre chênes, maisons de village et l''antique Korba.","tr":"Meşe ağaçları, köy evleri ve antik Korba arasında çoğunlukla düz bir bisiklet günü."},"title":{"de":"Radtour Sarılar – Belenli","en":"Sarılar – Belenli Bike Tour","fr":"Vélo Sarılar – Belenli","tr":"Sarılar – Belenli Bisiklet Turu"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"108e75239c7d5b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"108e75239c7d5b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"108e75239c7d5b","origin":"seed"}},"/options/0/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"02363304ff424b","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"017cd6be1971ed","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"017cd6be1971ed","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"017cd6be1971ed","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11880c7a69e1f0","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11880c7a69e1f0","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11880c7a69e1f0","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0fdbcdc8687fb9","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0fdbcdc8687fb9","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0fdbcdc8687fb9","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"01c1d73bd853f2","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"01c1d73bd853f2","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"01c1d73bd853f2","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'sharm-el-sheikh-2026', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Eine Reise von 8 Tagen / 7 Nächten nach Sharm El Sheikh mit etwa 10 Tauchgängen vom 26. bis 29. Oktober: Gebiete Tiran und Ras Mohammed sowie optional die Thistlegorm. Mindestens Open-Water-Brevet erforderlich.","type":"p"},{"items":["6 Nächte mit Frühstück in Naama Bay","10 Tauchgänge an 4 Tagen, Mittagessen an Bord und Nationalparkgebühren","Alle Transfers"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"An 8-day / 7-night trip to Sharm El Sheikh with about 10 dives on 26–29 October: the Tiran and Ras Mohammed areas and the optional Thistlegorm. Minimum Open Water certification required.","type":"p"},{"items":["6 nights bed and breakfast in Naama Bay","10 dives over 4 days, lunches on the boat and national park fees","All transfers"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Un voyage de 8 jours / 7 nuits à Sharm El Sheikh avec une dizaine de plongées du 26 au 29 octobre : secteurs de Tiran et de Ras Mohammed et, en option, le Thistlegorm. Niveau Open Water minimum.","type":"p"},{"items":["6 nuits en chambre et petit-déjeuner à Naama Bay","10 plongées sur 4 jours, déjeuners à bord et entrées du parc national","Tous les transferts"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"8 gün / 7 gecelik Sharm El Sheikh gezisinde 26–29 Ekim günlerinde toplam yaklaşık 10 dalış; Tiran ve Ras Muhammed bölgeleri ve isteğe bağlı Thistlegorm. En az Open Water sertifikası gerekir.","type":"p"},{"items":["Naama Bay''de 6 gece oda kahvaltı konaklama","4 günde 10 dalış, teknede öğle yemekleri ve milli park giriş ücretleri","Tüm transferler"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"blog-sharm-el-sheikh","duration":{"de":"8 Tage / 7 Nächte","en":"8 days / 7 nights","fr":"8 jours / 7 nuits","tr":"8 gün / 7 gece"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["blog-sharm-napoleon-1","blog-sharm-moray-1"],"healthForm":"diving","id":"sharm-el-sheikh-2026","itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":4,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"on_request","slug":{"de":"tauchreise-sharm-el-sheikh-2026","en":"sharm-el-sheikh-dive-trip-2026","fr":"voyage-plongee-sharm-el-sheikh-2026","tr":"sharm-el-sheikh-dalis-turu-2026"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/dragoman-blog/dragoman-sharm-el-sheikh-dalis-turu-2026/","1987"],"status":"archived","subgroup":"dalis-sertifikali","summary":{"de":"25.–31. Oktober 2026: etwa 10 Tauchgänge an 4 Tagen im Roten Meer.","en":"25–31 October 2026: about 10 dives in 4 days in the Red Sea.","fr":"25–31 octobre 2026 : une dizaine de plongées en 4 jours en mer Rouge.","tr":"25–31 Ekim 2026: Kızıldeniz''de 4 günde yaklaşık 10 dalış."},"title":{"de":"Tauchreise Sharm El Sheikh 2026","en":"Sharm El Sheikh Dive Trip 2026","fr":"Voyage plongée Sharm El Sheikh 2026","tr":"Sharm El Sheikh Dalış Turu 2026"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0305154c3633be","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0305154c3633be","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0305154c3633be","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1bb5d897fd98a9","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1bb5d897fd98a9","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1bb5d897fd98a9","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0e97ca5797ea43","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0e97ca5797ea43","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0e97ca5797ea43","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0104209042a97a","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0104209042a97a","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0104209042a97a","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'archived'),
  ('event', 'ssi-open-water-diver', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Das SSI Open Water Diver ist das weltweit beliebteste Tauchbrevet. Durch Theorie, Übungen im flachen Wasser und Freiwassertauchgänge mit erfahrenen Tauchlehrern erwerben Sie Wissen und Erfahrung zu Sicherheitsregeln, Ausrüstung sowie grundlegenden Tauchfertigkeiten und -techniken.","type":"p"},{"text":"Mit dem international anerkannten Brevet dürfen Sie bis 18 Meter tief tauchen. Die Ausbildung ist auf Türkisch, Englisch, Französisch und Deutsch möglich.","type":"p"},{"text":"Kursdaten","type":"h2"},{"items":["Niveau: Einsteiger","Mindestdauer: 3 Tage","Kurspreis: 395 €"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"The SSI Open Water Diver certification is the most popular diving certification in the world. Through theoretical training, confined (shallow) water sessions and open water dives with expert instructors, you gain knowledge and experience in safety rules, diving equipment, basic diving skills and techniques.","type":"p"},{"text":"With your internationally recognised certification you can dive to a depth of 18 metres. Training is available in Turkish, English, French and German.","type":"p"},{"text":"Course details","type":"h2"},{"items":["Level: Beginner","Minimum duration: 3 days","Course price: €395"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Le SSI Open Water Diver est la certification de plongée la plus répandue au monde. Grâce à la théorie, aux séances en eau peu profonde et aux plongées en mer encadrées par des moniteurs expérimentés, vous acquérez connaissances et expérience sur les règles de sécurité, l''équipement, les techniques et compétences de base.","type":"p"},{"text":"Avec cette certification reconnue internationalement, vous pouvez plonger jusqu''à 18 mètres. La formation est proposée en turc, anglais, français et allemand.","type":"p"},{"text":"Informations sur le cours","type":"h2"},{"items":["Niveau : débutant","Durée minimale : 3 jours","Prix du cours : 395 €"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"SSI Open Water Diver, dünya üzerindeki en popüler dalış sertifikasıdır. Uzman eğitmenler eşliğinde gerçekleştirilen teorik eğitim, sığ su eğitimleri ve deniz dalışları sonucunda güvenlik kuralları, dalış malzemeleri, temel dalış becerileri ve teknikleri konusunda bilgi ve tecrübe kazanırsınız.","type":"p"},{"text":"Uluslararası geçerliliği olan sertifikanızla 18 metre derinliğe kadar dalabilirsiniz. Eğitimler Türkçe, İngilizce, Fransızca ve Almanca olarak verilebilir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Kurs bilgileri","type":"h2"},{"items":["Seviye: Başlangıç","En kısa süre: 3 gün","Kurs ücreti: 395 €"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"diving-course-training-1","duration":{"de":"Mindestens 3 Tage","en":"At least 3 days","fr":"3 jours minimum","tr":"En az 3 gün"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["diving-try-dive-1"],"healthForm":"diving","id":"ssi-open-water-diver","includes":{"de":["Theorieunterricht","Übungen im flachen Wasser","Freiwassertauchgänge","Kursmaterial"],"en":["Theory training","Confined water sessions","Open water dives","Course materials"],"fr":["Formation théorique","Séances en eau peu profonde","Plongées en mer","Matériel pédagogique"],"tr":["Teorik eğitim","Sığ su eğitimleri","Deniz dalışları","Materyal ücreti"]},"itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kurs-ucreti","name":{"de":"Kursgebühr","en":"Course fee","fr":"Prix du cours","tr":"Kurs ücreti"},"price":395}],"order":2,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Machen Sie in Kaş das weltweit anerkannte SSI Open Water Diver Brevet und tauchen Sie überall bis 18 Meter. Mindestens 3 Tage: Theorie, Flach- und Freiwasser.","en":"Get the internationally recognised SSI Open Water Diver certificate in Kaş and dive to 18 metres anywhere. At least 3 days of theory, confined and open water.","fr":"Obtenez à Kaş le brevet SSI Open Water Diver, reconnu partout, pour plonger jusqu''à 18 mètres. Au moins 3 jours : théorie, eaux abritées et milieu naturel.","tr":"Uluslararası geçerli SSI Open Water Diver sertifikasıyla dünyanın her yerinde 18 metreye kadar dalın. Kaş''ta en az 3 gün; teori, sığ su ve açık su dalışları."},"title":{"de":"Tauchen lernen in Kaş: SSI Open Water Diver","en":"Learn to Dive in Kaş: SSI Open Water Diver","fr":"Apprendre à plonger à Kaş : SSI Open Water Diver","tr":"Kaş''ta SSI Open Water Diver: Dalış Sertifikası"}},"slug":{"de":"ssi-open-water-diver-kurs","en":"ssi-open-water-diver-course","fr":"cours-ssi-open-water-diver","tr":"ssi-open-water-diver-kursu"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/plongee/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-egitim","summary":{"de":"Das international anerkannte Brevet für Tauchgänge bis 18 Meter weltweit.","en":"The internationally recognised certification that lets you dive to 18 metres anywhere in the world.","fr":"La certification internationale qui vous permet de plonger jusqu''à 18 mètres partout dans le monde.","tr":"Dünyanın her yerinde 18 metreye kadar dalmanızı sağlayan uluslararası sertifika."},"title":{"de":"SSI Open Water Diver","en":"SSI Open Water Diver","fr":"SSI Open Water Diver","tr":"SSI Open Water Diver"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1eb58e85a39864","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1eb58e85a39864","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1eb58e85a39864","origin":"seed"}},"/duration":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1c421d72d363f6","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1c421d72d363f6","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1c421d72d363f6","origin":"seed"}},"/includes":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16981e09bc7fdc","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16981e09bc7fdc","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16981e09bc7fdc","origin":"seed"}},"/options/0/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"08a6b7a20914ab","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"08a6b7a20914ab","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"08a6b7a20914ab","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"01ad43f92f8bc6","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"01ad43f92f8bc6","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"01ad43f92f8bc6","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1e988c4911a2e9","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1e988c4911a2e9","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1e988c4911a2e9","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"01f98a8ab742de","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"01f98a8ab742de","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"01f98a8ab742de","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f5f5446dc75cc","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f5f5446dc75cc","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f5f5446dc75cc","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'ssi-uzmanlik-kurslari', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"SSI-Spezialkurse vermitteln Wissen und Fertigkeiten in einem bestimmten Bereich des Tauchens. Die meisten dauern 1–2 Tage, das Kursmaterial ist inbegriffen. Im Nitrox-Kurs lernen Sie zum Beispiel, Grundzeiten und Sicherheitsreserven zu verlängern, im Tieftauchkurs sicher zwischen 18 und 40 Metern zu tauchen und im Wracktauchkurs Wracks ohne Penetration bis 30 Meter zu betauchen.","type":"p"},{"text":"Für das Brevet SSI Specialty Diver fragen Sie uns bitte nach den aktuellen Preisen.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"SSI specialty programmes give you knowledge and skills in a particular field of diving. Most take 1–2 days and course materials are included. The Nitrox course, for example, teaches you to extend bottom times and safety margins, Deep Diving to dive safely between 18 and 40 metres, and Wreck Diving to dive wrecks without penetration down to 30 metres.","type":"p"},{"text":"Please ask us for current prices for the SSI Specialty Diver rating.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Les programmes de spécialité SSI vous apportent connaissances et compétences dans un domaine précis de la plongée. La plupart durent 1 à 2 jours, matériel pédagogique compris. Le cours Nitrox vous apprend par exemple à allonger vos temps au fond et vos marges de sécurité, la plongée profonde à évoluer en sécurité entre 18 et 40 mètres, et la plongée sur épave à visiter des épaves sans pénétration jusqu''à 30 mètres.","type":"p"},{"text":"Pour la certification SSI Specialty Diver, demandez-nous les tarifs actuels.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"SSI uzmanlık programları, belirli bir dalış alanında bilgi ve beceri kazandırır. Çoğu 1–2 gün sürer ve materyal ücreti fiyata dahildir. Örneğin Nitrox kursu dip sürelerinizi ve güvenlik marjlarınızı artırmayı, Derin Dalış 18 ile 40 metre arasına güvenle dalmayı, Batık Dalışı 30 metreye kadar penetrasyonsuz batık dalışını öğretir.","type":"p"},{"text":"SSI Speciality Diver sertifikası için güncel fiyatları bize sorun.","type":"p"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"diving-seahorse-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["diving-sea-urchin-1","diving-wreck-plane-1"],"healthForm":"diving","id":"ssi-uzmanlik-kurslari","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"nitrox","name":{"de":"SSI EANx (Nitrox) · 1 Tag","en":"SSI EANx (Nitrox) · 1 day","fr":"SSI EANx (Nitrox) · 1 jour","tr":"SSI EANx (Nitrox) · 1 gün"},"price":170},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"derin-dalis","name":{"de":"SSI Deep Diver · 2 Tage","en":"SSI Deep Diver · 2 days","fr":"SSI Deep Diver · 2 jours","tr":"SSI Deep Diver · 2 gün"},"price":285},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"batik-dalisi","name":{"de":"SSI Wreck Diver · 2 Tage","en":"SSI Wreck Diver · 2 days","fr":"SSI Wreck Diver · 2 jours","tr":"SSI Wreck Diver · 2 gün"},"price":205},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"gece-dalisi-uzmanlik","name":{"de":"SSI Night Diving · 1 Tag","en":"SSI Night Diving · 1 day","fr":"SSI Night Diving · 1 jour","tr":"SSI Night Diving · 1 gün"},"price":275},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"mukemmel-yuzerlik","name":{"de":"SSI Perfect Buoyancy · 1 Tag","en":"SSI Perfect Buoyancy · 1 day","fr":"SSI Perfect Buoyancy · 1 jour","tr":"SSI Perfect Buoyancy · 1 gün"},"price":205},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"sidemount","name":{"de":"SSI Sidemount · 2 Tage","en":"SSI Sidemount · 2 days","fr":"SSI Sidemount · 2 jours","tr":"SSI Sidemount · 2 gün"},"price":290},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"sualti-fotografciligi","name":{"de":"SSI Unterwasserfotografie · 1 Tag","en":"SSI Underwater Photography · 1 day","fr":"SSI Photographie sous-marine · 1 jour","tr":"SSI Sualtı Fotoğrafçılığı · 1 gün"},"price":220},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"speciality-diver","name":{"de":"SSI Specialty Diver · 2–2,5 Tage","en":"SSI Specialty Diver · 2–2.5 days","fr":"SSI Specialty Diver · 2–2,5 jours","tr":"SSI Speciality Diver · 2–2,5 gün"},"price":null}],"order":3,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Bauen Sie Ihr Brevet mit SSI-Spezialkursen in Kaş aus: Nitrox, Tieftauchen, Wracktauchen oder Nachttauchen. Die meisten dauern 1–2 Tage, Kursmaterial inklusive.","en":"Build on your certification with SSI specialty courses in Kaş, from Nitrox and deep diving to wreck and night diving. Most take 1–2 days, materials included.","fr":"Complétez votre brevet avec les spécialités SSI à Kaş : Nitrox, plongée profonde, épave ou de nuit. La plupart durent 1 à 2 jours, supports de cours inclus.","tr":"Nitrox, derin dalış, batık ve gece dalışı gibi SSI uzmanlık kurslarıyla brövenizi ilgi alanınıza göre geliştirin. Çoğu 1–2 gün sürer, materyaller dahildir."},"title":{"de":"SSI-Spezialkurse in Kaş: Nitrox, Wrack, Tiefe","en":"SSI Specialty Courses in Kaş: Nitrox, Deep, Wreck","fr":"Cours de spécialité SSI à Kaş : Nitrox, épave","tr":"Kaş''ta SSI Uzmanlık Kursları: Nitrox ve Batık"}},"slug":{"de":"ssi-spezialkurse","en":"ssi-specialty-courses","fr":"specialites-ssi","tr":"ssi-uzmanlik-kurslari"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/plongee/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-egitim","summary":{"de":"Von Nitrox bis Wrack- und Nachttauchen: Bauen Sie Ihr Brevet in Ihrem Interessengebiet aus.","en":"From Nitrox to wreck and night diving, build on your certification in the field that interests you.","fr":"Du Nitrox à l''épave et à la plongée de nuit, approfondissez votre brevet selon vos centres d''intérêt.","tr":"Nitrox''tan batık ve gece dalışına, brövenizi ilgi alanınıza göre geliştirin."},"title":{"de":"SSI-Spezialkurse","en":"SSI Specialty Courses","fr":"Spécialités SSI","tr":"SSI Uzmanlık Kursları"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1d26ec23d51270","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1d26ec23d5127