":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"13749481406684","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"13749481406684","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0b40d665d80522","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0b40d665d80522","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0b40d665d80522","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19fa52fbba3b5a","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19fa52fbba3b5a","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19fa52fbba3b5a","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1d1efc642620fd","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1d1efc642620fd","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1d1efc642620fd","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0afb9b2c973368","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0afb9b2c973368","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0afb9b2c973368","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('event', 'tekne-dalislari', '{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Alle Tauchgänge finden vom Boot aus statt, geführt von einem Guide (Tauchlehrer oder Divemaster), in Gruppen von höchstens 6 Tauchern (+ Guide). Briefings gibt es auf Türkisch, Englisch und Französisch.","type":"p"},{"text":"Unser Tauchboot Dragoman","type":"h2"},{"text":"Die 21 Meter lange Dragoman mit überdachtem Deck ist für das Tauchen bei jedem Wetter und das ganze Jahr über gebaut. Sie bietet 50 Tauchern persönliche Kisten, Bügel für Jackets und Anzüge, einen Umkleidebereich, Bar, Dusche, WC, einen Vorbereitungstisch und einen Süßwassertank für Kameras. Liegen und Schatten auf dem Oberdeck stehen allen zur Verfügung, die sich ausruhen möchten, und auch Begleitpersonen.","type":"p"},{"text":"Tauchpakete","type":"h2"},{"text":"Preise ohne Ausrüstung enthalten Flasche, Blei, Boot und Guide; Preise mit Ausrüstung enthalten die komplette Ausrüstung, Boot und Guide. Eine Nitroxflasche kostet 5 € extra.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"All dives are made from the boat, led by a guide (instructor or divemaster), with a maximum of 6 divers (+ guide) per group. Briefings are given in Turkish, English and French.","type":"p"},{"text":"Our dive boat Dragoman","type":"h2"},{"text":"Dragoman is a 21-metre boat with a sheltered deck, designed for diving in all seasons. It comfortably serves 50 divers with individual boxes, BC and suit hangers, a changing area, bar, shower, WC, a preparation table and fresh-water tank for cameras. Sun beds and shade on the upper deck are there for those who want to rest and for non-divers.","type":"p"},{"text":"Dive packages","type":"h2"},{"text":"Prices without equipment include tank, weights, boat and guide; prices with equipment include full equipment, boat and guide. A Nitrox tank costs €5 extra.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Toutes les plongées sont effectuées à partir du bateau, en groupes de 6 plongeurs maximum, en compagnie d''un guide (moniteur ou chef de palanquée). Les briefings sont assurés en turc, en anglais et en français.","type":"p"},{"text":"Notre bateau Dragoman","type":"h2"},{"text":"Dragoman, notre bateau de 21 m avec un pont couvert, est conçu pour plonger confortablement toute l''année et par tous les temps. Il accueille 50 plongeurs : casiers individuels, cintres pour gilets et combinaisons, espace pour se changer, bar, douche, WC, table de préparation et bac d''eau douce pour les appareils photo. Transats et zone ombragée sur le pont supérieur pour se reposer et pour les accompagnateurs.","type":"p"},{"text":"Forfaits de plongée","type":"h2"},{"text":"Le tarif sans équipement comprend bouteille, plombs, bateau et guide ; le tarif avec équipement comprend tout l''équipement, le bateau et le guide. Supplément bouteille Nitrox : 5 €.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Tüm dalışlar tekneden, bir rehber (eğitmen veya dalış lideri) refakatinde ve en fazla 6 kişilik gruplar (+ rehber) şeklinde yapılır. Brifingler Türkçe, İngilizce ve Fransızca verilir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Dalış teknesi Dragoman","type":"h2"},{"text":"21 metrelik Dragoman, kapalı güvertesiyle tüm hava koşullarında ve yıl boyunca rahatınız için tasarlanmıştır. 50 dalıcı için şahsi malzeme kutuları, malzeme askıları, soyunma bölümü, bar, duş, WC, fotoğraf ekipmanı için hazırlık masası ve tatlı su tankı bulunur. Üst güvertedeki şezlonglar ve gölgelik, dinlenmek isteyenlerin ve refakatçilerin hizmetindedir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Dalış paketleri","type":"h2"},{"text":"Ekipmansız fiyatlara tüp, ağırlık, tekne ve rehber; ekipmanlı fiyatlara tüm ekipman, tekne ve rehber dahildir. Nitrox tüp ek ücreti 5 €''dur.","type":"p"}]},"category":"diving","conditions":{"de":["Höchstens 6 Taucher + Guide"],"en":["Maximum 6 divers + guide"],"fr":["6 plongeurs maximum + guide"],"tr":["En fazla 6 dalıcı + rehber"]},"cover":"diving-fun-dive-fish-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["boat-dragoman-1","diving-turtle-2","diving-wreck-plane-1","diving-wreck-boat-1"],"healthForm":"diving","id":"tekne-dalislari","includes":{"de":["Boot","Guide (Tauchlehrer oder Divemaster)","Flasche und Blei","Komplette Ausrüstung bei den Optionen mit Ausrüstung"],"en":["Boat","Guide (instructor or divemaster)","Tank and weights","Full equipment with the equipment options"],"fr":["Bateau","Guide (moniteur ou chef de palanquée)","Bouteille et plombs","Tout l''équipement avec les options équipées"],"tr":["Tekne","Rehber (eğitmen veya dalış lideri)","Tüp ve ağırlık","Ekipmanlı seçeneklerde tüm ekipman"]},"itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"tek-dalis-ekipmansiz","name":{"de":"Ein Tauchgang, ohne Ausrüstung","en":"One dive, without equipment","fr":"1 plongée, sans équipement","tr":"Tek dalış, ekipmansız"},"price":30},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"tek-dalis-ekipmanli","name":{"de":"Ein Tauchgang, mit Ausrüstung","en":"One dive, with equipment","fr":"1 plongée, avec équipement","tr":"Tek dalış, ekipmanlı"},"price":39},{"basis":"package","currency":"EUR","id":"paket-6-ekipmansiz","name":{"de":"6er-Paket, ohne Ausrüstung","en":"6-dive pack, without equipment","fr":"Forfait 6 plongées, sans équipement","tr":"6''lı dalış paketi, ekipmansız"},"price":171},{"basis":"package","currency":"EUR","id":"paket-6-ekipmanli","name":{"de":"6er-Paket, mit Ausrüstung","en":"6-dive pack, with equipment","fr":"Forfait 6 plongées, avec équipement","tr":"6''lı dalış paketi, ekipmanlı"},"price":222},{"basis":"package","currency":"EUR","id":"paket-10-ekipmansiz","name":{"de":"10er-Paket, ohne Ausrüstung","en":"10-dive pack, without equipment","fr":"Forfait 10 plongées, sans équipement","tr":"10''lu dalış paketi, ekipmansız"},"price":270},{"basis":"package","currency":"EUR","id":"paket-10-ekipmanli","name":{"de":"10er-Paket, mit Ausrüstung","en":"10-dive pack, with equipment","fr":"Forfait 10 plongées, avec équipement","tr":"10''lu dalış paketi, ekipmanlı"},"price":351},{"basis":"package","currency":"EUR","id":"paket-20-ekipmansiz","name":{"de":"20er-Paket, ohne Ausrüstung","en":"20-dive pack, without equipment","fr":"Forfait 20 plongées, sans équipement","tr":"20''li dalış paketi, ekipmansız"},"price":480},{"basis":"package","currency":"EUR","id":"paket-20-ekipmanli","name":{"de":"20er-Paket, mit Ausrüstung","en":"20-dive pack, with equipment","fr":"Forfait 20 plongées, avec équipement","tr":"20''li dalış paketi, ekipmanlı"},"price":624}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Geführte Tauchgänge an über 30 Plätzen bei Kaş vom 21-Meter-Boot Dragoman aus, höchstens 6 Taucher pro Guide, Briefings auf Türkisch, Englisch und Französisch.","en":"Guided dives at more than 30 Kaş dive sites from our 21-metre boat Dragoman, with no more than 6 divers per guide and briefings in Turkish, English and French.","fr":"Plongées guidées sur plus de 30 sites de Kaş depuis notre bateau Dragoman de 21 mètres, 6 plongeurs maximum par guide, briefings en turc, anglais et français.","tr":"21 metrelik teknemiz Dragoman ile Kaş''ın 30''u aşkın dalış noktasına rehberli dalış; grupta en fazla 6 dalıcı, brifingler Türkçe, İngilizce ve Fransızca."},"title":{"de":"Geführte Bootstauchgänge in Kaş: 30+ Tauchplätze","en":"Guided Boat Dives in Kaş: 30+ Dive Sites","fr":"Plongées guidées en bateau à Kaş, 30+ sites","tr":"Rehberli Tekne Dalışları: Kaş''ın 30+ Noktası"}},"slug":{"de":"bootstauchgaenge","en":"boat-dives","fr":"plongees-bateau","tr":"tekne-dalislari"},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/diving/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/plongee/"],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-sertifikali","summary":{"de":"Mit unserem Tauchboot Dragoman zu über 30 Tauchplätzen rund um Kaş, in Gruppen von höchstens 6 Tauchern.","en":"Dive the 30-plus sites of Kaş from our boat Dragoman, in groups of no more than 6 divers.","fr":"Plongez sur plus de 30 sites de Kaş depuis notre bateau Dragoman, en palanquées de 6 plongeurs maximum.","tr":"Dalış teknemiz Dragoman ile Kaş''ın 30''u aşkın dalış noktasına, en fazla 6 kişilik gruplarla."},"title":{"de":"Geführte Bootstauchgänge","en":"Guided Boat Dives","fr":"Plongées guidées en bateau","tr":"Rehberli Tekne Dalışları"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}}'::jsonb, '{"/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a8b79e3bdb942","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a8b79e3bdb942","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a8b79e3bdb942","origin":"seed"}},"/conditions":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d24eb335dd0a0","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d24eb335dd0a0","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0d24eb335dd0a0","origin":"seed"}},"/includes":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"09c253c40f84a2","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"09c253c40f84a2","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"09c253c40f84a2","origin":"seed"}},"/options/0/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"179e6e1cb1e32c","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"179e6e1cb1e32c","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"179e6e1cb1e32c","origin":"seed"}},"/options/1/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0773da3ef42e57","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0773da3ef42e57","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0773da3ef42e57","origin":"seed"}},"/options/2/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a50e7f992820a","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a50e7f992820a","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a50e7f992820a","origin":"seed"}},"/options/3/name":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"005b62eca318bd","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"005b62eca318bd","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z