"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16322bc30544a2","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16322bc30544a2","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16322bc30544a2","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"089c5c650b1cb0","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"089c5c650b1cb0","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"089c5c650b1cb0","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0055e91fd37cba","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0055e91fd37cba","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0055e91fd37cba","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"186142894a99b5","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"186142894a99b5","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"186142894a99b5","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('rich_page', 'about', '{"cover":"about-office-2","key":"about","origin":"cloner","sections":[{"body":{"de":[{"text":"DRAGOMAN Diving & Outdoor organisiert Outdoor-Aktivitäten in der historischen Region Lykien, im Herzen des Meeresschutzgebiets Kaş-Kekova und an einigen besonderen Orten der Türkei. Seit 2002 sind wir in Kaş, Antalya, für Sie da.","type":"p"},{"text":"Zu uns gehören das Reisebüro Dragoman (TÜRSAB-Lizenz A4615) und das beim Türkischen Tauchsportverband registrierte Tauchzentrum Kaş-Archipel; in den ersten Jahren gab es außerdem Ekomarin Seekajak und Dragoman Outdoors, doch der Einfachheit halber nennen wir uns heute nur „DRAGOMAN“.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"DRAGOMAN Diving & Outdoor organizes outdoor activities in the historical Lycian region, in the heart of the Kaş-Kekova Marine Protected Area, and in a few very special spots in Turkey. We have been at your service in Kaş, Antalya since 2002.","type":"p"},{"text":"We operate with Dragoman Travel Agency (TÜRSAB licence A4615) and the Kaş-Archipel Diving Centre registered with the Turkish Diving Federation; in our early years there were also Ekomarin Sea Kayak and Dragoman Outdoors, but to keep it simple we now call ourselves “DRAGOMAN”.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"DRAGOMAN organise des activités de plein air et sous-marines dans la région de l''ancienne Lycie, au cœur de l''aire marine protégée de Kaş-Kekova, et sur quelques sites exceptionnels de Turquie. Nous sommes à votre service à Kaş, Antalya, depuis 2002.","type":"p"},{"text":"Nous travaillons avec l''agence de voyages Dragoman (licence TÜRSAB A4615) et le centre de plongée Kaş-Archipel, enregistré auprès de la Fédération turque de plongée ; à nos débuts existaient aussi Eko-Marin Kayak de Mer et Dragoman Activités Plein Air, mais pour simplifier, nous nous appelons désormais « DRAGOMAN ».","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Likya bölgesinde, Kaş-Kekova Deniz Koruma Alanı''nda ve Türkiye genelinde özel organizasyonlar sunmayı amaçlayan DRAGOMAN Dalış ve Outdoor Merkezi, 2002 yılından beri Antalya''nın Kaş ilçesinde hizmetinizde.","type":"p"},{"text":"Bünyemizde TÜRSAB onaylı A sınıfı Dragoman Seyahat Acentesi (A4615) ve Türkiye Sualtı Sporları Federasyonu''na kayıtlı Kaş-Arşipel Dalış Merkezi yer alıyor. Kuruluş yıllarında ayrı birimler olan Ekomarin Deniz Kanosu ve Dragoman Doğa Etkinlikleri ile birlikte sadeleştik; artık kendimize sadece “DRAGOMAN” diyoruz.","type":"p"}]}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Unsere Touren sollen authentisch sein und im Einklang mit der Natur, der Landschaft und dem kulturellen Reichtum Anatoliens stehen. Wir setzen auf naturverträgliches Reisen, kleine Gruppen, Ökotouren und kontrollierte Abenteuer und entwickeln immer wieder neue Touren.","type":"p"},{"text":"Sie werden merken, dass Ihr Tauchgruppenleiter Ihnen auch das kleinste Lebewesen zeigen möchte, ohne je Ihre Sicherheit aufs Spiel zu setzen, und dass Ihr Guide selbst auf einfachen Tagesausflügen unbekannte Details des lykischen Erbes zeigt.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Our goal is to develop excursions that are authentic in style and in harmony with the natural biodiversity, geography and cultural riches of Anatolia. Dragoman is concerned with outdoor ethics and responsible tourism with minimum impact by small groups, and we keep developing new trips.","type":"p"},{"text":"You will notice that your dive leader strives to show you the tiniest sea creature without ever compromising your safety, and that even on our simplest day trips your guides show you the most interesting details of the Lycian heritage.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Nous concevons des voyages authentiques, en harmonie avec les richesses naturelles, géographiques et culturelles de l''Anatolie. Dragoman se préoccupe sincèrement d''une éthique forte en matière de respect de la nature et d''impact minimum, par un tourisme responsable en petits groupes, et nous continuons à créer de nouveaux circuits.","type":"p"},{"text":"Vous réaliserez que votre chef de palanquée s''efforce de vous trouver la plus petite créature marine sans compromettre votre sécurité, et que même lors des excursions les plus simples, vos guides vous font découvrir les détails les plus intéressants de l''héritage lycien.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Turlarımız, doğayla iç içe seyahatlerle Anadolu coğrafyasının gizem ve kültürel değerlerini sunacak biçimde tasarlanır. Doğaya saygılı yolculuk, küçük grup seyahatleri, eko-turlar ve kontrollü macera turları üzerine yoğunlaşıyor, yeni turlar geliştirmeye çalışıyoruz.","type":"p"},{"text":"Dalışlarınızda grup liderinin size en ufak canlıyı göstermeye gayret ederken emniyetinizden ödün vermediğini, günlük doğa gezilerimizde bile rehberinizin Likya''nın kültürel mirasının bilinmeyen detaylarını gösterdiğini hissedeceksiniz.","type":"p"}]},"heading":{"de":"Unser Ansatz","en":"Our approach","fr":"Notre approche","tr":"Yaklaşımımız"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"DRAGOMAN ist Teamarbeit. Die Wege der Gründer kreuzten sich in den unterirdischen Gewässern der Karsthöhlen des Taurus, bei der 3216 km langen „Trans-Europa-Seekajak-Expedition“ von der Nordsee zum Schwarzen Meer, bei der Identifizierung des Struma-Wracks in 80 Metern Tiefe im Schwarzen Meer und in Natur- und Forschungsvereinen.","type":"p"},{"text":"Für uns ist das kein Geschäftsplan, sondern eine Lebensweise: Tauchen, Wandern, Seekajak; lernen und lehren; über die Zukunft der Meeresschildkröten sprechen und darüber, warum Mönchsrobben geschützt werden müssen.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"What makes DRAGOMAN what it is, is its enthusiastic crew. The founding members'' paths crossed in the underground waters of the karstic caves of the Taurus range, on the 3216 km “Trans-Europe Sea Kayak Expedition” from the North Sea to the Black Sea, in bringing the secrets of the Struma wreck to daylight from 80 metres in the Black Sea, and in nature and research societies.","type":"p"},{"text":"For us this is not a business plan but a way of life: diving, hiking, sea kayaking; learning and teaching; talking about the future of sea turtles and why monk seals must be protected.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Ce qui fait DRAGOMAN, c''est son équipe enthousiaste. Les chemins des fondateurs se sont croisés dans les eaux souterraines des grottes karstiques du Taurus, lors de « l''Expédition trans-Europe en kayak de mer » de 3216 km de la mer du Nord à la mer Noire, en remontant les secrets de l''épave du Struma à plus de 80 mètres en mer Noire, et dans des associations de nature et de recherche.","type":"p"},{"text":"Pour nous, ce n''est pas un plan d''affaires mais un mode de vie : plonger, randonner, pagayer ; apprendre et enseigner ; parler de l''avenir des tortues marines et des raisons de protéger les phoques moines.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"DRAGOMAN bir ekip işi. Kurucu ekibin yolları Toros''ların karstik mağaralarının yeraltı sularında, Kuzey Denizi''nden Karadeniz''e 3216 km süren “Denizden Denize Trans-Avrupa Kano Geçişi”nde, Karadeniz''de 80 metre derinlikteki Struma batığının kimliğini gün ışığına çıkarma çalışmasında ve doğa ve araştırma derneklerinde kesişti.","type":"p"},{"text":"Bizim için bu bir “iş planı” değil, bir “yaşam planı”: dalış, yürüyüş, deniz kanosu; öğrenmek ve öğretmek; deniz kaplumbağalarının geleceği ve Akdeniz foklarının neden korunması gerektiği üzerine konuşmak.","type":"p"}]},"heading":{"de":"Wer wir sind","en":"Who are we?","fr":"Qui sommes-nous ?","tr":"Biz kimiz?"}}],"seo":{"description":{"de":"Seit 2002 organisiert Dragoman Tauchen, Seekajak und Outdoor-Aktivitäten in Kaş, im Herzen des Meeresschutzgebiets Kaş-Kekova. TÜRSAB-Lizenz A4615.","en":"Since 2002 Dragoman has run diving, sea kayaking and outdoor activities in Kaş, in the heart of the Kaş-Kekova Marine Protected Area. TÜRSAB licence A4615.","fr":"Depuis 2002, Dragoman organise plongée, kayak de mer et activités de plein air à Kaş, au cœur de l''Aire Marine Protégée de Kaş-Kekova. Licence TÜRSAB A4615.","tr":"Dragoman 2002''den beri Kaş''ta, Kaş-Kekova Özel Deniz Koruma Alanı''nın kalbinde dalış, deniz kanosu ve doğa etkinlikleri düzenliyor. TÜRSAB belge no A4615."},"title":{"de":"Dragoman: Tauchen und Outdoor in Kaş seit 2002","en":"Dragoman: Diving and Outdoors in Kaş Since 2002","fr":"Dragoman : plongée et plein air à Kaş depuis 2002","tr":"Hakkımızda: 2002''den Beri Kaş''ta Dalış ve Doğa"}},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/dragoman/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/dragoman/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/dragoman/"],"summary":{"de":"Tauchen, Seekajak und Outdoor-Aktivitäten in Kaş seit 2002.","en":"Diving, sea kayaking and outdoor activities in Kaş since 2002.","fr":"Plongée, kayak de mer et activités de plein air à Kaş depuis 2002.","tr":"2002''den beri Kaş''ta dalış, deniz kanosu ve doğa etkinlikleri."},"title":{"de":"Dragoman","en":"Dragoman","fr":"Dragoman","tr":"Dragoman"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}}'::jsonb, '{"/sections/0/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0db1f3b9c136d9","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0db1f3b9c136d9","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0db1f3b9c136d9","origin":"seed"}},"/sections/1/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1b7cd4c07e4a1e","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1b7cd4c07e4a1e","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1b7cd4c07e4a1e","origin":"seed"}},"/sections/1/heading":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0b1bc42dc5b13e","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0b1bc42dc5b13e","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0b1bc42dc5b13e","origin":"seed"}},"/sections/2/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0293971d872b0e","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0293971d872b0e","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0293971d872b0e","origin":"seed"}},"/sections/2/heading":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19dd2230b0d993","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19dd2230b0d993","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"19dd2230b0d993","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a3bc0409bbbda","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a3bc0409bbbda","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0a3bc0409bbbda","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"027d0b3fe4a657","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"027d0b3fe4a657","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"027d0b3fe4a657","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1073d17cbbc03b","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1073d17cbbc03b","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1073d17cbbc03b","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0cd3811d49376f","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0cd3811d49376f","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0cd3811d49376f","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('rich_page', 'contact', '{"cover":"about-office-1","key":"contact","origin":"mockup","sections":[{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Schreiben Sie uns Ihre Buchungsanfragen und Fragen oder besuchen Sie unser Büro in Kaş. Das Reisebüro Dragoman arbeitet mit der TÜRSAB-Lizenz A4615.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Write to us with your booking requests and questions, or drop by our office in Kaş. Dragoman Travel Agency operates under TÜRSAB licence A4615.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Écrivez-nous pour vos demandes de réservation et vos questions, ou passez à notre bureau de Kaş. L''agence de voyages Dragoman est titulaire de la licence TÜRSAB A4615.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Rezervasyon talepleriniz ve sorularınız için bize yazın ya da Kaş''taki ofisimize uğrayın. Dragoman Seyahat Acentası TÜRSAB A4615 belgesiyle hizmet verir.","type":"p"}]}}],"seo":{"description":{"de":"Schreiben Sie Buchungsanfragen und Fragen zu Touren, Tauchgängen und Kursen oder besuchen Sie unser Büro in Kaş. Reisebüro Dragoman, TÜRSAB-Lizenz A4615.","en":"Write to us with booking requests and questions about tours, dives and courses, or drop by our office in Kaş. Dragoman Travel Agency, TÜRSAB licence A4615.","fr":"Écrivez-nous pour vos demandes de réservation et vos questions sur les circuits, plongées et cours, ou passez à notre bureau de Kaş. Licence TÜRSAB A4615.","tr":"Turlar, dalışlar ve kurslar için rezervasyon talebinizi ve sorularınızı bize yazın ya da Kaş''taki ofisimize uğrayın. Dragoman Seyahat Acentası, TÜRSAB A4615."},"title":{"de":"Buchung und Kontakt: besuchen Sie uns in Kaş","en":"Booking and Contact: Visit Our Office in Kaş","fr":"Réservation et contact : notre bureau à Kaş","tr":"Rezervasyon ve İletişim: Kaş''taki Ofisimiz"}},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/rezervasyon-ve-iletisim/"],"summary":{"de":"Schreiben Sie uns zu Touren, Tauchgängen und Kursen.","en":"Write to us about tours, dives and courses.","fr":"Écrivez-nous pour les sorties, plongées et stages.","tr":"Turlar, dalışlar ve kurslar için bize yazın."},"title":{"de":"Buchung und Kontakt","en":"Booking and Contact","fr":"Réservation et contact","tr":"Rezervasyon ve İletişim"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/sections/0/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"17f3699e225bae","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"17f3699e225bae","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"17f3699e225bae","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"08a861cc9cb7b1","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"08a861cc9cb7b1","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"08a861cc9cb7b1","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11b42cc8dca659","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11b42cc8dca659","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"11b42cc8dca659","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"12496ccf128260","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"12496ccf128260","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"12496ccf128260","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ed8f089c8c894","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ed8f089c8c894","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ed8f089c8c894","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('rich_page', 'diveSites', '{"cover":"dive-sites-kas-map-1","key":"diveSites","origin":"cloner","sections":[{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Dieses Felsriff, dessen Spitze 4 m unter der Oberfläche liegt, ist nach dem Wrack eines italienischen Bombers Savoia-Marchetti SM79 „Sparviero“ benannt, der zwischen 55 und 71 m liegt und im Zweiten Weltkrieg beim Angriff auf Meis abgeschossen wurde. Dieser sehr tiefe und riskante Wracktauchgang ist nur für sehr erfahrene Taucher; die Strömung kann so stark sein, dass der Tauchgang abgebrochen werden muss. Bei erträglicher Strömung sieht man Zahnbrassen, Zackenbarsche, Bernsteinmakrelen, Barrakudas und Pelamiden.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"This rocky reef, its top 4 m below the surface, gets its name from the wreck of an Italian Savoia-Marchetti SM79 “Sparviero” bomber lying between 55 and 71 m, brought down while bombarding Meis Island during WWII. This very deep and risky wreck dive is only for very experienced divers, and the current is sometimes strong enough to abort the dive. When the current is bearable, predators such as dentex, groupers, amberjacks, barracudas and bonitos abound.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Ce récif rocheux, dont le sommet se trouve à 4 mètres, tire son nom de l''épave d''un bombardier italien Savoia-Marchetti SM79 « Sparviero » qui repose entre 55 et 71 mètres, abattu alors qu''il bombardait l''île de Meis pendant la Seconde Guerre mondiale. Cette plongée très profonde et risquée est réservée aux plongeurs très expérimentés, le courant pouvant rendre la plongée impossible. Quand le courant est supportable, dentis, mérous, sérioles, barracudas et bonites abondent.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Tepesi 4 metreden başlayan bu banko adını, güneydoğu ucunda 55–71 metre arasında yatan ve II. Dünya Savaşı''nda Meis''i bombalarken düşürülmüş Savoia-Marchetti SM79 “Sparviero” bombardıman uçağı batığından alır. Bu çok derin ve riskli uçak dalışı yalnızca çok usta dalıcılara önerilir; akıntı bazen dalışı iptal ettirecek seviyede olabilir. Akıntı dayanılır olduğunda sinarit, orfoz, akya, barakuda ve palamut gibi avcı balıkları izlersiniz.","type":"p"}]},"heading":{"de":"1. Flying-fish-Riff","en":"1. Flying-fish reef","fr":"1. Flying-fish reef","tr":"1. Uçanbalık Bankosu"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Dieses schuhförmige Riff betaucht man rund um die Insel, entweder über die Untiefen im Nordosten oder entlang der großen Felsstufen. Im ersten Fall Ausschau nach Schildkröten halten, im zweiten nach Barrakudas. Am Nordende liegt unterhalb von 40 m eine antike Wrackstelle mit großen Pithoi, ganzen Amphoren und vielen Ankern, allerdings recht tief. Vorsicht bei der meist aus Südosten kommenden Strömung: Die griechische Insel Meis ist ganz nah!","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"You can dive this shoe-shaped reef by going round the island, choosing between the northeast shallows or the big rocky steps. Look for turtles in the first case and barracudas in the second. On the far northern side, below 40 m, is an ancient wreck site known for its large pithoi, whole amphorae and many anchors, but quite deep. Watch the current usually coming from the southeast: the Greek island of Meis is very close!","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Vous pouvez plonger sur ce récif en forme de chaussure en faisant le tour de l''île, entre les hauts-fonds au nord-est et les grandes marches rocheuses. Cherchez les tortues dans le premier cas, les barracudas dans le second. Au nord, sous 40 mètres, se trouve un site d''épave antique connu pour ses grandes jarres, ses amphores entières et ses nombreuses ancres, mais assez profond. Attention au courant venant souvent du sud-est : l''île grecque de Meis est toute proche !","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Pabuç şeklindeki bu bankoda dalışı adanın etrafını dolaşarak, kuzeydoğu sığlığını ya da basamaklar halinde inen kayalıkları gezerek yapabilirsiniz. İlk seçenekte kaplumbağaları, ikincisinde barakudaları arayın. Kuzey ucunda 40 metrenin altında pitosları, tam amforaları ve çapalarıyla bilinen derin bir antik batık alanı vardır. Genelde güneydoğudan gelen akıntıya dikkat: Meis çok yakın!","type":"p"}]},"heading":{"de":"2. Insel Besmi","en":"2. Besmi Island","fr":"2. Île de Besmi","tr":"2. Besmi Adası"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Ein Klassiker in Kaş. An diesem beliebten Platz gibt es manchmal mehr Taucher als Fische, doch die Landschaft lohnt sich. In der flachen Enge zwischen zwei Inseln kann eine starke Südströmung stehen; dann öffnet sich der Canyon mit zwei steilen Wänden bis 20 m. Bitte die empfindlichen Wände nicht berühren. Außerhalb des Canyons liegt die Dimitri, ein Küstenfrachter, der 1968 auf die Inseln lief und Baumwollballen verstreute, daher der Name „Baumwollwrack“.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"A Kaş classic. Fish may not always abound at this very popular site, but the sights are worth it. You may have to go against a strong southerly current through the shallow gorge, then the Canyon appears with two steep walls going down to 20 m. Please mind the very fragile sides. Outside the canyon lies the Dimitri, a steel coaster that hit the islands in 1968 and scattered cotton bales around, hence the local name “cotton wreck”.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Un grand classique de Kaş. Les poissons ne sont pas toujours au rendez-vous sur ce site très fréquenté, mais le paysage vaut le détour. Il faut parfois lutter contre un fort courant du sud dans la petite gorge, puis le Canyon apparaît avec deux parois abruptes jusqu''à 20 mètres. Attention aux parois très fragiles. À la sortie du canyon repose le Dimitri, petit cargo échoué sur les îles en 1968, qui a dispersé des ballots de coton, d''où son nom local d''« épave au coton ».","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Bir Kaş klasiği. Bazen balık az, dalıcı bol olabilir ama manzaralar müthiş. İki ada arasındaki sığ boğazdan geçerken güneyden sert bir akıntı olabilir; ardından Kanyon 20 metreye inen iki dik duvar olarak karşınıza çıkar. Duvarlardaki kırılgan oluşumlara dokunmayalım. Kanyonun dışında, 1968''de adalara vurup etrafa pamuk balyaları saçan koster Dimitri''nin batığı yatar.","type":"p"}]},"heading":{"de":"3. Der Canyon – Wrack der Dimitri","en":"3. The Canyon – Dimitri “Cotton” Wreck","fr":"3. Le Canyon – épave du Dimitri","tr":"3. Kanyon – Dimitri (Pamuk) Batığı"}}],"seo":{"description":{"de":"Eine Auswahl der Tauchplätze von Kaş: Felsriffe, Canyons und Wracks, darunter ein italienischer Bomber aus dem Zweiten Weltkrieg in 55 bis 71 m Tiefe.","en":"A selection of the dive sites of Kaş: rocky reefs, canyons and wrecks, including a WWII Italian bomber lying between 55 and 71 m for very experienced divers.","fr":"Une sélection de sites de plongée de Kaş : secs rocheux, canyons et épaves, dont un bombardier italien de la Seconde Guerre mondiale posé entre 55 et 71 m.","tr":"Kaş''ın dalış noktalarından bir seçki: bankolar, kanyonlar ve batıklar, 55–71 metrede yatan II. Dünya Savaşı''ndan bir İtalyan bombardıman uçağı dahil."},"title":{"de":"Tauchplätze in Kaş: Riffe, Wracks und Canyons","en":"Kaş Dive Sites: Reefs, Wrecks and Canyons","fr":"Sites de plongée de Kaş : secs, épaves et canyons","tr":"Kaş Dalış Noktaları: Batıklar ve Kanyonlar"}},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/kas-dalis-noktalari/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/kas-dive-sites/","https://dragoman-turkey.com/fr/sites-de-plongee-a-kas/"],"summary":{"de":"Riffe, Wracks und Canyons: eine Auswahl der Tauchplätze von Kaş.","en":"Reefs, wrecks and canyons: a selection of the dive sites of Kaş.","fr":"Secs, épaves et canyons : une sélection des sites de plongée de Kaş.","tr":"Bankolar, batıklar ve kanyonlar: Kaş''ın dalış noktalarından bir seçki."},"title":{"de":"Tauchplätze in Kaş","en":"Kaş dive sites","fr":"Sites de plongée à Kaş","tr":"Kaş dalış noktaları"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}}'::jsonb, '{"/sections/0/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1e7bf72f3019fe","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1e7bf72f3019fe","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1e7bf72f3019fe","origin":"seed"}},"/sections/0/heading":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f8b03523916c4","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f8b03523916c4","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0f8b03523916c4","origin":"seed"}},"/sections/1/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"10c8087b5ae290","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"10c8087b5ae290","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"10c8087b5ae290","origin":"seed"}},"/sections/1/heading":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ebf03765e973c","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ebf03765e973c","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ebf03765e973c","origin":"seed"}},"/sections/2/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0982b14d3b600c","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0982b14d3b600c","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0982b14d3b600c","origin":"seed"}},"/sections/2/heading":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"12db9ade5e2fd7","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"12db9ade5e2fd7","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"12db9ade5e2fd7","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/description":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ecb593ec3a645","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ecb593ec3a645","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0ecb593ec3a645","origin":"seed"}},"/seo/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"12bb01ab173f56","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"12bb01ab173f56","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"12bb01ab173f56","origin":"seed"}},"/summary":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1015c36e2c5775","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1015c36e2c5775","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1015c36e2c5775","origin":"seed"}},"/title":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0845565f8b5352","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0845565f8b5352","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0845565f8b5352","origin":"seed"}}}'::jsonb, 'published'),
  ('rich_page', 'lifeguard', '{"cover":"lifeguard-training-1","key":"lifeguard","notice":"provisional-scope","origin":"cloner","sections":[{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Unsere Kurse finden nach der Rettungsschwimmerordnung des Türkischen Unterwassersportverbands (TSSF) statt; die ausgestellten Zertifikate gelten in allen Einrichtungen, die zertifizierte Rettungsschwimmer beschäftigen müssen.","type":"p"},{"text":"Unterrichtet wird von einem Silber-Rettungsschwimmausbilder gemeinsam mit unserem Partner, einem zugelassenen Ausbildungszentrum. Kurse und Auffrischungen finden das ganze Jahr in Kaş und anderen Regionen statt. Alle Rettungsschwimmerzertifikate gelten 2 Jahre.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Our courses are given under the Lifeguard Regulation of the Turkish Underwater Sports Federation (TSSF), and the certificates issued are valid at all institutions and businesses required to employ certified lifeguards.","type":"p"},{"text":"Courses are taught by a Silver Lifeguard Instructor together with our partner, an authorised lifeguard training centre. Training and renewal courses run 12 months a year in Kaş and other regions. All lifeguard certificates are valid for 2 years.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Nos cours sont dispensés dans le cadre du règlement de sauvetage de la Fédération turque des sports subaquatiques (TSSF), et les brevets délivrés sont valables dans tous les établissements tenus d''employer des sauveteurs certifiés.","type":"p"},{"text":"Les cours sont assurés par un formateur sauveteur Argent avec notre partenaire, un centre de formation agréé. Formations et remises à niveau ont lieu toute l''année à Kaş et dans d''autres régions. Tous les brevets de sauveteur sont valables 2 ans.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Türkiye Sualtı Sporları Federasyonu Cankurtarma Yönetmeliği kapsamında verilen kurslarımız ve kurs sonunda verilen cankurtaran sertifikaları, sertifikalı cankurtaran çalıştırma zorunluluğu olan tüm kurum ve kuruluşlarda geçerlidir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Kurslar, yetkili cankurtaran eğitim merkezi çözüm ortağımızla birlikte bir Gümüş Cankurtaran Eğitmeni tarafından verilir. Eğitimler ve belge yenileme uyum eğitimleri Kaş''ta ve diğer bölgelerde 12 ay boyunca sürer. Tüm cankurtaran belgeleri 2 yıl geçerlidir.","type":"p"}]}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Das Zertifikat für die Aufsicht an Becken bis 5 Meter Tiefe. Dauer 3 Tage (21 Stunden): ein Praxistag und zwei Tage Theorie im Unterrichtsraum sowie Erste Hilfe an Übungspuppen. Anmeldung mindestens 15 Tage vorher, da der Kurs beim Verband angemeldet werden muss. Kursgebühr 18.000 ₺ (inkl. Ausbildung und Verbandszertifikat).","type":"p"},{"items":["Gute Schwimmfähigkeit","Mindestens 18 Jahre alt","Keine gesundheitlichen Hindernisse (Gesundheitserklärung der Teilnehmenden)","Mindestens Grundschulabschluss"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"The certificate needed to work at pools no deeper than 5 metres. Duration 3 days (21 hours): one practical day and two days of classroom theory and first aid on manikins. Registration is needed at least 15 days ahead because the course must be notified to the federation. Course fee ₺18,000 (training and federation certificate fee included).","type":"p"},{"items":["Good swimming ability","Aged 18 or over","No health condition preventing lifeguard work (participant''s health declaration)","At least primary school education"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Le brevet requis pour surveiller des piscines de 5 mètres de profondeur au plus. Durée 3 jours (21 heures) : une journée pratique et deux jours de théorie en salle et de premiers secours sur mannequins. Inscription au moins 15 jours à l''avance, le cours devant être déclaré à la fédération. Prix 18 000 ₺ (formation et frais de brevet fédéral compris).","type":"p"},{"items":["Bien savoir nager","Avoir 18 ans révolus","Aucune contre-indication médicale (déclaration de santé du stagiaire)","Avoir au moins terminé l''école primaire"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"5 metreden derin olmayan havuzlarda görev yapmak için gereken belge. Süre 3 gün (21 saat): bir gün pratik, iki gün dershanede teorik eğitim ve mankenler üzerinde ilk yardım. Federasyona izin bildirimi yapılacağından en az 15 gün önce kayıt gerekir. Kurs ücreti 18.000 ₺ (eğitim ve federasyon sertifika bedeli dahil).","type":"p"},{"items":["İyi derecede yüzme bilmek","18 yaşını doldurmuş olmak","Sağlık açısından engel bulunmaması (kursiyerin sağlık beyanı)","En az ilköğretim mezunu olmak"],"type":"ul"}]},"heading":{"de":"Rettungsschwimmer Bronze","en":"Bronze Lifeguard Course","fr":"Cours de sauveteur Bronze","tr":"Bronz Cankurtaran Kursu"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Berechtigt zur Aufsicht an Becken über 5 Meter Tiefe sowie an Flüssen, Seen und am Meer. Dauer 3 Tage: zwei Tage Theorie im Unterrichtsraum und ein Praxistag am Meer. Voraussetzung ist das Bronze-Zertifikat. Kursgebühr 20.000 ₺; die aufeinanderfolgende Ausbildung Bronze und Silber dauert 5 Tage (35 Stunden) und kostet 35.000 ₺.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Authorises lifeguard work at pools deeper than 5 metres and in rivers, lakes and the sea. Duration 3 days: two days of classroom theory and one practical day at sea. A Bronze certificate is required. Course fee ₺20,000; the consecutive Bronze and Silver training takes 5 days (35 hours) for ₺35,000.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Permet de surveiller des piscines de plus de 5 mètres, des rivières, des lacs et la mer. Durée 3 jours : deux jours de théorie en salle et une journée pratique en mer. Le brevet Bronze est requis. Prix 20 000 ₺ ; la formation Bronze et Argent enchaînée se fait en 5 jours (35 heures) pour 35 000 ₺.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"5 metreden derin havuzlarda, akarsu, göl ve denizlerde görev yapma yetkisi verir. Süre 3 gün: iki gün dershanede teori, bir gün deniz ortamında pratik. Bronz belgesi gerekir. Kurs ücreti 20.000 ₺; birbirini izleyen Bronz ve Gümüş eğitimi 5 günde (35 saat) 35.000 ₺.","type":"p"}]},"heading":{"de":"Rettungsschwimmer Silber","en":"Silver Lifeguard Course","fr":"Cours de sauveteur Argent","tr":"Gümüş Cankurtaran Kursu"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Berechtigt zur Tätigkeit als Gold-Rettungsschwimmer an Flüssen, Seen und am Meer sowie zur Assistenz in Rettungsschwimmerkursen an zugelassenen Zentren. Dauer 4 Tage (28 Stunden): drei Tage Theorie und ein Praxistag am Meer. Kursgebühr 35.000 ₺.","type":"p"},{"items":["Silber-Rettungsschwimmerzertifikat","Nachweis von mindestens 6 Monaten Tätigkeit als Silber-Rettungsschwimmer","TSSF/CMAS-3-Sterne-Taucherbrevet","Mindestens 19 Jahre alt"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"Authorises work as a gold lifeguard in rivers, lakes and the sea, and assisting lifeguard courses at authorised centres. Duration 4 days (28 hours): three days of theory and one practical day at sea. Course fee ₺35,000.","type":"p"},{"items":["Silver Lifeguard certificate","Proof of at least 6 months'' work as a Silver Lifeguard","TSSF/CMAS 3-Star Diver certificate","Aged 19 or over"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Permet d''exercer comme sauveteur Or en rivière, lac et mer, et d''assister les cours de sauveteur dans les centres agréés. Durée 4 jours (28 heures) : trois jours de théorie et une journée pratique en mer. Prix 35 000 ₺.","type":"p"},{"items":["Brevet de sauveteur Argent","Justifier d''au moins 6 mois d''activité comme sauveteur Argent","Brevet de plongeur TSSF/CMAS 3 étoiles","Avoir 19 ans révolus"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Akarsu, göl ve denizlerde altın cankurtaran olarak görev yapma ve yetkili merkezlerde cankurtaran kurslarına asistanlık yetkisi verir. Süre 4 gün (28 saat): üç gün teori, bir gün deniz ortamında pratik. Kurs ücreti 35.000 ₺.","type":"p"},{"items":["Gümüş Cankurtaran belgesine sahip olmak","En az 6 ay Gümüş Cankurtaran olarak görev yaptığını belgelemek","TSSF/CMAS 3 Yıldız Dalıcı belgesine sahip olmak","19 yaşını doldurmuş olmak"],"type":"ul"}]},"heading":{"de":"Rettungsschwimmer Gold","en":"Gold Lifeguard Course","fr":"Cours de sauveteur Or","tr":"Altın Cankurtaran Kursu"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Rettungsschwimmer Bronze, Silber und Gold müssen innerhalb von 6 Monaten nach Ablauf ihres Zertifikats verlängern; danach ist der Kurs erneut zu absolvieren.","type":"p"},{"items":["Verlängerung Bronze: 13.000 ₺","Verlängerung Silber: 14.000 ₺","Verlängerung Gold: 25.000 ₺"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"Bronze, Silver and Gold lifeguards must renew within 6 months of the certificate''s expiry date; after that, the full course has to be taken again.","type":"p"},{"items":["Bronze Lifeguard renewal: ₺13,000","Silver Lifeguard renewal: ₺14,000","Gold Lifeguard renewal: ₺25,000"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Les sauveteurs Bronze, Argent et Or doivent renouveler leur brevet dans les 6 mois suivant sa date d''expiration ; passé ce délai, il faut refaire le cours.","type":"p"},{"items":["Renouvellement sauveteur Bronze : 13 000 ₺","Renouvellement sauveteur Argent : 14 000 ₺","Renouvellement sauveteur Or : 25 000 ₺"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Bronz, Gümüş ve Altın cankurtaranların belge bitiş tarihinden itibaren 6 ay içinde yenileme yapması gerekir; bu süre geçerse yeniden kurs görmek gerekir.","type":"p"},{"items":["Bronz Cankurtaran yenileme: 13.000 ₺","Gümüş Cankurtaran yenileme: 14.000 ₺","Altın Cankurtaran yenileme: 25.000 ₺"],"type":"ul"}]},"heading":{"de":"Verlängerung der Zertifikate","en":"Certificate renewal","fr":"Renouvellement des brevets","tr":"Belge vize yenilemeleri"}}],"seo":{"description":{"de":"Rettungsschwimmerkurse in Bronze, Silber und Gold sowie Verlängerung nach der TSSF-Verordnung, ganzjährig in Kaş und anderswo; Zertifikate gelten 2 Jahre.","en":"Bronze, Silver and Gold lifeguard courses and certificate renewal under the TSSF regulation, all year round in Kaş and elsewhere; certificates valid 2 years.","fr":"Cours de sauveteur bronze, argent et or et renouvellement de brevet selon le règlement TSSF, toute l''année à Kaş et ailleurs ; brevets valables 2 ans.","tr":"TSSF Cankurtarma Yönetmeliği kapsamında Bronz, Gümüş ve Altın kursları ile belge yenileme; Kaş''ta ve diğer bölgelerde yıl boyu, belgeler 2 yıl geçerli."},"title":{"de":"Rettungsschwimmer-Kurse in Kaş: Bronze bis Gold","en":"Lifeguard Training in Kaş: Bronze, Silver, Gold","fr":"Formation de sauveteur à Kaş : bronze, argent, or","tr":"Cankurtaran Eğitimleri: Bronz, Gümüş ve Altın"}},"sourceRefs":["https://dragoman-turkey.com/tr/cankurtarma-merkezi/","865"],"summary":{"de":"Rettungsschwimmerkurse Bronze, Silber und Gold sowie Verlängerung nach der TSSF-Rettungsschwimmerordnung.","en":"Bronze, Silver and Gold lifeguard courses and certificate renewal under the TSSF lifeguard regulation.","fr":"Cours de sauveteur Bronze, Argent et Or et renouvellement des brevets selon le règlement de la TSSF.","tr":"TSSF Cankurtarma Yönetmeliği kapsamında Bronz, Gümüş ve Altın cankurtaran kursları ve belge yenileme."},"title":{"de":"Rettungsschwimmer-Ausbildung","en":"Lifeguard Training","fr":"Formations de sauveteur","tr":"Cankurtaran Eğitimleri"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}'::jsonb, '{"/sections/0/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1f7e276081f704","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1f7e276081f704","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"1f7e276081f704","origin":"seed"}},"/sections/1/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"098fd45a45fb00","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"098fd45a45fb00","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"098fd45a45fb00","origin":"seed"}},"/sections/1/heading":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16f9f1422c0904","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16f9f1422c0904","origin":"seed"},"fr":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"16f9f1422c0904","origin":"seed"}},"/sections/2/body":{"de":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0820746ac2d884","origin":"seed"},"en":{"at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","hash":"0820746a