       '{"content":{"categoryPages":[{"cover":"cover-diving","intro":{"de":[{"text":"Kaş bietet über 30 Tauchplätze für alle Erfahrungsstufen: moderne Wracks, antike Amphoren und Anker, felsige Riffe, Canyons, große Höhlen und Seegraswiesen. Das Unterwasserleben des Meeresschutzgebiets Kaş-Kekova wird durch lessepsische Arten aus dem Roten Meer zusätzlich bereichert.","type":"p"},{"text":"Dank ausgezeichneter Sicht und Wassertemperaturen zwischen 19 °C (Januar) und 29 °C (August) kann hier das ganze Jahr über getaucht werden.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Kaş offers over 30 dive spots that suit all levels, with modern wrecks, amphorae and anchors from ancient civilizations, rocky reefs, canyons, large caves and sea-grass meadows. The Mediterranean life of the Kaş-Kekova Marine Protected Area is further enriched by lessepsian species migrating from the Red Sea.","type":"p"},{"text":"Excellent underwater visibility and water temperatures between 19 °C (January) and 29 °C (August) make diving possible all year round.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Kaş compte plus de 30 sites de plongée convenant à tous les niveaux : épaves anciennes et modernes, amphores, ancres, secs rocheux, canyons, grandes grottes et herbiers. La faune et la flore de l''Aire Marine Protégée de Kaş-Kekova s''enrichissent d''espèces lessepsiennes venues de la mer Rouge.","type":"p"},{"text":"Une excellente visibilité et une eau entre 19 °C (janvier) et 29 °C (août) permettent de plonger toute l''année.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Kaş''ta her seviyeye uygun 30''un üzerinde dalış noktası; modern batıklar, antik amforalar ve çapalar, geniş sualtı mağaraları, kayalık bankolar, duvarlar ve deniz çayırları sunuyor. Kaş-Kekova Özel Deniz Koruma Alanı''nın zengin sualtı yaşamı, Kızıldeniz''den gelen lesepsiyen türlerle daha da zenginleşiyor.","type":"p"},{"text":"Mükemmel görüş mesafesi ve 19 °C (Ocak) ile 29 °C (Ağustos) arasındaki su sıcaklıklarıyla burada 12 ay dalış yapılabiliyor.","type":"p"}]},"key":"diving","origin":"cloner","seo":{"description":{"de":"Über 30 Tauchplätze für alle Stufen in Kaş: Wracks, Amphoren, Höhlen und Seegraswiesen. Bei 19 bis 29 °C ganzjährig tauchen, mit Kursen und Bootstouren.","en":"Over 30 dive sites for all levels in Kaş: wrecks, amphorae, caves and seagrass. Water at 19–29 °C means diving all year, with courses and boat dives.","fr":"Plus de 30 sites de plongée pour tous niveaux à Kaş : épaves, amphores, grottes et herbiers. Eau de 19 à 29 °C toute l''année, cours et sorties en bateau.","tr":"Kaş''ta her seviyeye uygun 30''u aşkın dalış noktası: batıklar, amforalar, mağaralar ve deniz çayırları. 19–29 °C suda 12 ay dalış, kurslar ve tekne dalışları."},"title":{"de":"Tauchen in Kaş: über 30 Tauchplätze und Kurse","en":"Diving in Kaş: 30+ Dive Sites, Courses and Trips","fr":"Plongée à Kaş : 30+ sites, cours et sorties","tr":"Kaş''ta Dalış: 30''u Aşkın Nokta, Kurs ve Turlar"}},"sourceRefs":[],"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}},{"cover":"cover-outdoor","intro":{"de":[{"text":"Vom Wandern bis zum Coasteering, vom Radfahren bis zu Bootsausflügen: Alle unsere Outdoor-Aktivitäten bringen Sie den Geheimnissen Lykiens, des Landes des Lichts, ein Stück näher. Das Türkis des Meeres, die Zedernwälder der Berge oder vergessene lykische Siedlungen an der Küste: Für alle von 7 bis 70 gibt es etwas zu entdecken.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"From hiking to coasteering, from cycling to boat trips, all of our outdoor activities bring you one step closer to the secrets of Lycia, the land of light. The turquoise sea, the cedar forests of the mountains or forgotten Lycian settlements on the coast: there is something to discover for everyone from 7 to 70.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"De la randonnée au coasteering, du vélo aux sorties en bateau, toutes nos activités de plein air vous rapprochent des secrets de la Lycie, la terre de lumière. Le turquoise de la mer, les forêts de cèdres des montagnes ou les cités lyciennes oubliées sur la côte : il y a de quoi découvrir pour tous, de 7 à 70 ans.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Yürüyüşten kıyı traversine, bisikletten tekne turlarına tüm doğa etkinliklerimiz sizi ışık ülkesi Likya''nın sırlarını keşfetmeye bir adım yaklaştırıyor. Denizin turkuazı, dağların sedir ormanları ya da kıyıda unutulmuş kadim Likya yerleşimleri; 7''den 70''e herkes için keşfedecek bir şey var.","type":"p"}]},"key":"outdoor","origin":"cloner","seo":{"description":{"de":"Vom Wandern bis zum Coasteering, vom Radfahren bis zur Bootstour: Outdoor-Aktivitäten, die Sie Lykiens Geheimnissen näherbringen. Für alle von 7 bis 70 Jahren.","en":"From hiking to coasteering, from cycling to boat trips: outdoor activities that bring you closer to the secrets of Lycia. Something for everyone from 7 to 70.","fr":"De la randonnée au coasteering, du vélo aux sorties en bateau : des activités de plein air pour percer les secrets de la Lycie. Pour tous, de 7 à 70 ans.","tr":"Yürüyüşten kıyı tırmanışına, bisikletten tekne turlarına: Likya''nın sırlarına bir adım daha yaklaştıran doğa aktiviteleri. 7''den 70''e herkes için bir rota var."},"title":{"de":"Outdoor in Kaş: Wandern, Radfahren, Bootstouren","en":"Outdoor Activities in Kaş: Hiking, Biking, Boats","fr":"Plein air à Kaş : randonnée, vélo et bateau","tr":"Kaş''ta Doğa Aktiviteleri: Yürüyüş ve Bisiklet"}},"sourceRefs":[],"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"cover":"cover-sea-kayak","intro":{"de":[{"text":"Paddeln Sie über die versunkene Stadt, schwimmen Sie in versteckten Buchten und entdecken Sie die lykische Küste im Seekajak. Von ruhigen Buchten bis zu Routen auf offenem Wasser gibt es Angebote für jedes Niveau.","type":"p"},{"text":"Unsere Touren werden von Guides mit Lizenz des Türkischen Kanuverbands geführt; Route, Wetter und Seegang werden vor jeder Tour geprüft.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Paddle over the sunken city, swim in hidden coves and discover the beauty of the Lycian coast by sea kayak. There are options for every level, from calm bays to open-water routes.","type":"p"},{"text":"Our tours are led by guides licensed by the Turkish Canoe Federation; the route, weather and sea conditions are assessed before every tour.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Pagayez au-dessus de la cité engloutie, baignez-vous dans des criques cachées et découvrez la côte lycienne en kayak de mer. Des baies calmes aux itinéraires en pleine mer, il y a une option pour chaque niveau.","type":"p"},{"text":"Nos sorties sont encadrées par des guides diplômés de la Fédération turque de canoë-kayak ; l''itinéraire, la météo et l''état de la mer sont évalués avant chaque sortie.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Batık şehir üzerinde kürek çekin, saklı koylarda yüzün, Likya kıyısının güzelliğini deniz kayağıyla keşfedin. Sakin koylardan açık deniz rotalarına kadar her seviyeye uygun seçenekler var.","type":"p"},{"text":"Turlarımızı Türkiye Kano Federasyonu lisanslı rehberler yönetir; rota, hava ve deniz koşulları her tur öncesinde değerlendirilir.","type":"p"}]},"key":"seaKayak","origin":"kayak-site","seo":{"description":{"de":"Über die versunkene Stadt paddeln, in versteckten Buchten baden: Touren für jedes Niveau an der lykischen Küste, mit vom Kanuverband lizenzierten Guides.","en":"Paddle over the sunken city and swim in hidden coves: sea kayak tours for all levels on the Lycian coast, with guides licensed by the Turkish Canoe Federation.","fr":"Pagayez sur la cité engloutie, baignez-vous dans des criques cachées : kayak de mer pour tous niveaux sur la côte lycienne, avec des guides agréés.","tr":"Batık şehrin üzerinde kürek çekin, saklı koylarda yüzün: Likya kıyısında her seviyeye uygun deniz kanosu turları, Türkiye Kano Federasyonu lisanslı rehberlerle."},"title":{"de":"Seekajak bei Kekova: Tages- und Mehrtagestouren","en":"Sea Kayaking in Kekova: Day and Multi-Day Tours","fr":"Kayak de mer à Kekova : journées et circuits","tr":"Kekova''da Deniz Kanosu: Günübirlik ve Uzun Turlar"}},"sourceRefs":[],"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"cover":"book-tropical-spread-1","intro":{"de":[{"text":"Unsere Bücher über die Unterwasserwelt von Kaş: The Diving Guide – Kaş mit Karten der Tauchplätze und Tropical Mediterranean über die Arten, die aus dem Roten Meer einwandern.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Our books documenting the underwater world of Kaş: The Diving Guide – Kaş with maps of the local dive sites, and Tropical Mediterranean on the species arriving from the Red Sea.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Nos livres consacrés au monde sous-marin de Kaş : The Diving Guide – Kaş, avec les cartes des sites de plongée, et Méditerranée tropicale, sur les espèces venues de la mer Rouge.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Kaş sualtını belgeleyen kitaplarımız: Kaş dalış noktalarının haritalarıyla Dalış Rehberi – Kaş ve Kızıldeniz''den gelen türleri anlatan Tropikal Akdeniz.","type":"p"}]},"key":"shop","origin":"mockup","seo":{"description":{"de":"Bücher über die Unterwasserwelt von Kaş: der Tauchführer mit Karten und Tropical Mediterranean über Arten aus dem Roten Meer. Bestellung per WhatsApp.","en":"Our books on the underwater world of Kaş: The Diving Guide – Kaş with dive site maps, and Tropical Mediterranean on Red Sea species. Order by WhatsApp or email.","fr":"Livres sur le monde sous-marin de Kaş : le guide de plongée et ses cartes, et Méditerranée tropicale sur les espèces de la mer Rouge. Commande par WhatsApp.","tr":"Kaş''ın sualtı dünyasını belgeleyen kitaplarımız: haritalı Dalış Rehberi – Kaş ve Kızıldeniz türleri üzerine Tropikal Akdeniz. WhatsApp ile sipariş."},"title":{"de":"Shop: Bücher über die Unterwasserwelt von Kaş","en":"Shop: Books on the Underwater World of Kaş","fr":"Boutique : livres sur le monde sous-marin de Kaş","tr":"Mağaza: Kaş Dalış Rehberi ve Tropikal Akdeniz"}},"sourceRefs":[],"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"cover":"kas-town-view-1","intro":{"de":[{"text":"Wir organisieren Ihre Transfers nach Kaş von den Flughäfen Dalaman und Antalya und planen Ihren Aufenthalt in den Hotels und Pensionen, die wir empfehlen. Schreiben Sie uns für aktuelle Preise und Verfügbarkeit.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"We arrange your transfers to Kaş from Dalaman and Antalya airports and plan your stay at the hotels and guesthouses we recommend. Please write to us for current prices and availability.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Nous organisons vos transferts vers Kaş depuis les aéroports de Dalaman et d''Antalya, et votre séjour dans les hôtels et pensions que nous recommandons. Écrivez-nous pour les tarifs et disponibilités à jour.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Dalaman ve Antalya havalimanlarından Kaş''a transferlerinizi ayarlıyor, önerdiğimiz otel ve pansiyonlarda konaklamanızı planlıyoruz. Güncel fiyat ve müsaitlik için lütfen bize yazın.","type":"p"}]},"key":"transport","origin":"cloner","seo":{"description":{"de":"Wir organisieren Ihren Transfer nach Kaş ab den Flughäfen Dalaman und Antalya und Ihren Aufenthalt in empfohlenen Hotels und Pensionen. Preise auf Anfrage.","en":"We arrange your transfer to Kaş from Dalaman and Antalya airports and plan your stay at hotels and guesthouses we recommend. Write to us for current prices.","fr":"Nous organisons votre transfert vers Kaş depuis Dalaman et Antalya et votre séjour dans les hôtels et pensions que nous recommandons. Prix sur demande.","tr":"Dalaman ve Antalya havalimanlarından Kaş''a transferinizi ayarlıyor, önerdiğimiz otel ve pansiyonlarda konaklamanızı planlıyoruz. Güncel fiyat için bize yazın."},"title":{"de":"Transfer und Unterkunft in Kaş ab Dalaman","en":"Kaş Transfers and Stays from Dalaman and Antalya","fr":"Transferts et hébergement à Kaş depuis Dalaman","tr":"Kaş Transfer ve Konaklama: Dalaman ve Antalya"}},"sourceRefs":[],"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}],"events":[{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Die Tauch-Auffrischung richtet sich an alle, die gerade ihr erstes Brevet erhalten haben oder lange nicht getaucht sind. Vor dem Einstieg in die Tauchgruppen wiederholen Sie mit einem Tauchlehrer oder Divemaster kurz die Theorie und üben in zwei Tauchgängen (an einem Tag) wichtige Fertigkeiten.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"The scuba skills update is for those who have just got their first diver''s certificate and/or want a refresher after a long period without diving. You are given a concise theoretical review and two dives with a dive professional during which essential practical skills are practised, before you join the dive groups. It is a one-day programme.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Pour ceux qui désirent un petit rappel après une longue période sans plongée, ou qui viennent d''obtenir leur premier brevet : une courte révision théorique et 2 plongées avec un dive-master ou un moniteur, pendant lesquelles quelques exercices essentiels sont exécutés, avant de rejoindre les palanquées. Le programme se déroule sur une journée.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Beceri tazeleme dalışı, ilk dalış sertifikasını yeni almış ve/veya uzun zamandır dalmamış olanların dalış gruplarına katılmadan önce eğitmen veya dalış lideri eşliğinde özet bilgi tekrarı yaptığı ve bazı önemli becerileri uyguladığı 2 dalışlık (1 günlük) bir programdır.","type":"p"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"boat-dragoman-1","duration":{"de":"1 Tag · 2 Tauchgänge","en":"1 day · 2 dives","fr":"1 jour · 2 plongées","tr":"1 gün · 2 dalış"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":[],"healthForm":"diving","id":"beceri-tazeleme","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"iki-dalis","name":{"de":"Programm mit 2 Tauchgängen","en":"2-dive programme","fr":"Programme de 2 plongées","tr":"2 dalışlık program"},"price":120}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Nach längerer Pause oder mit frischem Brevet: kurze Theoriewiederholung und zwei Tauchgänge mit einem Tauchprofi in Kaş, bevor Sie sich den Gruppen anschließen.","en":"Back in the water after a long break, or newly certified? A concise theory review and two dives with a dive professional in Kaş before you join the dive groups.","fr":"Après une longue pause ou un tout nouveau brevet : révision théorique et deux plongées avec un professionnel à Kaş, avant de rejoindre les groupes. Une journée.","tr":"Uzun bir aradan sonra ya da yeni sertifikanızla, gruplara katılmadan önce kısa bir teori tekrarı ve bir profesyonelle iki dalış: bir günlük tazeleme."},"title":{"de":"Tauch-Auffrischung in Kaş: 1 Tag, 2 Tauchgänge","en":"Scuba Skills Update in Kaş: 1 Day, 2 Dives","fr":"Remise à niveau plongée à Kaş, 2 plongées","tr":"Kaş''ta Beceri Tazeleme Dalışı: 1 Gün, 2 Dalış"}},"slug":{"de":"tauchauffrischung","en":"scuba-skills-update","fr":"plongees-de-rappel","tr":"beceri-tazeleme-dalisi"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-egitim","summary":{"de":"Zwei Auffrischungstauchgänge vor dem Einstieg in die Gruppen, nach langer Pause oder mit frischem Brevet.","en":"Two refresher dives before joining the groups, after a long break or with a brand-new certificate.","fr":"Deux plongées de rappel avant de rejoindre les groupes, après une longue pause ou un tout nouveau brevet.","tr":"Uzun aradan sonra ya da yeni sertifikayla, gruplara katılmadan önce 2 dalışlık tazeleme."},"title":{"de":"Tauch-Auffrischung","en":"Scuba Skills Update","fr":"Plongées de rappel","tr":"Beceri Tazeleme Dalışı"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Für den allerersten Abstieg bietet Kaş ideale Bedingungen: Das Wasser ist warm und klar, die Tauchplätze sind sicher und ruhig. In einer kurzen Einweisung erklärt der Tauchlehrer die wichtigsten Sicherheits- und Anpassungstechniken unter Wasser und stellt die Tier- und Pflanzenwelt des Mittelmeers vor.","type":"p"},{"text":"Danach tauchen Sie etwa zwanzig Minuten allein mit einem Tauchlehrer oder Divemaster bis maximal 5 Meter Tiefe. Ein Schnuppertauch-Zertifikat hält Ihren ersten Tauchgang fest. Wer zwei Schnuppertauchgänge bucht, taucht an zwei verschiedenen Plätzen.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"A chance to discover the underwater world for absolute beginners: the water in Kaş is warm and clear and the dive spots are safe and calm. You first take a briefing introducing the diving techniques that help you adapt to the underwater world and to SCUBA equipment, and presenting Mediterranean fauna and flora.","type":"p"},{"text":"You are then taken on a dive of about 20 minutes, one-to-one with an instructor, to a maximum of 5 metres. A try-dive certificate from our dive centre immortalises the experience. Those who do a double try dive will dive at two different spots.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Pour le vrai débutant, une petite escapade dans les eaux turquoise qui vous fera découvrir les plaisirs du monde sous-marin : l''eau est chaude et limpide, les sites sûrs et calmes. Un briefing récapitule les techniques d''adaptation au milieu subaquatique, l''équipement de plongée et la faune et la flore méditerranéennes.","type":"p"},{"text":"Vous êtes ensuite accompagné, en tête-à-tête par un moniteur, lors d''une plongée d''une vingtaine de minutes à 5 mètres de profondeur maximum. Un certificat de baptême immortalise cette expérience. Le double baptême se fait sur deux sites différents.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Kaş''ın turkuaz derinliklerinde ilk geçiş için en elverişli şartlar bir araya gelmiştir: su sıcak ve berrak, dalış yerleri güvenli ve sakindir. Kısa bir brifingde eğitmen temel güvenlik ve sualtına uyum bilgilerini ve becerilerini özetler, Akdeniz''in fauna ve florasını tanıtır.","type":"p"},{"text":"Ardından uzman bir eğitmen veya dalış lideri eşliğinde en fazla 5 metreye birebir yaklaşık yirmi dakikalık bir dalış yaparsınız. İlk dalışınızı ölümsüzleştirecek bir deneme dalışı sertifikası da verilir. İki deneme dalışı yapanlar iki farklı noktada dalar.","type":"p"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"diving-try-dive-1","duration":{"de":"Ein Tauchgang von etwa 20 Minuten","en":"A dive of about 20 minutes","fr":"Une plongée d''environ 20 minutes","tr":"Yaklaşık 20 dakikalık dalış"},"faq":[],"featured":true,"gallery":["diving-turtle-2","cover-diving"],"healthForm":"diving","id":"deneme-dalisi","includes":{"de":["Tauchgang allein mit dem Tauchlehrer","Einweisung","Schnuppertauch-Zertifikat"],"en":["One-to-one dive with an instructor","Briefing","Try-dive certificate"],"fr":["Plongée en tête-à-tête avec un moniteur","Briefing","Certificat de baptême"],"tr":["Eğitmenle birebir dalış","Brifing","Deneme dalışı sertifikası"]},"itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"tek-deneme","name":{"de":"Schnuppertauchgang","en":"Try dive","fr":"Baptême","tr":"Deneme dalışı"},"price":50},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"iki-deneme","name":{"de":"Zwei Schnuppertauchgänge","en":"Double try dive","fr":"Double baptême","tr":"İki deneme dalışı"},"price":90}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Zum ersten Mal abtauchen: in Kaş eins zu eins mit einem Tauchlehrer, nach kurzem Briefing rund 20 Minuten bis 5 Meter Tiefe, mit Schnuppertauch-Zertifikat.","en":"Never dived before? Take your first dive in Kaş one-to-one with an instructor: a short briefing, about 20 minutes at up to 5 metres and a try-dive certificate.","fr":"Première plongée à Kaş pour les débutants, en tête-à-tête avec un moniteur : briefing, environ 20 minutes jusqu''à 5 mètres et un certificat de baptême.","tr":"Hiç dalmamış olanlar için Kaş''ta eğitmenle birebir ilk dalış: kısa bir brifing, en fazla 5 metrede yaklaşık 20 dakika ve deneme dalışı sertifikası."},"title":{"de":"Schnuppertauchen in Kaş mit eigenem Tauchlehrer","en":"Try Dive in Kaş: First Dive with an Instructor","fr":"Baptême de plongée à Kaş avec un moniteur","tr":"Kaş''ta Deneme Dalışı: Eğitmenle İlk Dalış"}},"slug":{"de":"schnuppertauchen","en":"try-dive","fr":"bapteme-de-plongee","tr":"deneme-dalisi"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-deneme","summary":{"de":"Ein erster Tauchgang allein mit einem Tauchlehrer im klaren Wasser von Kaş, für absolute Anfänger.","en":"A first one-to-one dive with an instructor in the clear waters of Kaş, for absolute beginners.","fr":"Une première plongée en tête-à-tête avec un moniteur dans les eaux limpides de Kaş, pour les vrais débutants.","tr":"Hiç dalmamış olanlar için Kaş''ın berrak sularında eğitmenle birebir ilk dalış."},"title":{"de":"Schnuppertauchen","en":"Try Dive","fr":"Baptême de plongée","tr":"Deneme Dalışı"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Seien Sie Ihr eigener Motor: wandernd, radelnd und paddelnd durch die eindrucksvollsten Ecken dieser schönen Mittelmeerregion. Tauchen Sie ein in die Geschichte bei unserem viertägigen Outdoor-Abenteuer, zelten Sie neben antiken lykischen Stätten und genießen Sie das klare Meer in der Hitze des Tages wie in der Ruhe der Nacht.","type":"p"},{"text":"Entdecken Sie fünf lykische Städte, zwei davon versunken: Paddeln Sie an der versunkenen Stadt Kekova entlang oder schnorcheln Sie nach einer schönen Wanderung zwischen den Ruinen von Aperlai. Abstand vom Trubel der Stadt ist garantiert.","type":"p"},{"items":["Aktivitäten: Wandern, Radfahren, Seekajak","Dauer: 3 Nächte, 4 Tage"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"Be your own engine, hiking, biking and paddling your way through the most stunning parts of this beautiful Mediterranean region. Immerse yourself in history on our 4-day multi-activity outdoor adventure, camping next to ancient Lycian sites and enjoying the crystal-clear sea in the heat of the day as well as at its calmest at night.","type":"p"},{"text":"Explore five different Lycian cities, two of which are sunken: paddle along the ancient sunken city of Kekova or treat yourself to a snorkel along the ruins of Aperlai after a beautiful hike. Seclusion from the hustle and bustle of city life is guaranteed.","type":"p"},{"items":["Activities: hiking, biking, sea kayaking","Duration: 3 nights, 4 days"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Soyez votre propre moteur en randonnée, à vélo et en kayak à travers les plus beaux endroits de cette magnifique région méditerranéenne. Plongez dans l''histoire lors de notre aventure de 4 jours, où vous camperez près des sites lyciens antiques et profiterez de la mer cristalline pendant les heures chaudes comme au calme de la nuit.","type":"p"},{"text":"Explorez cinq cités lyciennes, dont deux englouties : pagayez le long de la cité engloutie de Kekova ou offrez-vous du snorkeling parmi les ruines d''Aperlai après une belle randonnée. Isolement et refuge loin de l''agitation urbaine garantis.","type":"p"},{"items":["Activités : randonnée, VTT, kayak de mer","Durée : 3 nuits, 4 jours"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Kendi motorun ol: Akdeniz''in bu güzel bölgesinin en etkileyici yerlerinde yürüyerek, bisiklete binerek ve kürek çekerek ilerle. Antik Likya alanlarının yanında kamp kuracağın, günün sıcağında olduğu kadar gecenin en sakin anlarında da berrak denizin tadını çıkaracağın 4 günlük bir açık hava macerası.","type":"p"},{"text":"İkisi batık beş farklı Likya kentini keşfet: Kekova batık kenti boyunca kürek çek ya da güzel bir yürüyüşün ardından Aperlai harabeleri arasında şnorkelle yüz. Şehrin koşuşturmasından uzaklık ve huzur garanti.","type":"p"},{"items":["Etkinlikler: bisiklet, deniz kanosu, yürüyüş","Süre: 3 gece 4 gün"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"outdoor","conditions":{"de":["Wochentouren finden ab 2 Teilnehmenden statt; Preise pro Person."],"en":["Weekly tours run with a minimum of 2 participants; prices are per person."],"fr":["Les circuits hebdomadaires partent à partir de 2 participants ; prix par personne."],"tr":["Haftalık turlar en az 2 kişiyle yapılır; fiyatlar kişi başıdır."]},"cover":"outdoor-multi-activity-1","duration":{"de":"4 Tage / 3 Nächte","en":"4 days / 3 nights","fr":"4 jours / 3 nuits","tr":"4 gün / 3 gece"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["cover-outdoor","hero-sea-kayak"],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"dogaya-donus","itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Vier Tage Wandern, Radfahren und Seekajak: Camping neben antiken lykischen Stätten, im Kajak an der versunkenen Stadt Kekova und Schnorcheln bei Aperlai.","en":"Four days of hiking, biking and sea kayaking: camp beside ancient Lycian sites, paddle along the sunken city of Kekova and snorkel over the ruins of Aperlai.","fr":"Quatre jours de randonnée, de vélo et de kayak de mer : bivouacs près de sites lyciens antiques, la cité engloutie de Kekova en kayak et snorkeling à Aperlai.","tr":"Yürüyüş, bisiklet ve deniz kanosuyla 4 gün: antik Likya kentlerinin yanında kamp, Kekova Batık Şehri boyunca kürek ve Aperlai kalıntılarında şnorkel."},"title":{"de":"Zurück zur Natur: 4 Tage Multisport in Lykien","en":"Back to Nature: 4-Day Lycian Multi-Activity Trip","fr":"Retour à la nature : 4 jours actifs en Lycie","tr":"Doğaya Dönüş: 4 Günlük Çok Aktiviteli Likya Turu"}},"slug":{"de":"zurueck-zur-natur","en":"back-to-nature","fr":"retour-a-la-nature","tr":"dogaya-donus"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-coklu-aktivite","summary":{"de":"Ein viertägiges Multiaktivitätsabenteuer in Lykien zu Fuß, mit dem Rad und im Seekajak.","en":"A 4-day multi-activity Lycian adventure on foot, by bike and by sea kayak.","fr":"Une aventure lycienne multi-activités de 4 jours à pied, à vélo et en kayak de mer.","tr":"Yürüyüş, bisiklet ve deniz kanosuyla 4 günlük çok aktiviteli Likya macerası."},"title":{"de":"Zurück zur Natur","en":"Back to Nature","fr":"Retour à la nature","tr":"Doğaya Dönüş"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Die Wanderung beginnt an einem kleinen Waldhaus, das man durch kleine Dörfer erreicht. Nach einigen hundert Metern legen wir eine kurze Pause ein, um den Blick über das bewaldete Tal zu genießen. Dann zeigt sich die antike Stadt Phellos mit ihrer eindrucksvollen Nekropole und den zwischen Bäumen und Büschen versteckten Sarkophagen.","type":"p"},{"text":"Beim Abstieg zum Dorf Çukurbağ fällt die gut erhaltene Architektur der alten Häuser auf. Im letzten Abschnitt bildet die griechische Insel Meis die Kulisse.","type":"p"},{"items":["Transferzeit: 25 Min.","Schwierigkeit: A (leicht, für alle Altersgruppen)","Höhe: 850–0 m"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"The hike starts at a small forest house reached through small village settlements. After a few hundred metres we stop to enjoy the view of the valley, covered with trees. The ancient city of Phellos then presents itself with its impressive necropolis and tombs hidden in the trees and bushes.","type":"p"},{"text":"Going down towards Çukurbağ village, the well-preserved architecture of the old houses is worth seeing. On the final part of the hike the Greek island of Meis forms the backdrop.","type":"p"},{"items":["Transfer time: 25 min","Grade: A (easy, for anyone of any age)","Altitude: 850–0 m"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"La randonnée commence près d''une petite maison forestière, accessible par de petits villages. Après quelques centaines de mètres, nous faisons une pause pour admirer le panorama de la vallée boisée. La cité antique de Phellos se révèle alors avec son impressionnante nécropole et ses tombes cachées parmi les arbres et les buissons.","type":"p"},{"text":"En descendant vers le village de Çukurbağ, l''architecture bien conservée des vieilles maisons mérite le coup d''œil. Dans la dernière partie, l''île grecque de Meis s''impose à l''horizon.","type":"p"},{"items":["Durée du transfert : 25 min","Niveau : A (facile, pour tous les âges)","Altitude : 850–0 m"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Yürüyüş, küçük köy yerleşimlerinden geçilerek ulaşılan orman evinden başlar. Birkaç yüz metre sonra, yoğun bitki örtüsüyle kaplı vadi manzarasının tadını çıkarmak için kısa bir mola verilir. Ağaçlar arasından birdenbire karşımıza çıkan, lahit mezarlarla donatılmış Phellos kentidir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Çukurbağ Köyü''ne inerken köyün iyi korunmuş ev mimarisi dikkat çeker. Yürüyüşün son etabı fon manzarası olarak Meis adasını sunar.","type":"p"},{"items":["Transfer süresi: 25 dk","Zorluk: A (kolay, her yaştan herkes için)","İrtifa: 850–0 m"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"outdoor","conditions":{"de":["Tagestouren finden ab 4 Teilnehmenden statt."],"en":["Day tours run with a minimum of 4 participants."],"fr":["Les sorties à la journée partent à partir de 4 participants."],"tr":["Günlük turlar en az 4 kişiyle yapılır."]},"cover":"outdoor-hiking-lycian-way-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["cover-outdoor"],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"felen-kas-yuruyusu","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kisi-basi","name":{"de":"Pro Person","en":"Per person","fr":"Par personne","tr":"Kişi başı"},"price":50}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Leichte Tageswanderung von der Nekropole des antiken Phellos über das Dorf Çukurbağ nach Kaş, von 850 m auf Meereshöhe, mit Blick auf Meis. Für jedes Alter.","en":"An easy day hike from the necropolis of ancient Phellos via Çukurbağ village down to Kaş, from 850 m to sea level with views of Meis. Suitable for all ages.","fr":"Randonnée facile d''une journée, de la nécropole de l''antique Phellos à Kaş par le village de Çukurbağ, de 850 m au niveau de la mer, face à Meis. Tous âges.","tr":"Antik Phellos nekropolünden Çukurbağ köyü üzerinden Kaş''a inen kolay yürüyüş: 850 metreden deniz seviyesine, Meis adası manzarasıyla. Her yaşa uygun."},"title":{"de":"Wanderung von Phellos nach Kaş mit Blick auf Meis","en":"Phellos to Kaş Hike: Easy Downhill Day Walk","fr":"Randonnée facile de Phellos à Kaş, vue sur Meis","tr":"Felen (Phellos) – Kaş Yürüyüşü: Kolay Günlük Rota"}},"slug":{"de":"wanderung-phellos-kas","en":"phellos-to-kas-hike","fr":"randonnee-phellos-kas","tr":"felen-kas-yuruyusu"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-yuruyus","summary":{"de":"Eine Tageswanderung von der Nekropole von Phellos hinunter nach Kaş mit Blick auf Meis.","en":"A day hike from the Phellos necropolis down to Kaş, with views of Meis.","fr":"Une randonnée à la journée de la nécropole de Phellos jusqu''à Kaş, face à Meis.","tr":"Phellos nekropolünden Kaş''a, Meis manzarasıyla inen günlük yürüyüş."},"title":{"de":"Wanderung Felen (Phellos) – Kaş (Antiphellos)","en":"Felen (Phellos) – Kaş (Antiphellos) Hike","fr":"Randonnée Felen (Phellos) – Kaş (Antiphellos)","tr":"Felen (Phellos) – Kaş (Antiphellos) Yürüyüşü"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Ein Nachttauchgang für brevetierte Taucher, vom Boot aus, mit Guide und in Gruppen von höchstens 6 Personen. Die Tauchlampe ist inbegriffen. Der Preis ohne Ausrüstung enthält Flasche, Blei, Boot und Guide; der Preis mit Ausrüstung enthält die komplette Ausrüstung, Boot und Guide.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"A night dive for certified divers, made from the boat with a guide and in groups of no more than 6. The dive torch is included. The price without equipment includes tank, weights, boat and guide; the price with equipment includes full equipment, boat and guide.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Une plongée de nuit pour plongeurs certifiés, depuis le bateau, avec un guide et en groupes de 6 plongeurs maximum. La torche de plongée est incluse. Le tarif sans équipement comprend bouteille, plombs, bateau et guide ; le tarif avec équipement comprend tout l''équipement, le bateau et le guide.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Sertifikalı dalıcılar için tekneden, rehber eşliğinde ve en fazla 6 kişilik gruplarla yapılan gece dalışı. Dalış feneri fiyata dahildir. Ekipmansız fiyata tüp, ağırlık, tekne ve rehber; ekipmanlı fiyata tüm ekipman, tekne ve rehber dahildir.","type":"p"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"diving-nudibranch-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["diving-cornetfish-1"],"healthForm":"diving","id":"gece-dalisi","includes":{"de":["Tauchlampe","Boot und Guide","Flasche und Blei"],"en":["Dive torch","Boat and guide","Tank and weights"],"fr":["Torche de plongée","Bateau et guide","Bouteille et plombs"],"tr":["Dalış feneri","Tekne ve rehber","Tüp ve ağırlık"]},"itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"ekipmansiz","name":{"de":"Ohne Ausrüstung","en":"Without equipment","fr":"Sans équipement","tr":"Ekipmansız"},"price":35},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"ekipmanli","name":{"de":"Mit Ausrüstung","en":"With equipment","fr":"Avec équipement","tr":"Ekipmanlı"},"price":44}],"order":2,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Geführter Nachttauchgang vom Boot in Kaş für zertifizierte Taucher, in Gruppen von höchstens 6 Personen, Tauchlampe inklusive, mit oder ohne Ausrüstung.","en":"A guided night dive from the boat in Kaş for certified divers, in groups of no more than 6, with the dive torch included. Choose with or without equipment.","fr":"Plongée de nuit guidée depuis le bateau à Kaş, réservée aux plongeurs certifiés, en groupes de 6 au plus, lampe fournie. Formule avec ou sans équipement.","tr":"Sertifikalı dalıcılar için Kaş''ta tekneden rehberli gece dalışı. Gruplar en fazla 6 kişi, dalış feneri dahil; ekipmanlı ve ekipmansız seçenekler var."},"title":{"de":"Nachttauchgang in Kaş für zertifizierte Taucher","en":"Night Diving in Kaş for Certified Divers","fr":"Plongée de nuit à Kaş pour plongeurs certifiés","tr":"Kaş''ta Gece Dalışı: Sertifikalı Dalıcılar İçin"}},"slug":{"de":"nachttauchgang","en":"night-dive","fr":"plongee-de-nuit","tr":"gece-dalisi"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-sertifikali","summary":{"de":"Geführter Nachttauchgang für brevetierte Taucher; Lampe inklusive.","en":"A guided night dive for certified divers; dive torch included.","fr":"Une plongée de nuit guidée pour plongeurs certifiés ; torche incluse.","tr":"Sertifikalı dalıcılar için rehberli gece dalışı; fener dahil."},"title":{"de":"Nachttauchgang","en":"Night Dive","fr":"Plongée de nuit","tr":"Gece Dalışı"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Eine Seekajakreise entlang der lykischen Küste: von Kaş bis Andriake, dem historischen Hafen von Myra, vorbei an zwei versunkenen Städten, Mittelmeerpanoramen und versteckten Buchten. Zeltnächte in Üzümlü und Aperlai, eine Hotelnacht in Simena.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Zwei versunkene Städte: Kekova und Aperlai","Übernachtung am Strand und im Camp","Ausblicke auf den Lykischen Weg","Schnorcheln über versunkenen Häfen","Simena, das Burgdorf"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"A sea kayaking journey along the Lycian coast: paddle from Kaş to Andriake, the historic harbour of Myra, discovering two sunken cities, Mediterranean views and hidden coves. Camping nights in Üzümlü and Aperlai, a hotel night in Simena.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["Two sunken cities: Kekova and Aperlai","Beach and camp accommodation","Views of the Lycian Way","Snorkelling over sunken harbours","Simena, the castle village"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Un voyage en kayak de mer le long de la côte lycienne : de Kaş jusqu''à Andriake, le port historique de Myra, en découvrant deux cités englouties, des panoramas méditerranéens et des criques cachées. Nuits en camping à Üzümlü et Aperlai, nuit à l''hôtel à Simena.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["Deux cités englouties : Kekova et Aperlai","Nuits en bord de mer et en camping","Vues sur le chemin lycien","Snorkeling au-dessus de ports engloutis","Simena, le village du château"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Likya kıyısı boyunca bir deniz kayağı yolculuğu: Kaş''tan Myra''nın tarihi limanı Andriake''ye kürek çekerek iki batık şehri, Akdeniz manzaralarını ve saklı koyları keşfedin. Üzümlü ve Aperlai''de kamp geceleri, Simena''da otel konaklaması.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["İki batık şehir: Kekova ve Aperlai","Sahil ve kamp konaklaması","Likya Yolu manzaraları","Batık limanlar üzerinde şnorkel","Kale köyü Simena"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","cover":"kayak-light-coast-1","duration":{"de":"4 Tage / 3 Nächte","en":"4 days / 3 nights","fr":"4 jours / 3 nuits","tr":"4 gün / 3 gece"},"faq":[{"answer":{"de":"Die ersten beiden Nächte im Camp in Üzümlü und Aperlai, die dritte Nacht im Hotel im Burgdorf Simena.","en":"The first two nights are spent camping in Üzümlü and Aperlai, the third night in a hotel in Simena, the castle village.","fr":"Les deux premières nuits en camping à Üzümlü et Aperlai, la troisième à l''hôtel à Simena, le village du château.","tr":"İlk iki gece Üzümlü''de ve Aperlai''de kampta, üçüncü gece kale köyü Simena''da otelde."},"question":{"de":"Wo übernachten wir?","en":"Where do we sleep?","fr":"Où dort-on ?","tr":"Geceleri nerede kalıyoruz?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Sie beginnt in Büyükçakıl in Kaş und endet in Andriake, dem antiken Hafen von Myra.","en":"It starts from Büyükçakıl in Kaş and ends at Andriake, the ancient harbour of Myra.","fr":"Il part de Büyükçakıl à Kaş et se termine à Andriake, le port antique de Myra.","tr":"Kaş''ta Büyükçakıl''dan başlar ve Myra''nın antik limanı Andriake''de biter."},"question":{"de":"Wo beginnt und endet die Tour?","en":"Where does the tour start and end?","fr":"Où commence et se termine le circuit ?","tr":"Tur nerede başlayıp bitiyor?"}}],"featured":false,"gallery":["kayak-light-coast-2"],"healthForm":null,"id":"isik-kiyisi","itinerary":[{"description":{"de":"Treffen in Kaş, Start in Büyükçakıl und Paddeln nach Üzümlü, wo wir zelten. Mittag- und Abendessen im Camp, Frühstück am nächsten Morgen.","en":"Meet in Kaş, start the tour at Büyükçakıl and paddle to Üzümlü, where we camp. Lunch and dinner at the campsite, breakfast the next morning.","fr":"Rendez-vous à Kaş, départ de Büyükçakıl et pagayage jusqu''à Üzümlü, où l''on campe. Déjeuner et dîner au camp, petit-déjeuner le lendemain matin.","tr":"Kaş''ta buluşun ve tura Büyükçakıl''dan başlayıp Üzümlü''ye kürek çekin; kamp burada. Kamp alanında öğle ve akşam yemeği, ertesi sabah kahvaltı."},"title":{"de":"Tag 1 — Von Kaş nach Üzümlü","en":"Day 1 — Kaş to Üzümlü","fr":"Jour 1 — De Kaş à Üzümlü","tr":"Gün 1 — Kaş''tan Üzümlü''ye"}},{"description":{"de":"Paddeln von Üzümlü zur antiken Stadt Aperlai. Camp in Aperlai; Mittagessen, Abendessen und Frühstück.","en":"Paddle from Üzümlü to the ancient city of Aperlai. Camp at Aperlai; lunch, dinner and breakfast.","fr":"Pagayage d''Üzümlü jusqu''à la cité antique d''Aperlai. Camp à Aperlai ; déjeuner, dîner et petit-déjeuner.","tr":"Üzümlü''den antik Aperlai kentine kürek çekin. Aperlai''de kamp; öğle, akşam yemeği ve kahvaltı."},"title":{"de":"Tag 2 — Von Üzümlü nach Aperlai","en":"Day 2 — Üzümlü to Aperlai","fr":"Jour 2 — D''Üzümlü à Aperlai","tr":"Gün 2 — Üzümlü''den Aperlai''ye"}},{"description":{"de":"Weiter nach Simena mit Mittagspause in einem Fischerhaus unterwegs. Abendessen und Übernachtung im Burgdorf Simena.","en":"Continue to Simena with a lunch stop at a fisherman''s house on the way. Dinner and overnight in Simena, the castle village.","fr":"Poursuite vers Simena avec une pause déjeuner chez un pêcheur en chemin. Dîner et nuit à Simena, le village du château.","tr":"Yol üzerinde bir balıkçı evinde öğle yemeği molasıyla Simena''ya devam edin. Kale köyü Simena''da akşam yemeği ve konaklama."},"title":{"de":"Tag 3 — Von Aperlai nach Simena","en":"Day 3 — Aperlai to Simena","fr":"Jour 3 — D''Aperlai à Simena","tr":"Gün 3 — Aperlai''den Simena''ya"}},{"description":{"de":"Nach dem Frühstück über die versunkene Stadt paddeln, Picknick genießen und dann der Ostroute bis nach Andriake folgen.","en":"After breakfast, paddle over the Sunken City, enjoy a picnic lunch, then follow the eastern route to finish at Andriake.","fr":"Après le petit-déjeuner, pagayage au-dessus de la cité engloutie, déjeuner pique-nique, puis la route est jusqu''à l''arrivée à Andriake.","tr":"Kahvaltıdan sonra Batık Şehir üzerinde kürek çekin, piknik öğle yemeğinin tadını çıkarın, ardından doğu rotasını izleyerek Andriake''de tamamlayın."},"title":{"de":"Tag 4 — Versunkene Stadt und Ostroute nach Andriake","en":"Day 4 — The Sunken City and the eastern route to Andriake","fr":"Jour 4 — La cité engloutie et la route est jusqu''à Andriake","tr":"Gün 4 — Batık Şehir ve doğu rotasıyla Andriake"}}],"options":[],"order":2,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Vier Tage im Seekajak von Kaş nach Andriake, dem Hafen von Myra: versunkene Städte Kekova und Aperlai, Camping in Üzümlü und Aperlai, eine Hotelnacht in Simena.","en":"Four days of sea kayaking from Kaş to Andriake, Myra''s harbour: sunken cities of Kekova and Aperlai, camping at Üzümlü and Aperlai, a hotel night in Simena.","fr":"Quatre jours de kayak de mer de Kaş à Andriake, port de Myra : cités englouties de Kekova et d''Aperlai, bivouacs à Üzümlü et Aperlai, une nuit d''hôtel à Simena.","tr":"Kaş''tan Myra''nın limanı Andriake''ye 4 gün deniz kayağı: Kekova ve Aperlai batık şehirleri, Üzümlü ve Aperlai''de kamp, Simena''da otel gecesi ve bol şnorkel."},"title":{"de":"Küste des Lichts: 4 Tage Seekajak und Camping","en":"Coast of Light: 4-Day Lycian Kayak & Camping Tour","fr":"Côte de Lumière : 4 jours de kayak et camping","tr":"Işık Kıyısı: 4 Günlük Likya Kano ve Kamp Turu"}},"slug":{"de":"kueste-des-lichts","en":"coast-of-light","fr":"cote-de-lumiere","tr":"isik-kiyisi"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-cok-gunlu","summary":{"de":"Ein Kajak- und Schnorchelabenteuer entlang des antiken Lykien.","en":"A kayaking and snorkelling adventure along ancient Lycia.","fr":"Une aventure en kayak et en snorkeling le long de l''antique Lycie.","tr":"Antik Likya boyunca kayak ve şnorkel macerası."},"title":{"de":"Küste des Lichts — Kajak- und Campingtour (4 Tage)","en":"Coast of Light — Kayak & Camping Tour (4 Days)","fr":"Côte de Lumière — Kayak et camping (4 jours)","tr":"Işık Kıyısı — Kano & Kamp Turu (4 Gün)"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Eine Seekajakreise an der antiken karischen Küste, wo Geschichte, Natur und Abenteuer zusammenkommen. Entdecken Sie versteckte Buchten, Naturhäfen und historische Stätten wie die antike Stadt Knidos im unberührten Wasser von Mittelmeer und Ägäis. Übernachten Sie in den Ägäisorten Datça und Bozburun und genießen Sie die traditionelle Küche der Ägäis.","type":"p"},{"text":"Diese Route ist noch ein Entwurf; das ausführliche Tagesprogramm wird in Kürze ergänzt.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Die antike Stadt Knidos","Unberührtes Wasser von Mittelmeer und Ägäis","Versteckte Buchten und Naturhäfen","Osmanische Burgen","Übernachtungen in Datça und Bozburun","Traditionelle ägäische Küche"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"A sea kayaking journey on the ancient Carian coast, where history, nature and adventure meet. Discover hidden coves, natural harbours and historic sites such as the ancient city of Knidos in the unspoilt waters of the Mediterranean and the Aegean. Stay in the Aegean towns of Datça and Bozburun and enjoy traditional Aegean cuisine.","type":"p"},{"text":"This route is still a draft; the detailed day-by-day programme will be added soon.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["The ancient city of Knidos","Unspoilt waters of the Mediterranean and the Aegean","Hidden coves and natural harbours","Ottoman castles","Stays in Datça and Bozburun","Traditional Aegean cuisine"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Un voyage en kayak de mer sur la côte de l''antique Carie, là où se rencontrent histoire, nature et aventure. Découvrez des criques cachées, des ports naturels et des sites historiques comme la cité antique de Cnide, dans les eaux préservées de la Méditerranée et de l''Égée. Logez dans les bourgs égéens de Datça et de Bozburun et goûtez à la cuisine égéenne traditionnelle.","type":"p"},{"text":"Cet itinéraire est encore à l''état de projet ; le programme détaillé jour par jour sera ajouté prochainement.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["La cité antique de Cnide","Les eaux préservées de la Méditerranée et de l''Égée","Criques cachées et ports naturels","Châteaux ottomans","Séjours à Datça et Bozburun","Cuisine égéenne traditionnelle"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Tarih, doğa ve maceranın buluştuğu antik Karia kıyılarında bir deniz kayağı yolculuğu. Akdeniz ve Ege''nin el değmemiş sularında saklı koyları, doğal limanları ve Knidos antik kenti gibi tarihi yerleri keşfedin. Datça ve Bozburun''un Ege kasabalarında konaklayın ve geleneksel Ege mutfağının tadını çıkarın.","type":"p"},{"text":"Bu rota taslak aşamasındadır; ayrıntılı günlük program yakında eklenecektir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["Antik Knidos kenti","Akdeniz ve Ege''nin el değmemiş suları","Saklı koylar ve doğal limanlar","Osmanlı kaleleri","Datça ve Bozburun''da konaklama","Geleneksel Ege mutfağı"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","cover":"kayak-caria-coast-1","duration":{"de":"7 Tage / 6 Nächte","en":"7 days / 6 nights","fr":"7 jours / 6 nuits","tr":"7 gün / 6 gece"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":[],"healthForm":null,"id":"karia-kiyisi","itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":5,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Eine Woche Seekajak an der antiken karischen Küste: die Stadt Knidos, versteckte Buchten und Naturhäfen, Nächte in Datça und Bozburun, ägäische Küche.","en":"A week of sea kayaking on the ancient Carian coast: the city of Knidos, hidden coves and natural harbours, stays in Datça and Bozburun and Aegean cuisine.","fr":"Une semaine de kayak de mer sur l''antique côte carienne : la cité de Cnide, criques cachées et ports naturels, étapes à Datça et Bozburun, cuisine égéenne.","tr":"Antik Karia kıyısında bir hafta deniz kayağı: Knidos antik kenti, saklı koylar ve doğal limanlar, Datça ve Bozburun''da konaklama ve geleneksel Ege mutfağı."},"title":{"de":"Karische Küste: eine Woche Seekajak bis Knidos","en":"Carian Shore: A Week of Sea Kayaking to Knidos","fr":"Côte carienne : une semaine de kayak vers Cnide","tr":"Karia Kıyısı: Knidos ve Datça''da 1 Hafta Kayak"}},"slug":{"de":"karische-kueste","en":"carian-shore","fr":"cote-carienne","tr":"karia-kiyisi"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-cok-gunlu","summary":{"de":"Eine Woche Kajak-Entdeckung an der eindrucksvollen Küste des antiken Karien.","en":"A week of kayak exploration along the striking coast of ancient Caria.","fr":"Une semaine de découverte en kayak sur la côte saisissante de l''antique Carie.","tr":"Antik Karia''nın etkileyici kıyılarında bir hafta süren kayak keşfi."},"title":{"de":"Karische Küste — 1 Woche","en":"Carian Shore — 1 Week","fr":"Côte carienne — 1 semaine","tr":"Karia Kıyısı — 1 Hafta"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Der Ausflug dauert insgesamt etwa 9 Stunden. Sie erkunden das Sonderschutzgebiet Kaş-Kekova und sehen die Ruinen antiker Siedlungen, die 3000 Jahre zurückreichen, von lykischer bis römischer Zeit.","type":"p"},{"text":"Im Laufe des Tages besuchen Sie den Archipel von Kaş, den Strand von Limanağzı, die Insel Kekova, die versunkene Stadt und die Burg von Simena (Kaleköy).","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"The tour takes around 9 hours in total. You explore the Specially Protected Area of Kaş-Kekova and see the ruins of ancient settlements going back 3000 years, from Lycian to Roman times.","type":"p"},{"text":"During the day you visit the Kaş archipelago, Limanağzı beach, Kekova island, the Sunken City and Simena Castle (Kaleköy).","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"La sortie dure environ 9 heures au total. Vous explorez la zone spécialement protégée de Kaş-Kekova et découvrez les ruines de cités anciennes vieilles de 3000 ans, des villes lyciennes aux villes romaines.","type":"p"},{"text":"Au cours de la journée, vous visitez l''archipel de Kaş, la plage de Limanağzı, l''île de Kekova, la cité engloutie et le château de Simena (Kaleköy).","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Tur toplamda yaklaşık 9 saat sürer. Kaş-Kekova Özel Koruma Alanı''nı keşfeder, Likya''dan Roma dönemine 3000 yıl öncesine uzanan antik yerleşimlerin güzelliklerini görürsünüz.","type":"p"},{"text":"Gün boyunca Kaş takımadalarını, Limanağzı plajını, Kekova adasını, Batık Şehir''i ve Simena Kalesi''ni (Kaleköy) ziyaret edeceksiniz.","type":"p"}]},"category":"outdoor","cover":"boat-dragoman-aerial-1","duration":{"de":"Etwa 9 Stunden","en":"About 9 hours","fr":"Environ 9 heures","tr":"Yaklaşık 9 saat"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["kayak-simena-castle-1","kas-town-view-1"],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"kas-kekova-tekne-turu","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kisi-basi","name":{"de":"Pro Person","en":"Per person","fr":"Par personne","tr":"Kişi başı"},"price":55}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Ein Bootstag von rund 9 Stunden: Archipel von Kaş, Strand Limanağzı, Insel Kekova, versunkene Stadt und Burg Simena, Ruinen aus lykischer bis römischer Zeit.","en":"A boat day of about 9 hours: the Kaş archipelago, Limanağzı beach, Kekova Island, the Sunken City and Simena Castle, with ruins from Lycian to Roman times.","fr":"Une journée d''environ 9 heures en bateau : archipel de Kaş, plage de Limanağzı, île de Kekova, cité engloutie et château de Simena, des Lyciens aux Romains.","tr":"Yaklaşık 9 saatlik tekne günü: Kaş takımadaları, Limanağzı plajı, Kekova Adası, Batık Şehir ve Simena Kalesi; Likya''dan Roma''ya 3000 yıllık kalıntılar."},"title":{"de":"Bootstour Kaş – Kekova zur versunkenen Stadt","en":"Kaş – Kekova Boat Trip: Sunken City and Simena","fr":"Bateau Kaş – Kekova : cité engloutie et Simena","tr":"Kaş – Kekova Tekne Turu: Batık Şehir ve Simena"}},"slug":{"de":"bootsausflug-kas-kekova-kas","en":"kas-kekova-kas-boat-trip","fr":"excursion-bateau-kas-kekova-kas","tr":"kas-kekova-kas-tekne-turu"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-tekne","summary":{"de":"Ein etwa neunstündiger Bootstag vom Archipel von Kaş zur versunkenen Stadt und zur Burg von Simena.","en":"A boat day of about 9 hours from the Kaş archipelago to the Sunken City and Simena Castle.","fr":"Une journée en bateau d''environ 9 heures, de l''archipel de Kaş à la cité engloutie et au château de Simena.","tr":"Kaş takımadalarından Batık Şehir ve Simena Kalesi''ne yaklaşık 9 saatlik tekne günü."},"title":{"de":"Bootsausflug Kaş – Kekova – Kaş","en":"Kaş – Kekova – Kaş Boat Trip","fr":"Excursion en bateau Kaş – Kekova – Kaş","tr":"Kaş – Kekova – Kaş Tekne Turu"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Diese Route zeigt Ihnen zwei versunkene Städte an einem Tag und richtet sich an fortgeschrittene Paddler: etwa 15 km Paddeln und 1,5 km zu Fuß. Sie fahren über die versunkene Stadt Kekova, paddeln weiter zur antiken Stadt Aperlai, wandern ein kurzes Stück auf dem Lykischen Weg und schnorcheln über den versunkenen Hafenruinen.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Der Kekova-Sund und seine Inseln","Die antike Stadt Aperlai","Seekajak und kurze Wanderung","Ganztägige Route"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Route","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → Kekova-Sund und Inseln → Polemos → Sıçak → Aperlai","type":"p"},{"text":"Programm","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 Treffpunkt am Königsgrab in Kaş; Abholung auf der Halbinsel Kaş möglich, Transfer ab Kalkan +10 €.","Etwa 40 Minuten Fahrt nach Üçağız; komplette Ausrüstung und ausführliche Sicherheitseinweisung.","Paddeln Richtung Simena, vorbei am berühmten halb versunkenen lykischen Grab und über die versunkene Stadt; Badepause in der Bucht Tersane.","Mittagessen in einem Fischerhaus: gegrillter Fisch, Kartoffeln und frischer Mittelmeersalat.","Kurze Wanderung auf dem Lykischen Weg und Blick über die Küste von den Mauern Aperlais.","Schnorcheln über versunkenen Häfen und Gebäuden; die Geschichte der antiken Purpurfärberei.","Kajaksegeln mit kleinen Segeln, wenn das Wetter es erlaubt.","Freie Zeit in Üçağız und Rückfahrt nach Kaş; Ankunft 17:00–17:30."],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"This route shows you two sunken cities in one day and is designed for intermediate and advanced paddlers: about 15 km of paddling and a 1.5 km walk. You cross over the Kekova Sunken City, paddle on to the ancient city of Aperlai, take a short hike on the Lycian Way and snorkel over the sunken harbour ruins.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["Kekova Sound and its islands","The ancient city of Aperlai","Sea kayaking plus a short hike","Full-day route"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Route","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → Kekova Sound and islands → Polemos → Sıçak → Aperlai","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 meeting at the King''s Tomb in Kaş; pick-up available on the Kaş Peninsula, Kalkan transfer +€10.","About 40 minutes'' drive to Üçağız; full equipment and a detailed safety briefing.","Paddle towards Simena, past the iconic half-submerged Lycian tomb and over the Kekova Sunken City; swim break in Tersane Bay.","Lunch at a fisherman''s house: grilled fish, potatoes and fresh Mediterranean salad.","Short hike on the Lycian Way and coastal views from the walls of Aperlai.","Snorkel over sunken harbours and buildings; the story of the ancient purple-dye industry.","Kayak sailing with small sails, weather permitting.","Free time in Üçağız and return to Kaş; arrival 17:00–17:30."],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Cet itinéraire vous fait découvrir deux cités englouties en une journée et s''adresse aux pagayeurs de niveau intermédiaire à avancé : environ 15 km de pagaie et 1,5 km de marche. Vous passez au-dessus de la cité engloutie de Kekova, pagayez jusqu''à la cité antique d''Aperlai, marchez un peu sur le chemin lycien et faites du snorkeling sur les vestiges du port englouti.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["La baie de Kekova et ses îles","La cité antique d''Aperlai","Kayak de mer et courte randonnée","Itinéraire à la journée"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Itinéraire","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → baie et îles de Kekova → Polemos → Sıçak → Aperlai","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["07h30 rendez-vous au Tombeau du Roi à Kaş ; transfert possible sur la péninsule de Kaş, transfert depuis Kalkan +10 €.","Environ 40 minutes de route jusqu''à Üçağız ; équipement complet et briefing sécurité détaillé.","Pagayage vers Simena, le long de la célèbre tombe lycienne à demi immergée et au-dessus de la cité engloutie ; pause baignade dans la baie de Tersane.","Déjeuner chez un pêcheur : poisson grillé, pommes de terre et salade méditerranéenne.","Courte randonnée sur le chemin lycien et vue sur la côte depuis les remparts d''Aperlai.","Snorkeling au-dessus des ports et bâtiments engloutis ; l''histoire de l''industrie antique de la pourpre.","Voile en kayak avec de petites voiles, si la météo le permet.","Temps libre à Üçağız et retour à Kaş ; arrivée 17h00–17h30."],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"İki batık şehri tek günde gören bu rota orta ve ileri seviye kürekçiler içindir: yaklaşık 15 km kürek ve 1,5 km yürüyüş. Kekova Batık Şehri''nin üzerinden geçip antik Aperlai kentine kadar kürek çeker, Likya Yolu''nda kısa bir yürüyüş yapar ve batık liman kalıntılarında şnorkel yaparsınız.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["Kekova Boğazı ve adaları","Aperlai antik kenti","Deniz kayağı ve kısa yürüyüş","Tam gün rota"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Rota","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → Kekova Boğazı ve adaları → Polemos → Sıçak → Aperlai","type":"p"},{"text":"Tur programı","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 Kaş Kral Mezarı''nda buluşma; Kaş Yarımadası''nda transfer mevcut, Kalkan transferi +10 €.","Üçağız''a yaklaşık 40 dakikalık yolculuk; tam ekipman ve detaylı güvenlik brifingi.","Simena''ya doğru kürek, yarı batık ikonik Likya mezarı ve Kekova Batık Şehri; Tersane Koyu''nda yüzme molası.","Bir balıkçı evinde öğle yemeği: ızgara balık, patates ve taze Akdeniz salatası.","Likya Yolu''nda kısa yürüyüş ve Aperlai surlarından kıyı manzarası.","Batık limanlar ve yapılar üzerinde şnorkel; antik mor boya endüstrisinin hikâyesi.","Hava uygunsa küçük yelkenlerle kayak yelkeni.","Üçağız''da serbest zaman ve Kaş''a dönüş; varış 17:00–17:30."],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","conditions":{"de":["Transfer ab Kalkan +10 €"],"en":["Transfer from Kalkan +€10"],"fr":["Transfert depuis Kalkan +10 €"],"tr":["Transfer Kalkan''dan +10 €"]},"cover":"kayak-kekova-west-1","duration":{"de":"Tagestour · 07:30 – 16:30/17:00","en":"Day tour · 07:30 – 16:30/17:00","fr":"À la journée · 07h30 – 16h30/17h00","tr":"Günübirlik · 07:30 – 16:30/17:00"},"faq":[{"answer":{"de":"Es ist eine ganztägige Route für fortgeschrittene Paddler mit etwa 15 km Paddeln und 1,5 km Fußweg.","en":"It is a full-day route designed for intermediate and advanced paddlers, with about 15 km of paddling and a 1.5 km walk.","fr":"C''est un itinéraire à la journée conçu pour les pagayeurs intermédiaires et avancés, avec environ 15 km de pagaie et 1,5 km de marche.","tr":"Orta ve ileri seviye kürekçiler için tasarlanmış tam gün bir rotadır; yaklaşık 15 km kürek ve 1,5 km yürüyüş içerir."},"question":{"de":"Für wen ist diese Tour geeignet?","en":"Who is this tour for?","fr":"À qui s''adresse cette sortie ?","tr":"Bu tur kimler için uygun?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Ja. Ein hausgemachtes Mittagessen mit gegrilltem Fisch, Kartoffeln und Mittelmeersalat in einem Fischerhaus in Aperlai ist inbegriffen.","en":"Yes. A home-cooked lunch of grilled fish, potatoes and fresh Mediterranean salad at a fisherman''s house in Aperlai is included.","fr":"Oui. Un déjeuner fait maison chez un pêcheur à Aperlai (poisson grillé, pommes de terre et salade méditerranéenne) est inclus.","tr":"Evet. Aperlai''de bir balıkçı evinde ızgara balık, patates ve taze Akdeniz salatasından oluşan ev yemeği fiyata dahildir."},"question":{"de":"Ist das Mittagessen inbegriffen?","en":"Is lunch included?","fr":"Le déjeuner est-il inclus ?","tr":"Öğle yemeği fiyata dahil mi?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Ja, ein Transfer ab Kalkan ist gegen 10 € Aufpreis möglich. Auch auf der Halbinsel Kaş wird abgeholt.","en":"Yes, a transfer from Kalkan can be arranged for an extra €10. Pick-up is also available on the Kaş Peninsula.","fr":"Oui, un transfert depuis Kalkan peut être organisé avec un supplément de 10 €. Un transfert est aussi possible sur la péninsule de Kaş.","tr":"Evet, Kalkan transferi 10 € ek ücretle ayarlanabilir. Kaş Yarımadası''nda konaklayanlar için transfer de mevcuttur."},"question":{"de":"Kann ich von Kalkan aus teilnehmen?","en":"Can I join from Kalkan?","fr":"Puis-je partir de Kalkan ?","tr":"Kalkan''dan katılabilir miyim?"}}],"featured":false,"gallery":["kayak-kekova-west-2","kayak-aperlai-1","kayak-aperlai-2","kayak-aperlai-3","kayak-aperlai-4"],"healthForm":null,"id":"kekova-bati","includes":{"de":["Vom Kanuverband lizenzierter Guide","Kajak und komplette Ausrüstung","Maske und Schnorchel","Wasserdichter Packsack","Hin- und Rücktransfer ab Kaş","Mittagessen im Restaurant","Snacks"],"en":["Guide licensed by the canoe federation","Kayak and all equipment","Mask and snorkel","Dry bag","Return transfer from Kaş","Restaurant lunch","Snacks"],"fr":["Guide diplômé de la fédération de canoë-kayak","Kayak et tout l''équipement","Masque et tuba","Sac étanche","Transfert aller-retour depuis Kaş","Déjeuner au restaurant","Collations"],"tr":["Kayak federasyonu lisanslı rehber","Kayak ve tüm ekipman","Maske ve şnorkel","Kuru çanta (dry bag)","Kaş''tan gidiş-dönüş transfer","Restoranda öğle yemeği","Atıştırmalıklar"]},"itinerary":[],"meetingPoint":{"de":"Königsgrab, Kaş, 07:30","en":"King''s Tomb, Kaş, 07:30","fr":"Tombeau du Roi, Kaş, 07h30","tr":"Kaş Kral Mezarı, 07:30"},"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kisi-basi","name":{"de":"Pro Person","en":"Per person","fr":"Par personne","tr":"Kişi başı"},"price":80}],"order":2,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Zwei versunkene Städte an einem Tag für Fortgeschrittene: rund 15 km von Kekova nach Aperlai, 1,5 km auf dem Lykischen Weg und Schnorcheln am alten Hafen.","en":"Two sunken cities in one day for intermediate and advanced paddlers: 15 km from Kekova to Aperlai, a 1.5 km Lycian Way hike and snorkelling over the harbour.","fr":"Deux cités englouties en un jour pour pagayeurs intermédiaires et confirmés : 15 km de Kekova à Aperlai, 1,5 km sur la voie lycienne et snorkeling sur le port.","tr":"Orta ve ileri seviye için tam gün: Kekova ve Aperlai''nin iki batık şehri, yaklaşık 15 km kürek, Likya Yolu''nda 1,5 km yürüyüş ve batık liman üzerinde şnorkel."},"title":{"de":"Kekova West: Seekajak-Tagestour nach Aperlai","en":"Kekova West: Full-Day Sea Kayak to Aperlai","fr":"Kekova Ouest : kayak de mer jusqu''à Aperlai","tr":"Kekova Batı: Kekova ve Aperlai Deniz Kayağı"}},"slug":{"de":"kekova-west","en":"kekova-west","fr":"kekova-ouest","tr":"kekova-bati"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-gunluk","summary":{"de":"Ein ganztägiges Seekajak-Abenteuer nach Kekova und Aperlai!","en":"A full-day sea kayaking adventure to Kekova and Aperlai!","fr":"Une journée complète en kayak de mer entre Kekova et Aperlai !","tr":"Kekova & Aperlai tam gün deniz kayağı macerası!"},"title":{"de":"Kekova West","en":"Kekova West","fr":"Kekova Ouest","tr":"Kekova Batı"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Eine ganztägige Route, auf der Sie über versunkene Ruinen paddeln, in abgelegenen Buchten schwimmen, Tiere beobachten und an einer Meereshöhle vorbeifahren. Sie umfasst etwa 17 km und richtet sich an fortgeschrittene Paddler oder Teilnehmende mit guter Kondition für einen langen Paddeltag.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Theimussa und Simena","Die versunkene Stadt","Die Bucht Hamidiye","Die Piratenhöhle der Insel Aşırlı","Der Bach von Andriake","Meeresschildkröten beobachten","Ziel im Hafen von Andriake"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Route","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız → Simena → Versunkene Stadt → Bucht Hamidiye → Insel Aşırlı → Çayağzı (Andriake)","type":"p"},{"text":"Programm","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 Treffpunkt am Königsgrab in Kaş; Abholung auf der Halbinsel Kaş möglich, Transfer ab Kalkan +10 €.","Etwa 40 Minuten Fahrt nach Üçağız; Ausrüstung, Einweisung und Start mit Blick auf die Nekropole von Üçağız.","Direkt über die versunkene Stadt Kekova paddeln: Treppen, Mauern und Hafenreste unter Wasser.","Bade- und Schnorchelpausen in versteckten Buchten; Wildziegen an den Felsen.","Picknick am Strand mit Sandwiches, Obst und lokalen Snacks.","Vorbei an der Meereshöhle bei der Insel Aşırlı, einst Heimat der Mittelmeer-Mönchsrobben.","Dem Bach von Andriake folgen, einem geschützten Nistgebiet, und Meeresschildkröten beobachten.","Ziel im Hafen von Andriake bei Demre (Myra) und Rückfahrt nach Kaş; Ankunft gegen 17:00–17:30."],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"A full-day route where you paddle over sunken ruins, swim in secluded bays, watch wildlife and pass by a sea cave. It covers about 17 km and is meant for intermediate and advanced paddlers, or participants fit enough for a long day of paddling.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["Theimussa and Simena","The Sunken City","Hamidiye Bay","The pirate cave on Aşırlı Island","The Andriake stream","Sea turtle watching","Finish at Andriake harbour"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Route","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız → Simena → Sunken City → Hamidiye Bay → Aşırlı Island → Çayağzı (Andriake)","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 meeting at the King''s Tomb in Kaş; pick-up can be arranged on the Kaş Peninsula, Kalkan transfer +€10.","About 40 minutes'' drive to Üçağız; equipment, briefing and launch with a view of the Üçağız necropolis.","Paddle straight over the Kekova Sunken City: stairs, walls and harbour remains under the water.","Swimming and snorkelling breaks in hidden bays; wild goats on the cliffs.","Picnic lunch on the shore with sandwiches, fruit and local snacks.","Pass by the sea cave near Aşırlı Island, once home to Mediterranean monk seals.","Follow the Andriake stream, a protected turtle nesting area, to watch sea turtles.","Finish at Andriake harbour near Demre (Myra) and return to Kaş; arrival around 17:00–17:30."],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Une journée complète où vous pagayez au-dessus de ruines englouties, vous baignez dans des baies isolées, observez la faune et longez une grotte marine. Environ 17 km de pagaie, pour des pagayeurs intermédiaires et avancés ou des participants en bonne condition physique pour une longue journée sur l''eau.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["Theimussa et Simena","La cité engloutie","La baie d''Hamidiye","La grotte des pirates de l''île d''Aşırlı","Le ruisseau d''Andriake","Observation des tortues marines","Arrivée au port d''Andriake"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Itinéraire","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız → Simena → cité engloutie → baie d''Hamidiye → île d''Aşırlı → Çayağzı (Andriake)","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["07h30 rendez-vous au Tombeau du Roi à Kaş ; transfert possible sur la péninsule de Kaş, transfert depuis Kalkan +10 €.","Environ 40 minutes de route jusqu''à Üçağız ; équipement, briefing et mise à l''eau face à la nécropole d''Üçağız.","Pagayage directement au-dessus de la cité engloutie : escaliers, murs et vestiges du port sous l''eau.","Pauses baignade et snorkeling dans des baies cachées ; chèvres sauvages sur les falaises.","Déjeuner pique-nique sur la plage : sandwich, fruits et en-cas locaux.","Passage devant la grotte marine près de l''île d''Aşırlı, autrefois habitée par des phoques moines.","Remontée du ruisseau d''Andriake, zone protégée de ponte, pour observer les tortues marines.","Arrivée au port d''Andriake près de Demre (Myra) et retour à Kaş vers 17h00–17h30."],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Batık kalıntıların üzerinden kürek çekip tenha koylarda yüzdüğünüz, yaban hayatını gözlediğiniz ve bir deniz mağarasının yanından geçtiğiniz tam günlük bir rota. Yaklaşık 17 km kürek içerir; orta ve ileri seviye kürekçiler ya da uzun süre kürek çekebilecek kondisyondaki katılımcılar içindir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["Theimussa ve Simena","Batık Şehir","Hamidiye Koyu","Aşırlı Adası korsan mağarası","Andriake deresi","Deniz kaplumbağası gözlemi","Andriake limanında bitiş"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Rota","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız → Simena → Batık Şehir → Hamidiye Koyu → Aşırlı Adası → Çayağzı (Andriake)","type":"p"},{"text":"Tur programı","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 Kaş Kral Mezarı''nda buluşma; Kaş Yarımadası''nda transfer ayarlanabilir, Kalkan transferi +10 €.","Üçağız''a yaklaşık 40 dakikalık yolculuk; donanım, brifing ve Üçağız nekropolü manzarasıyla suya iniş.","Doğrudan Kekova Batık Şehri''nin üzerinden kürek; su altındaki merdivenler, duvarlar ve liman kalıntıları.","Saklı koylarda yüzme ve şnorkel molaları; kayalıklarda yaban keçileri.","Sahilde sandviç, meyve ve yerel atıştırmalıklarla piknik öğle yemeği.","Aşırlı Adası yakınında, bir zamanlar Akdeniz foklarının yaşadığı deniz mağarasının yanından geçiş.","Korunan bir kaplumbağa yuvalama alanı olan Andriake deresini takip ederek kaplumbağa gözlemi.","Demre (Myra) yakınındaki Andriake limanında bitiş ve Kaş''a dönüş; varış 17:00–17:30 civarı."],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","conditions":{"de":["Transfer ab Kalkan +10 €"],"en":["Transfer from Kalkan +€10"],"fr":["Transfert depuis Kalkan +10 €"],"tr":["Transfer Kalkan''dan +10 €"]},"cover":"kayak-kekova-east-1","duration":{"de":"Tagestour · 07:30 – 17:00/17:30","en":"Day tour · 07:30 – 17:00/17:30","fr":"À la journée · 07h30 – 17h00/17h30","tr":"Günübirlik · 07:30 – 17:00/17:30"},"faq":[{"answer":{"de":"Abfahrt in Kaş um 07:30, Rückkehr gegen 17:00–17:30. Im Laufe des Tages paddeln Sie etwa 17 km.","en":"We leave Kaş at 07:30 and are back around 17:00–17:30. You paddle about 17 km during the day.","fr":"Départ de Kaş à 07h30, retour vers 17h00–17h30. Vous pagayez environ 17 km dans la journée.","tr":"07:30''da Kaş''tan çıkılır, 17:00–17:30 civarında dönülür. Gün boyunca yaklaşık 17 km kürek çekilir."},"question":{"de":"Wie lange dauert die Tour und wie weit wird gepaddelt?","en":"How long is the tour and how far do we paddle?","fr":"Quelle est la durée de la sortie et la distance pagayée ?","tr":"Tur ne kadar sürüyor ve ne kadar kürek çekiliyor?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Im Hafen von Andriake bei Demre (Myra). Von dort sind es etwa 40 Minuten Fahrt zurück nach Kaş.","en":"At Andriake harbour near Demre (Myra). From there it is a drive of about 40 minutes back to Kaş.","fr":"Au port d''Andriake, près de Demre (Myra). Le retour à Kaş se fait ensuite en 40 minutes de route environ.","tr":"Demre (Myra) yakınındaki Andriake limanında. Buradan Kaş''a yaklaşık 40 dakikalık bir sürüşle dönülür."},"question":{"de":"Wo endet die Tour?","en":"Where does the tour finish?","fr":"Où se termine la sortie ?","tr":"Tur nerede bitiyor?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Mittags gibt es ein Picknick am Strand mit Sandwiches, Obst und lokalen Snacks; das Lunchpaket ist inbegriffen.","en":"Lunch is a picnic on the shore with sandwiches, fruit and local snacks; the lunch box is included.","fr":"Le déjeuner est un pique-nique sur la plage avec sandwich, fruits et en-cas locaux ; le panier-repas est inclus.","tr":"Sahilde sandviç, meyve ve yerel atıştırmalıklardan oluşan bir piknik öğle yemeği yapılır; öğle yemeği kutusu fiyata dahildir."},"question":{"de":"Wie sieht das Mittagessen aus?","en":"What about lunch?","fr":"Comment se passe le déjeuner ?","tr":"Öğle yemeği nasıl?"}}],"featured":false,"gallery":["kayak-kekova-east-2","kayak-kekova-east-3","kayak-kekova-east-4","kayak-kekova-east-5"],"healthForm":null,"id":"kekova-dogu","includes":{"de":["Vom Kanuverband lizenzierter Guide","Kajak und komplette Ausrüstung","Maske und Schnorchel","Wasserdichter Packsack","Hin- und Rücktransfer ab Kaş","Lunchpaket","Snacks"],"en":["Guide licensed by the canoe federation","Kayak and all equipment","Mask and snorkel","Dry bag","Return transfer from Kaş","Lunch box","Snacks"],"fr":["Guide diplômé de la fédération de canoë-kayak","Kayak et tout l''équipement","Masque et tuba","Sac étanche","Transfert aller-retour depuis Kaş","Panier-repas","Collations"],"tr":["Kayak federasyonu lisanslı rehber","Kayak ve tüm ekipman","Maske ve şnorkel","Kuru çanta (dry bag)","Kaş''tan gidiş-dönüş transfer","Öğle yemeği kutusu","Atıştırmalıklar"]},"itinerary":[],"meetingPoint":{"de":"Königsgrab, Kaş, 07:30","en":"King''s Tomb, Kaş, 07:30","fr":"Tombeau du Roi, Kaş, 07h30","tr":"Kaş Kral Mezarı, 07:30"},"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kisi-basi","name":{"de":"Pro Person","en":"Per person","fr":"Par personne","tr":"Kişi başı"},"price":80}],"order":3,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Ein Tag mit rund 17 km für Fortgeschrittene: Simena, die versunkene Stadt, die Bucht Hamidiye, die Piratenhöhle auf Aşırlı und Meeresschildkröten bei Andriake.","en":"A full day of 17 km for intermediate and advanced paddlers: Simena, the Sunken City, Hamidiye Bay, the pirate cave on Aşırlı Island and turtles at Andriake.","fr":"Journée de 17 km pour pagayeurs intermédiaires et confirmés : Simena, la cité engloutie, la baie d''Hamidiye, la grotte des pirates et les tortues d''Andriake.","tr":"Orta ve ileri seviye için yaklaşık 17 km''lik tam gün: Simena, Batık Şehir, Hamidiye Koyu, Aşırlı Adası''nda korsan mağarası ve Andriake''de kaplumbağalar."},"title":{"de":"Kekova Ost: Seekajak von Kekova nach Andriake","en":"Kekova East: Sea Kayak from Kekova to Andriake","fr":"Kekova Est : kayak de mer de Kekova à Andriake","tr":"Kekova Doğu: Batık Şehir''den Andriake''ye Kayak"}},"slug":{"de":"kekova-ost","en":"kekova-east","fr":"kekova-est","tr":"kekova-dogu"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-gunluk","summary":{"de":"Ein ganztägiges Seekajak- und Schnorchelabenteuer zwischen Kekova, Çayağzı und Demre!","en":"A full-day sea kayaking and snorkelling adventure between Kekova, Çayağzı and Demre!","fr":"Une journée complète de kayak de mer et de snorkeling entre Kekova, Çayağzı et Demre !","tr":"Kekova, Çayağzı ve Demre arasında tam gün deniz kayağı ve şnorkel macerası!"},"title":{"de":"Kekova Ost","en":"Kekova East","fr":"Kekova Est","tr":"Kekova Doğu"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Erleben Sie eine der großartigsten Küsten des Mittelmeers auf einer Reise, die das Seekajakfahren mit dem Komfort einer traditionellen türkischen Gulet verbindet. Diese mehrtägige Expedition ist für alle gedacht, die Abenteuer lieben, ohne auf Komfort verzichten zu wollen. Sie führt zu den versteckten Buchten, den antiken lykischen Städten und dem klaren Wasser von Kekova, einem der geschützten Küstengebiete der Türkei.","type":"p"},{"text":"Jeder Tag beginnt an Bord unserer handgefertigten Gulet; danach brechen Sie mit dem Seekajak auf, um einsame Strände, steile Klippen, verborgene Höhlen und die versunkene Stadt Kekova zu entdecken. Unterwegs paddeln Sie auf ruhigem, türkisfarbenem Wasser, besuchen antike Siedlungen wie Aperlai und Simena, legen Badepausen ein und erfahren viel über die reiche Geschichte und die natürliche Schönheit dieser Küste.","type":"p"},{"text":"Nach einem Tag auf dem Wasser kehren Sie auf das Boot zurück, wo frisch zubereitete, hausgemachte türkische Gerichte unserer Gulet-Crew auf Sie warten. Verbringen Sie die Abende beim Schwimmen, beim Betrachten des Sonnenuntergangs, im Gespräch mit Ihren Mitreisenden oder entspannt an Deck unter einem sternenklaren Himmel.","type":"p"},{"text":"Unsere erfahrenen Guides passen die Route jedes Tages an Wetter und Seegang an, damit die Reise sicher und zugleich angenehm bleibt. Diese Flexibilität erlaubt es uns, das Beste aus der Küste herauszuholen, und schafft ein authentisches Entdeckungserlebnis in enger Verbindung mit der Natur.","type":"p"},{"text":"Ob Sie bereits erfahren im Paddeln sind oder zu Ihrem ersten mehrtägigen Seekajak-Abenteuer aufbrechen: Diese Reise bietet ein ausgewogenes Verhältnis von Entdeckung, Komfort, Kultur und türkischer Gastfreundschaft.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Übernachtung auf einer traditionellen türkischen Gulet","Seekajakfahren an der versunkenen Stadt Kekova","Die antiken Städte Aperlai und Simena","Versteckte Buchten, Höhlen und einsame Strände","Frische hausgemachte türkische Küche an Bord","Sonnenuntergänge und Sternennächte an Deck"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Führung und Sicherheit","type":"h2"},{"items":["Ausgebildete, vom Türkischen Kanuverband lizenzierte Tourleiter erzählen Ihnen von Geschichte, Geografie und Kultur der Region.","Route, Wetter und Seegang werden vor jeder Tour geprüft; Ausrüstung und Abläufe werden nach festgelegten Standards vorbereitet.","Kleine Gruppen und bei Bedarf zusätzliche Sicherheitsmaßnahmen, damit sich die Guides um jede einzelne Person kümmern können."],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Schwierigkeitsgrad","type":"h2"},{"text":"Unsere mehrtägigen Kajaktouren entsprechen der Klasse 2: Touren in Gebieten mit wenigen Siedlungen, mit Strömungen von höchstens 2 Knoten, Überfahrten auf offenem Wasser von höchstens 5 Seemeilen, geringem Seegang, geschützten Buchten und sicheren Anlandestränden etwa jede Seemeile und einer täglichen Paddelzeit von unter 6 Stunden.","type":"p"},{"text":"Programm","type":"h2"},{"text":"Das ausführliche Tagesprogramm wird in Kürze ergänzt.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Experience one of the most magnificent coastlines of the Mediterranean on a journey that combines sea kayaking with the comfort of a traditional Turkish gulet. Designed for those who love adventure without giving up comfort, this multi-day expedition explores the hidden coves, ancient Lycian cities and clear waters of Kekova, one of Turkey''s protected coastal areas.","type":"p"},{"text":"Every day starts on our handcrafted gulet; then you set off by sea kayak to discover secluded beaches, steep cliffs, hidden caves and the Kekova Sunken City. Along the way you paddle on calm turquoise water, visit ancient settlements such as Aperlai and Simena, stop for swims and learn about the rich history and natural beauty of this coast.","type":"p"},{"text":"After a day on the water you return to the boat, where fresh home-made Turkish dishes prepared by our gulet crew are waiting. Spend your evenings swimming, watching the sunset, chatting with your travel companions or resting on deck under a starry sky.","type":"p"},{"text":"Our experienced guides adapt each day''s route to the weather and sea conditions so that the journey is both safe and enjoyable. This flexibility lets us make the most of the coast and creates an authentic exploration closely connected with nature.","type":"p"},{"text":"Whether you are an experienced paddler or setting out on your first multi-day sea kayaking adventure, this trip offers a balance of exploration, comfort, culture and Turkish hospitality.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["Accommodation on a traditional Turkish gulet","Sea kayaking at the Kekova Sunken City","The ancient cities of Aperlai and Simena","Hidden coves, caves and secluded beaches","Fresh home-made Turkish food on board","Sunsets and starry nights on deck"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Guiding and safety","type":"h2"},{"items":["Trained tour leaders licensed by the Turkish Canoe Federation share the history, geography and culture of the area.","Route, weather and sea conditions are assessed before every tour; equipment and procedures are prepared to set standards.","Small groups, with extra safety measures when needed, so that every participant gets close attention."],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Difficulty grade","type":"h2"},{"text":"Our multi-day kayak tours are Class 2: trips where settlements are sparse, currents do not exceed 2 knots, open-water crossings do not exceed 5 nautical miles, swell is low, there are sheltered coves and safe landing beaches every mile, and daily paddling time is under 6 hours.","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"text":"The detailed day-by-day programme will be added soon.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Découvrez l''un des plus beaux littoraux de la Méditerranée lors d''un voyage qui associe le kayak de mer au confort d''une goélette turque traditionnelle (gulet). Conçue pour ceux qui aiment l''aventure sans renoncer au confort, cette expédition de plusieurs jours explore les criques cachées, les cités lyciennes antiques et les eaux limpides de Kekova, l''une des zones côtières protégées de Turquie.","type":"p"},{"text":"Chaque journée commence à bord de notre goélette construite à la main ; vous partez ensuite en kayak de mer à la découverte de plages isolées, de falaises abruptes, de grottes cachées et de la cité engloutie de Kekova. En chemin, vous pagayez sur une eau turquoise et calme, visitez des sites antiques comme Aperlai et Simena, faites des pauses baignade et découvrez l''histoire et la beauté naturelle de cette côte.","type":"p"},{"text":"Après une journée sur l''eau, vous retrouvez le bateau, où vous attendent des plats turcs faits maison préparés par l''équipage. Passez vos soirées à vous baigner, à regarder le coucher du soleil, à discuter avec vos compagnons de voyage ou à vous reposer sur le pont sous un ciel étoilé.","type":"p"},{"text":"Nos guides expérimentés adaptent l''itinéraire de chaque jour à la météo et à l''état de la mer pour que le voyage soit à la fois sûr et agréable. Cette souplesse nous permet de profiter au mieux de la côte et crée une expérience de découverte authentique, en lien étroit avec la nature.","type":"p"},{"text":"Que vous soyez un pagayeur expérimenté ou que vous partiez pour votre première aventure de plusieurs jours, ce voyage offre un équilibre entre découverte, confort, culture et hospitalité turque.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["Hébergement sur une goélette turque traditionnelle","Kayak de mer à la cité engloutie de Kekova","Les cités antiques d''Aperlai et de Simena","Criques cachées, grottes et plages isolées","Cuisine turque maison à bord","Couchers de soleil et nuits étoilées sur le pont"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Encadrement et sécurité","type":"h2"},{"items":["Des chefs de groupe formés et diplômés de la Fédération turque de canoë-kayak vous racontent l''histoire, la géographie et la culture de la région.","L''itinéraire, la météo et l''état de la mer sont évalués avant chaque sortie ; équipement et pratiques respectent des standards établis.","Petits groupes, avec des mesures de sécurité supplémentaires si nécessaire, pour une attention réelle à chaque participant."],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Niveau de difficulté","type":"h2"},{"text":"Nos circuits de kayak de plusieurs jours sont de classe 2 : peu de villages, courant inférieur à 2 nœuds, traversées en pleine mer de moins de 5 milles, peu de houle, criques abritées et plages de débarquement sûres tous les milles, et moins de 6 heures de pagaie par jour.","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"text":"Le programme détaillé jour par jour sera ajouté prochainement.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Akdeniz''in en görkemli kıyı şeritlerinden birini, deniz kayağını geleneksel bir Türk guletinin konforuyla birleştiren bir yolculukta deneyimleyin. Konfordan ödün vermeden macerayı sevenler için tasarlanan bu çok günlü keşif gezisi, Türkiye''nin korunan kıyı bölgelerinden biri olan Kekova''nın saklı koylarını, antik Likya kentlerini ve berrak sularını keşfeder.","type":"p"},{"text":"Her gün el yapımı guletimizde başlar; ardından tenha plajları, sarp kayalıkları, gizli mağaraları ve Kekova Batık Şehri''ni keşfetmek için deniz kayaklarıyla yola çıkarsınız. Yol boyunca sakin turkuaz sularda kürek çeker, Aperlai ve Simena gibi antik yerleşimleri ziyaret eder, yüzme molaları verir ve bu kıyının zengin tarihi ile doğal güzelliğini öğrenirsiniz.","type":"p"},{"text":"Suda geçen bir günün ardından, gulet ekibimizin taze hazırladığı ev yapımı Türk yemeklerinin sizi beklediği tekneye dönersiniz. Akşamlarınızı yüzerek, gün batımlarını izleyerek, yol arkadaşlarınızla sohbet ederek ya da yıldızlı gökyüzünün altında güvertede dinlenerek geçirin.","type":"p"},{"text":"Deneyimli rehberlerimiz her günün rotasını hava ve deniz koşullarına göre uyarlayarak yolculuğun hem güvenli hem keyifli olmasını sağlar. Bu esneklik, kıyıdan en iyi şekilde yararlanmamızı ve doğayla bağlı, otantik bir keşif deneyimi yaratmamızı sağlar.","type":"p"},{"text":"İster deneyimli bir kürekçi olun ister ilk çok günlü deniz kayağı maceranıza çıkıyor olun, bu gezi keşif, konfor, kültür ve Türk misafirperverliği arasında bir denge sunar.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["Geleneksel Türk guletinde konaklama","Kekova Batık Şehri''nde deniz kayağı","Antik Aperlai ve Simena kentleri","Saklı koylar, mağaralar ve tenha plajlar","Teknede taze ev yapımı Türk yemekleri","Güvertede gün batımları ve yıldızlı geceler"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Rehberlik ve güvenlik","type":"h2"},{"items":["Türkiye Kano Federasyonu lisanslı, eğitimli tur liderlerinden bölgenin tarihi, coğrafyası ve kültürü üzerine bilgiler.","Rota, hava ve deniz koşulları her tur öncesinde değerlendirilir; ekipman ve uygulamalar belirlenmiş standartlara göre hazırlanır.","Her katılımcıyla yakından ilgilenebilmek için küçük gruplar ve gerektiğinde ek güvenlik önlemleri."],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Zorluk derecesi","type":"h2"},{"text":"Çok günlü kano turlarımız Sınıf 2 zorluk derecesindedir: yerleşimlerin seyrek olduğu, akıntı hızının 2 mili geçmediği, açık deniz geçişlerinin 5 mili aşmadığı, dalgalanmanın az olduğu, her 1 milde kapalı koyların ve güvenli yanaşma plajlarının bulunduğu ve günlük kürek süresinin 6 saatten az olduğu geziler.","type":"p"},{"text":"Tur programı","type":"h2"},{"text":"Ayrıntılı günlük program yakında eklenecek.","type":"p"}]},"category":"seaKayak","cover":"kayak-kekova-gulet-1","duration":{"de":"7 Tage / 6 Nächte","en":"7 days / 6 nights","fr":"7 jours / 6 nuits","tr":"7 gün / 6 gece"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["kayak-simena-castle-1","kayak-group-1"],"healthForm":null,"id":"kekova-kayak-gulet","itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":3,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Sieben Tage auf einer traditionellen Gulet, täglich im Seekajak zu versteckten Buchten, zur versunkenen Stadt und zu lykischen Stätten wie Aperlai und Simena.","en":"Seven days on a traditional Turkish gulet, setting off daily by sea kayak to hidden coves, the Sunken City and Lycian sites such as Aperlai and Simena.","fr":"Sept jours sur un gulet turc traditionnel, et chaque jour en kayak de mer vers criques cachées, cité engloutie et sites lyciens comme Aperlai et Simena.","tr":"Geleneksel bir Türk guletinin konforunda 7 gün: her gün deniz kayağıyla saklı koylara, Batık Şehir''e, Aperlai ve Simena gibi antik Likya yerleşimlerine kürek."},"title":{"de":"Kekova mit Seekajak und Gulet: 7-tägige Reise","en":"Kekova by Sea Kayak and Gulet: a 7-Day Voyage","fr":"Kekova en kayak de mer et gulet : 7 jours","tr":"Kekova Deniz Kayağı ve Gulet Turu: 7 Gün"}},"slug":{"de":"kekova-kajak-und-gulet","en":"kekova-kayak-and-gulet","fr":"kekova-kayak-et-goelette","tr":"kekova-kayak-gulet"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-cok-gunlu","summary":{"de":"Eine Reise, die das Abenteuer Seekajak mit dem Komfort einer traditionellen türkischen Gulet verbindet.","en":"A journey that combines the adventure of sea kayaking with the comfort of a traditional Turkish gulet.","fr":"Un voyage qui associe l''aventure du kayak de mer au confort d''une goélette turque traditionnelle.","tr":"Deniz kayağının macerasını geleneksel bir Türk guletinin konforuyla birleştiren bir yolculuk."},"title":{"de":"Kekova: Seekajak- und Gulettour","en":"Kekova Sea Kayak & Gulet Tour","fr":"Kekova, kayak de mer et goélette","tr":"Kekova Deniz Kayağı & Gulet Turu"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Auf dieser einsteigerfreundlichen Route entdecken Sie die Insel Kekova, die Bucht Tersane, die Ruinen der versunkenen Stadt Kekova direkt unter der Wasserlinie und Simena (Kaleköy) mit seiner Burg auf dem Hügel. Die Paddelstrecke beträgt etwa 8 km.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Das Ufer der versunkenen Stadt","Badepause in der Bucht Tersane","Das Dorf Simena und der Blick von der Burg","Einsteigerfreundliche Route"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Route","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → Insel Kekova → Bucht Tersane → Versunkene Stadt → Simena","type":"p"},{"text":"Programm","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 Treffpunkt am Königsgrab in Kaş; auf der Halbinsel Kaş kann eine Abholung organisiert werden.","Etwa 40 Minuten Fahrt nach Üçağız mit einem kurzen Halt für Wasser und letzte Besorgungen.","Kajak, Schwimmweste, wasserdichter Packsack und Paddel; ausführliche Paddel- und Sicherheitseinweisung. Schnorchelausrüstung wird gestellt.","Paddeln an Inselchen mit römischen und lykischen Ruinen vorbei zur Bucht Tersane (etwa 30 Minuten) mit kurzer Snackpause.","Im Gänsemarsch entlang der versunkenen Stadt: halb versunkene Mauern, Treppen und der antike Hafen unter klarem Wasser.","Überfahrt nach Simena, das nur per Boot oder Kajak erreichbar ist; Mittagessen am Wasser (gegrillter Fisch, Köfte, gegrilltes Hähnchen oder eine vegetarische/vegane Option).","Etwa 1 Stunde freie Zeit in Simena: Burg, Steingassen, hausgemachtes Eis oder ein Bad.","Rückpaddeln nach Üçağız an in den Felsen versteckten lykischen Gräbern vorbei, danach 40 Minuten Fahrt nach Kaş."],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"On this beginner-friendly route you discover Kekova Island, Tersane Bay, the ruins of the Kekova Sunken City that begin just below the waterline, and Simena (Kaleköy) with its hilltop castle. The paddling distance is about 8 km.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["The shore of the Sunken City","Swim break in Tersane Bay","Simena village and the castle view","Beginner-friendly route"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Route","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → Kekova Island → Tersane Bay → Sunken City → Simena","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 meeting at the King''s Tomb in Kaş; pick-up can be arranged on the Kaş Peninsula.","About 40 minutes'' drive to Üçağız, with a short stop for water and last-minute needs.","Kayak, life jacket, dry bag and paddle; a detailed paddling and safety briefing. Snorkelling gear is provided.","Paddle past islets with Roman and Lycian ruins to Tersane Bay (about 30 minutes) and a short snack break.","Paddle single file along the Sunken City: half-submerged walls, stairs and the ancient harbour under clear water.","Cross to Simena, reachable only by boat or kayak; lunch by the sea (grilled fish, köfte, grilled chicken or a vegetarian/vegan option).","About 1 hour of free time in Simena: the castle, stone lanes, homemade ice cream or a swim.","Paddle back to Üçağız past Lycian tombs hidden in the rocks, then a 40-minute drive to Kaş."],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Sur cet itinéraire accessible aux débutants, vous découvrez l''île de Kekova, la baie de Tersane, les ruines de la cité engloutie de Kekova qui commencent juste sous la surface, et Simena (Kaleköy) avec son château perché. La distance pagayée est d''environ 8 km.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["Le rivage de la cité engloutie","Pause baignade dans la baie de Tersane","Le village de Simena et la vue depuis le château","Itinéraire adapté aux débutants"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Itinéraire","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → île de Kekova → baie de Tersane → cité engloutie → Simena","type":"p"},{"text":"Programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["07h30 rendez-vous au Tombeau du Roi à Kaş ; un transfert peut être organisé sur la péninsule de Kaş.","Environ 40 minutes de route jusqu''à Üçağız, avec un court arrêt pour l''eau et les derniers achats.","Kayak, gilet de sauvetage, sac étanche et pagaie ; briefing détaillé sur la pagaie et la sécurité. Le matériel de snorkeling est fourni.","Pagayage le long d''îlots aux ruines romaines et lyciennes jusqu''à la baie de Tersane (environ 30 minutes), courte pause collation.","Pagayage en file indienne le long de la cité engloutie : murs à demi immergés, escaliers et port antique sous une eau limpide.","Traversée vers Simena, accessible uniquement en bateau ou en kayak ; déjeuner au bord de l''eau (poisson grillé, köfte, poulet grillé ou option végétarienne/vegan).","Environ 1 heure de temps libre à Simena : château, ruelles en pierre, glace maison ou baignade.","Retour en kayak vers Üçağız le long de tombes lyciennes cachées dans les rochers, puis 40 minutes de route jusqu''à Kaş."],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Başlangıç dostu bu rotada Kekova Adası''nı, Tersane Koyu''nu, Kekova Batık Şehri''nin su seviyesinin hemen altında başlayan kalıntılarını ve tepesindeki kalesiyle Simena''yı (Kaleköy) keşfedersiniz. Kürek mesafesi yaklaşık 8 km''dir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["Batık Şehir kıyısı","Tersane Koyu''nda yüzme molası","Simena köyü ve kale manzarası","Başlangıç dostu rota"],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Rota","type":"h2"},{"text":"Üçağız (Theimussa) → Kekova Adası → Tersane Koyu → Batık Şehir → Simena","type":"p"},{"text":"Tur programı","type":"h2"},{"items":["07:30 Kaş Kral Mezarı''nda buluşma; Kaş Yarımadası''nda transfer ayarlanabilir.","Üçağız''a yaklaşık 40 dakikalık yolculuk, su ve son ihtiyaçlar için kısa bir mola.","Kayak, can yeleği, su geçirmez çanta ve kürek ile donanım; detaylı kürek ve güvenlik brifingi. Şnorkel ekipmanı sağlanır.","Roma ve Likya kalıntılı adacıkların yanından Tersane Koyu''na kürek (yaklaşık 30 dakika) ve atıştırmalıklı kısa mola.","Batık Şehir boyunca tek sıra kürek; berrak suyun altındaki yarı batık duvarlar, merdivenler ve antik liman.","Yalnızca tekne veya kayakla ulaşılan Simena''ya geçiş; deniz kenarında öğle yemeği (ızgara balık, köfte, ızgara tavuk veya vejetaryen/vegan seçenek).","Simena''da yaklaşık 1 saat serbest zaman: kale, taş sokaklar, ev yapımı dondurma ya da yüzme.","Kayalıklara gizlenmiş Likya mezarlarının yanından Üçağız''a dönüş küreği, ardından Kaş''a 40 dakikalık sürüş."],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","cover":"kayak-kekova-classic-1","duration":{"de":"Tagestour · 07:30 – 14:30/15:00","en":"Day tour · 07:30 – 14:30/15:00","fr":"À la journée · 07h30 – 14h30/15h00","tr":"Günübirlik · 07:30 – 14:30/15:00"},"faq":[{"answer":{"de":"Ja. Kekova Klassik ist eine einsteigerfreundliche Route; vor dem Start gibt es eine ausführliche Paddel- und Sicherheitseinweisung, und die Guides begleiten Sie während der gesamten Tour.","en":"Yes. Kekova Classic is a beginner-friendly route; a thorough paddling and safety briefing is given before you go on the water, and the guides are with you throughout the tour.","fr":"Oui. Kekova Classique est un itinéraire adapté aux débutants ; un briefing complet sur la pagaie et la sécurité est donné avant la mise à l''eau, et les guides vous accompagnent tout au long de la sortie.","tr":"Evet. Kekova Klasik başlangıç dostu bir rotadır; suya çıkmadan önce kapsamlı bir kürek ve güvenlik brifingi verilir ve rehberler tur boyunca yanınızdadır."},"question":{"de":"Kann ich ohne Kajakerfahrung teilnehmen?","en":"Can I join without any kayaking experience?","fr":"Puis-je participer sans expérience du kayak ?","tr":"Daha önce kano deneyimim olmadan katılabilir miyim?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Nein. Die versunkene Stadt ist geschützt, Schwimmen ist dort verboten; Sie betrachten die Ruinen vom Kajak aus. Badepausen gibt es in der Bucht Tersane und in Simena.","en":"No. The Sunken City is a protected area where swimming is not allowed; you view the ruins from your kayak. Swim breaks are taken in Tersane Bay and in Simena.","fr":"Non. La cité engloutie est une zone protégée où la baignade est interdite ; vous observez les ruines depuis votre kayak. Les pauses baignade ont lieu dans la baie de Tersane et à Simena.","tr":"Hayır. Batık Şehir koruma altındadır ve burada yüzmek yasaktır; kalıntıları kanonuzdan izlersiniz. Yüzme molaları Tersane Koyu''nda ve Simena''da verilir."},"question":{"de":"Darf man über der versunkenen Stadt schwimmen?","en":"Can we swim over the Sunken City?","fr":"Peut-on se baigner au-dessus de la cité engloutie ?","tr":"Batık Şehir''in üzerinde yüzebilir miyiz?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Treffpunkt ist um 07:30 am Königsgrab in Kaş. Wer auf der Halbinsel Kaş wohnt, kann abgeholt werden. Zurück in Kaş sind wir gegen 14:30–15:00.","en":"We meet at 07:30 at the King''s Tomb in Kaş. If you are staying on the Kaş Peninsula, a pick-up can be arranged. We are back in Kaş around 14:30–15:00.","fr":"Rendez-vous à 07h30 au Tombeau du Roi à Kaş. Si vous logez sur la péninsule de Kaş, un transfert peut être organisé. Retour à Kaş vers 14h30–15h00.","tr":"Saat 07:30''da Kaş Kral Mezarı''nda buluşuyoruz. Kaş Yarımadası''nda konaklıyorsanız transfer ayarlanabilir. Kaş''a dönüş 14:30–15:00 civarındadır."},"question":{"de":"Wo und wann ist der Treffpunkt?","en":"Where and when do we meet?","fr":"Où et à quelle heure est le rendez-vous ?","tr":"Buluşma nerede ve saat kaçta?"}}],"featured":true,"gallery":["kayak-kekova-classic-2","kayak-kekova-classic-3","kayak-simena-castle-1","kayak-group-1"],"healthForm":null,"id":"kekova-klasik","includes":{"de":["Vom Kanuverband lizenzierter Guide","Kajak und komplette Ausrüstung","Maske und Schnorchel","Wasserdichter Packsack","Hin- und Rücktransfer ab Kaş","Mittagessen im Restaurant (bei der Option mit Mittagessen)","Snacks"],"en":["Guide licensed by the canoe federation","Kayak and all equipment","Mask and snorkel","Dry bag","Return transfer from Kaş","Restaurant lunch (with the lunch option)","Snacks"],"fr":["Guide diplômé de la fédération de canoë-kayak","Kayak et tout l''équipement","Masque et tuba","Sac étanche","Transfert aller-retour depuis Kaş","Déjeuner au restaurant (avec l''option déjeuner)","Collations"],"tr":["Kayak federasyonu lisanslı rehber","Kayak ve tüm ekipman","Maske ve şnorkel","Kuru çanta (dry bag)","Kaş''tan gidiş-dönüş transfer","Restoranda öğle yemeği (yemekli seçenekte)","Atıştırmalıklar"]},"itinerary":[],"meetingPoint":{"de":"Königsgrab, Kaş, 07:30","en":"King''s Tomb, Kaş, 07:30","fr":"Tombeau du Roi, Kaş, 07h30","tr":"Kaş Kral Mezarı, 07:30"},"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"yemekli","name":{"de":"Mit Mittagessen","en":"With lunch","fr":"Déjeuner inclus","tr":"Öğle yemeği dahil"},"price":60},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"yemeksiz","name":{"de":"Ohne Mittagessen","en":"Without lunch","fr":"Sans déjeuner","tr":"Öğle yemeği hariç"},"price":45}],"order":1,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Einsteigerfreundliche Seekajak-Tagestour ab Üçağız zur Insel Kekova, Bucht Tersane, versunkenen Stadt und nach Simena: rund 8 km, Start in Kaş um 7:30 Uhr.","en":"A beginner-friendly day of sea kayaking from Üçağız to Kekova Island, Tersane Bay, the Sunken City and Simena: about 8 km of paddling, leaving Kaş at 07:30.","fr":"Journée de kayak de mer pour débutants : d''Üçağız à l''île de Kekova, la baie de Tersane, la cité engloutie et Simena, environ 8 km, départ de Kaş à 7 h 30.","tr":"Yeni başlayanlara uygun günübirlik rota: Üçağız''dan Kekova Adası, Tersane Koyu, Batık Şehir ve Simena''ya yaklaşık 8 km kürek; Kaş''tan sabah 07:30''da hareket."},"title":{"de":"Kekova Klassik: Seekajak zur versunkenen Stadt","en":"Kekova Classic: Sunken City Sea Kayak Day Trip","fr":"Kekova Classique : kayak de mer et cité engloutie","tr":"Kekova Klasik: Batık Şehir''e Deniz Kayağı Turu"}},"slug":{"de":"kekova-klassik","en":"kekova-classic","fr":"kekova-classique","tr":"kekova-klasik"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-gunluk","summary":{"de":"Entdecken Sie die einzigartige Schönheit von Kekova auf diesem unvergesslichen Seekajak-Abenteuer!","en":"Discover the unique beauty of Kekova on this unforgettable sea kayaking adventure!","fr":"Découvrez la beauté unique de Kekova lors de cette aventure inoubliable en kayak de mer !","tr":"Kekova''nın eşsiz güzelliğini bu unutulmaz deniz kayağı macerasında keşfedin!"},"title":{"de":"Kekova Klassik","en":"Kekova Classic","fr":"Kekova Classique","tr":"Kekova Klasik"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Eine zweitägige Seekajakreise durch die Gebiete Kekova und Aperlai. Paddeln Sie über versunkene Ruinen, schnorcheln Sie in klarem Wasser, setzen Sie bei passendem Wetter Segel und beobachten Sie Tiere in ihrem natürlichen Lebensraum. Mit einer Übernachtung in einem Küstendorf richtet sich diese Tour an fortgeschrittene Paddler.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Paddeln über der versunkenen Stadt Kekova","Schwimmen und Schnorcheln in der Bucht Tersane","Die antike Stadt Aperlai und der Lykische Weg","Hausmannskost in einem Fischerhaus","Schildkrötenbeobachtung am Bach von Andriake"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"A two-day sea kayaking journey through the Kekova and Aperlai areas. Paddle over sunken ruins, snorkel in clear water, sail your kayak if the weather allows and watch wildlife in its natural setting. With one night in a coastal village, this tour is designed for intermediate to advanced paddlers.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["Paddling over the Kekova Sunken City","Swimming and snorkelling in Tersane Bay","The ancient city of Aperlai and the Lycian Way","Home cooking at a fisherman''s house","Turtle watching on the Andriake stream"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Deux jours de kayak de mer dans les secteurs de Kekova et d''Aperlai. Pagayez au-dessus de ruines englouties, faites du snorkeling dans une eau limpide, hissez la voile si la météo le permet et observez la faune dans son milieu. Avec une nuit dans un village côtier, ce circuit s''adresse aux pagayeurs de niveau intermédiaire à avancé.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["Pagayer au-dessus de la cité engloutie de Kekova","Baignade et snorkeling dans la baie de Tersane","La cité antique d''Aperlai et le chemin lycien","Cuisine maison chez un pêcheur","Observation des tortues sur le ruisseau d''Andriake"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Kekova ve Aperlai bölgelerinde iki günlük bir deniz kayağı yolculuğu. Batık kalıntılar üzerinde kürek çekin, berrak sularda şnorkel yapın, hava uygunsa kayakla yelken açın ve yaban hayatını doğal ortamında gözlemleyin. Sahil köyünde bir gece konaklamalı bu tur orta-ileri seviye kürekçiler için tasarlandı.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["Kekova Batık Şehri üzerinde kürek","Tersane Koyu''nda yüzme ve şnorkel","Aperlai antik kenti ve Likya Yolu","Balıkçı evinde ev yemeği","Andriake deresinde kaplumbağa gözlemi"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","cover":"kayak-kekova-bay-1","duration":{"de":"2 Tage / 1 Nacht","en":"2 days / 1 night","fr":"2 jours / 1 nuit","tr":"2 gün / 1 gece"},"faq":[{"answer":{"de":"In einem Hotel im Dorf Simena (Kaleköy). Das Abendessen im Hotel am ersten Abend gehört zum Programm.","en":"At a hotel in the village of Simena (Kaleköy). Dinner at the hotel on the first evening is part of the programme.","fr":"Dans un hôtel du village de Simena (Kaleköy). Le dîner à l''hôtel le premier soir fait partie du programme.","tr":"Simena (Kaleköy) köyünde bir otelde. Programda ilk akşam otelde akşam yemeği yer alır."},"question":{"de":"Wo übernachten wir?","en":"Where do we stay overnight?","fr":"Où passe-t-on la nuit ?","tr":"Gece nerede konaklıyoruz?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Sie ist für fortgeschrittene Paddler konzipiert.","en":"It is designed for intermediate to advanced paddlers.","fr":"Il est conçu pour les pagayeurs de niveau intermédiaire à avancé.","tr":"Orta ve ileri seviye kürekçiler için tasarlanmıştır."},"question":{"de":"Für welches Niveau ist die Tour gedacht?","en":"What level is this tour for?","fr":"À quel niveau s''adresse ce circuit ?","tr":"Bu tur hangi seviyeye uygun?"}}],"featured":false,"gallery":["kayak-kekova-bay-2","kayak-kekova-bay-3"],"healthForm":null,"id":"kekova-korfezi","itinerary":[{"description":{"de":"Treffpunkt um 07:30 am Königsgrab in Kaş, Transfer nach Üçağız, dann Paddeln nach Simena und über die versunkene Stadt Kekova. Badepause in der Bucht Tersane, danach Hausmannskost in einem Fischerhaus in Aperlai und eine kurze Wanderung auf dem Lykischen Weg. Abendessen und Übernachtung im Hotel.","en":"Meet at 07:30 at the King''s Tomb in Kaş, transfer to Üçağız, then paddle to Simena and over the Kekova Sunken City. Swim break in Tersane Bay, then a home-cooked meal at a fisherman''s house in Aperlai and a short hike on the Lycian Way. Dinner and overnight at the hotel.","fr":"Rendez-vous à 07h30 au Tombeau du Roi à Kaş, transfert à Üçağız, puis pagayage vers Simena et au-dessus de la cité engloutie de Kekova. Pause baignade dans la baie de Tersane, repas fait maison chez un pêcheur à Aperlai et courte randonnée sur le chemin lycien. Dîner et nuit à l''hôtel.","tr":"07:30''da Kaş Kral Mezarı''nda buluşun, Üçağız''a transfer olun, ardından Simena''ya ve Kekova Batık Şehri üzerine kürek çekin. Tersane Koyu''nda yüzme molası, sonra Aperlai''de balıkçı evinde ev yemeği ve Likya Yolu''nda kısa yürüyüş. Otelde akşam yemeği ve konaklama."},"title":{"de":"Tag 1 — Kekova West","en":"Day 1 — Kekova West","fr":"Jour 1 — Kekova Ouest","tr":"Gün 1 — Kekova Batı"}},{"description":{"de":"Nach dem Frühstück direkt über die versunkene Stadt paddeln, in versteckten Buchten schwimmen und schnorcheln und ein Picknick genießen. Vorbei an der Meereshöhle, in der einst Mönchsrobben lebten, dem Bach von Andriake zu den Meeresschildkröten folgen und mit einem letzten Bad abschließen, bevor man auf einem nahen Campingplatz duschen kann.","en":"After breakfast, paddle straight over the Sunken City, swim and snorkel in hidden bays and enjoy a picnic lunch. Pass the sea cave once home to monk seals, follow the Andriake stream to see sea turtles and finish with a last swim before a shower at a nearby campsite.","fr":"Après le petit-déjeuner, pagayez directement au-dessus de la cité engloutie, baignez-vous et faites du snorkeling dans des baies cachées, puis pique-niquez. Passez devant la grotte marine autrefois habitée par les phoques moines, remontez le ruisseau d''Andriake pour voir les tortues marines et terminez par une dernière baignade avant une douche dans un camping voisin.","tr":"Kahvaltıdan sonra doğrudan Batık Şehir üzerinde kürek çekin, saklı koylarda yüzüp şnorkel yapın ve piknik öğle yemeğinin tadını çıkarın. Bir zamanlar fokların yaşadığı deniz mağarasının yanından geçin, Andriake deresini izleyerek deniz kaplumbağalarını görün ve yakındaki kamp alanında duş almadan önce son bir yüzmeyle bitirin."},"title":{"de":"Tag 2 — Kekova Ost","en":"Day 2 — Kekova East","fr":"Jour 2 — Kekova Est","tr":"Gün 2 — Kekova Doğu"}}],"options":[],"order":1,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Zwei Tage im Seekajak durch Kekova und Aperlai: versunkene Ruinen, Schnorcheln in der Bucht Tersane und eine Nacht im Dorf Simena. Für Fortgeschrittene.","en":"Two days of sea kayaking through Kekova and Aperlai: sunken ruins, snorkelling in Tersane Bay and a night in Simena. For intermediate to advanced paddlers.","fr":"Deux jours de kayak de mer entre Kekova et Aperlai : ruines englouties, snorkeling à Tersane et une nuit à Simena. Niveau intermédiaire à confirmé.","tr":"Kekova ve Aperlai boyunca iki günlük deniz kayağı yolculuğu: batık kalıntılar, Tersane Koyu''nda şnorkel ve Simena köyünde bir gece. Orta ve ileri seviye için."},"title":{"de":"Kekova-Bucht: 2 Tage Seekajak mit Nacht in Simena","en":"Kekova Sound: 2-Day Kayak Trip, Night in Simena","fr":"Golfe de Kekova : 2 jours de kayak, nuit à Simena","tr":"Kekova Körfezi: Simena Konaklamalı 2 Günlük Tur"}},"slug":{"de":"kekova-bucht-2-tage","en":"kekova-sound-2-days","fr":"baie-de-kekova-2-jours","tr":"kekova-korfezi"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-cok-gunlu","summary":{"de":"Eine zweitägige Kajakreise durch Kekova und Aperlai mit einer Übernachtung im reizvollen Dorf Simena.","en":"A two-day kayak journey through Kekova and Aperlai, with a night in the charming village of Simena.","fr":"Deux jours de kayak à travers Kekova et Aperlai, avec une nuit dans le charmant village de Simena.","tr":"Büyüleyici Simena köyünde konaklamalı, Kekova ve Aperlai boyunca iki günlük kayak yolculuğu."},"title":{"de":"Kekova-Bucht — 2 Tage","en":"Kekova Sound — 2 Days","fr":"Baie de Kekova — 2 jours","tr":"Kekova Körfezi — 2 Gün"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Beim Coasteering durchquert man die felsige Küste ganz nah am Wasser. Technische Kletterausrüstung oder fortgeschrittene Klettertechnik braucht es nicht: einfach gehen, klettern, springen, schwimmen und wieder springen!","type":"p"},{"text":"Unterwegs entdecken Sie die geologischen und ökologischen Formationen der Gegend und können Seevögel, Fische, Krabben und Meeresschildkröten beobachten. Mit viel Glück sogar eine scheue Mittelmeer-Mönchsrobbe.","type":"p"},{"items":["Strecke: 3 km","Route: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"Coasteering basically consists of traversing the rocky coastline very close to the water. No technical climbing equipment or advanced climbing techniques are needed: you just walk, climb, jump, swim and jump again!","type":"p"},{"text":"Along your path you explore the geological and ecological formations of the area, and you may observe sea birds, fish, crabs and sea turtles. If you are very lucky, perhaps even an elusive Mediterranean monk seal.","type":"p"},{"items":["Distance: 3 km","Route: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Le coasteering consiste essentiellement à parcourir la côte rocheuse tout près de l''eau. Aucun équipement technique d''escalade ni technique avancée n''est nécessaire : vous marchez, grimpez, sautez, nagez, et sautez encore !","type":"p"},{"text":"En chemin, vous découvrez les formations géologiques et écologiques de la région et pouvez observer oiseaux marins, poissons, crabes et tortues de mer. Pourquoi pas un phoque moine furtif, si vous avez beaucoup de chance ?","type":"p"},{"items":["Distance : 3 km","Itinéraire : Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Coasteering temel olarak kayalık kıyıyı suya çok yakın bir şekilde geçmeyi içerir. Hiçbir teknik tırmanış ekipmanına veya ileri tırmanış tekniğine gerek yoktur: sadece yürüyün, tırmanın, atlayın, yüzün ve tekrar atlayın!","type":"p"},{"text":"Rotanız boyunca bölgenin jeolojik ve ekolojik oluşumlarını keşfeder; deniz kuşlarını, balıkları, yengeçleri ve deniz kaplumbağalarını gözlemleyebilirsiniz. Çok şanslıysanız nadir bir Akdeniz fokunu bile görebilirsiniz.","type":"p"},{"items":["Mesafe: 3 km","Rota: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"outdoor","conditions":{"de":["Mindestens 4 Teilnehmende; Preise pro Person.","Geeignet für 16- bis 55-Jährige, gute körperliche Fitness erforderlich."],"en":["Minimum 4 participants; prices are per person.","Suitable for ages 16–55 and requires a good level of fitness."],"fr":["4 participants minimum ; prix par personne.","Adapté aux 16–55 ans et nécessite une bonne condition physique."],"tr":["En az 4 katılımcı; fiyatlar kişi başıdır.","16–55 yaş grubu için uygundur ve iyi bir fiziksel kondisyon gerektirir."]},"cover":"outdoor-coasteering-1","faq":[],"featured":true,"gallery":["outdoor-coasteering-2","hero-outdoor"],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"kiyi-tirmanisi","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kisi-basi","name":{"de":"Pro Person","en":"Per person","fr":"Par personne","tr":"Kişi başı"},"price":70}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Gehen, klettern, springen und schwimmen auf 3 km Felsküste von Büyükçakıl nach Limanağzı. Ohne Kletterausrüstung; unterwegs Seevögel, Fische und Schildkröten.","en":"Walk, climb, jump and swim along 3 km of rocky shore from Büyükçakıl to Limanağzı. No technical gear needed; look out for sea birds, fish, crabs and turtles.","fr":"Marcher, grimper, sauter et nager sur 3 km de côte rocheuse, de Büyükçakıl à Limanağzı. Sans matériel technique ; oiseaux marins, poissons et tortues en chemin.","tr":"Büyükçakıl''dan Limanağzı''na 3 km kayalık kıyıda yürü, tırman, atla ve yüz. Teknik ekipman gerekmez; deniz kuşları, balıklar ve kaplumbağalar görülebilir."},"title":{"de":"Coasteering in Kaş: von Büyükçakıl nach Limanağzı","en":"Coasteering in Kaş: Büyükçakıl to Limanağzı","fr":"Coasteering à Kaş : de Büyükçakıl à Limanağzı","tr":"Kaş''ta Coasteering: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı Kıyısı"}},"slug":{"de":"coasteering-buyukcakil-limanagzi","en":"coasteering-buyukcakil-limanagzi","fr":"coasteering-buyukcakil-limanagzi","tr":"coasteering-buyukcakil-limanagzi"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-kiyi-tirmanisi","summary":{"de":"Gehen, klettern, springen und schwimmen entlang der Felsküste: eine 3 km lange Küstentraverse.","en":"Walk, climb, jump and swim along the rocky shore: a 3 km coastal traverse.","fr":"Marchez, grimpez, sautez et nagez le long de la côte rocheuse : une traversée de 3 km.","tr":"Kayalık kıyı boyunca yürü, tırman, atla ve yüz: 3 km''lik kıyı traversi."},"title":{"de":"Coasteering: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı","en":"Coasteering: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı","fr":"Coasteering : Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı","tr":"Coasteering: Büyükçakıl – Limanağzı"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Begeben Sie sich mit unserer einwöchigen Seekajaktour entlang der Lykischen Küste auf eine Reise durch Zeit und Natur. Paddeln Sie durch klares Wasser und entdecken Sie antike Städte, versteckte Buchten und jahrtausendealte Ruinen. Für Abenteurer, Geschichtsinteressierte und alle, die ein authentisches Erlebnis suchen.","type":"p"},{"text":"Höhepunkte","type":"h2"},{"items":["Zwei versunkene antike Städte: Kekova und Aperlai","Ein ganzer Paddeltag im Archipel von Kaş","Der Strand von Patara","Das Lykische Museum in Andriake","Optionale Ausflüge am freien Tag","All-inclusive-Unterkunft mit Komfort"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"Set out on a journey through time and nature with our week-long sea kayaking tour along the Lycian Coast. Paddle through clear water and discover ancient cities, hidden coves and ruins thousands of years old. For adventurers, history lovers and anyone looking for an authentic experience.","type":"p"},{"text":"Highlights","type":"h2"},{"items":["Two sunken ancient cities: Kekova and Aperlai","A full day of paddling in the Kaş archipelago","Patara beach","The Lycian Museum at Andriake","Optional tours on the free day","All-inclusive comfortable accommodation"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Partez pour un voyage dans le temps et la nature avec notre semaine de kayak de mer le long de la côte lycienne. Pagayez dans une eau limpide et découvrez des cités antiques, des criques cachées et des ruines millénaires. Pour les aventuriers, les passionnés d''histoire et tous ceux qui cherchent une expérience authentique.","type":"p"},{"text":"Points forts","type":"h2"},{"items":["Deux cités antiques englouties : Kekova et Aperlai","Une journée complète de pagaie dans l''archipel de Kaş","La plage de Patara","Le musée lycien d''Andriake","Excursions en option le jour libre","Hébergement confortable en formule tout compris"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Likya Kıyısı boyunca haftalık deniz kayağı turumuzla zaman ve doğa içinde bir yolculuğa çıkın. Berrak sularda kürek çekerken antik kentleri, saklı koyları ve binlerce yıllık kalıntıları keşfedin. Maceracılar, tarih meraklıları ve otantik bir deneyim arayanlar için.","type":"p"},{"text":"Öne çıkanlar","type":"h2"},{"items":["İki batık antik kent: Kekova ve Aperlai","Kaş takımadalarında tam gün kürek","Patara kumsalı","Andriake Likya Müzesi","Serbest gün opsiyonel turları","Her şey dahil konfor konaklama"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","conditions":{"de":["Mindestens 6, höchstens 12 Teilnehmende"],"en":["Minimum 6, maximum 12 participants"],"fr":["6 participants minimum, 12 maximum"],"tr":["En az 6, en fazla 12 kişi"]},"cover":"kayak-lycian-comfort-1","duration":{"de":"7 Tage / 6 Nächte","en":"7 days / 6 nights","fr":"7 jours / 6 nuits","tr":"7 gün / 6 gece"},"excludes":{"de":["Alle internationalen und Inlandsflüge","Persönliche Ausgaben wie Getränke oder Souvenirs","Trinkgelder für Reiseleitung, Kajakguide, Fahrer usw.","Hotelnächte vor und nach den Tourdaten","Optionale Ausflüge am freien Tag","Reiseversicherung"],"en":["All international and domestic flights","Personal expenses such as drinks or souvenirs","Tips for the tour leader, kayak guide, driver etc.","Hotel nights before and after the tour dates","Optional tours on the free day","Travel insurance"],"fr":["Tous les vols internationaux et intérieurs","Dépenses personnelles (boissons, souvenirs)","Pourboires du chef de groupe, du guide de kayak, du chauffeur, etc.","Nuits d''hôtel avant et après les dates du circuit","Excursions en option le jour libre","Assurance voyage"],"tr":["Türkiye''ye/Türkiye''den ve ülke içi tüm uçak biletleri","İçecek veya hediyelik gibi kişisel harcamalar","Tur lideri, kayak rehberi, sürücü vb. için bahşişler","Tur tarihlerinden önce ve sonra otel konaklaması","Serbest gün opsiyonel turları","Seyahat sigortası"]},"faq":[{"answer":{"de":"Die Tour findet mit mindestens 6 und höchstens 12 Teilnehmenden statt.","en":"The tour runs with a minimum of 6 and a maximum of 12 participants.","fr":"Le circuit se fait avec 6 participants minimum et 12 au maximum.","tr":"Tur en az 6, en fazla 12 kişiyle yapılır."},"question":{"de":"Wie groß ist die Gruppe?","en":"How big is the group?","fr":"Quelle est la taille du groupe ?","tr":"Grup kaç kişilik?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Sie können sich in Kaş erholen oder einen optionalen Ausflug wählen: Bootsfahrt zur griechischen Insel Meis, Besuch von Myra und der Nikolauskirche oder ein Tauchgang in Kaş. Optionale Ausflüge sind nicht im Preis enthalten.","en":"You can rest in Kaş or choose an optional tour: a boat trip to the Greek island of Meis, a visit to Myra and the Church of St Nicholas, or a dive in Kaş. Optional tours are not included in the price.","fr":"Vous pouvez vous reposer à Kaş ou choisir une excursion en option : bateau vers l''île grecque de Meis, visite de Myra et de l''église Saint-Nicolas, ou plongée à Kaş. Les excursions en option ne sont pas comprises dans le prix.","tr":"Kaş''ta dinlenebilir ya da opsiyonel bir tur seçebilirsiniz: Meis adasına tekne turu, Myra ve Aziz Nikolaos Kilisesi ziyareti veya Kaş''ta dalış. Opsiyonel turlar fiyata dahil değildir."},"question":{"de":"Was kann ich am freien Tag unternehmen?","en":"What can I do on the free day?","fr":"Que faire le jour libre ?","tr":"Serbest günde neler yapılabilir?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Ja, alle Flughafentransfers der Gruppe sind inbegriffen. Flüge sind nicht enthalten.","en":"Yes, all group airport transfers are included. Flights are not included.","fr":"Oui, tous les transferts aéroport du groupe sont inclus. Les vols ne le sont pas.","tr":"Evet, tüm grup havalimanı transferleri dahildir. Uçak biletleri dahil değildir."},"question":{"de":"Sind Flughafentransfers inbegriffen?","en":"Are airport transfers included?","fr":"Les transferts aéroport sont-ils inclus ?","tr":"Havalimanı transferi dahil mi?"}}],"featured":true,"gallery":["kayak-lycian-comfort-2","kayak-sea-turtle-1"],"healthForm":null,"id":"likya-kayak-konfor","includes":{"de":["Alle Flughafentransfers der Gruppe","Hotelunterkunft (6 Nächte)","Alle Mahlzeiten inkl. Snacks (außer Mittagessen am freien Tag)","Alle Bus-/Minibusfahrten","Zertifizierter Kajakguide und zweiter Guide","Kajak, Paddel, Schwimmweste, Packsack, Spritzdecke, Schnorchelausrüstung","Begleitboote bei Bedarf","Trinkwasser an Paddeltagen","Parkgebühren","Gebühren für externe Führer","Eintritt in Museen und Ausgrabungsstätten"],"en":["All group airport transfers","Hotel accommodation (6 nights)","All meals including snacks (except lunch on the free day)","All bus/minibus transport","Certified kayak guide and a second guide","Kayak, paddle, life jacket, dry bag, spray skirt, snorkelling gear","Support boats when needed","Drinking water on paddling days","Parking fees","External guide fees","Museum and site entrance fees"],"fr":["Tous les transferts aéroport du groupe","Hébergement à l''hôtel (6 nuits)","Tous les repas, collations comprises (sauf le déjeuner du jour libre)","Tous les transports en bus/minibus","Guide de kayak certifié et second guide","Kayak, pagaie, gilet, sac étanche, jupe, matériel de snorkeling","Bateaux d''assistance si nécessaire","Eau potable les jours de pagaie","Frais de parking","Frais de guides externes","Entrées des musées et des sites"],"tr":["Tüm grup havalimanı transferleri","Otel konaklaması (6 gece)","Atıştırmalıklar dahil tüm öğünler (serbest gün öğle yemeği hariç)","Tüm otobüs/minibüs ulaşımı","Sertifikalı kayak rehberi ve ikinci rehber","Kayak, kürek, can yeleği, su geçirmez çanta, etek, şnorkel ekipmanı","Gerektiğinde destek tekneleri","Kürek günlerinde içme suyu","Otopark ücretleri","Harici rehber ücretleri","Müze ve ören yeri giriş ücretleri"]},"itinerary":[{"description":{"de":"3 Meilen. Empfang am Flughafen und Transfer nach Üçağız mit einem ersten türkischen Mittagessen unterwegs. Nach dem Einchecken im Hotel in Üçağız/Simena Paddeln über die versunkene Stadt und Erkundung des Burgdorfs Kaleköy; traditionelles türkisches Abendessen.","en":"3 miles. Airport welcome and transfer to Üçağız with a first Turkish lunch on the way. After checking in at the hotel in Üçağız/Simena, paddle over the Kekova Sunken City and explore the castle village of Kaleköy; traditional Turkish dinner.","fr":"3 milles. Accueil à l''aéroport et transfert à Üçağız avec un premier déjeuner turc en route. Après l''installation à l''hôtel à Üçağız/Simena, pagayage au-dessus de la cité engloutie et découverte du village fortifié de Kaleköy ; dîner turc traditionnel.","tr":"3 mil. Havalimanında karşılanıp yol üzerinde ilk Türk öğle yemeğiyle Üçağız''a transfer. Üçağız/Simena''daki otele yerleştikten sonra Kekova Batık Şehri üzerinde kürek ve kale köyü Kaleköy; ardından geleneksel Türk akşam yemeği."},"title":{"de":"Tag 1 — Ankunft und erste Eindrücke von Kekova","en":"Day 1 — Arrival and introduction to Kekova","fr":"Jour 1 — Arrivée et découverte de Kekova","tr":"Gün 1 — Varış ve Kekova''ya giriş"}},{"description":{"de":"8,5 Meilen, 1,5 Meilen zu Fuß. Westroute über die Bucht Tersane zum antiken Aperlai; kurzer Fußweg zu den Ruinen und die Geschichte des Königspurpurs, danach Schnorcheln über der versunkenen Stadt. Mittagessen mit Meeresfrüchten in einem Fischerhaus, auf dem Rückweg optional Kajaksegeln.","en":"8.5 miles, 1.5-mile walk. Western route via Tersane Bay to ancient Aperlai; a short walk to the ruins and the story of royal purple dye, then snorkelling over the sunken city. Seafood lunch at a fisherman''s house, optional kayak sailing on the way back.","fr":"8,5 milles, 1,5 mille à pied. Route ouest par la baie de Tersane jusqu''à l''antique Aperlai ; courte marche jusqu''aux ruines et histoire de la pourpre royale, puis snorkeling au-dessus de la cité engloutie. Déjeuner de produits de la mer chez un pêcheur, voile en kayak en option au retour.","tr":"8,5 mil, 1,5 mil yürüyüş. Tersane Koyu üzerinden batı rotasıyla antik Aperlai''ye kürek; kalıntılara kısa yürüyüş ve kraliyet moru boyasının hikâyesi, ardından batık şehrin üzerinde şnorkel. Bir balıkçı evinde deniz ürünleri öğle yemeği, dönüşte opsiyonel kayak yelkeni."},"title":{"de":"Tag 2 — Aperlai und Schnorcheln","en":"Day 2 — Aperlai and snorkelling","fr":"Jour 2 — Aperlai et snorkeling","tr":"Gün 2 — Aperlai ve şnorkel"}},{"description":{"de":"9 Meilen. Die Ostroute mit versteckten Buchten, der geschützten Robbenhöhle und Schildkrötenbeobachtung am Bach von Andriake. Besuch des Lykischen Museums in Andriake und der antiken Zisterne, danach Transfer nach Kaş zum Abendessen.","en":"9 miles. The eastern route with hidden coves, the protected seal cave and turtle watching on the Andriake stream. Visit to the Lycian Museum at Andriake and the ancient cistern, then transfer to Kaş for dinner.","fr":"9 milles. Route est avec criques cachées, grotte protégée des phoques et observation des tortues sur le ruisseau d''Andriake. Visite du musée lycien d''Andriake et de la citerne antique, puis transfert à Kaş pour le dîner.","tr":"9 mil. Saklı koylar, korunan fok mağarası ve Andriake deresinde kaplumbağa gözlemiyle doğu rotası. Andriake Likya Müzesi ve antik sarnıç ziyareti, akşam yemeği için Kaş''a transfer."},"title":{"de":"Tag 3 — Kekova Ost und das Lykische Museum in Andriake","en":"Day 3 — Kekova East and the Lycian Museum at Andriake","fr":"Jour 3 — Kekova Est et le musée lycien d''Andriake","tr":"Gün 3 — Kekova Doğu ve Andriake Likya Müzesi"}},{"description":{"de":"Erholung in Kaş oder ein optionaler Ausflug: Bootsfahrt nach Meis, Besuch von Myra und der Nikolauskirche oder ein Tauchgang vor Kaş. Abendessen mit mediterranen Spezialitäten.","en":"Rest in Kaş or choose an optional tour: a boat trip to Meis, a visit to Myra and the Church of St Nicholas, or a dive in the waters of Kaş. Dinner with Mediterranean flavours.","fr":"Repos à Kaş ou excursion en option : bateau vers Meis, visite de Myra et de l''église Saint-Nicolas, ou plongée dans les eaux de Kaş. Dîner aux saveurs méditerranéennes.","tr":"Kaş''ta dinlenin veya opsiyonel bir tur seçin: Meis adasına tekne turu, Myra ve Aziz Nikolaos Kilisesi ziyareti ya da Kaş sularında dalış. Akdeniz lezzetleriyle akşam yemeği."},"title":{"de":"Tag 4 — Freier Tag","en":"Day 4 — Free day","fr":"Jour 4 — Journée libre","tr":"Gün 4 — Serbest gün"}},{"description":{"de":"7,5 Meilen. Ein ganzer Paddeltag rund um Kaş: versteckte Buchten, ruhiges Wasser, Blick auf Kaş und Meis und Mittagessen am Meer. Abends traditionelles türkisches Essen.","en":"7.5 miles. A full day of paddling around Kaş: hidden coves, calm water, views of Kaş and Meis and a seaside lunch. Traditional Turkish dinner in the evening.","fr":"7,5 milles. Une journée complète de pagaie autour de Kaş : criques cachées, eau calme, vues sur Kaş et Meis et déjeuner en bord de mer. Dîner turc traditionnel le soir.","tr":"7,5 mil. Kaş çevresinde tam gün kürek: saklı koylar, sakin sular, Kaş ve Meis manzaraları ve deniz kenarında öğle yemeği. Akşam geleneksel Türk yemeği."},"title":{"de":"Tag 5 — Paddeln im Archipel von Kaş","en":"Day 5 — Paddling in the Kaş archipelago","fr":"Jour 5 — Pagaie dans l''archipel de Kaş","tr":"Gün 5 — Kaş takımadalarında kürek"}},{"description":{"de":"9 Meilen. Transfer nach Kalkan und Paddeln zum Strand von Patara mit den Ruinen eines der ältesten Versammlungsgebäude der Welt. Strandpicknick und Zeit für die Ruinen, danach Abschiedsessen im Hotel in Patara.","en":"9 miles. Transfer to Kalkan and paddle to Patara Beach, home to the ruins of one of the oldest assembly buildings in the world. Beach picnic and time to explore the ruins, then a farewell dinner at the hotel in Patara.","fr":"9 milles. Transfert à Kalkan et pagayage jusqu''à la plage de Patara, où se trouvent les ruines de l''un des plus anciens bâtiments d''assemblée au monde. Pique-nique sur la plage et visite des ruines, puis dîner d''adieu à l''hôtel à Patara.","tr":"9 mil. Kalkan''a transfer ve Patara Plajı''na kürek; dünyanın en eski meclis binalarından birinin kalıntıları. Plaj pikniği ve antik kalıntıları gezme zamanı, ardından Patara''daki otelde veda yemeği."},"title":{"de":"Tag 6 — Patara","en":"Day 6 — Patara","fr":"Jour 6 — Patara","tr":"Gün 6 — Patara"}},{"description":{"de":"Frühstück vor dem Auschecken, danach Transfer zum Flughafen.","en":"Breakfast before check-out, then transfer to the airport.","fr":"Petit-déjeuner avant le départ, puis transfert à l''aéroport.","tr":"Çıkıştan önce kahvaltı, ardından havalimanına transfer."},"title":{"de":"Tag 7 — Abreise","en":"Day 7 — Departure","fr":"Jour 7 — Départ","tr":"Gün 7 — Ayrılış"}}],"options":[],"order":4,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Eine Woche Seekajak in Lykien, all inclusive: versunkene Städte Kekova und Aperlai, ein Tag im Archipel von Kaş, Strand von Patara und Lykisches Museum.","en":"A 7-day all-inclusive sea kayaking trip in Lycia: the sunken cities of Kekova and Aperlai, a day in the Kaş archipelago, Patara beach and the Lycian Museum.","fr":"Une semaine tout compris en kayak de mer en Lycie : cités englouties de Kekova et d''Aperlai, journée dans l''archipel de Kaş, plage de Patara et musée lycien.","tr":"Likya kıyısında her şey dahil 7 günlük deniz kayağı: Kekova ve Aperlai batık şehirleri, Kaş takımadalarında tam gün, Patara plajı ve Andriake''deki Likya Müzesi."},"title":{"de":"Lykien im Seekajak mit Komfort, all inclusive","en":"Lycian Kayak & Comfort Escape, All-Inclusive","fr":"Escapade lycienne en kayak, tout compris, 7 jours","tr":"Likya Kayak ve Konfor Kaçamağı: Her Şey Dahil"}},"slug":{"de":"lykien-kajak-komfort","en":"lycian-kayak-comfort-escape","fr":"kayak-lycien-evasion-confort","tr":"likya-kayak-konfor"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-cok-gunlu","summary":{"de":"Sieben Tage Paddeln all-inclusive zwischen Geschichte und Natur.","en":"An all-inclusive 7-day paddling experience between history and nature.","fr":"Sept jours de pagaie tout compris, entre histoire et nature.","tr":"Tarih ve doğa arasında her şey dahil 7 günlük kürek deneyimi."},"title":{"de":"Lykien: Kajak und Komfort","en":"Lycian Kayak & Comfort Escape","fr":"Kayak lycien et évasion confort","tr":"Likya Kayak & Konfor Kaçamağı"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Ab Kyaenai, besiedelt seit dem 4. Jahrhundert v. Chr., führt unser Ausflug zur Nikolauskirche bei Myra, wo der Heilige die meiste Zeit verbrachte, zu den lykischen Felsgräbern und zum antiken Theater von Myra.","type":"p"},{"text":"Am Strand von Sülüklü legen wir eine Badepause ein und essen dort zu Mittag. Nach dem Besuch von Andriake bringt uns der Bus nach Hoyran, der Stadt der Muttergöttin aus phrygischer Zeit, wo Sie die Felsgräber erkunden.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Starting from Kyaenai, a settlement since the 4th century BC, our trip includes the Church of St Nicholas near Myra, where the saint spent most of his time, the rock tombs from Lycian times and the ancient theatre of Myra.","type":"p"},{"text":"We stop for a swim at Sülüklü beach and have lunch on the beach. After visiting Andriake, our bus takes us to Hoyran, the city of the mother goddess dating back to the Phrygians, where you can explore the rock tombs.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Au départ de Kyaenai, habitée depuis le IVe siècle av. J.-C., notre excursion comprend l''église Saint-Nicolas près de Myra, où le saint passa la majeure partie de son temps, les tombes rupestres lyciennes et le théâtre antique de Myra.","type":"p"},{"text":"Nous faisons une pause baignade à la plage de Sülüklü et déjeunons sur la plage. Après Andriake, notre bus nous conduit à Hoyran, la ville de la déesse mère datant des Phrygiens, où vous explorez les tombes rupestres.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"M.Ö. 4. yüzyıldan beri yerleşim yeri olarak kullanılan Kyaenai''den başlayan gezimiz, Aziz Nikolaos''un zamanının çoğunu geçirdiği Myra yakınlarındaki Aya Nikola kilisesini, Likya dönemine ait kaya mezarlarını ve Myra''daki antik tiyatroyu kapsar.","type":"p"},{"text":"Sülüklü Plajı''nda yüzme molası verip öğle yemeğini plajda alırız. Andriake''yi ziyaret ettikten sonra otobüsümüz bizi Frigler dönemine uzanan ana tanrıça kenti Hoyran''a götürür; burada kaya mezarlarını keşfedersiniz.","type":"p"}]},"category":"outdoor","conditions":{"de":["Mindestens 2, höchstens 22 Teilnehmende"],"en":["Minimum 2, maximum 22 participants"],"fr":["2 participants minimum, 22 maximum"],"tr":["En az 2, en fazla 22 katılımcı"]},"cover":"outdoor-culture-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["outdoor-culture-2","outdoor-beach-dunes-1"],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"myra-demre-kultur-turu","itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Ein Kulturtag von Kyaenai zu den Felsgräbern und dem Theater von Myra und zur Nikolauskirche, mit Badestopp in Sülüklü, Andriake und den Gräbern von Hoyran.","en":"A day of culture from Kyaenai to the rock tombs and theatre of Myra and the Church of St Nicholas, with a swim at Sülüklü, Andriake and the tombs of Hoyran.","fr":"Une journée culturelle de Kyaenai aux tombes rupestres et au théâtre de Myra, avec l''église Saint-Nicolas, baignade à Sülüklü, Andriake et tombes de Hoyran.","tr":"Kyaenai''den Myra''nın kaya mezarları ve tiyatrosuna, Aya Nikola Kilisesi''nden Sülüklü plajında yüzmeye, Andriake ve Hoyran''a uzanan günlük kültür turu."},"title":{"de":"Kulturtour Myra: Nikolauskirche und Andriake","en":"Myra Culture Tour: St Nicholas, Andriake, Hoyran","fr":"Circuit culturel Myra : Saint-Nicolas et Andriake","tr":"Myra (Demre) Kültür Turu: Aya Nikola ve Andriake"}},"slug":{"de":"kulturtour-myra-demre","en":"myra-demre-culture-tour","fr":"circuit-culturel-myra-demre","tr":"myra-demre-kultur-turu"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-kultur","summary":{"de":"Von Kyaenai zum Theater von Myra, von der Nikolauskirche nach Andriake und Hoyran.","en":"From Kyaenai to the theatre of Myra, from the Church of St Nicholas to Andriake and Hoyran.","fr":"De Kyaenai au théâtre de Myra, de l''église Saint-Nicolas à Andriake et Hoyran.","tr":"Kyaenai''den Myra tiyatrosuna, Aya Nikola kilisesinden Andriake ve Hoyran''a."},"title":{"de":"Kulturtour Myra (Demre)","en":"Myra (Demre) Culture Tour","fr":"Circuit culturel Myra (Demre)","tr":"Myra (Demre) Kültür Turu"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Dragoman Junior ist 5,9 Meter lang, hat 80 PS und erreicht jeden Tauchplatz in kurzer Zeit. Die Kapazität ist auf 4 Taucher begrenzt. Solange Wetter und Meer es erlauben, steht das Boot unseren Tauchern unabhängig von Uhrzeit und Tauchplatz zur Verfügung. Die Preise gelten für einen Tauchgang; für diesen besonderen Service wenden Sie sich bitte an unser Büro.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"Dragoman Junior is 5.9 metres long with an 80 HP engine and reaches every dive site quickly. Its capacity is limited to 4 divers. As long as the weather and sea allow, it is at our divers'' disposal whatever the time or dive site. Prices are for one dive; please contact our office for this special service.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Dragoman Junior, long de 5,9 mètres et doté d''un moteur de 80 chevaux, rejoint rapidement tous les sites de plongée. Sa capacité est limitée à 4 plongeurs. Tant que la météo et la mer le permettent, il est à la disposition de nos plongeurs quels que soient l''heure et le site. Les tarifs s''entendent pour une plongée ; contactez notre bureau pour ce service particulier.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Dragoman Junior, 5,9 metre uzunluğu ve 80 beygir motor gücüyle tüm dalış noktalarına kısa sürede ulaşım sağlar. Tekne kapasitesi 4 dalıcı ile sınırlıdır. Hava ve deniz koşulları elverdiği sürece saat ve dalış noktası gözetmeksizin dalıcılarımızın hizmetindedir. Fiyatlar 1 dalış içindir; bu özel hizmet için lütfen ofisimizle iletişime geçin.","type":"p"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"diving-wreck-boat-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":[],"healthForm":"diving","id":"ozel-dalis-dragoman-junior","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"bir-dalici","name":{"de":"1 Taucher","en":"1 diver","fr":"1 plongeur","tr":"1 dalıcı"},"price":150},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"iki-uc-dalici","name":{"de":"2–3 Taucher, pro Person","en":"2–3 divers, per diver","fr":"2–3 plongeurs, par personne","tr":"2–3 dalıcı, kişi başı"},"price":95},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"dort-bes-dalici","name":{"de":"4–5 Taucher, pro Person","en":"4–5 divers, per diver","fr":"4–5 plongeurs, par personne","tr":"4–5 dalıcı, kişi başı"},"price":85}],"order":3,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Private Tauchgänge für bis zu 4 Taucher mit dem 5,9-Meter-Schnellboot Dragoman Jr: Wenn Wetter und Meer es erlauben, jederzeit an den Tauchplatz Ihrer Wahl.","en":"Private dives for up to 4 divers on the 5.9-metre speedboat Dragoman Jr: when the weather and sea allow, we take you to the dive site of your choice, any time.","fr":"Plongées privées pour 4 plongeurs au plus sur Dragoman Jr, notre vedette de 5,9 mètres : si la météo et la mer le permettent, le site et l''heure de votre choix.","tr":"5,9 metrelik hız teknemiz Dragoman Jr ile en fazla 4 dalıcıya özel dalış: hava ve deniz uygunsa istediğiniz saatte, istediğiniz dalış noktasına gidiyoruz."},"title":{"de":"Private Tauchgänge in Kaş mit Dragoman Jr","en":"Private Dives in Kaş with Speedboat Dragoman Jr","fr":"Plongées privées à Kaş à bord de Dragoman Jr","tr":"Dragoman Jr ile Kaş''ta Özel Tekne Dalışları"}},"slug":{"de":"private-tauchgaenge-dragoman-junior","en":"private-dives-dragoman-junior","fr":"plongees-privees-dragoman-junior","tr":"dragoman-junior-ozel-dalis"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-sertifikali","summary":{"de":"Wohin und wann Sie wollen: ein privater Tauchgang von unserem Schnellboot aus.","en":"Anywhere, any time: a private dive from our speedboat.","fr":"Où vous voulez, quand vous voulez : une plongée privée depuis notre semi-rigide.","tr":"İstediğiniz zaman, istediğiniz yere: hız teknemizle özel dalış."},"title":{"de":"Private Tauchgänge mit Dragoman Jr","en":"Private Dives with Dragoman Jr","fr":"Plongées privées avec Dragoman Jr","tr":"Dragoman Jr ile Özel Dalışlar"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Wenn Sie eine Tour nur für Ihre Gruppe wünschen oder sie mit Tauchen und anderen Outdoor-Aktivitäten verbinden möchten, schreiben Sie uns Ihre Vorstellungen; wir stellen Ihr Programm gemeinsam mit Ihnen zusammen. Route, Termine und Dauer richten sich nach Ihren Wünschen.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"If you would like a tour just for your group, or one combined with diving or other outdoor activities, write to us with what you have in mind and we will put your programme together with you. Route, dates and duration are planned around your needs.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Si vous souhaitez une sortie réservée à votre groupe, ou combinée avec de la plongée ou d''autres activités de plein air, écrivez-nous vos attentes et nous préparerons votre programme ensemble. Itinéraire, dates et durée sont adaptés à vos besoins.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Turunuzu grubunuza özel hâle getirmek, dalış veya farklı doğa etkinlikleriyle zenginleştirmek isterseniz beklentilerinizi bize yazın; size özel programınızı birlikte hazırlayalım. Rota, tarih ve süre sizin ihtiyaçlarınıza göre planlanır.","type":"p"}]},"category":"outdoor","cover":"kas-town-view-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["outdoor-beach-dunes-1"],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"ozel-turlar","itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":1,"origin":"mockup","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Eine Tour nur für Ihre Gruppe oder kombiniert mit Tauchen und anderen Outdoor-Aktivitäten? Schreiben Sie Ihre Wünsche, wir planen Route und Termine gemeinsam.","en":"Want a tour just for your group, or combined with diving or other outdoor activities? Tell us what you have in mind and we plan the route and dates with you.","fr":"Un circuit pour votre groupe, ou combiné avec la plongée et d''autres activités de plein air ? Dites-nous vos envies, nous préparons l''itinéraire avec vous.","tr":"Yalnızca grubunuz için ya da dalış ve doğa etkinlikleriyle birleşik bir tur mu istiyorsunuz? Beklentinizi yazın, rotayı ve tarihleri birlikte planlayalım."},"title":{"de":"Private Touren in Kaş, geplant für Ihre Gruppe","en":"Private Tours in Kaş, Planned for Your Group","fr":"Circuits privés à Kaş, conçus pour votre groupe","tr":"Size Özel Turlar: Kaş''ta Grubunuza Özel Program"}},"slug":{"de":"private-touren","en":"private-tours","fr":"circuits-prives","tr":"size-ozel-turlar"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-ozel-turlar","summary":{"de":"Ein Programm nur für Ihre Gruppe: Sagen Sie uns, was Sie sich wünschen, wir planen es gemeinsam.","en":"A programme just for your group: tell us what you have in mind and we plan it together.","fr":"Un programme rien que pour votre groupe : dites-nous ce que vous souhaitez, nous le préparons ensemble.","tr":"Grubunuza özel program: beklentilerinizi yazın, birlikte hazırlayalım."},"title":{"de":"Private Touren","en":"Private Tours","fr":"Circuits privés","tr":"Size Özel Turlar"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Eichen, alte Dorfhäuser und die Ruinen der antiken Stadt Korba begleiten Sie an diesem Radtag. Wir starten auf etwa 450 Metern Höhe; die durchschnittliche Höhe liegt bei rund 355 Metern, und die Strecke ist überwiegend flach. Je nach Jahreszeit essen Sie im Schatten einer Eiche oder im Hof einer alten Schule zu Mittag.","type":"p"},{"text":"Gesamtstrecke: 22 km + 12 km (optional).","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"A view of oak trees, old village houses and the ruins of the ancient city of Korba welcomes you on this cycling day. We start pedalling at around 450 metres; the average altitude during the tour is about 355 metres and the route is mostly flat. Depending on the season, you can have lunch in the shade of an oak tree or in an old school yard.","type":"p"},{"text":"Total distance: 22 km + 12 km (optional).","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Une vue sur de nombreux chênes, de vieilles maisons de village et les ruines de l''ancienne cité de Korba vous accueille pour cette journée de vélo. Nous commençons à pédaler vers 450 mètres d''altitude ; l''altitude moyenne du parcours est d''environ 355 mètres, sur un itinéraire principalement plat. Selon la saison, vous déjeunerez à l''ombre d''un chêne ou dans la cour d''une ancienne école.","type":"p"},{"text":"Distance totale : 22 km + 12 km (en option).","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Meşe ağaçları, eski köy evleri ve antik Korba kentinin kalıntılarından oluşan bir manzara bu bisiklet gününde sizi karşılıyor. Pedallamaya yaklaşık 450 metre rakımda başlıyoruz; tur boyunca ortalama rakım yaklaşık 355 metre, rota ise çoğunlukla düz. Mevsime bağlı olarak öğle yemeğinizi bir meşe ağacının gölgesinde ya da eski bir okul bahçesinde yiyebilirsiniz.","type":"p"},{"text":"Toplam mesafe: 22 km + isteğe bağlı 12 km.","type":"p"}]},"category":"outdoor","cover":"outdoor-cycling-placeholder","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":[],"healthForm":"outdoor","id":"sarilar-belenli-bisiklet","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kisi-basi","name":{"de":"Pro Person","en":"Per person","fr":"Par personne","tr":"Kişi başı"},"price":50}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Ein überwiegend flacher Radtag zwischen Eichen, alten Dorfhäusern und den Ruinen des antiken Korba: 22 km plus optional 12 km, im Schnitt auf etwa 355 m Höhe.","en":"A mostly flat day of cycling among oak trees, old village houses and the ruins of ancient Korba: 22 km plus an optional 12 km, at about 355 m on average.","fr":"Une journée de vélo presque plate entre chênes, vieilles maisons de village et ruines de l''antique Korba : 22 km et 12 km en option, vers 355 m d''altitude.","tr":"Meşe ağaçları, eski köy evleri ve antik Korba kalıntıları arasında çoğunlukla düz bir bisiklet günü: 22 km ve isteğe bağlı 12 km daha, ortalama rakım 355 metre."},"title":{"de":"Radtour Sarılar – Belenli zur antiken Stadt Korba","en":"Sarılar – Belenli Bike Tour past Ancient Korba","fr":"Vélo Sarılar – Belenli : chênes et antique Korba","tr":"Sarılar – Belenli Bisiklet Turu ve Antik Korba"}},"slug":{"de":"radtour-sarilar-belenli","en":"sarilar-belenli-bike-tour","fr":"velo-sarilar-belenli","tr":"sarilar-belenli-bisiklet-turu"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"doga-bisiklet","summary":{"de":"Ein überwiegend flacher Radtag zwischen Eichen, Dorfhäusern und dem antiken Korba.","en":"A mostly flat cycling day among oak trees, village houses and ancient Korba.","fr":"Une journée de vélo, surtout à plat, entre chênes, maisons de village et l''antique Korba.","tr":"Meşe ağaçları, köy evleri ve antik Korba arasında çoğunlukla düz bir bisiklet günü."},"title":{"de":"Radtour Sarılar – Belenli","en":"Sarılar – Belenli Bike Tour","fr":"Vélo Sarılar – Belenli","tr":"Sarılar – Belenli Bisiklet Turu"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Eine Reise von 8 Tagen / 7 Nächten nach Sharm El Sheikh mit etwa 10 Tauchgängen vom 26. bis 29. Oktober: Gebiete Tiran und Ras Mohammed sowie optional die Thistlegorm. Mindestens Open-Water-Brevet erforderlich.","type":"p"},{"items":["6 Nächte mit Frühstück in Naama Bay","10 Tauchgänge an 4 Tagen, Mittagessen an Bord und Nationalparkgebühren","Alle Transfers"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"An 8-day / 7-night trip to Sharm El Sheikh with about 10 dives on 26–29 October: the Tiran and Ras Mohammed areas and the optional Thistlegorm. Minimum Open Water certification required.","type":"p"},{"items":["6 nights bed and breakfast in Naama Bay","10 dives over 4 days, lunches on the boat and national park fees","All transfers"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Un voyage de 8 jours / 7 nuits à Sharm El Sheikh avec une dizaine de plongées du 26 au 29 octobre : secteurs de Tiran et de Ras Mohammed et, en option, le Thistlegorm. Niveau Open Water minimum.","type":"p"},{"items":["6 nuits en chambre et petit-déjeuner à Naama Bay","10 plongées sur 4 jours, déjeuners à bord et entrées du parc national","Tous les transferts"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"8 gün / 7 gecelik Sharm El Sheikh gezisinde 26–29 Ekim günlerinde toplam yaklaşık 10 dalış; Tiran ve Ras Muhammed bölgeleri ve isteğe bağlı Thistlegorm. En az Open Water sertifikası gerekir.","type":"p"},{"items":["Naama Bay''de 6 gece oda kahvaltı konaklama","4 günde 10 dalış, teknede öğle yemekleri ve milli park giriş ücretleri","Tüm transferler"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"blog-sharm-el-sheikh","duration":{"de":"8 Tage / 7 Nächte","en":"8 days / 7 nights","fr":"8 jours / 7 nuits","tr":"8 gün / 7 gece"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["blog-sharm-napoleon-1","blog-sharm-moray-1"],"healthForm":"diving","id":"sharm-el-sheikh-2026","itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":4,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"on_request","slug":{"de":"tauchreise-sharm-el-sheikh-2026","en":"sharm-el-sheikh-dive-trip-2026","fr":"voyage-plongee-sharm-el-sheikh-2026","tr":"sharm-el-sheikh-dalis-turu-2026"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"archived","subgroup":"dalis-sertifikali","summary":{"de":"25.–31. Oktober 2026: etwa 10 Tauchgänge an 4 Tagen im Roten Meer.","en":"25–31 October 2026: about 10 dives in 4 days in the Red Sea.","fr":"25–31 octobre 2026 : une dizaine de plongées en 4 jours en mer Rouge.","tr":"25–31 Ekim 2026: Kızıldeniz''de 4 günde yaklaşık 10 dalış."},"title":{"de":"Tauchreise Sharm El Sheikh 2026","en":"Sharm El Sheikh Dive Trip 2026","fr":"Voyage plongée Sharm El Sheikh 2026","tr":"Sharm El Sheikh Dalış Turu 2026"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Das SSI Open Water Diver ist das weltweit beliebteste Tauchbrevet. Durch Theorie, Übungen im flachen Wasser und Freiwassertauchgänge mit erfahrenen Tauchlehrern erwerben Sie Wissen und Erfahrung zu Sicherheitsregeln, Ausrüstung sowie grundlegenden Tauchfertigkeiten und -techniken.","type":"p"},{"text":"Mit dem international anerkannten Brevet dürfen Sie bis 18 Meter tief tauchen. Die Ausbildung ist auf Türkisch, Englisch, Französisch und Deutsch möglich.","type":"p"},{"text":"Kursdaten","type":"h2"},{"items":["Niveau: Einsteiger","Mindestdauer: 3 Tage","Kurspreis: 395 €"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"The SSI Open Water Diver certification is the most popular diving certification in the world. Through theoretical training, confined (shallow) water sessions and open water dives with expert instructors, you gain knowledge and experience in safety rules, diving equipment, basic diving skills and techniques.","type":"p"},{"text":"With your internationally recognised certification you can dive to a depth of 18 metres. Training is available in Turkish, English, French and German.","type":"p"},{"text":"Course details","type":"h2"},{"items":["Level: Beginner","Minimum duration: 3 days","Course price: €395"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Le SSI Open Water Diver est la certification de plongée la plus répandue au monde. Grâce à la théorie, aux séances en eau peu profonde et aux plongées en mer encadrées par des moniteurs expérimentés, vous acquérez connaissances et expérience sur les règles de sécurité, l''équipement, les techniques et compétences de base.","type":"p"},{"text":"Avec cette certification reconnue internationalement, vous pouvez plonger jusqu''à 18 mètres. La formation est proposée en turc, anglais, français et allemand.","type":"p"},{"text":"Informations sur le cours","type":"h2"},{"items":["Niveau : débutant","Durée minimale : 3 jours","Prix du cours : 395 €"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"SSI Open Water Diver, dünya üzerindeki en popüler dalış sertifikasıdır. Uzman eğitmenler eşliğinde gerçekleştirilen teorik eğitim, sığ su eğitimleri ve deniz dalışları sonucunda güvenlik kuralları, dalış malzemeleri, temel dalış becerileri ve teknikleri konusunda bilgi ve tecrübe kazanırsınız.","type":"p"},{"text":"Uluslararası geçerliliği olan sertifikanızla 18 metre derinliğe kadar dalabilirsiniz. Eğitimler Türkçe, İngilizce, Fransızca ve Almanca olarak verilebilir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Kurs bilgileri","type":"h2"},{"items":["Seviye: Başlangıç","En kısa süre: 3 gün","Kurs ücreti: 395 €"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"diving-course-training-1","duration":{"de":"Mindestens 3 Tage","en":"At least 3 days","fr":"3 jours minimum","tr":"En az 3 gün"},"faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["diving-try-dive-1"],"healthForm":"diving","id":"ssi-open-water-diver","includes":{"de":["Theorieunterricht","Übungen im flachen Wasser","Freiwassertauchgänge","Kursmaterial"],"en":["Theory training","Confined water sessions","Open water dives","Course materials"],"fr":["Formation théorique","Séances en eau peu profonde","Plongées en mer","Matériel pédagogique"],"tr":["Teorik eğitim","Sığ su eğitimleri","Deniz dalışları","Materyal ücreti"]},"itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"kurs-ucreti","name":{"de":"Kursgebühr","en":"Course fee","fr":"Prix du cours","tr":"Kurs ücreti"},"price":395}],"order":2,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Machen Sie in Kaş das weltweit anerkannte SSI Open Water Diver Brevet und tauchen Sie überall bis 18 Meter. Mindestens 3 Tage: Theorie, Flach- und Freiwasser.","en":"Get the internationally recognised SSI Open Water Diver certificate in Kaş and dive to 18 metres anywhere. At least 3 days of theory, confined and open water.","fr":"Obtenez à Kaş le brevet SSI Open Water Diver, reconnu partout, pour plonger jusqu''à 18 mètres. Au moins 3 jours : théorie, eaux abritées et milieu naturel.","tr":"Uluslararası geçerli SSI Open Water Diver sertifikasıyla dünyanın her yerinde 18 metreye kadar dalın. Kaş''ta en az 3 gün; teori, sığ su ve açık su dalışları."},"title":{"de":"Tauchen lernen in Kaş: SSI Open Water Diver","en":"Learn to Dive in Kaş: SSI Open Water Diver","fr":"Apprendre à plonger à Kaş : SSI Open Water Diver","tr":"Kaş''ta SSI Open Water Diver: Dalış Sertifikası"}},"slug":{"de":"ssi-open-water-diver-kurs","en":"ssi-open-water-diver-course","fr":"cours-ssi-open-water-diver","tr":"ssi-open-water-diver-kursu"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-egitim","summary":{"de":"Das international anerkannte Brevet für Tauchgänge bis 18 Meter weltweit.","en":"The internationally recognised certification that lets you dive to 18 metres anywhere in the world.","fr":"La certification internationale qui vous permet de plonger jusqu''à 18 mètres partout dans le monde.","tr":"Dünyanın her yerinde 18 metreye kadar dalmanızı sağlayan uluslararası sertifika."},"title":{"de":"SSI Open Water Diver","en":"SSI Open Water Diver","fr":"SSI Open Water Diver","tr":"SSI Open Water Diver"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"SSI-Spezialkurse vermitteln Wissen und Fertigkeiten in einem bestimmten Bereich des Tauchens. Die meisten dauern 1–2 Tage, das Kursmaterial ist inbegriffen. Im Nitrox-Kurs lernen Sie zum Beispiel, Grundzeiten und Sicherheitsreserven zu verlängern, im Tieftauchkurs sicher zwischen 18 und 40 Metern zu tauchen und im Wracktauchkurs Wracks ohne Penetration bis 30 Meter zu betauchen.","type":"p"},{"text":"Für das Brevet SSI Specialty Diver fragen Sie uns bitte nach den aktuellen Preisen.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"SSI specialty programmes give you knowledge and skills in a particular field of diving. Most take 1–2 days and course materials are included. The Nitrox course, for example, teaches you to extend bottom times and safety margins, Deep Diving to dive safely between 18 and 40 metres, and Wreck Diving to dive wrecks without penetration down to 30 metres.","type":"p"},{"text":"Please ask us for current prices for the SSI Specialty Diver rating.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Les programmes de spécialité SSI vous apportent connaissances et compétences dans un domaine précis de la plongée. La plupart durent 1 à 2 jours, matériel pédagogique compris. Le cours Nitrox vous apprend par exemple à allonger vos temps au fond et vos marges de sécurité, la plongée profonde à évoluer en sécurité entre 18 et 40 mètres, et la plongée sur épave à visiter des épaves sans pénétration jusqu''à 30 mètres.","type":"p"},{"text":"Pour la certification SSI Specialty Diver, demandez-nous les tarifs actuels.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"SSI uzmanlık programları, belirli bir dalış alanında bilgi ve beceri kazandırır. Çoğu 1–2 gün sürer ve materyal ücreti fiyata dahildir. Örneğin Nitrox kursu dip sürelerinizi ve güvenlik marjlarınızı artırmayı, Derin Dalış 18 ile 40 metre arasına güvenle dalmayı, Batık Dalışı 30 metreye kadar penetrasyonsuz batık dalışını öğretir.","type":"p"},{"text":"SSI Speciality Diver sertifikası için güncel fiyatları bize sorun.","type":"p"}]},"category":"diving","cover":"diving-seahorse-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["diving-sea-urchin-1","diving-wreck-plane-1"],"healthForm":"diving","id":"ssi-uzmanlik-kurslari","itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"nitrox","name":{"de":"SSI EANx (Nitrox) · 1 Tag","en":"SSI EANx (Nitrox) · 1 day","fr":"SSI EANx (Nitrox) · 1 jour","tr":"SSI EANx (Nitrox) · 1 gün"},"price":170},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"derin-dalis","name":{"de":"SSI Deep Diver · 2 Tage","en":"SSI Deep Diver · 2 days","fr":"SSI Deep Diver · 2 jours","tr":"SSI Deep Diver · 2 gün"},"price":285},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"batik-dalisi","name":{"de":"SSI Wreck Diver · 2 Tage","en":"SSI Wreck Diver · 2 days","fr":"SSI Wreck Diver · 2 jours","tr":"SSI Wreck Diver · 2 gün"},"price":205},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"gece-dalisi-uzmanlik","name":{"de":"SSI Night Diving · 1 Tag","en":"SSI Night Diving · 1 day","fr":"SSI Night Diving · 1 jour","tr":"SSI Night Diving · 1 gün"},"price":275},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"mukemmel-yuzerlik","name":{"de":"SSI Perfect Buoyancy · 1 Tag","en":"SSI Perfect Buoyancy · 1 day","fr":"SSI Perfect Buoyancy · 1 jour","tr":"SSI Perfect Buoyancy · 1 gün"},"price":205},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"sidemount","name":{"de":"SSI Sidemount · 2 Tage","en":"SSI Sidemount · 2 days","fr":"SSI Sidemount · 2 jours","tr":"SSI Sidemount · 2 gün"},"price":290},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"sualti-fotografciligi","name":{"de":"SSI Unterwasserfotografie · 1 Tag","en":"SSI Underwater Photography · 1 day","fr":"SSI Photographie sous-marine · 1 jour","tr":"SSI Sualtı Fotoğrafçılığı · 1 gün"},"price":220},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"speciality-diver","name":{"de":"SSI Specialty Diver · 2–2,5 Tage","en":"SSI Specialty Diver · 2–2.5 days","fr":"SSI Specialty Diver · 2–2,5 jours","tr":"SSI Speciality Diver · 2–2,5 gün"},"price":null}],"order":3,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Bauen Sie Ihr Brevet mit SSI-Spezialkursen in Kaş aus: Nitrox, Tieftauchen, Wracktauchen oder Nachttauchen. Die meisten dauern 1–2 Tage, Kursmaterial inklusive.","en":"Build on your certification with SSI specialty courses in Kaş, from Nitrox and deep diving to wreck and night diving. Most take 1–2 days, materials included.","fr":"Complétez votre brevet avec les spécialités SSI à Kaş : Nitrox, plongée profonde, épave ou de nuit. La plupart durent 1 à 2 jours, supports de cours inclus.","tr":"Nitrox, derin dalış, batık ve gece dalışı gibi SSI uzmanlık kurslarıyla brövenizi ilgi alanınıza göre geliştirin. Çoğu 1–2 gün sürer, materyaller dahildir."},"title":{"de":"SSI-Spezialkurse in Kaş: Nitrox, Wrack, Tiefe","en":"SSI Specialty Courses in Kaş: Nitrox, Deep, Wreck","fr":"Cours de spécialité SSI à Kaş : Nitrox, épave","tr":"Kaş''ta SSI Uzmanlık Kursları: Nitrox ve Batık"}},"slug":{"de":"ssi-spezialkurse","en":"ssi-specialty-courses","fr":"specialites-ssi","tr":"ssi-uzmanlik-kurslari"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-egitim","summary":{"de":"Von Nitrox bis Wrack- und Nachttauchen: Bauen Sie Ihr Brevet in Ihrem Interessengebiet aus.","en":"From Nitrox to wreck and night diving, build on your certification in the field that interests you.","fr":"Du Nitrox à l''épave et à la plongée de nuit, approfondissez votre brevet selon vos centres d''intérêt.","tr":"Nitrox''tan batık ve gece dalışına, brövenizi ilgi alanınıza göre geliştirin."},"title":{"de":"SSI-Spezialkurse","en":"SSI Specialty Courses","fr":"Spécialités SSI","tr":"SSI Uzmanlık Kursları"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Alle Tauchgänge finden vom Boot aus statt, geführt von einem Guide (Tauchlehrer oder Divemaster), in Gruppen von höchstens 6 Tauchern (+ Guide). Briefings gibt es auf Türkisch, Englisch und Französisch.","type":"p"},{"text":"Unser Tauchboot Dragoman","type":"h2"},{"text":"Die 21 Meter lange Dragoman mit überdachtem Deck ist für das Tauchen bei jedem Wetter und das ganze Jahr über gebaut. Sie bietet 50 Tauchern persönliche Kisten, Bügel für Jackets und Anzüge, einen Umkleidebereich, Bar, Dusche, WC, einen Vorbereitungstisch und einen Süßwassertank für Kameras. Liegen und Schatten auf dem Oberdeck stehen allen zur Verfügung, die sich ausruhen möchten, und auch Begleitpersonen.","type":"p"},{"text":"Tauchpakete","type":"h2"},{"text":"Preise ohne Ausrüstung enthalten Flasche, Blei, Boot und Guide; Preise mit Ausrüstung enthalten die komplette Ausrüstung, Boot und Guide. Eine Nitroxflasche kostet 5 € extra.","type":"p"}],"en":[{"text":"All dives are made from the boat, led by a guide (instructor or divemaster), with a maximum of 6 divers (+ guide) per group. Briefings are given in Turkish, English and French.","type":"p"},{"text":"Our dive boat Dragoman","type":"h2"},{"text":"Dragoman is a 21-metre boat with a sheltered deck, designed for diving in all seasons. It comfortably serves 50 divers with individual boxes, BC and suit hangers, a changing area, bar, shower, WC, a preparation table and fresh-water tank for cameras. Sun beds and shade on the upper deck are there for those who want to rest and for non-divers.","type":"p"},{"text":"Dive packages","type":"h2"},{"text":"Prices without equipment include tank, weights, boat and guide; prices with equipment include full equipment, boat and guide. A Nitrox tank costs €5 extra.","type":"p"}],"fr":[{"text":"Toutes les plongées sont effectuées à partir du bateau, en groupes de 6 plongeurs maximum, en compagnie d''un guide (moniteur ou chef de palanquée). Les briefings sont assurés en turc, en anglais et en français.","type":"p"},{"text":"Notre bateau Dragoman","type":"h2"},{"text":"Dragoman, notre bateau de 21 m avec un pont couvert, est conçu pour plonger confortablement toute l''année et par tous les temps. Il accueille 50 plongeurs : casiers individuels, cintres pour gilets et combinaisons, espace pour se changer, bar, douche, WC, table de préparation et bac d''eau douce pour les appareils photo. Transats et zone ombragée sur le pont supérieur pour se reposer et pour les accompagnateurs.","type":"p"},{"text":"Forfaits de plongée","type":"h2"},{"text":"Le tarif sans équipement comprend bouteille, plombs, bateau et guide ; le tarif avec équipement comprend tout l''équipement, le bateau et le guide. Supplément bouteille Nitrox : 5 €.","type":"p"}],"tr":[{"text":"Tüm dalışlar tekneden, bir rehber (eğitmen veya dalış lideri) refakatinde ve en fazla 6 kişilik gruplar (+ rehber) şeklinde yapılır. Brifingler Türkçe, İngilizce ve Fransızca verilir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Dalış teknesi Dragoman","type":"h2"},{"text":"21 metrelik Dragoman, kapalı güvertesiyle tüm hava koşullarında ve yıl boyunca rahatınız için tasarlanmıştır. 50 dalıcı için şahsi malzeme kutuları, malzeme askıları, soyunma bölümü, bar, duş, WC, fotoğraf ekipmanı için hazırlık masası ve tatlı su tankı bulunur. Üst güvertedeki şezlonglar ve gölgelik, dinlenmek isteyenlerin ve refakatçilerin hizmetindedir.","type":"p"},{"text":"Dalış paketleri","type":"h2"},{"text":"Ekipmansız fiyatlara tüp, ağırlık, tekne ve rehber; ekipmanlı fiyatlara tüm ekipman, tekne ve rehber dahildir. Nitrox tüp ek ücreti 5 €''dur.","type":"p"}]},"category":"diving","conditions":{"de":["Höchstens 6 Taucher + Guide"],"en":["Maximum 6 divers + guide"],"fr":["6 plongeurs maximum + guide"],"tr":["En fazla 6 dalıcı + rehber"]},"cover":"diving-fun-dive-fish-1","faq":[],"featured":false,"gallery":["boat-dragoman-1","diving-turtle-2","diving-wreck-plane-1","diving-wreck-boat-1"],"healthForm":"diving","id":"tekne-dalislari","includes":{"de":["Boot","Guide (Tauchlehrer oder Divemaster)","Flasche und Blei","Komplette Ausrüstung bei den Optionen mit Ausrüstung"],"en":["Boat","Guide (instructor or divemaster)","Tank and weights","Full equipment with the equipment options"],"fr":["Bateau","Guide (moniteur ou chef de palanquée)","Bouteille et plombs","Tout l''équipement avec les options équipées"],"tr":["Tekne","Rehber (eğitmen veya dalış lideri)","Tüp ve ağırlık","Ekipmanlı seçeneklerde tüm ekipman"]},"itinerary":[],"options":[{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"tek-dalis-ekipmansiz","name":{"de":"Ein Tauchgang, ohne Ausrüstung","en":"One dive, without equipment","fr":"1 plongée, sans équipement","tr":"Tek dalış, ekipmansız"},"price":30},{"basis":"person","currency":"EUR","id":"tek-dalis-ekipmanli","name":{"de":"Ein Tauchgang, mit Ausrüstung","en":"One dive, with equipment","fr":"1 plongée, avec équipement","tr":"Tek dalış, ekipmanlı"},"price":39},{"basis":"package","currency":"EUR","id":"paket-6-ekipmansiz","name":{"de":"6er-Paket, ohne Ausrüstung","en":"6-dive pack, without equipment","fr":"Forfait 6 plongées, sans équipement","tr":"6''lı dalış paketi, ekipmansız"},"price":171},{"basis":"package","currency":"EUR","id":"paket-6-ekipmanli","name":{"de":"6er-Paket, mit Ausrüstung","en":"6-dive pack, with equipment","fr":"Forfait 6 plongées, avec équipement","tr":"6''lı dalış paketi, ekipmanlı"},"price":222},{"basis":"package","currency":"EUR","id":"paket-10-ekipmansiz","name":{"de":"10er-Paket, ohne Ausrüstung","en":"10-dive pack, without equipment","fr":"Forfait 10 plongées, sans équipement","tr":"10''lu dalış paketi, ekipmansız"},"price":270},{"basis":"package","currency":"EUR","id":"paket-10-ekipmanli","name":{"de":"10er-Paket, mit Ausrüstung","en":"10-dive pack, with equipment","fr":"Forfait 10 plongées, avec équipement","tr":"10''lu dalış paketi, ekipmanlı"},"price":351},{"basis":"package","currency":"EUR","id":"paket-20-ekipmansiz","name":{"de":"20er-Paket, ohne Ausrüstung","en":"20-dive pack, without equipment","fr":"Forfait 20 plongées, sans équipement","tr":"20''li dalış paketi, ekipmansız"},"price":480},{"basis":"package","currency":"EUR","id":"paket-20-ekipmanli","name":{"de":"20er-Paket, mit Ausrüstung","en":"20-dive pack, with equipment","fr":"Forfait 20 plongées, avec équipement","tr":"20''li dalış paketi, ekipmanlı"},"price":624}],"order":1,"origin":"cloner","priceDisplay":"numeric","seo":{"description":{"de":"Geführte Tauchgänge an über 30 Plätzen bei Kaş vom 21-Meter-Boot Dragoman aus, höchstens 6 Taucher pro Guide, Briefings auf Türkisch, Englisch und Französisch.","en":"Guided dives at more than 30 Kaş dive sites from our 21-metre boat Dragoman, with no more than 6 divers per guide and briefings in Turkish, English and French.","fr":"Plongées guidées sur plus de 30 sites de Kaş depuis notre bateau Dragoman de 21 mètres, 6 plongeurs maximum par guide, briefings en turc, anglais et français.","tr":"21 metrelik teknemiz Dragoman ile Kaş''ın 30''u aşkın dalış noktasına rehberli dalış; grupta en fazla 6 dalıcı, brifingler Türkçe, İngilizce ve Fransızca."},"title":{"de":"Geführte Bootstauchgänge in Kaş: 30+ Tauchplätze","en":"Guided Boat Dives in Kaş: 30+ Dive Sites","fr":"Plongées guidées en bateau à Kaş, 30+ sites","tr":"Rehberli Tekne Dalışları: Kaş''ın 30+ Noktası"}},"slug":{"de":"bootstauchgaenge","en":"boat-dives","fr":"plongees-bateau","tr":"tekne-dalislari"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"dalis-sertifikali","summary":{"de":"Mit unserem Tauchboot Dragoman zu über 30 Tauchplätzen rund um Kaş, in Gruppen von höchstens 6 Tauchern.","en":"Dive the 30-plus sites of Kaş from our boat Dragoman, in groups of no more than 6 divers.","fr":"Plongez sur plus de 30 sites de Kaş depuis notre bateau Dragoman, en palanquées de 6 plongeurs maximum.","tr":"Dalış teknemiz Dragoman ile Kaş''ın 30''u aşkın dalış noktasına, en fazla 6 kişilik gruplarla."},"title":{"de":"Geführte Bootstauchgänge","en":"Guided Boat Dives","fr":"Plongées guidées en bateau","tr":"Rehberli Tekne Dalışları"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"cloner","fr":"cloner"}},{"body":{"de":[{"text":"Eine Einzelsitzung im Steuern von TRAK-Kajaks, begleitet von unserem Guide. Dies ist keine Tour, sondern ein privates Erlebnis mit einem transportablen Kajak, das Ihnen das Skin-on-Frame-System gründlich näherbringt. Sie verbessern Ihre Paddeltechnik, erkunden ruhige Küstengewässer und lernen, wie das Kajak funktioniert und wie es reist.","type":"p"},{"text":"Was es besonders macht","type":"h2"},{"items":["Sie bauen ein expeditionstaugliches TRAK-Faltkajak Schritt für Schritt selbst auf.","Sie lernen, wie die Leistungseinstellungen des TRAK 2.0 funktionieren.","Beim Paddeln sehen Sie das historische Erbe der Region.","Mittagessen im Burgdorf Simena.","Sie sehen, wie das Kajak in einen Koffer passt und wie es reist.","Das Einzelcoaching gibt Ihnen echtes Selbstvertrauen auf dem Wasser."],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Für jedes Niveau","type":"h2"},{"text":"Mit Einsteigern konzentrieren wir uns auf Sicherheit, Gleichgewicht und Selbstvertrauen. Mit erfahrenen Paddlern arbeiten wir an Paddelschlag, Trimm und Effizienz, und auf Wunsch üben Sie sogar die Eskimorolle.","type":"p"},{"text":"Ablauf","type":"h2"},{"items":["Begrüßung und Gespräch über die Idee des transportablen Kajaks","Praktischer Aufbau: Gerüst, Haut, Spannung und Cockpit","Entdeckungsfahrt durch geschützte Buchten und an der versunkenen Stadt Kekova vorbei","Fragen und Antworten zu Besitz und Reisen mit dem Kajak","Abbau des Kajaks; Fotos und Videos des Tages erhalten Sie von uns"],"type":"ul"}],"en":[{"text":"A one-to-one piloting session with TRAK kayaks, accompanied by our guide. This is not a tour: it is a private experience with a portable kayak, designed to help you understand the skin-on-frame kayak system in depth. You improve your paddling technique, explore calm coastal waters and learn how the kayak works and how it travels.","type":"p"},{"text":"What makes it different?","type":"h2"},{"items":["You assemble an expedition-grade TRAK folding kayak yourself, step by step.","You learn how the performance adjustments of the TRAK 2.0 work.","You see the historical heritage of the area while paddling.","Lunch in the castle village of Simena.","You see how the kayak fits into a suitcase and how it travels.","One-to-one coaching builds real confidence on the water."],"type":"ul"},{"text":"For every level","type":"h2"},{"text":"With beginners we focus on safety, balance and confidence. With experienced paddlers we work on stroke, trim and efficiency, and you can even practise rolling if you wish.","type":"p"},{"text":"What to expect","type":"h2"},{"items":["Welcome and a talk about the portable kayak philosophy","Hands-on assembly: frame, skin, tensioning and cockpit","An exploration paddle through sheltered coves and past the Kekova sunken city","Questions and answers on owning and travelling with the kayak","Packing up the kayak; photos and videos of the day are shared with you"],"type":"ul"}],"fr":[{"text":"Une séance de pilotage en tête-à-tête avec les kayaks TRAK, accompagnée par notre guide. Ce n''est pas une excursion : c''est une expérience privée avec un kayak portable, pensée pour comprendre en profondeur le système skin-on-frame (peau sur armature). Vous améliorez votre technique de pagaie, explorez des eaux côtières calmes et apprenez comment le kayak fonctionne et voyage.","type":"p"},{"text":"Ce qui la rend différente","type":"h2"},{"items":["Vous montez vous-même, étape par étape, un kayak pliant TRAK de niveau expédition.","Vous apprenez le fonctionnement des réglages de performance du TRAK 2.0.","Vous découvrez le patrimoine historique de la région en pagayant.","Déjeuner dans le village fortifié de Simena.","Vous voyez comment le kayak tient dans une valise et comment il voyage.","Le coaching individuel vous donne une vraie confiance sur l''eau."],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Pour tous les niveaux","type":"h2"},{"text":"Avec les débutants, nous travaillons la sécurité, l''équilibre et la confiance. Avec les pagayeurs expérimentés, nous travaillons le coup de pagaie, l''assiette et l''efficacité, et vous pouvez même vous exercer à l''esquimautage si vous le souhaitez.","type":"p"},{"text":"Au programme","type":"h2"},{"items":["Accueil et échange sur la philosophie du kayak portable","Montage pratique : armature, peau, mise en tension et hiloire","Balade de découverte dans des criques abritées et le long de la cité engloutie de Kekova","Questions-réponses sur l''achat et le voyage avec le kayak","Démontage du kayak ; partage des photos et vidéos de la journée"],"type":"ul"}],"tr":[{"text":"Rehberimiz eşliğinde TRAK kayaklarıyla birebir bir pilotaj seansı. Bu bir tur değil: skin-on-frame (deri-iskelet) kayak sistemini derinlemesine anlamanız için tasarlanmış, taşınabilir kayakla yapılan özel bir deneyim. Kürek tekniğinizi geliştirir, sakin kıyı sularını keşfeder ve kayağın nasıl çalıştığını, nasıl seyahat ettiğini öğrenirsiniz.","type":"p"},{"text":"Bu deneyimi farklı kılan ne?","type":"h2"},{"items":["Ekspedisyon seviyesinde katlanabilir bir TRAK kayağını adım adım kendiniz monte edersiniz.","TRAK 2.0 kayağı için performans ayarlarının nasıl çalıştığını öğrenirsiniz.","Kürek çekerken bölgenin tarihi mirasını görürsünüz.","Simena kale köyünde öğle yemeği.","Kayağın bir bavula nasıl sığdığını ve nasıl seyahat ettiğini görürsünüz.","Birebir koçlukla suda özgüven kazanırsınız."],"type":"ul"},{"text":"Her seviyeye uygun","type":"h2"},{"text":"Yeni başlayanlarla güvenlik, denge ve özgüvene odaklanıyoruz. Deneyimli kürekçilerle kürek vuruşu, trim ayarı ve verimlilik üzerinde çalışıyor, isterseniz roll (kendini toparlama) tekniğini de pratik ediyoruz.","type":"p"},{"text":"Sizi neler bekliyor","type":"h2"},{"items":["Karşılama ve taşınabilir kayak felsefesi üzerine sohbet","Uygulamalı montaj: iskelet, deri kaplama, gerginlik ayarı ve kokpit","Korunaklı koylar ve Kekova batık şehri geçişiyle keşif küreği","Sahiplenme ve seyahat üzerine soru-cevap","Kayağı toplama; günün fotoğraf ve videolarının paylaşımı"],"type":"ul"}]},"category":"seaKayak","cover":"kayak-trak-signature-1","duration":{"de":"1 Tag","en":"1 day","fr":"1 jour","tr":"1 gün"},"faq":[{"answer":{"de":"Nein. TRAK Signature ist eine private Einzelsitzung; pro Woche gibt es nur eine begrenzte Zahl an Terminen.","en":"No. TRAK Signature is a private one-to-one session; only a limited number of sessions are held each week.","fr":"Non. TRAK Signature est une séance privée en tête-à-tête ; le nombre de séances par semaine est limité.","tr":"Hayır. TRAK Signature birebir özel bir seanstır; haftada sınırlı sayıda seans yapılır."},"question":{"de":"Ist das eine Gruppentour?","en":"Is this a group tour?","fr":"S''agit-il d''une sortie en groupe ?","tr":"Bu bir grup turu mu?"}},{"answer":{"de":"Ja. Bei Einsteigern liegt der Schwerpunkt auf Sicherheit, Gleichgewicht und Selbstvertrauen, bei Erfahrenen auf Technik und Effizienz.","en":"Yes. With beginners the focus is on safety, balance and confidence; with experienced paddlers on technique and efficiency.","fr":"Oui. Avec les débutants, l''accent est mis sur la sécurité, l''équilibre et la confiance ; avec les confirmés, sur la technique et l''efficacité.","tr":"Evet. Yeni başlayanlarla güvenlik, denge ve özgüvene; deneyimli kürekçilerle teknik ve verimliliğe odaklanılır."},"question":{"de":"Können Einsteiger teilnehmen?","en":"Can beginners take part?","fr":"Les débutants peuvent-ils participer ?","tr":"Yeni başlayanlar katılabilir mi?"}}],"featured":false,"gallery":[],"healthForm":null,"id":"trak-signature","includes":{"de":["TRAK-Kajak und Paddel","Sicherheitsausrüstung","Unterricht","Fotos und kurze Videos","Snacks und Mittagessen","Transport","Coaching (ohne Trinkgeld)"],"en":["TRAK kayak and paddle","Safety equipment","Instruction","Photos and short videos","Snacks and lunch","Transport","Coaching (tips not included)"],"fr":["Kayak et pagaie TRAK","Équipement de sécurité","Formation","Photos et courtes vidéos","Collations et déjeuner","Transport","Coaching (pourboires non compris)"],"tr":["TRAK kayak ve kürek","Güvenlik ekipmanları","Eğitim","Fotoğraf ve kısa videolar","Atıştırmalık ve öğle yemeği","Ulaşım","Koçluk (bahşiş hariç)"]},"itinerary":[],"options":[],"order":1,"origin":"kayak-site","priceDisplay":"on_request","seo":{"description":{"de":"Ein privater Tag eins zu eins mit unserem Guide: Sie bauen ein TRAK-Faltkajak selbst auf, verfeinern Ihre Paddeltechnik und essen im Burgdorf Simena zu Mittag.","en":"A private one-to-one day with our guide: assemble a TRAK folding kayak yourself, refine your paddling technique and have lunch in the castle village of Simena.","fr":"Une journée privée en tête-à-tête avec notre guide : montez vous-même un kayak pliant TRAK, affinez votre technique de pagaie et déjeunez au village de Simena.","tr":"Rehberimizle birebir özel bir gün: TRAK katlanır kayağı adım adım kendiniz kurun, kürek tekniğinizi geliştirin ve Simena kale köyünde öğle yemeği yiyin."},"title":{"de":"TRAK Signature: Faltkajak im Einzelcoaching","en":"TRAK Signature: One-to-One Folding Kayak Day","fr":"TRAK Signature : kayak pliant en tête-à-tête","tr":"TRAK Signature: Katlanır Kayakla Birebir Seans"}},"slug":{"de":"trak-signature-erlebnis","en":"trak-signature-experience","fr":"experience-trak-signature","tr":"trak-signature-deneyimi"},"sourceRefs":[],"status":"published","subgroup":"kano-ozel-deneyim","summary":{"de":"Eine private Einzelsitzung, um das TRAK-Faltkajak genau kennenzulernen.","en":"A private one-to-one session to get to know the TRAK folding kayak in depth.","fr":"Une séance privée en tête-à-tête pour découvrir en profondeur le kayak pliant TRAK.","tr":"Birebir özel seans: TRAK katlanır kayağı derinlemesine öğrenin."},"title":{"de":"TRAK Signature Erlebnis","en":"TRAK Signature Experience","fr":"Expérience TRAK Signature","tr":"TRAK Signature Deneyimi"},"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"}}],"home":{"featured":[{"id":"kekova-klasik","kind":"event"},{"id":"deneme-dalisi","kind":"event"},{"id":"kiyi-tirmanisi","kind":"event"},{"id":"likya-kayak-konfor","kind":"event"},{"id":"raja-ampat-2027","kind":"post"}],"hero":{"heading":{"de":"Tauchen, Seekajak und Outdoor in Kaş und Kekova","en":"Diving, sea kayaking and outdoors in Kaş and Kekova","fr":"Plongée, kayak de mer et plein air à Kaş et Kekova","tr":"Kaş ve Kekova''da dalış, deniz kanosu ve doğa"},"subheading":{"de":"Seit 2002 in Kaş: unter und auf dem Meer an der lykischen Küste, in kleinen Gruppen.","en":"In Kaş since 2002: under and on the sea along the Lycian coast, in small groups.","fr":"À Kaş depuis 2002 : sous la mer et sur l''eau le long de la côte lycienne, en petits groupes.","tr":"2002''den beri Kaş''ta: Likya kıyısında denizin altında ve üstünde, küçük gruplarla."},"tiles":[{"category":"diving","media":"hero-diving","tagline":{"de":"Mehr als 30 Tauchplätze","en":"More than 30 dive sites","fr":"Plus de 30 sites de plongée","tr":"30''u aşkın dalış noktası"}},{"category":"seaKayak","media":"hero-sea-kayak","tagline":{"de":"Paddeln über der versunkenen Stadt","en":"Paddle over the sunken city","fr":"Pagayer au-dessus de la cité engloutie","tr":"Batık şehir üzerinde kürek"}},{"category":"outdoor","media":"hero-outdoor","tagline":{"de":"Wandern, Radfahren, Coasteering","en":"Hiking, cycling, coasteering","fr":"Randonnée, vélo, coasteering","tr":"Yürüyüş, bisiklet, coasteering"}}]},"origin":"mockup","quickLinks":[{"media":"kas-town-view-1","page":"transport","text":{"de":"Flughafentransfers und Unterkunft","en":"Airport transfers and accommodation","fr":"Transferts aéroport et hébergement","tr":"Havalimanı transferleri ve konaklama"}},{"media":"book-tropical-spread-1","page":"shop","text":{"de":"Unsere Bücher über das Unterwasser-Kaş","en":"Our books on underwater Kaş","fr":"Nos livres sur le Kaş sous-marin","tr":"Kaş sualtı kitaplarımız"}}],"seo":{"description":{"de":"Seit 2002 in Kaş: Tauchen, Seekajak, Wandern und Radfahren in Kaş und Kekova, unter und auf dem Meer an der lykischen Küste, in kleinen Gruppen.","en":"In Kaş since 2002: diving, sea kayaking, hiking and cycling in Kaş and Kekova, under and on the sea along the Lycian coast, always in small groups.","fr":"À Kaş depuis 2002 : plongée, kayak de mer, randonnée et vélo à Kaş et Kekova, sous la mer et sur l''eau le long de la côte lycienne, en petits groupes.","tr":"2002''den beri Kaş''ta: Kaş ve Kekova''da dalış, deniz kanosu, yürüyüş ve bisiklet; Likya kıyısında denizin altında ve üstünde, küçük gruplarla etkinlikler."},"title":{"de":"Tauchen, Seekajak und Outdoor in Kaş und Kekova","en":"Diving, Sea Kayaking and Outdoors in Kaş & Kekova","fr":"Plongée, kayak de mer, plein air à Kaş et Kekova","tr":"Kaş''ta Dalış, Deniz Kanosu ve Doğa Etkinlikleri"}},"sourceRefs":[],"translationOrigin":{"de":"mockup","en":"mockup","fr":"mockup"},"why":[{"text":{"de":"Ein Team, das Meer, Küste, Wetter und Routen von Kaş und Kekova genau kennt.","en":"A team that knows the sea, coastline, weather and routes of Kaş and Kekova closely.","fr":"Une équipe qui connaît de près la mer, la côte, la météo et les itinéraires de Kaş et Kekova.","tr":"Kaş ve Kekova''nın denizini, kıyılarını, hava koşullarını ve rotalarını yakından tanıyan bir ekip."},"title":{"de":"Mehr als 25 Jahre Erfahrung vor Ort","en":"More than 25 years of local experience","fr":"Plus de 25 ans d''expérience locale","tr":"25 yılı aşan yerel deneyim"}},{"text":{"de":"Route, Wetter und Seegang werden vor jeder Aktivität geprüft; Ausrüstung und Abläufe folgen festen Standards.","en":"Route, weather and sea conditions are assessed before every activity; equipment and procedures follow set standards.","fr":"L''itinéraire, la météo et l''état de la mer sont évalués avant chaque activité ; équipement et pratiques suivent des standards établis.","tr":"Rota, hava ve deniz koşulları her etkinlik öncesinde değerlendirilir; ekipman ve uygulamalar standartlara uygun hazırlanır."},"title":{"de":"Sicherheit zuerst","en":"Safety first","fr":"La sécurité d''abord","tr":"Önce güvenlik"}},{"text":{"de":"Unsere Tauchlehrer und Guides sind seit vielen Jahren in diesen Gewässern und auf diesen Pfaden unterwegs.","en":"Our instructors and guides have worked in these waters and on these trails for many years.","fr":"Nos moniteurs et guides travaillent depuis de nombreuses années sur ces eaux et ces sentiers.","tr":"Eğitmenlerimiz ve rehberlerimiz uzun yıllardır bu sularda ve patikalarda çalışıyor."},"title":{"de":"Ein langjähriges Expertenteam","en":"A long-standing expert team","fr":"Une équipe d''experts fidèle","tr":"Uzun soluklu uzman ekip"}},{"text":{"de":"Mit kleinen Gruppen und naturverträglichen Touren erkunden wir das Meeresschutzgebiet Kaş-Kekova und schützen es zugleich.","en":"Small groups and nature-friendly trips let us explore the Kaş-Kekova Marine Protected Area while protecting it.","fr":"Petits groupes et voyages respectueux de la nature : nous explorons l''Aire Marine Protégée de Kaş-Kekova tout en la préservant.","tr":"Küçük gruplar ve doğaya saygılı yolculuklarla Kaş-Kekova Özel Deniz Koruma Alanı''nı koruyarak keşfediyoruz."},"title":{"de":"Respekt vor der Natur","en":"Respect for nature","fr":"Le respect de la nature","tr":"Doğaya saygı"}}]},"media":[{"alt":{"de":"Eingang des Dragoman-Ladens im Erdgeschoss eines Gebäudes mit Bougainvillea","en":"Entrance of the Dragoman shop on the ground floor of a building with bougainvillea","fr":"Entrée de la boutique Dragoman au rez-de-chaussée d''un bâtiment fleuri de bougainvilliers","tr":"Begonvillerle çevrili binanın zemin katında Dragoman dükkânının girişi"},"height":960,"id":"about-office-1","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"Ofis-foto-f2b2697538c3.jpeg","storage":"repo","topic":"About / contact: Dragoman office (portrait)","width":720,"widths":[480,720]},{"alt":{"de":"Ladenfront des Dragoman-Büros mit Schild und Schaufenstern","en":"Shopfront of the Dragoman office with its sign and window displays","fr":"Devanture du bureau Dragoman avec son enseigne et ses vitrines","tr":"Dragoman tabelalı dükkânın ön cephesi ve vitrinleri"},"height":372,"id":"about-office-2","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"dragoman-office-91b8564247bd.jpg","storage":"repo","topic":"About / contact: Dragoman office front","width":480,"widths":[480]},{"alt":{"de":"Beispielbild: Teamfoto noch nicht vorhanden","en":"Sample image: team photo not yet available","fr":"Image d''exemple : photo de l''équipe pas encore disponible","tr":"Örnek görsel: ekip fotoğrafı henüz yok"},"height":1280,"id":"about-team-placeholder","placeholder":true,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"generated-placeholder","storage":"repo","topic":"About: team group photo (only small individual portraits exist in the archive)","width":1920,"widths":[480,720,800,1280,1920]},{"alt":{"de":"Ein Mantarochen im tiefblauen Wasser","en":"A manta ray swimming in deep blue water","fr":"Une raie manta nageant dans le bleu profond","tr":"Derin mavi suda yüzen bir manta vatozu"},"height":682,"id":"blog-maldives","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"maldives-manta-222829270504.jpg","storage":"repo","topic":"Blog cover: Maldives diving trip","width":1024,"widths":[480,720,800,1024]},{"alt":{"de":"Holzbungalows über dem Wasser vor bewaldeter Küste","en":"Wooden bungalows built over the water in front of a forested shore","fr":"Bungalows en bois sur pilotis devant une côte boisée","tr":"Ormanlık kıyının önünde su üzerine kurulmuş ahşap bungalovlar"},"height":864,"id":"blog-raja-ampat-2027","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"Raja-Ampat-Bungalow-1536x864-1-40977ee2423d.jpg","storage":"repo","topic":"Blog cover: Raja Ampat 2027","width":1536,"widths":[480,720,800,1280,1536]},{"alt":{"de":"Ein Taucher schwimmt neben Gorgonien und Riff","en":"A diver swimming beside sea fans and reef","fr":"Un plongeur nageant près de gorgones et du récif","tr":"Gorgon mercanları ve resifin yanında yüzen bir dalgıç"},"height":853,"id":"blog-sharm-el-sheikh","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"Kizil-deniz-3-a4aed1efb52f.jpeg","storage":"repo","topic":"Blog cover: Sharm el Sheikh diving trip","width":1280,"widths":[480,720,800,1280]},{"alt":{"de":"Zwei helle Muränen schauen aus Felslöchern","en":"Two pale moray eels peering out of holes in the rock","fr":"Deux murènes claires sortant la tête de trous dans la roche","tr":"Kayadaki deliklerden başını çıkaran iki açık renkli müren"},"height":853,"id":"blog-sharm-moray-1","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"kizildeniz-4-fc2717292903.jpeg","storage":"repo","topic":"Blog gallery: Sharm el Sheikh","width":1280,"widths":[480,720,800,1280]},{"alt":{"de":"Ein großer Napoleon-Lippfisch zwischen Korallen, dahinter ein Taucher","en":"A large humphead wrasse among corals, with a diver behind"