ique","tr":"Çakıllı kumsalda kanolar, arkada bir adacık ve antik bir kalıntı"},"height":500,"id":"kayak-kekova-bay-3","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"Seakayak5-9bb3048edef2.jpg","storage":"repo","topic":"Sea kayak: Kekova Bay 2 days gallery (camp beach)","width":1026,"widths":[480,720,800,1026]},{"alt":{"de":"Drei Seekajaks vor felsiger Küste mit antiken Ruinen in Kekova","en":"Three sea kayaks in front of a rocky shore with ancient ruins in Kekova","fr":"Trois kayaks de mer devant une côte rocheuse aux ruines antiques à Kekova","tr":"Kekova''da antik kalıntılı kayalık kıyının önünde üç deniz kanosu"},"height":768,"id":"kayak-kekova-classic-1","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"Kekova-Klasik-1d8658e7bbe5.jpeg","storage":"repo","topic":"Sea kayak: Kekova Classic (cover)","width":1024,"widths":[480,720,800,1024]},{"alt":{"de":"Ein Paddler im roten Seekajak vor einer hohen Felswand","en":"A paddler in a red sea kayak below a tall rock face","fr":"Un pagayeur en kayak de mer rouge au pied d''une haute paroi rocheuse","tr":"Yüksek kaya duvarının önünde kırmızı deniz kanosuyla kürek çeken biri"},"height":712,"id":"kayak-kekova-classic-2","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"dragoman-kekova-klasik-deniz-kanosu-265ebd7d0f73.jpg","storage":"repo","topic":"Sea kayak: Kekova Classic gallery","width":960,"widths":[480,720,800,960]},{"alt":{"de":"Zwei Seekajaks auf klarem Wasser neben antiken Mauerresten","en":"Two sea kayaks on clear water beside ancient wall remains","fr":"Deux kayaks de mer sur une eau limpide près de vestiges de murs antiques","tr":"Antik duvar kalıntılarının önünde berrak suda iki deniz kanosu"},"height":768,"id":"kayak-kekova-classic-3","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"Seakayak4-22e5e712468c.jpg","storage":"repo","topic":"Sea kayak: Kekova Classic gallery (sunken city shore)","width":1024,"widths":[480,720,800,1024]},{"alt":{"de":"Versunkene antike Mauer unter türkisfarb