aki antik kalıntıların önünde suda deniz kanoları"},"height":2560,"id":"kayak-lycian-comfort-2","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"WhatsApp-Image-2025-04-13-at-20.05.11_c12c9e24-scaled-8f7afa038924.jpg","storage":"repo","topic":"Sea kayak: Lycian kayak & comfort escape gallery (portrait)","width":1920,"widths":[480,720,800,1280,1920]},{"alt":{"de":"Eine Meeresschildkröte schwimmt dicht unter der Oberfläche","en":"A sea turtle swimming just below the surface","fr":"Une tortue de mer nageant juste sous la surface","tr":"Su yüzeyinin hemen altında yüzen bir deniz kaplumbağası"},"height":1079,"id":"kayak-sea-turtle-1","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"WhatsApp-Image-2025-04-13-at-20.05.02_ef83f83a-3de101d8faad.jpg","storage":"repo","topic":"Sea kayak: Lycian kayak & comfort escape gallery (wildlife)","width":1920,"widths":[480,720,800,1280,1920]},{"alt":{"de":"Blick von den Mauern der Burg von Kaleköy (Simena) auf das Dorf und ankernde Boote","en":"View from the walls of Kaleköy (Simena) castle over the village and boats anchored in the bay","fr":"Vue depuis les remparts du château de Kaleköy (Simena) sur le village et les bateaux au mouillage","tr":"Kaleköy (Simena) kalesinin surlarından köye ve koyda demirli teknelere bakış"},"height":1277,"id":"kayak-simena-castle-1","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"seakayak-klasik-kalekoy-2-2018-scaled-1-c7b48c03e357.jpg","storage":"repo","topic":"Sea kayak: Simena / Kaleköy castle (Kekova Classic, kayak & gulet)","width":1920,"widths":[480,720,800,1280,1920]},{"alt":{"de":"Ein Paddler im gelben Seekajak mit einem Hund an Bord","en":"A paddler in a yellow sea kayak with a dog on board","fr":"Un pagayeur dans un kayak de mer jaune avec un chien à bord","tr":"Sarı deniz kanosunda kürek çeken biri ve kanodaki bir köpek"},"height":2560,"id":"kayak-trak-signature-1","placeholder":false,"rights":"unverified","sourceFile":"Oguzhan-scaled-f69416900cc5.jpg","storage":"repo","t